	quest.001193061B6363C1.quest_desc: ["Those enormous chickens can be often found in plains."]
	quest.00588B2FDB99874D.quest_desc: ["&bApotheosis&r gives purpose to the &eFletching Table&r! Use it to craft high-yield arrows and four exclusive special arrow types: &7Broadhead Arrows&r, &5Obsidian Arrows&r, &6Explosive Arrows&r, and &bMining Arrows&r."]
	quest.00588B2FDB99874D.title: "Fletching Table: Custom Arrows"
	quest.00654F576522DDCA.quest_desc: [
		"A gearbox with shafts on all 6 sides."
		"Top and bottom spin at half speed."
	]
	quest.006A26D253D4D1C2.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Jetpack&r is an item that allows the player to fly, equippable in the chestplate slot."
		""
		"It uses &3Hydrogen&r gas as a fuel, of which it can store up to &o&b24,000mB&r."
	]
	quest.00A3AD4BD4EE0FC7.quest_desc: [
		"The Guard Tower will employ and house one Guard to protect your colony. Your citizens will appreciate a well guarded colony. A general rule of thumb is two guards for every three citizens."
		""
		"Guards sleep in guard dowers, freeing up the bed they previously occupied in a residence or tavern allowing you to recruit new colonists. "
		""
		"Tip: You can expand your colony border by building and leveling up guard towers."
	]
	quest.00A3AD4BD4EE0FC7.quest_subtitle: "Build a Guard Tower and Hire a Guard"
	quest.00ACD837E30165B3.quest_desc: ["Generates rotational energy from FE. Enables bridging between electrical mods and Create's kinetic systems."]
	quest.00B8F3AE04BF9027.quest_desc: ["Collects &bliquids&r from &esources around it&r."]
	quest.00C65DA0590BF5CA.quest_desc: [
		"After casting &bDispel&r on a witch when it is below &chalf health&r, the &awitch&r will turn into a &dWixie token&r. You can use the token to craft a &dWixie charm&r in the &dEnchanting apparatus&r."
		""
		"Wixies are used to automate crafting, mainly &epotion&r brewing, &lRight-Click&r a &acauldron&r to turn it into a &dWixe's cauldron&r and summon a Wixie."
		""
		"Now for the hard part, place a &6chest&r, next to it place a &dwixies cauldron&r, then a &bArcane Pedestal&r, then a &apotion jar&r. Have a Jar with &dsource&r in it nearby, on the &bPedestal&r place the potion you want to craft, and in the &6chest&r place the ingredient you would normaly add to get that, &li.e&r &onetherwart for Awkward&r, &osuger for speed&r, &oglowstone to buff the effect&r."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		" "
		"Using a &dDominion wand&r &lShift-Right-Click&r the chest, then the &dWixie&r, after that the &apotion jar&r should star filling up with the potion on the pedestal after a little animation."
		""
		"&dWixies&r can also craft with the potion from &aother&r nearby potion jar another &dWixie&r is filling up to make a little conveyor belt-like system. So you can have one &dWixie&r create the Awkward potion then another &dwixie&r buff the &aawkward potion&r to &cstrength&r or something."
		""
		"After a &apotion jar&r already has some of a potion in it, you can &lShift-Right-Click&r in order to &eLock it&r this means only that potion can be added to it, no others with different effects, you can still add more of the same potion to it after its locked but not other ones."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&aAlchemical sourcelinks&r make and put source in &dSource jars&r from nearby potion jars, the more &ccomplex&r the potion the &emore&r &dsource&r is created."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&bFamiliar form&r: &cFights&r with &dpotions&r in combat, can brew &llevel one&r&d potions&r if given the main ingredient, and increases the &aduration&r of used &dpotions.&r"
	]
	quest.00C88180C14B1A91.quest_desc: ["Used with &6Spatial IO Port&r to store spatial regions."]
	quest.00D11748B75CDABC.quest_desc: ["&dMystical Agriculture&r is a mod based on &agrowing crops&r to gather &6essence&r which is used to &ecraft materials&r."]
	quest.00D11748B75CDABC.title: "Welcome to Mystical Agriculture"
	quest.00D6F365E1D3D46F.quest_desc: ["Generates energy by burning solid fuels (like coal or logs). Simple and effective early game power source."]
	quest.00E49393B6B2DB11.quest_desc: ["More storage."]
	quest.00EFC7B327E79076.quest_desc: [
		"After zapping away trillions of power in the &dSPS&r, we can finally create &5Antimatter Pellets&r."
		""
		"Run the &3Antimatter Gas&r you get from the &dSPS&r into a &2Chemical Crystallizer&r and you'll get &o&b1&r &5Antimatter Pellet&r for every &o&b1,000mb&r you make."
	]
	quest.0104893F8F3458DA.quest_subtitle: "Right click steel casings with a heavy plate."
	quest.012148BBA9DA43A0.quest_desc: [
		"The &eMaterial StoneWork Factory&r is an all-in-one machine for processing &astone materials&r."
		""
		"Provide it with &dpower&r, &aWater&r, and &dLava&r."
		""
		"It can perform tasks such as &acrushing, cutting, grinding&r, and &asmelting&r to produce various &astone-based materials&r."
		""
		"Configure the &eMaterial StoneWork Factory&r through its interface to select the desired processes and outputs."
	]
	quest.0149B3F7F08D7E35.quest_subtitle: "Crafting ingredient"
	quest.014BB7CA85D14532.quest_desc: ["Applies an &6touch&r spell for a &ediscounted price&r and &bduration buff&r to the user. must be&d inscribed&r with no Form."]
	quest.0152C49AB74B9D32.quest_desc: [
		"You've probably heard people talk about how the &6Fusion Reactor&r is the best power source in the pack. &bThat's correct&r!"
		""
		"Once activated, the &6Reactor&r can push out up to &o&b200MRF/t&r with the right setup. It can also be cooled with &9Water&r to produce &7Steam&r, which can go into an &dIndustrial Turbine&r to make even more power."
		""
		"To build the &6Fusion Reactor&r, we need to follow a simple pattern. Each face will look like this:"
		""
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"For the top, we want replace the middle block with the &aFusion Reactor Controller&r."
		""
		"For the ports, you can replace any of the &bReactor Glass&r on the sides. For this setup, we'll need two ports to input &cDeuterium&r and &eTritium&r, then a port to output power. "
		""
	]
	quest.0152C49AB74B9D32.quest_subtitle: "The best power source you can get"
	quest.0152C49AB74B9D32.title: "&6The Fusion Reactor"
	quest.0158F70E9E7F6ED7.quest_desc: ["The 16384k Storage Disk can store 16384000 items."]
	quest.019D5A05A2134C7E.quest_desc: ["Made from a &8Metallurgic Infuser&r this item is used in a few crafting recipes. Can also be found in &9loot crates&r."]
	quest.01A250921FB4E8EA.quest_desc: ["A &0mysterious component&r used to &dempower&r &9ancient tools&r and &bartifacts.&r Brimming with &cunstable energy&r and &aforbidden logic&r."]
	quest.01B7A0376B792788.quest_desc: ["After completing the &aSpelunking table&r puzzle &ethree times in a row&r, you will acquire the &6Forlorn Hollows cave codex&r, which is used in crafting a &amap&r to the &6Forlorn Hollows&r or &lRight-Clicking&r for &binformation&r on the &acaves.&r"]
	quest.01C3B23461807007.quest_desc: ["A better tier of pipe with more storage."]
	quest.01C3B23461807007.title: "&dUltimate Mechanical Pipe"
	quest.01E0820861BE3E93.quest_desc: ["The ultimate drilling tool, forged from powerful Netherite for unmatched strength and endurance. It tears through the hardest blocks with ease, offering top-tier performance for advanced automation and late-game mining setups."]
	quest.01EFE05083181909.quest_desc: [
		"&6Crafting&r in &ePackagedAuto&r is handled using"
		"the &ePackage Crafter&r."
		""
		"Instead of crafting items directly in a crafting table, recipes are processed using &6packages&r, making automation easier and more reliable."
		""
		"• Crafting recipes are executed by the &ePackage Crafter&r"
		"• It supports all recipes normally craftable"
		"  in a &6Crafting Table&r"
		"• The Package Crafter &crequires power&r to operate"
		""
		"By default, crafted items are &ejected&r into adjacent inventories."
		""
		"The &ePackage Crafter&r does &cNOT&r work without power."
		""
		"Make sure it is supplied with energy either directly or via the &3ME Network&r."
	]
	quest.01EFE05083181909.title: "&eCrafting&r"
	quest.01F18150EC923482.quest_desc: ["&9Refined Storage&r is a mass storage mod that offers a network-based storage system. \\\\n \\\\n To get started with the mod, you'll want to make the &6Controller&r. \\\\n \\\\n The Controller is the 'Core' of your storage network. When provided with power, it gives life to all RS components connected. Each network can only have one Controller."]
	quest.01F18150EC923482.quest_subtitle: "Getting Started"
	quest.01F18150EC923482.title: "&dRefined Storage"
	quest.01F6171999948717.quest_desc: ["Processes items using FE to transform them into advanced materials. Required to progress to higher tiers."]
	quest.01F6171999948717.title: "&2The Energizing Orb"
	quest.01FB8D69E655FED3.quest_desc: ["The &aWyvern Core&r is the advanced version of a Draconic Core. It is used in higher crafting recipes like all the &bWyvern Tools&r and &bChest Piece&r."]
	quest.0203D270DDDC7E84.quest_subtitle: "Made by spouting creosote oil in planks."
	quest.020781DCBCE5AA49.quest_desc: ["Chests can be converter into shulker by right clicking them using 2 shells"]
	quest.0219BA01C1F9A0DE.quest_desc: ["Ah the dragonforge, pride of the Obsidian Kingdom. They discovered that if you let dragon breath into a forge, while there is iron inside, the outcome is dragonsteel. Each type of dragon requires its own forge. "]
	quest.0219BA01C1F9A0DE.title: "Lightning Dragonforge"
	quest.0221FE72F998600E.quest_subtitle: "A Create mod add-on adding quality-of-life blocks that you wish existed in Create."
	quest.02272D430F08B1DC.quest_desc: [
		"This multiblock has a &dcustomizable shape&r when you open its &amenu,&r however its &eminimum&r is a &l3x3x3 Cube.&r"
		""
		"Make all of the &eedge&r and &ecorner&r blocks &bcasing,&r the &emiddles&r of each side &bglass,&r and the&a Large tank&r in &eone side.&r"
		""
		"Then of course &eadd hatches&r for &binputting&r and &9outputting&r &oFluids.&r and yes, &ewrenches&r work on this too, allowing you to &bview&r where blocks need to be placed &cwhen held.&r"
	]
	quest.024ECF6DAC3691FD.quest_desc: ["Similar to the &7Dark matter armor&r, though this set has more&6 knockback resistance&r. All of the armor &dnever breaks&r."]
	quest.025861E0BD7CC285.quest_desc: ["More storage."]
	quest.025A2610DEFC8C99.quest_subtitle: "Essential in every modpack."
	quest.02643BAD1AE747C6.quest_desc: ["A high end compressor that runs on fluid fuels. Provides better fuel efficiency and higher pressure capacity."]
	quest.027084AE2DF5EBA6.quest_desc: [
		"The &cThermal Evaporation Plant&r multi-block produces &eBrine&r based on the internal temperature."
		""
		"There are several methods to increase the temperature of the plant, including building them in a desert!"
		""
		"The &aFuelwood Heater&r burns buckets of &6Lava&r, which can them be piped in using a pipe that transfers heat."
		""
		"The &eResistive Heater&r uses &cRF/FE&r to produce heat, and can be set to use whatever &cRF/FE&r you want it to use."
	]
	quest.027B95599926AC64.quest_desc: ["The &aShield Capacity Module&r increases your Energy Shield."]
	quest.027E771CE7C66EAC.quest_desc: ["You will find &epillars of neodymium&r throughout the &dmagnetic caves&r, the &cscarlet version&r has the ability to &apull you&r while holding or wearing &dmagnetic items&r."]
	quest.028BAE69E167F3C0.quest_desc: ["A &bdetailed map&r that reveals the &6primordial cave biomes&r, and the borders of &anearby biomes&r. is crafted from &ecodex's.&r"]
	quest.029986AB191B2173.quest_desc: [
		"&7Tablets&r are used with &cRitual Braziers&r to perform &crituals,&r not all &7tablets&r can be crafted however. The &7tablet&r will tell you its effect when you hover over it in your invertory, once you have found the &7tablet&r you want, &lRight-Click&r the &cBrazier&r with the tab&7let,&r then with an &lempty&r hand and it will activate using nearby &dsource&r from a jar."
		""
		"This one summons a few random &6Wilden&r creatures for you to fight, if agumented with a &6Wilden spike&r, &ehorn&r, and &awing,&r it will summon a deadly &cchimera&r to fight and &cdestroys&r nearby blocks around the &dbrazier&r."
	]
	quest.02C61505B5649304.quest_desc: ["The &aAwakened Core&r is the third tier of cores. It's mainly used for crafting the &bDraconic Staff of Power&r."]
	quest.02D05B1D0B266578.quest_desc: ["Once you have steel, you might choose to speed up your blast furnace by making these reinforcing walls for it."]
	quest.02FE307E10DEACA5.quest_desc: ["The 256k Storage Disk can store 256000 items."]
	quest.0318AF961DA821CA.quest_desc: ["The &6Culinary Generator&r consumes &aFood Items&r to generate &cEnergy&r. From simple &bBaked Potatoes&r to &dGolden Apples&r, this generator turns edible items into valuable &cPower&r. It’s ideal for those with abundant food supplies."]
	quest.0328346D53437756.quest_desc: [
		"Obviously, the modpack isn't just that; this questline only served to guide you from the early game to what I hope you're at now &6the midgame&r. "
		""
		"Now it's up to you to choose how you'll progress, with your goal still being the &4Heart of the Void&r. Base your progress on the other questlines and crafting the items needed for the &4Heart of the Void&r. Everything you need now is in the questlines and the JEI."
		""
		"&2If you still have any questions, our Discord server is always open for questions and suggestions!&r"
	]
	quest.032867F83089732B.quest_desc: [
		"The &bScreen Controller&r in &5RFTools&r is used to manage and power multiple screens in your network, ensuring they operate efficiently."
		""
		"To use the &bScreen Controller&r:"
		"1. &n&bRight-click&r the screen controller to open its &6GUI&r."
		"2. Configure the controller to recognize and manage nearby screens."
		"3. The screen controller will distribute power to the connected screens, ensuring they display information &bcontinuously and efficiently&r."
	]
	quest.0359F741EACB7578.quest_desc: ["A &anew alloy&r with many uses, smelted with the &6alloy smelter&r."]
	quest.037A36EA33EE666D.quest_desc: ["Provides 1 Billion bytes of crafting storage for your ME network. Enough memory to queue up massive crafting jobs without running into storage capacity limits."]
	quest.037A36EA33EE666D.quest_subtitle: "1,000,000,000 Byte Storage Cell"
	quest.037A36EA33EE666D.title: "1B Mega Crafting Storage"
	quest.037B8971900F3840.quest_desc: [
		"The Factory Must Grow (TFMG for short) is an addon to the Create mod. The mod adds factory-style structures, processes, and items like Crude Oil, Steel Blasting, and various Electric Components."
		""
		"TFMG adds more processes that extend Create's Steampunk style to a more industrial, diesel-punk stage of advancement. "
		""
		"Processes that this mod adds are Oil Distillation by boiling Crude Oil into various oil products (more commonly known as \"fractions\") like Diesel and Gasoline. You can use your Diesel to power a easy-scalable Diesel Engine or further refine your Naphtha into Ethylene and Propylene for Plastic and Coolant Liquid. Make Napalm Bombs out of Gasoline, Sulfuric Acid, and Aluminum to \"prank\" your friends, but don't try this at home!"
	]
	quest.03C78165C5CBD9E1.quest_desc: ["The 16k Storage Disk can store 16000 items."]
	quest.03C78165C5CBD9E1.title: "&a16k Storage Part&r"
	quest.03DB20CF345324D5.quest_subtitle: "Crush some Pulsar Fragment Ingots."
	quest.03E7D73433AB6B7C.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.03E7D73433AB6B7C.title: "Mundabitur Dust"
	quest.041A1C64A8468087.quest_desc: ["Suspended high in the sky, this arrowhead-shaped airship drifts on a massive aft propeller. Boarding is perilous, but those who succeed will witness its strange and fearsome inhabitants riding boar-like beasts, their eyeless faces obscured by ominous cages. Danger and mystery ride with them across the clouds."]
	quest.041A1C64A8468087.quest_subtitle: "Find a Heavenly Rider"
	quest.042165DED0816E00.quest_desc: ["&6AllTheModium&r adds a few new &aores,&r each with its own set of &cgear&r and &eitems.&r"]
	quest.045B1DF7F39940DF.quest_desc: ["A &anew alloy&r with many uses, smelted with the &6alloy smelter&r."]
	quest.0462CF00D2373233.quest_subtitle: "Upgrade your space suit!"
	quest.04733260730F3A83.quest_desc: [
		"&zDon't know where to start?&r"
		""
		"&zDon't worry, me neither!&r"
		""
		"But your &egoal&r will always be &#014548Heart of the Void&r, so take a look into quests. "
		""
		"There really isn't a &1single&r right path to follow; &beverything is optional&r. Choose which &cmods&r you'll use, how you'll make &6farms&r, the modpack is &2yours&r to explore!"
		""
		"Use &6JEI&r, tooltips, and in game documentation to understand mods."
	]
	quest.04770ED4ACF276A8.quest_desc: ["To obtain the rainbow coal simply blow up a rainbow furnace."]
	quest.0488989FD7F5AF42.quest_desc: ["Obtained by putting an Iron Ingot in a Rolling Mill."]
	quest.0488989FD7F5AF42.quest_subtitle: "Crafting component."
	quest.048E545ED70D577F.quest_desc: [
		"Not every practitioner is born with a green-thumb. Thankfully, mana naturally trickles out of molten lava, escaping into the air. This device assists in collecting these trace amounts of mana so they may be put to use."
		""
		"Uses &cburnable&r items (&cblazing archwood&r is the best) to generate &dsource&r for jars."
		""
		"Turns stone under it to&c lava&r btw."
	]
	quest.0490AEBD08511F15.quest_desc: [
		"&cRockets&r need &efuel&r to fly! Fill your &crocket&r with &efuel&r using a Fuel Loader or Auto Fuel Loader before launch."
		""
		"You can find &6oil&r inside the ground in &boceans&r which can be refined into &efuel&r within a &bFuel Refinery&r. To use a refinery, you power it by &atransporting power&r from another mod or with &6steel cables&r connected to a &8coal generater&r. Then just put a oil bucket in the left slot to give the &6machine oil&r, then put an empty bucket in the right slot to gather the &efuel.&r"
	]
	quest.0490AEBD08511F15.title: "Fuel"
	quest.0498A578D0EC3254.quest_desc: ["Made from a &8Metallurgic Infuser&r this item is used in a few crafting recipes."]
	quest.049B8732C1336CB4.quest_desc: ["The baseline magnetic containment coils for the Stellar Nexus. Remember that all field generators in the multiblock must be the exact same tier for it to form."]
	quest.049B8732C1336CB4.quest_subtitle: "Baseline Magnetic Confinement"
	quest.049B8732C1336CB4.title: "Stellar Field Generator Mk.I"
	quest.049C9E235C4BDAC1.quest_desc: ["Unlike&6 ATM tools&r, these are crafted in a &esmithing table&r. These have even &abetter stats&r then &6ATM&r and are &cindestructible.&r"]
	quest.04A69DE982F47E64.quest_desc: ["A &bbetter machine turbine&r capable ofproducing more &epower.&r"]
	quest.04A7299079141D52.quest_desc: [
		"In Applied Energistics 2, presses are used with the Inscriber to create key components for the ME system. There are four types:"
		""
		"- &eLogic Press&r – for logic processors (gold)"
		"- &fCalculation Press&r – for calculation processors (pure Certus Quartz)"
		"- &bEngineering Press&r – for engineering processors (diamond)"
		"- &8Silicon Press&r – for printed silicon"
		""
		"These presses are typically found in meteorites scattered around the world (&2Lost Cities&r)."
	]
	quest.04B3B99637C7E275.quest_desc: ["By now, you're already making &aLithium&r. Pump that into a &dSolar Neutron Activator&r to create &eTritium&r."]
	quest.04B3B99637C7E275.title: "&eTritium"
	quest.04E2D539E33B7B0F.quest_desc: [
		"The Chemical Infuser combines two gases to create another gas. The gas gauges on the left and right side of its GUI are the input tanks, and correspond to correspond with the left and right sides of the machine. The gauge in the middle is for the resulting gas, which likewise is output through the front of the machine. The input and output sides can be changed in the UI of the machine."
		""
		"Without any upgrades, it operates using 200 J/t and operates once per tick (according to the recipe's cost and output). Notably, each speed upgrade doubles the operation speed of this machine, for 256 operations/t production rate at maximum upgrades."
	]
	quest.04E552E69695756D.quest_desc: ["Provides Nigh &eInfinite&r &aEterna&r, and Used for a few &6crafting recipes&r."]
	quest.04F456B8F4DF695D.quest_desc: [
		"Refined from Corporeal Matter and pulsar dust in the DMA or QMF."
		""
		"Pulsar Matter carries the intense rotational energy needed to construct &bEvent Horizon Component Matrices&r."
		""
		"&7Fun fact: Pulsars are highly magnetized neutron stars spinning hundreds of times per second, sweeping intense beams of radiation across space like cosmic lighthouses.&r"
	]
	quest.04F456B8F4DF695D.quest_subtitle: "High-Frequency Stellar Condensate"
	quest.04F456B8F4DF695D.title: "Pulsar Matter"
	quest.05157ADC0E37127D.quest_desc: [
		"The amount of &cpower&r you hold in &eyour hands&r is &dimmense&r."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Its a &dnuke&r that&c blows up&r, what would you expect."
	]
	quest.05157ADC0E37127D.quest_subtitle: "you have become death, destroyer of worlds."
	quest.052DDFB3F5EF8504.quest_desc: [
		"The &aBasic Energy Relay Crystal&r is used to make a relay between I/O Crystal and Energy Crystal. It can store &b4M RF&r and has &c8 links&r, with a range of &d32 blocks&r."
		""
		"The &aBasic Energy I/O Crystal&r can store &b4M RF&r and has &c2 links&r, with a range of &d32 blocks&r."
		""
		"The &aBasic Wireless Energy Crystal&r is used to power machines wirelessly. It can store &b4M RF&r and has &c4 links&r, providing wireless RF to &d16 machines&r within a range of &e128 blocks&r."
	]
	quest.05567D628EF8D1FF.quest_desc: ["More storage."]
	quest.05618FE80F2E0372.quest_desc: [
		"You will be using &6crystals&r like these to upgrade your curent &aessence&r to the next level,&l i.e&r &aInferium&r to &9Prudentium.&r"
		""
		"After &6crafting&r one &aessence's&r &6crystal&r you can use it to craft other &aessence.&r"
	]
	quest.0565F76E9C66AAA9.quest_desc: ["The &bXNet Controller&r in &5XNet&r is the central unit for managing and configuring your XNet network, allowing you to control the flow of items, fluids, and energy with precision and flexibility."]
	quest.0565F76E9C66AAA9.title: "xNet"
	quest.059EC5CDA14D238F.quest_desc: [
		"Right click and config your height"
		"shift right click to change your height"
		"shift right click to change your height back to default"
		"left click a entity to chage the height"
		"left click the entity again to change height back to default"
	]
	quest.059EC5CDA14D238F.title: "Shrinking Device"
	quest.05A3AA93A48E3C48.quest_desc: ["Has 45 filter slots and works 6.5x faster."]
	quest.05BD16EDF8181418.quest_desc: ["Dropped from an &bmagnetron,&r you will use this to craft two &dpowerful items&r."]
	quest.05C97F07DA5B7ACF.quest_desc: ["Generates energy from hot fluids like lava."]
	quest.05D20B506213A449.quest_desc: [
		"The &9Turbine Rotor&r is placed in the middle of the &6Turbine&r. For every &9Turbine Rotor&r, you will need &b&o2&r &aTurbine Blades&r. For this Turbine, we'll be using &b&o3&r &9Turbine Rotors&r."
		""
		"While looking at the &9Rotor&r, &eright clicking&r with &aTurbine Blades&r will place them directly onto the &9Rotor&r. The taller the &9Rotor&r, the longer the &aBlades&r will become. For this build, we are using &o&b6&r total &aBlades&r. If you plan on building a bigger &6Turbine&r, you will need to increase the width of the &6Turbine&r depending on how many &aBlades&r you plan on using."
		""
		"The &dRotational Complex&r must be placed at the top of the &9Turbine Rotor&r. This is then surrounded by &ePressure Dispersers&r."
		""
		"The &eDispersers&r must fill out the entire layer where the &dRotational Complex&r sits."
	]
	quest.05D20B506213A449.title: "The &aRotor&r"
	quest.05D2473CB1BE8F74.quest_desc: ["Put it on XP fluid tank to extract XP."]
	quest.05D344B86D2AD2AA.title: "Obsidian"
	quest.05DE72DD68A60883.title: "Obtain any log"
	quest.0608B33CBA0EDBF3.quest_desc: [
		"The &cAnimal Feeder&r automatically feeds &aanimals&r."
		""
		"Place it in front of animals and provide it with &dfeed&r."
		""
		"The &eAnimal Rancher&r collects resources from &aanimals&r."
		""
		"Place it near animals to collect &aresources&r like milk, wool, or eggs."
		""
		"The &bAnimal Baby Separator&r separates &ababy animals&r from adults."
		""
		"Place it in the breeding area to automatically separate &ababy animals&r."
	]
	quest.060F2F34D29C71A1.quest_desc: [
		"The indisputable apex of cosmic energy: &c&l1 Trillion FE&r."
		""
		"Only colossal-scale Induction Matrices can withstand such extreme energy density!"
	]
	quest.060F2F34D29C71A1.title: "⚡ &c&lThe Supreme Vortex: 1 Trillion FE"
	quest.0615933CCBB5411E.quest_desc: [
		"The &dPitiful Generator&r generates &dpower&r from &acombustible items&r."
		""
		"Place it with &acombustible fuel&r like &bCoal&r or &aWood&r."
		""
		"It provides a steady supply of &dpower&r for early-stage automation."
	]
	quest.062051ED6D130ACD.quest_desc: [
		"Steel is used for almost everything in TFMG, make a lot of this."
		""
		"Don't add more than a stack of each ingredient into the blast furnace at once. Additionally, it has a chance to not consume coal coke dust."
	]
	quest.062541F2C134DFB0.quest_desc: [
		"Welcome to the &5&lInfinity Challenges&r — the ultimate test of automation, power, and combat in &6Version 4.5&r!"
		""
		"Here lie the greatest milestones a modded player can achieve:"
		"• &e100 Billion and 1 Trillion FE&r"
		"• &b10 Million compressed items&r"
		"• &cSlaughter of the Multiverse's greatest Bosses&r"
		"• &dColossal EMC reserves&r"
		""
		"Prove that you have mastered every single production line in this modpack!"
	]
	quest.062541F2C134DFB0.title: "🌌 &#D4AF37&lInfinity Challenges (v4.5)&r"
	quest.0650996C7818ADB5.quest_desc: [
		"The &aHeat Generator&r has 2 modes to generate power:"
		""
		"&9Passive:&r &7Shift-Right click&r while holding a &6Lava&r bucket to start generating power, attach cables to the &aGreen box&r in the back to move the power."
		""
		"&9Active:&r Placing combustible materials such as &0coal&r or &2wood&r into the generator will burn the fuel to create power."
	]
	quest.0650996C7818ADB5.quest_subtitle: "Basic Power Gen"
	quest.066FA99DD39A0BF4.quest_desc: [
		"Put the magnetic alloy on top of a lightning rod during a thunderstorm and wait for the rod to get hit. Channeling tridents also work."
		""
		"There is about a 50% yield from this process."
	]
	quest.068728DE3B9B13C3.quest_desc: [
		"The &aSupercritical Phase Shifter&r (SPS) is another multiblock structure used to infuse &3Polonium&r with large amounts of power to create &dAntimatter&r gas, which can be crystallized into pellets."
		""
		"To build the &aSPS&r, you'll need to make a total of &o&b72&r &9SPS Casings&r (&o&b60&r for the build, &o&b12&r to make the ports), &o&b3&r &eSPS Ports&r, &o&b122&r &3Reactor Glass&r, and one other item we'll talk about in the next quest."
	]
	quest.068728DE3B9B13C3.title: "&dSupercritical Phase Shifter"
	quest.0696B725E840B996.quest_desc: [
		"For us to take anything in or out of the &6Fission Reactor&r, we'll need &aFission Reactor Ports&r. These can be configured to &9input&r or &coutput&r by using the &dConfigurator&r. "
		""
		"Every &6Fission Reactor&r needs a &nminimum&r of &o&b4 Ports&r:"
		""
		"&o&b1 Coolant&r &9Input&r"
		"&o&b1 Coolant&r &cOutput&r"
		"&o&b1 Fissile Fuel&r &9Input&r"
		"&o&b1 Waste&r &cOutput&r"
		""
		"For this starter build, let's put a port on each side. Make sure to configure them to match the list of &9inputs&r and &coutputs&r!"
	]
	quest.0696B725E840B996.title: "Interacting with the Fission Reactor"
	quest.069E13A3475B3EC8.quest_desc: [
		"Quality of life enhancements for everyday work."
		""
		"The Entropy Magnet pulls nearby item drops and XP directly to you, Loot Singularity enhances mob drops, and Phase Step adds effortless auto-step and bonus reach."
	]
	quest.069E13A3475B3EC8.quest_subtitle: "Quality of Life Suit Augments"
	quest.069E13A3475B3EC8.title: "Field Utility Modules"
	quest.06A9BCE371EB7F32.quest_subtitle: "“Born from the stars.”"
	quest.06B6786122F3DAF9.quest_desc: [
		"What time of day the bee can work."
		""
		"The best being Metaturnal"
	]
	quest.06B6786122F3DAF9.title: "Behaviour"
	quest.06CA244E47D9C097.quest_desc: [
		"&2QIO Dashboards&r allow a user to interface with the contents of a &9QIO Drive Array&r."
		""
		"It looks similar to a &echest inventory&r, but it can be searched, sorted, scrolled through, and shows all items of one type as a single stack, even if there are thousands of them."
		""
		"In order to access a &9drive array&r, the &2dashboard&r must be set to the same &o&bfrequency&r as the &9drive array&r."
	]
	quest.06E2A9904675C5C2.quest_desc: ["Steel vat + heating is required. Made from naphtha, but these two products don't \"live\" for very long."]
	quest.06E39E99E00A5283.quest_desc: [
		"This requires a very precise redstone timing in order to extract the ethylene before it turns into plastic."
		""
		"Cooling fluid is mainly used for improving modular engine efficiency."
		"Please consider if this is worth your time before trying to get some."
	]
	quest.06E5134C2F756BED.quest_desc: ["Say, rumor on the street is that killing an Ender Dragon with a Revolver is a fun challenge; it's also a way to get Shader Grabbags which can be used to get Shaders. Shaders can be used to make your Revolver look nifty."]
	quest.06EAA74E0A10CBB6.quest_desc: [
		"&bGrowth accelerators&r are placed &ebelow plants&r to &aspeed up growth&r of &ethat plant&r, &ceach tier&r has a different &9\"Range\"&r of how far down you can place it, the &6more accelerators you place&r below the &cfaster&r that &aplant grows&r. "
		"(the &9range&r is basically how many can place below the plant.)"
	]
	quest.06EDAD76FFAD55FC.quest_desc: ["Advanced armor made with the force of the earth itself. Strong, heavy, and ancient."]
	quest.06EDAD76FFAD55FC.title: "Tectonic armor set"
	quest.06EF0A84611D0671.title: "See a Shulker"
	quest.07179D5D4D9AC02E.quest_desc: [
		"A machine that supplies crafting ingredients to adjacent machines (e.g. furnaces, pulverizers) when triggered by an &bME Automation Recipe&r. Acts as the interface between your &5ME Network&r and external processing devices."
		""
		"Key Features:"
		""
		"Outputs items based on &eProcessing Patterns&r "
		""
		"Can push/pull from inventories and machines"
		""
		"Works with &6Autocrafting&r setups"
		""
		"*(The essential bridge for &dnon-AE2 machine integration&r into your network!)*"
		""
		"&a\"Automation's best friend\"&r"
	]
	quest.07179D5D4D9AC02E.title: "&5Pattern Provider&r"
	quest.0729CB454B970201.quest_desc: ["Used as a &6resource&r to &e\"power\"&r your &aquarry.&r"]
	quest.072DC5776151764D.quest_desc: [
		"The &bStasis Chamber&r is used to immobilize &amobs&r and &aplayers&r within its range."
		""
		"Place the &bStasis Chamber&r in a desired location and provide it with &dpower&r."
		""
		"It creates a field that &fparalyzes&r any &amob&r or &aplayer&r within its radius, making it useful for &dcontainment&r or &dmob farming setups&r."
	]
	quest.075E97B2BB5F93DF.quest_desc: ["Items cannot be added or removed by the player, but by components such as Chutes, Funnels, and Item Hatches."]
	quest.0763A4489C0609C2.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.076C2AC9BA063D14.quest_desc: [
		"A device that speeds up crop growth in a &b3x3 area&r beneath it when powered by an &5ME Network&r. Works on &ewheat&r, &dcarrots&r, &6potatoes&r, and other farmable plants."
		""
		"Key Traits:"
		""
		"Requires &5AE2 power&r (2 AE/t)"
		""
		"Stacks effects with multiple accelerators"
		""
		"&cDoes not affect&r bonemeal or tick-based growth"
		""
		"(The &bfarmer's high-tech solution&r for compact crop farms!)"
		""
		"&e\"Like sunlight steroids for plants\"&r"
	]
	quest.076C2AC9BA063D14.title: "&aGrowth Accelerator&r"
	quest.076DFB0B39A4259F.quest_desc: ["A better version of the &bseashelf&r. Increases &aEtrena&r by 5 to a max of 60, and &dArcana&r by 5."]
	quest.077B2D62FA7650FB.quest_desc: [
		"&bGrowth accelerators&r are placed &ebelow plants&r to &aspeed up growth&r of &ethat plant&r, &ceach tier&r has a different &9\"Range\"&r of how far down you can place it, the &6more accelerators you place&r below the &cfaster&r that &aplant grows&r. "
		"(the &9range&r is basically how many can place below the plant.)"
	]
	quest.07AC24DAEAB45D23.quest_desc: ["The &bInfused Enderpearl&r in &5RFTools&r is a valuable crafting component created by infusing an ender pearl with &aDimensional Shards&r, essential for advanced teleportation devices and upgrades."]
	quest.07AD45DCF9EE3C2E.quest_desc: [
		"&9Tier Installers&r are used to upgrade various machines into their &3Factory&r equivalent."
		""
		"&aRight-click&r on the machine with the &9Tier Installer&r and it will upgrade that machine to a &3Factory&r - its level (Basic, Advanced, or Elite) depending on the level of the &9Factory Installer&r used."
		""
		"&aBasic Tier Installers&r can be used on any machine that has a &3Factory&r associated with it that has not yet been turned into one."
		""
		"However, &4Advanced Tier Installers&r can only be used on &aBasic Factories&r, while &9Elite Tier Installers&r can only be used on &4Advanced Factories&r, and &dUltimate Tier Installers&r can only be used on &9Elite Factories&r."
		""
		"This is intended so that the player does not &nskip any tiers&r in the &b&oupgrade chain&r, e.g. going from &aBasic Factory&r to &dUltimate Factory&r instantly."
	]
	quest.07BD1E5F77EE63CF.quest_desc: [
		"The &cSpores Recreator&r is used to convert &anormal mushrooms&r into &bNether Wart&r."
		""
		"Simply provide it with &3Water&r and power, and it will process the &amushrooms&r into &bNether Wart&r."
	]
	quest.07C6A708506A6522.quest_desc: ["You are making progress, &agood,&r but you must &6improve.&r"]
	quest.07D2F9D6128C2437.quest_desc: ["Mass storage for one item type perfect for storing gravel, sand, or crops in bulk with style and function."]
	quest.07D2F9D6128C2437.quest_subtitle: "The Silo is a 3x3x7 multi-block used for storing items"
	quest.07D2F9D6128C2437.title: "&aSilo"
	quest.07D875C6BBFF3264.quest_desc: ["&bApotheosis&r introduces a system for modifying the stats of &cspawners&r.  To use a &dspawner modifier&r, simply &lRight-Click&r the item on the spawner, and if the &amodifier&r can be applied, the item &cwill be consumed&r."]
	quest.07D875C6BBFF3264.title: "Spawners"
	quest.07ECC87DFF2D3991.quest_desc: [
		"A correctly formed &9Induction Matrix&r will spark once with &cRedstone Particles&r when you place down the last block, and will also have an interface when &eright-clicking&r the block."
		""
		"To make the &9Induction Matrix&r function properly, you will want to have one &2Induction Port&r configured to &9input&r and one &2Induction Port&r to &coutput&r, using a &dConfigurator&r."
		""
		"Don't be afraid to upgrade with higher tier &aCells&r and &eProviders&r! The maximum size of the &9Induction Matrix&r structure can be &o&b18x18x18&r. "
	]
	quest.07ECC87DFF2D3991.title: "&bCompleted Induction Matrix"
	quest.07EF8ABA0027BB91.quest_desc: [
		"Required to create a connection between two Quantum Network Bridges, they are always produced in matching pairs. To create a connection place 1 of the pair of quantum entangled singularities into the ME Quantum Link Chamber of the bridge on each side."
		""
		"They are crafted by causing a reaction between Ender Pearl or Ender Dust"
		"and a Singularity. Any explosive force should be enough to trigger the reaction."
	]
	quest.07FBE11761DFA85D.quest_desc: ["Crafted with &auranium&r use these for &6crafting&r and to fuel a &cnuclear furnace&r."]
	quest.07FE9074247583EE.quest_desc: ["Input &bsteam&r into the &9fluid input hatch,&r &ccoal&r in the &bitem input hatch,&r and in the &eliquid output&r you will get &6creosote.&r"]
	quest.0805FE8036EB6655.quest_desc: [
		"The &dPlant Sower&r automates the planting of &aseeds&r."
		""
		"Place it beneath the farming area and provide it with &aseeds&r and &dpower&r."
		""
		"It will plant the &aseeds&r in the configured area, ensuring a constant supply of crops."
	]
	quest.0810990893AD9074.quest_desc: ["Equip a &bspace suit&r to survive in &dspace.&r Don’t forget the &boxygen tanks&r and gear! After equipping a full set you will get an &boxygen UI&r on the &nleft&r."]
	quest.0810990893AD9074.title: "Space suit"
	quest.0823980B57BB9324.quest_desc: ["Boosts &bswim speed&r, &9freezes&r hit enemies. boosts &bwater spell&r damage, and gives &7speed&r when in rain or water."]
	quest.0834527ED1C0E83B.quest_desc: ["Allows FE to be carried into and used inside Create contraptions."]
	quest.0847FA3F33F03338.quest_desc: ["Made at the &cNether table&r these can be used to craft a block which provides &aEterna&r to &dEnchanting tables&r."]
	quest.085F473094778DCD.quest_desc: [
		"The resource scroll is an easy way to tell what one of your Builder needs. Sneak + right-click on a Builder’s Hut to register the resource scroll to the builder."
		""
		"Now when you right-click while holding the resource scroll, you will see all the needed materials for the Builder’s Hut you clicked on."
	]
	quest.085F473094778DCD.quest_subtitle: "Micromanagement at it's finest"
	quest.087144F5252E5FF5.quest_subtitle: "Blaze burners will never run out of fuel"
	quest.087367112470E5D5.quest_desc: ["A &6crude&r but &cpowerful melee&r &cweapon&r made from &bheavy bone&r. Has a &echance&r to &astun mobs&r upon hit."]
	quest.087367112470E5D5.quest_subtitle: "only use this if you hate yourself, it attacks. SO. SLOW."
	quest.0889B37C31A4D6EA.quest_desc: [
		"The &bDimensional Matter Assembler&r (DMA) is your primary workstation for UFO Future."
		""
		"It crafts custom processors, fuses celestial ingots, and synthesizes complex matter fluids. Give it plenty of power, and watch its heat gauge when queuing up heavy recipes."
	]
	quest.0889B37C31A4D6EA.quest_subtitle: "High-Density Matter Workstation"
	quest.0889B37C31A4D6EA.title: "Dimensional Matter Assembler"
	quest.08B1A64B01A8A604.title: "&bCapturing&r &dDemons&r"
	quest.08BE431ACC886F18.quest_desc: [
		"&9Modules&r are &eupgrades&r that can be applied to the &3Mekasuit&r and the &7Meka-Tool&r at a &dModification Station&r."
		""
		"Each &o&bmodule's effects can be tuned in the config&r screen bound to your desired &akeybind&r."
	]
	quest.08DB6154965F3519.quest_desc: ["&eHolds anything.&r Even things that shouldn't be held. Useful? &aYes.&r Safe? &cNo.&r"]
	quest.08DDE018A804BFE7.quest_desc: [
		"This machine uses energy to extract dusts out of certain blocks and ores, making it essential to producing different kinds of tools. Not to be mistaken with the Crusher, this machine is the pulverizer equivalent in other mods."
		""
		"Can also be used to turn Coal or Charcoal into Compressed Carbon, Redstone into Compressed Redstone, Diamond into Compressed Diamond and Refined Obsidian Dust into Compressed Obsidian, all for use in the Metallurgic Infuser."
		""
		"Note: Compressed Carbon is worth 100 carbon; Coal is worth 10 and Charcoal is worth 20; hence it is better to refine coal and use Compressed Carbon."
	]
	quest.08DDE018A804BFE7.quest_subtitle: "Breaks Raw Ores into Dusts"
	quest.08FBA6F89454D23D.quest_desc: [
		"The &dbest&r of the &dbest,&r &6no one can match you&r."
		""
		"&e&ospeeeed&r&r"
	]
	quest.08FBA6F89454D23D.quest_subtitle: "Move with the weight of neutronium and the speed of starlight."
	quest.0921CCD3C66B3750.quest_desc: ["The &bBlazing Generator&r in &5RFTools&r is an advanced energy-producing machine that generates &cRF energy&r by burning &dblaze rods&r and other high-energy fuels."]
	quest.09230E15B7C02F85.quest_desc: [
		"The &bBlock Breaker&r breaks blocks in front of it."
		""
		"Provide it with &dpower&r, and it will continuously break &ablocks&r, dropping the &aitems&r for collection."
		""
		"Ideal for &dautomated mining operations&r."
	]
	quest.09335D2AE7F0E044.quest_desc: ["The &aProjectile Penetration Module&r allows your arrows to penetrate armor, sometimes passing through a target to potentially hit additional targets."]
	quest.0933E0EF37133C32.quest_desc: [
		"Using the Circuit Table, you can create much smaller logic circuits. To do so, you will need a backplane, some vacuum tubes and some solder like blead or copper wires. The table also needs to be supplied with energy through the input at its back."
		""
		"Using the various components, you then select the pattern of circuit you want to make and decide the input values, as well as the designated output. The available in and outputs are the 16 colored channels of a Redstone wire, as well as 8 \"Registers\"."
	]
	quest.093A97D9E08FFFD0.quest_desc: [
		"&4Don't build it next to other blocks, the structure checks in a square around so it will count blocks right next to it too&r"
		""
		"[ \"Tip build it in \", { \"text\": \"The Other\", \"underlined\": true, \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"2978E3692E772978\" } }, \" dim\" ]"
		""
		"Due to how (&6MMR&r) works, for the &4Catalyst Forge&r multiblock on top of the &dantimatter block&r you must place 2 stacked 3x3 &#FF6209Energy Core Stabilizers&r to form a ring just like so:"
		""
		""
		"{image:ftb:textures/quests/corestab.png width:250 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.093A97D9E08FFFD0.quest_subtitle: "Avaritia Time!"
	quest.09408C6DCAC90318.quest_desc: [
		"An &4Energy Cube&r is an advanced type of battery that is compatible with multiple energy systems."
		""
		"&cEnergy&r can be input from &o&b5&r sides, and output on &o&b1&r side. The output side has a special marking which looks like a &nsmall panel&r."
		""
		"Rotate the Cube by &eright-clicking&r with a &awrench&r."
		""
		"&4Energy Cubes&r can be transported by &ashift-right-clicking&r with a &ewrench&r. This will “break” the Cube, but all its energy will be &nsafely stored inside&r."
		""
		"When the Cube is in your &einventory&r, &nholding shift&r will display additional data about the Cube’s energy level."
	]
	quest.0942C0CC13ABAF70.quest_desc: [
		"&1ME Drive&r"
		"The physical storage device for digital &5Storage Cells&r in an &bME Network&r. Acts as a bay for up to &e10 cells&r (1K-65M types)."
		""
		"Key Properties:"
		""
		"&6No internal storage&r - capacity depends on inserted cells"
		""
		"Requires &5Fluix Cable&r connection and &dME Controller&r power"
		""
		"&5ME Chest&r"
		"A wireless access point to your &bME Network&r inventory."
		""
		"Special Traits:"
		""
		"Needs &6Wireless Access Point&r + power"
		""
		"Shows only &epermitted items&r (via Security Terminal)"
		""
		"Works &across dimensions&r with Quantum Link"
		""
		"&e\"From physical storage to quantum access\"&r"
	]
	quest.0942C0CC13ABAF70.title: "ME Chest and ME Drive"
	quest.094F221EA84BF301.quest_desc: ["&aArmor&r almost identical to Netherite, though crafted from Dark matter. All of the armor &dnever breaks&r."]
	quest.095E1C928584FAAC.quest_desc: [
		"&9Free Runners&r are an item that allows players to ascend 1-block inclines automatically (like the Horse), as well as preventing &cfall damage&r as long as they are charged. A fall will reduce the item's charge, depending on how far the fall was."
		""
		"&9Free Runners&r can be charged inside of various power-related generators or storage devices, like the &aAdvanced Solar Generator&r or the &2Energy Cube&r."
	]
	quest.096767E4292E6892.quest_desc: ["Fires off a beam of &eirradiation&r while using &auranium rods&r as fuel, "]
	quest.096D7F5CBB5BCA9B.quest_desc: ["Used in &6crafting&r multiple machines."]
	quest.0992D0E2A65857F4.quest_desc: ["Used in the making of the archamage spellbook and the &0manuscript of the void&f, and acquired from killing the &cWilden Chimera&r."]
	quest.09994EF9059206FD.quest_desc: ["This ancient tome has expanded once more... The Candy Cavity now shimmers on its pages, revealing secrets coated in sugar and madness."]
	quest.09BE3D92053AE1F8.quest_desc: ["When attempting to place the Roller on the top face of a block, it will be placed one block above it, similarly to a Mechanical Mixer or Mechanical Press. Though it appears to take up a few blocks of space, it only takes up one. There is also Placement Assist functionality, allowing for easy placement of Rollers to either of two sides of a roller. The Roller can be picked up by sneak using a Wrench on it."]
	quest.09C334C044BC464F.quest_desc: [
		"Pipe out the CO2 or it will clog up. You can make it taller than two blocks but it has no effect."
		""
		"Air is collected from air intakes, which need rotation to start collecting. They can be 1x1, 2x2, or 3x3 multiblock. They take zero power, so speed them up all you like."
		""
		"Fuel (creosote or furnace gas) is piped into the bottom face."
		""
		"Air (collected from air intakes) is piped into the side of the bottom block."
		""
		"CO2 is extracted from the sides of the bottom block."
		""
		"Hot air is extracted from the top face of the tower."
	]
	quest.09C334C044BC464F.title: "Blast Stove"
	quest.09CCC797BF15ADFC.quest_desc: ["When killing mobs with it with a test tube in your inventory, it will also collect blood."]
	quest.09D97507A2027B57.quest_desc: [
		"Iron/Gold/Diamond Chests: Use the upgraded chests for more space."
		""
		"Storage Drawers: This mod is FANTASTIC for the early game. "
		"Use drawers to store items in bulk. "
		"Connect them with a controller and you can deposit and retrieve items from a single block. "
		"It's the best way to organize before moving on to a more robust system."
	]
	quest.09D97507A2027B57.quest_subtitle: "In the beginning, simplicity reigns."
	quest.09D97507A2027B57.title: "Sophisticated Storage"
	quest.0A0D08D0032BAF5B.quest_desc: [
		"It uses Iron and Coal Coke to generate Steel Ingots and Slag. "
		""
		"Unlike with the Crude Blast Furnace, items are able to be piped in and out."
		""
		"Slag is removed from the back, items are loaded into the top and Blast Furnace Preheaters may be placed on either side to speed up manufacture."
	]
	quest.0A0D08D0032BAF5B.title: "Improved Blast Furnace"
	quest.0A34FD02D54EA6A2.quest_desc: [
		"A display block that shows &blive status&r of ongoing &eautocrafting jobs&r in your &5ME Network&r. Lists queued, in-progress, and completed crafts with detailed progress bars."
		""
		"Key Features:"
		""
		"&dReal-time updates&r on all crafting orders"
		""
		"&6Color-coded&r status (pending/active/error)"
		""
		"&cClick-to-cancel&r functionality"
		""
		"(The &a\"mission control center\"&r for your automated factory!)"
	]
	quest.0A34FD02D54EA6A2.title: "&5Crafting Monitor&r"
	quest.0A5C03A114ABF62D.quest_desc: [
		"In the silent pulse between universes, there exists a presence that defies reason."
		"A creature shaped not by nature, but by the quiet gravity of forgotten worlds."
		"From its shadow comes this fragment a small, unassuming relic, yet heavy with the weight of cosmic mystery."
		""
		"Those who hold it swear they can hear a faint echo, like a heartbeat in the dark…"
		"A reminder that even the simplest beings may carry the essence of infinity."
	]
	quest.0A5C03A114ABF62D.quest_subtitle: "A reward wouldn't be useful enough for those who have made it this far..."
	quest.0A7940B06E7A3A56.quest_desc: [
		"This mod adds 7 new containers that function as both storage, and backpacks and so much more. These will be called danks from now on for the sake of brevity."
		""
		"These aren't your typical storage containers because each slot can hold much more than a normal stack and gets larger with each tier."
		""
		"Each tier can have it's stacksize and listed on the tooltip. Colors provide a visual means of determining the tier at a glance."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"To start off with, there are 2 modes: Construction and Bag. They can be switched between by toggling the usetype keybind with a dank in hand."
		""
		"In addition, there is also a block called a Dock that can be used to hold danks and allow them to interact with hoppers and other storage systems"
		""
		"Dock:"
		"They have the ItemHandler capability so they can be inserted/extracted with any form of item transport, and is compatible with Simple Storage Network and RS/AE2. as of 1.11, this also holds true for the item form as well."
		""
		"They can be harvested with anything, but break faster with a pickaxe and can be picked up instantly with a wrench "
		""
		"(Note: this mod does not use any wrenches and opts for datapack support (tag: items:forge:wrenches) because there's already 20 different mods that add their own wrenches and it only adds to JEI/inventory clutter)."
		""
		"Bag Mode:"
		"In bag mode, the dank acts like a backpack."
		""
		"Sneaking while hovering the tooltip will show contained items (limited to 10 since it crowds the screen) and the currently assigned keybinds."
	]
	quest.0A7940B06E7A3A56.title: "Dank Storage"
	quest.0A912B2E2BE34920.quest_desc: [
		"A method to extract Crude Oil from underground reservoirs. Requires power and pressure but is the first step toward oil processing."
		""
		""
		"{image:pneumaticcraft:textures/patchouli/oil_pumping.png width:200 height:200 align:right fit:true}"
	]
	quest.0AA074D4F7CBCED1.quest_desc: [
		"Use this table to &crefine weaker Gems&r into &d more powerful socketable items&r. Precision matters higher cutting quality means better stats. Basically, it's gem surgery."
		""
		"You need two &dgems&r of the same &etype&r and &elevel,&r &bgemdust&r, and &drarity ingredients&r of the same tier."
		""
		"&oYou can sometimes use materials of a lower rarity but you will need more.&r"
	]
	quest.0AA72D6706542CA6.quest_desc: [
		"A tech-focused mod introducing &bdigital item storage&r and &eautomated crafting&r via sophisticated &5ME Networks&r. Replaces traditional chests with a &dsearchable,&r channel-managed system using &6Storage Cells&r and &bquantum technology&r."
		""
		"Core Components:"
		""
		"&5ME Drives&r (hold digital storage media)"
		""
		"&bWireless Terminals&r (remote network access)"
		""
		"&dMolecular Assemblers&r (on-demand crafting)"
		""
		"&9Quantum Bridges&r (cross-dimensional networks)"
		""
		"*(Integrates with &6RF/FE&r power systems while maintaining unique &5AE2 energy&r mechanics.)*"
		""
		"&a\"Your entire base's inventory - one wireless terminal away\"&r"
	]
	quest.0AA72D6706542CA6.title: "&5Applied Energistics 2&r"
	quest.0ABDED0707E01F06.quest_desc: [
		"The Sack of Sating must be fed by right-clicking edible items into it, similar to storing items in a Bundle. When fed, it irreversibly stores the hunger value of the items within itself. If fed food contained in Bowls or Bottles, the Sack of Sating will return the Bowl or Bottle."
		""
		"When the player becomes hungry, the Sack of Sating will passively feed them, replenishing 1 (🍗) hunger every 5 seconds (100 ticks). This effect will stack if the player has multiple Sack of Sating in their inventory."
		""
		"&4Feeding the Sack of Sating certain items (like the Eternal Steak from the Artifacts mod) will cause it and the item to explode, creating an effect similar to a Nuclear Bomb, but pink and smaller. Be warned that this explosion may harm or kill the player."
	]
	quest.0ABDED0707E01F06.quest_subtitle: "Freaky ahh sack"
	quest.0AC7D844C55119E1.quest_desc: ["&lRight-Click&r to disconnect &epipes,&r and &lShift-Right-Click&r to break a &epipe.&r"]
	quest.0ACCCC1B217D98D0.quest_desc: [
		"These blocks provide the framing of the quantum computer. They are used as a building block for the quantum computer and"
		"connect everything together."
	]
	quest.0AD6897A8AB1CC5D.quest_desc: ["Use to check how much oil a deposit has."]
	quest.0ADA2391DDE7466E.quest_desc: ["An advanced control unit that manages engine performance and power output. It optimizes efficiency, regulates speed, and ensures smooth operation of complex machinery systems."]
	quest.0ADEFF34AAA0D7C7.quest_desc: [
		"Stamp iron and obsidian inside the DMA to craft this reusable press."
		""
		"You will use it just like standard AE2 inscriber presses to form printed dimensional circuits."
	]
	quest.0ADEFF34AAA0D7C7.quest_subtitle: "Precision Inscriber Die"
	quest.0ADEFF34AAA0D7C7.title: "Dimensional Processor Press"
	quest.0AE0E5AA8FB69FE2.quest_subtitle: "Gadgets for all situations"
	quest.0AE0E5AA8FB69FE2.title: "Welcome to Create:Connected"
	quest.0AE4B0BD9B765D60.quest_desc: [
		"Place the Surface Scanner atop the Machine Input and supply it with power."
		""
		"The 25 lights above indicate the 25 chunks closest to the scanner, with the center light marking the chunk it occupies. A light will illuminate if at least one Oil Deposit is detected in that chunk."
		""
		"That's all the guidance it provides time to start digging!"
	]
	quest.0AEAEA976ED0C470.quest_desc: ["Used to charge pneumatic tools and armor with compressed air. Essential when you begin using items like the Jackhammer or Minigun."]
	quest.0AEDFC064B84C877.quest_desc: [
		"Autocrafting is one of the primary functions of AE2. Instead of manually having to craft the correct number of each sub-ingredient and labor away like some sort of plebian, you can ask your ME system to do it for you. Or automatically craft items and export them somewhere. Or automatically keep certain amounts of items in stock through clever emergent behavior. It also works with fluids, and, if you have certain addons for extra mod material types, like Mekanism gasses, those materials too. It's pretty great."
		""
		"It is quite a complex topic, so strap in and let's go."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"An autocrafting setup consists of 3 things:"
		""
		"The thing sending the crafting request"
		"The crafting CPU"
		"The ME Pattern Provider."
		"Here is what happens:"
		""
		"Something creates a crafting request. This can be you in the terminal clicking on something autocraftable, or an export bus or interface with a crafting card requesting one of the item they're set to export/stock."
		"(IMPORTANT: use whatever you have bound to \"pick block\" (usually middle-mouse) to request crafts of something you already have in stock, this can conflict with inventory sorting mods),"
		"The ME system calculates the required ingredients and prerequisite crafting steps to fulfill the request, and stores them in the selected crafting CPU"
		""
		"The ME Pattern Provider with the relevant pattern pushes the ingredients specified in the pattern to any adjacent inventory. In the case of a crafting table recipe (a \"crafting pattern\") this will be a Molecular Assembler. In the case of a non-crafting recipe (a \"processing pattern\") this will be some other block or machine or elaborate redstone-controlled setup."
		""
		"The result of the craft is returned to the system somehow, be it by import bus, interface, or pushing the result back into a pattern provider. Note that an \"item entering system\" event must occur, you can't just pipe the result into a chest with a ME Storage Bus on it."
		""
		"If that craft is a prerequisite for another craft in the request, the items are stored in that crafting CPU and then used in that craft."
	]
	quest.0AEDFC064B84C877.title: "Auto-Crafting"
	quest.0AFFE685B5B34A56.quest_desc: [
		"&eWhat Is the ME Packaging Provider?&r"
		""
		"The &eME Packaging Provider&r is a powerful all-in-one machine that combines the functionality of a &ePackager&r and an &eUnpackager&r."
		""
		"It is designed to work &aexclusively&r with an &3ME Network&r and requires an AE2 channel."
		""
		"&eHow It Works&r"
		""
		"• Insert an encoded &ePackage Recipe Holder&r"
		"• The provider reads all stored recipes"
		"• Recipes are exposed directly to the ME Network"
		"• Requires an &3AE2&r channel"
		""
		"Depending on its configuration, the provider can handle packaging, unpackaging, or both automatically."
		""
		"&eProviding Modes&r"
		""
		"The ME Packaging Provider supports three different providing modes:"
		""
		"• &eDirect&r"
		"  – Provides a single large processing recipe"
		"  – Skips both packaging and unpackaging steps"
		""
		"• &ePackaging&r"
		"  – Provides packaging recipes"
		"  – Works like a normal &ePackager&r"
		""
		"• &eUnpackaging&r"
		"  – Provides unpackaging recipes"
		"  – Works like a normal &eUnpackager&r"
		""
		"&eWhy Use the ME Packaging Provider?&r"
		""
		"• Combines Packager and Unpackager in one block"
		"• Reduces machine count and wiring"
		"• Fully integrated into &3AE2&r autocrafting"
		"• Ideal for compact, high-performance setups"
	]
	quest.0AFFE685B5B34A56.title: "&eME Packaging Provider&r"
	quest.0B009391E3F76D6E.quest_desc: [
		"The fisher is an excellent source of early game food for your citizens. Hopefully you have a decent resource for string. With any luck the fisherman will also get some some extra loot. "
		""
		"If your colony lacks a natural water source like an ocean or river, you can make do with a 6x6x1 area of water. "
	]
	quest.0B16C3B1377A5C6C.quest_desc: [
		"The &bDimensional Matter Assembler&r has internal slots for catalysts to boost its performance."
		""
		"Chrono catalysts speed up recipe time, Matterflow cuts down power usage, and Quantum keeps outputs steady. Pop them into the machine to make your batches run smoother."
	]
	quest.0B16C3B1377A5C6C.quest_subtitle: "Internal Reaction Modifiers"
	quest.0B16C3B1377A5C6C.title: "DMA Catalysts (Tier I)"
	quest.0B1DF8A040826D87.quest_desc: [
		"Now that you have &4Rossinite&r, you can mix it with &bBenitoite&r to create &6Insanite Ingots&r."
		""
		"&bBenitoite Ore&r can be found in the &cNether&r."
	]
	quest.0B281C34E455EE72.quest_desc: ["Just a larger pumpjack."]
	quest.0B2DF0B5F4247A3F.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Items can be input into the Fermenter via the 2 hatches at the back that are marked with blue dots. The hatch with the orange dot serves as an item output and the block below it to output fluids. Applying a redstone signal to the control panel at the front will halt the machine's process, this behavior can be inverted by use of the Engineer's Screwdriver."
	]
	quest.0B2DF0B5F4247A3F.title: "Fermenter"
	quest.0B2FF8169FD3812D.quest_desc: ["Now &6replace&r some of the &bsteel casing &rwith these &ehatches.&r"]
	quest.0B3EA604C5172D98.quest_desc: [
		"For us to specify which &c&mDemon&r &9Friend&r we want to summon, we'll need to make a specific &bBook of Binding&r."
		""
		"To make this, you'll need to purify some Black Dye in &dSpiritfire&r to get Purified Ink. With this, we're going to make our first Book of Binding which will summon a &aFoliot&r Demon."
	]
	quest.0B3EA604C5172D98.title: "&bBooks of&r &dBinding&r"
	quest.0B561068C56FBB32.quest_desc: ["Shows you the &ctemperature,&r &agravity,&r and &boxygen&r levels of the space around you."]
	quest.0B5A46562DA0FFBC.quest_desc: ["It plays &bmusic&r from&l IRL&r &eradio channels&r, simply &lRight-Click&r on the &eradio&r then choose the &astation&r you want to listen to."]
	quest.0B5A46562DA0FFBC.quest_subtitle: "Somehow this works"
	quest.0B68E3C046C82860.title: "&6Deorum Ingots"
	quest.0B6A6B50D338546B.quest_desc: [
		"Jupiter Info:"
		"&aGravity:&r 24.714 m/s"
		"&bOxygen:&r none"
		"&cTemperature:&r -126 °C"
	]
	quest.0B6B6601CB180BAA.quest_desc: ["Placed in the &bfluid conduit&r, these can whitelist and &0blacklist&r up to &6five fluid&r types by placing the &6container&r of the &bliquid&r you want to &afilter&r &oin the &afilter&r.&r"]
	quest.0B7FFB9FF90F10CF.quest_subtitle: "Yummers"
	quest.0B8148DAF5CC9DF1.quest_desc: ["High current"]
	quest.0B88116C06EDF9D2.quest_desc: ["A &anew alloy&r with many uses, smelted with the &6alloy smelter&r."]
	quest.0B89EB36AC565461.quest_desc: ["Deep within this subterranean city, the heat of molten lava and the hum of industry dominate the air. The Nether’s influence is strong here, fueling forges and animating Forge Sentinels that patrol every corridor. Only those prepared for fire and steel will survive, and claim the treasures forged within."]
	quest.0B89EB36AC565461.quest_subtitle: "Find a Foundry"
	quest.0BA95CE9654FFC67.quest_desc: ["The entry tier of component matrices. Used to assemble 1B crafting storages, early co-processors, and advanced casings."]
	quest.0BA95CE9654FFC67.quest_subtitle: "Dimensional Shift Matrix"
	quest.0BA95CE9654FFC67.title: "Phase-Shift Component Matrix"
	quest.0BBE6CADED48A971.quest_desc: [
		"Click a Stock Link with the Stock Ticker to connect it to that network. Place a Mob in a Seat or a Blaze Burner behind the Stock Ticker to turn it into a Stock Keeper."
		""
		"The Stock Keeper can see all the items on the network. The UI displays how many Stock Links are connected. If the Stock Keeper is left unlocked, players can search the network, request items, and give their requests an Address to be sent to."
		""
		"If the Stock Keeper is locked, other players will not be able to access its UI. The Stock Keeper will still be able to accept Shopping Lists."
	]
	quest.0BFE9E9F4EF6C9C7.quest_desc: [
		"&0Relays&r also have &cMultiple tiers&r and will move &eEMC&r from &ecollectors&r attached to them into &6Condensers&r also attached to the &0relay.&r"
		""
		"&0Relays&r can also &edrain EMC&r from items to then input into nearby &6condensers.&r"
	]
	quest.0C0D0B80B3FA26F2.quest_desc: ["An upgrade to the &bElite Fluid Tank&r."]
	quest.0C0DF208C802277E.quest_desc: [
		"There are two types of &6Energy condensers&r, &aMk1&r and &bMk2.&r"
		""
		"&aMk1:&r &eConverts items&r in the &astorage area&r into the item placed in the &6top slot&r by the &eyellow bar&r."
		""
		"&bMk2:&r Similar to the &aMk1,&r however this chest will&e convert items&r in the &aleft side&r to the item in the &6top slot&r which will be placed in the &bright slot&r and can be extracted with &cMekanism pipes&r."
	]
	quest.0C0DF208C802277E.quest_subtitle: "Obsidian is a pain to mine, have some compensation"
	quest.0C110E8F2F0509EC.quest_desc: ["&bFly&r between &dstars.&r Ignore the &0void.&r Become the &bsky.&r"]
	quest.0C15462C836B4C7B.quest_desc: ["Crafted with &biron&r and &cscarlet neodymium&r, this is the base for some &6crafting recipes&r."]
	quest.0C596CB7C7C24615.quest_desc: ["Boosts &aEterna&r and &cQuanta&r with a good Max."]
	quest.0C6719D81DE5A614.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The Forge requires 4 different items to be powered: Aureal, Souls, Blood, and Experience."
		""
		"To learn more, follow the corner quests."
	]
	quest.0C6D0B1C1AF75292.quest_desc: ["Changes some&b item's states,&r creates &9new items, &ror &anew liquids.&r"]
	quest.0C6D669301F8655A.quest_desc: [
		"The &eFluid Sieving Machine&r processes &afluids&r to extract valuable &amaterials&r."
		""
		"Provide it with &dpower&r and the specific &afluid&r you want to sieve."
		""
		"The &eFluid Sieving Machine&r will separate the &afluid&r into its components, producing useful &amaterials&r as output."
	]
	quest.0C8F501F6BDFFB92.quest_desc: ["Obtained by putting a Gold Ingot in a Rolling Mill."]
	quest.0C8F501F6BDFFB92.quest_subtitle: "Crafting component."
	quest.0CB1D02EA360398E.quest_desc: ["The &bMachine Infuser&r in &5RFTools&r is used to enhance and upgrade various machines, improving their efficiency and capabilities by infusing them with &aDimensional Shards&r."]
	quest.0CE497493208E8AC.quest_desc: ["Also dropped from the &dunderzealot&r, you will &6craft&r with this."]
	quest.0CE50A7F4F1A0E4D.quest_desc: ["ladder stretches skyward, disappearing into the clouds. At its top floats a strange, floating vessel. What secrets or dangers await above, none can say… except that the view alone is enough to make even the bravest adventurer’s stomach turn."]
	quest.0CE50A7F4F1A0E4D.quest_subtitle: "Find a Small Blimp"
	quest.0CF441CB162B62B2.quest_desc: [
		"The &eSewage Composter&r processes &cSewage&r into &aFertilizer&r."
		""
		"Provide it with &cSewage&r, which can be collected from animal farms using &eSewage Collectors&r, to produce &aFertilizer&r for crops."
	]
	quest.0D158BAE5A38798A.quest_desc: ["Allows the player to fly, move and swim faster. Works with water"]
	quest.0D2F5CC96269F9E3.quest_desc: ["Used with Etching Acid to chemically process exposed PCBs. Slowly converts them into Unassembled PCBs."]
	quest.0D31CD79BE6CC8D2.quest_desc: ["A food crafting ingredient made under specific conditions in the Thermopneumatic Plant. Used in recipes like Sourdough or Salmon Tempura."]
	quest.0D5015B8FF482D0A.quest_desc: ["Used to access the Amadron system, a drone-based trading network. Allows you to buy or sell items using in-game currency or fluids."]
	quest.0D6D45DBA64E612D.quest_desc: [
		"Applying the &aFrontier Spawner Upgrade Rune&r upgrades the spawner's core stats to Tier 1:"
		""
		"• &eMin Spawn Delay:&r 150 ticks (7.5s)"
		"• &eMax Spawn Delay:&r 600 ticks (30s)"
		"• &bSpawn Count:&r 7 mobs"
		"• &cMax Nearby Entities:&r 12"
		"• &dPlayer Activation Range:&r 24 blocks"
	]
	quest.0D6D45DBA64E612D.title: "Tier I: Frontier Upgrade Rune"
	quest.0D6E099A1A242153.quest_desc: [
		"The &bBuild Tool&r is one of the most important tools in the mod. It's how you will place all building from now on. Right+click any solid item to open the build preview GUI. On the right are controls for moving, rotating, raising, and lowering your building. "
		""
		"Place your &bTown Hall&r block and register your colony. However, the first building to be constructed is the builders hut. Your Town Hall cannot be built until you have a completed builders hut."
		""
		""
		"{image:minecolonies:textures/quests/hc_build_tool.png width:190 height:100 align:1}"
	]
	quest.0D9F327D30321040.quest_desc: ["&4Voidborn&r and &dancient,&r this table is used for &ehigher cost crafting&r."]
	quest.0DA65A502C57261C.quest_desc: ["Just like any other create contraption, you can superglue basically anything to a pumpjack, with the stipulation that the main arm is complete."]
	quest.0DA972D85BB3C86C.quest_desc: [
		"Coke Oven is a multi-block machine added by the Immersive Engineering mod. It turns Coal into Coal Coke and creates Creosote as a byproduct."
		""
		"The Coke oven makes charcoal, coal coke, or coal coke blocks. Input logs will be converted to charcoal, coal will create coal coke, and coal blocks create coal coke blocks. Coal coke can smelt 16 items and coal coke blocks can smelt 160 items. "
		""
		"Coal coke is also used as fuel for crude and improved blast furnaces since it cannot take regular coal."
	]
	quest.0DA972D85BB3C86C.quest_subtitle: "Hot Topic!"
	quest.0DA972D85BB3C86C.title: "Coke Oven"
	quest.0DCFCBCFB363C921.quest_desc: ["Your whole farm is now in 1 block."]
	quest.0DCFCBCFB363C921.quest_subtitle: "Can't be easier than that"
	quest.0DD9575CCAD78266.quest_desc: [
		"&bIndustrial Foregoing&r is a &6technology mod&r that offers automation for &dresource processing&r, &afarming&r, &cmob management&r, and &9energy control&r."
		""
		"Including the &3Plant Gatherer&r and &5Plant Sower&r for crop automation, the &cFluid Extractor&r and &dLatex Processing Unit&r for fluid management, and the &9Pitiful Generator&r for power generation."
		""
		"Mob interactions are handled by the &dMob Crusher&r and &eMob Duplicator&r, while the &bAnimal Rancher&r automates animal product collection."
		""
		"Transport systems like &eConveyor Belts&r and &bFluid Pipes&r ensure efficient resource movement."
		""
		"&bIndustrial Foregoing&r simplifies automation and boosts efficiency in Minecraft."
	]
	quest.0DDC8C4F4BE5788D.quest_desc: [
		"The &aChestpiece&r is used to protect you on top of your already worn armor. On its own, it does nothing; you have to upgrade it with modules."
		""
		"The &aWyvern Chest Piece&r has a grid of &b6x5&r for modules."
	]
	quest.0E01D082BFC07BF4.quest_desc: ["&eInfinite chemical storage&r at your fingertips."]
	quest.0E02CE4469FCA4C9.quest_desc: [
		"Applying the &cRedstone Control Spawner Rune&r enables Redstone Control."
		""
		"The spawner will only generate mobs when powered by a redstone signal, allowing full automation and shutdown control."
	]
	quest.0E02CE4469FCA4C9.title: "Redstone Control Rune"
	quest.0E2A7FD65EF7EFFE.quest_desc: ["The &aProjectile Damage Module&r increases the damage done by your arrows."]
	quest.0E44E5C58D943786.quest_desc: [
		"Sirens are sailors' worst nightmare and for good reasons. They singing causes mind control, they lure their prey and deliver a final blow. "
		"Sirens can be found in the open seas on small rock formations."
	]
	quest.0E547F2503A07ACE.quest_desc: ["A sturdy mechanical drill made of iron, designed for efficient mining and material processing. It delivers reliable power and durability, perfect for automating excavation tasks and breaking tough blocks with ease."]
	quest.0E580153F1936699.quest_desc: ["A powerful machine that converts excess energy or items into stored matter. It’s essential for producing singularities and other high-tier materials used in advanced storage and automation systems."]
	quest.0E5FC39E6C71A872.quest_desc: ["The shaft is a basic mechanical component in Create. A shaft can be used to connect two mechanical components such that the rotation of one rotates the other, and shafts serve as the only blocks upon which Mechanical Belts can be placed."]
	quest.0E5FC39E6C71A872.title: "Shaft"
	quest.0E63C1AD9074987E.quest_desc: ["Melt quartz in the blast furnace and cast the resulting liquid silicon."]
	quest.0E72EF13D91DF064.quest_desc: [
		"The first step in &dspace exploration&r."
		"The &bMoon&r has valuable resources like &6Desh&r. (and &echeese&r, yumm)"
		""
		"Moon Info:"
		"&aGravity:&r 1.625 m/s"
		"&bOxygen:&r None"
		"&cTemperature:&r -160.0 °C"
		""
		"To get to the &dmoon&r, you need &nthree&r buckets of &efuel,&r and your &areturn journey&r also needs &nthree&r."
	]
	quest.0E72EF13D91DF064.title: "The moon"
	quest.0E7B5DB74C3C9ACB.quest_desc: ["The &6Magma Generator&r burns &9Lava&r to generate &cEnergy&r. This generator is perfect for players in or near the Nether, providing a reliable source of power from hot materials."]
	quest.0E7C77B6B57340E6.quest_desc: ["More storage."]
	quest.0E8F0E3589291140.quest_desc: [
		"Welcome to the &bBasic Storage System&r chapter! Here, you'll learn about essential mods that improve your storage capabilities in Minecraft. This chapter covers:"
		""
		"- &eSophisticated Backpacks and Storage&r"
		"- &6Dank&r"
		""
		"These mods offer a variety of &dstorage solutions&r to help you manage your &aitems&r and &cfluids&r efficiently."
		""
		"&eSophisticated Backpacks&r offer portable storage with upgradeable features, allowing you to carry more items on your adventures."
		""
		"&eSophisticated Storage&r adds smarter storage solutions to Minecraft, including larger chests, barrels, and backpacks with upgrades like sorting, filtering, and auto-pickup."
		""
		"&6Dank&r introduces 7 new containers that function as both storage and backpacks. Each slot can hold much more than a normal stack and increases with each tier. The stack size and tier color are fully configurable and shown in the tooltip, providing a quick visual reference."
		""
		""
		"Explore each mod to find the best storage solutions for your needs and enhance your overall gameplay experience."
	]
	quest.0E9258C07CDD7385.quest_desc: [
		"A Wrench made of Certus Quartz Crystal or Nether Quartz."
		""
		"Useful for rotating blocks, and removing individual parts from Cables."
	]
	quest.0E9F3510205FE096.quest_desc: ["Speeds up the growth of the plant."]
	quest.0E9F3510205FE096.quest_subtitle: "Improved Growth"
	quest.0EB2BB5FA8BED1B7.quest_desc: [
		"&5Left click&r - &4shears&r the &aanimal&r."
		""
		"&6Right click&r on a tree - &9Breaks&r all wood blocks in the &aarea&r of the right-clicked block."
		""
		"&6Right click&r on leaves - &4Shears&r all &2leaf&r blocks in the &barea&r of the right-clicked block, &3dropping&r them as items."
		""
		"&6Right click&r on grass - &8Tills&r all &edirt&r in the area of &9effect&r."
		""
		"&dPressing&r [&4Change Mode&r] will execute a &eattack&r that will insta &0kill&r most &2mob&r/&cbosses&r"
		""
		"&dPressing&r the [&4Change Mode&r] button will &9change&r the mode of the &0death&r swing between Slay-All and Slay-Agro."
	]
	quest.0EB2BB5FA8BED1B7.quest_subtitle: "Good luck killing the Chaos Dragon to make this"
	quest.0EB5B926E1FBAF0E.quest_desc: ["This upgraded &dEnchanting Table&r unlocks the real magic. &6Higher level caps&r, new enchantments, and full control over outcomes &bno more RNG&r rage. Just make sure your library setup is &etop tier&r."]
	quest.0EB8FB3CD73A611E.quest_desc: [
		"Arguably the best &aearly&r-&emid game&r bee setup."
		"The multiblock is a very simple 3x3, you can build the &5multiblock&r like so:"
		""
		""
		"{image:ftb:textures/quests/mystian.png width:200 height:90 align:center}"
	]
	quest.0EB8FB3CD73A611E.title: "Mystian Apiary Controller"
	quest.0EBB4E5195610A82.quest_desc: [
		"The Sawmill is where the Carpenter will craft any items made of at least 75% wood. This is the point where the colony really starts to feel like it’s running on its own. Be sure to set up important recipes for items your builder regularly needs. While the sawmill starts with a paltry 10 recipes, the number of recipes you can teach the Sawmill doubles per building level."
		""
		"Tip: Be sure to give your carpenter a &ebuild tool&r as some recipes require it. "
	]
	quest.0EBB4E5195610A82.quest_subtitle: "Build a Sawmill"
	quest.0ECD78BDD6FABA7C.quest_desc: [
		"Assembler Matrix is a multiblock structure. It is an combination of Molecular Assembler and Pattern Provider."
		""
		"It can run a lot crafting jobs at the same (with enough Crafting Accelerators in your ME network) and save channels for you."
		""
		"It is a rectangular prism, with edge lengths between 3 and 7. "
		"- Edges composed of &cAssembler Matrix Frame&r."
		"- Faces composed of &9Assembler Matrix Wall/Glass&r."
		"- Interior composed of &2Assembler Matrix Pattern/Craft/Speed Core&r."
		""
		"A valid Assembler Matrix must contain at least one pattern core and craft core. "
		"It must be completely filled and can't be hollow."
		"When Assembler Matrix is correctly formed and powered, the lines on Assembler Matrix Frame will turn blue."
		"{image:kubejs:block/screen/extended_ae_multiblock width:200 height:200 align:center}"
	]
	quest.0ECD78BDD6FABA7C.title: "Advanced AE Multiblock"
	quest.0ED1670F8AEB8077.quest_desc: ["Has 6 slots for Constructing."]
	quest.0ED4263270D37EF6.quest_desc: ["&dPowerful tools&r that run on &ediesel&r as fuel."]
	quest.0EE2E9EB6DC01E34.quest_subtitle: "Crafting ingredient"
	quest.0EEA8C33BC327CCA.quest_desc: ["The Pattern Access Terminal serves to solve a specific issue: in a dense tower of ME Pattern Providers and Molecular Assemblers, you can't physically access the providers to insert new patterns. Additionally, perhaps you're lazy and don't want to walk across your base to insert a pattern. The pattern access terminal allows access to all pattern providers on the network."]
	quest.0EF4982211D87606.quest_desc: [
		"To increase the &aMorgan&r’s damage cap, you now need to toss &bMithril Weaves&r into the lake instead of &3Nether Stars&r."
		"                      This"
		"{image:supplementaries:block/cannon_arrow width:15 height:15 align:center}"
		""
		"{image:irons_spellbooks:item/mithril_weave width:15 height:15 align:center}"
	]
	quest.0F00BBDF3618B3BA.quest_desc: ["This lets you access your storage, but with a crafting table! \\n \\nLet's be honest, no one just uses regular Grids."]
	quest.0F00BBDF3618B3BA.title: "Crafting Grid"
	quest.0F031E62E5235251.quest_desc: ["A &ecrucial component&r in crafting &5Creative Essence&r. And used to make &dInsanium bees&r."]
	quest.0F11F9D74E9F54E3.quest_desc: ["The &aFlight Module&r gives you an Elytra on your Chest Piece."]
	quest.0F2B26C04A3593A9.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.0F2DC52E03408D83.quest_desc: [
		"Crafting on a stick let's you craft items without the need to place a crafting table on the ground."
		""
		"This mod adds multiple workbenches on a stick:"
		"Crafting Table"
		"Anvil"
		"Loom"
		"Grindstone"
		"Cartography Table"
		"Stonecutter"
		"Smithing Table"
		""
		"You can use these items in hand to access the workbenches."
	]
	quest.0F2DC52E03408D83.title: "Crafting on a stick"
	quest.0F409DACBEB7BBF8.quest_desc: ["Depending on the pack style you choose, supply ships may need to be placed in water, or in the air. Clear an area large enough to fit your supply ship. This may include digging under water, depending on where you place your ship. The supply ship will not place if there are objects in the way. Right clicking the supply ship on the ground will show a 3D preview of the camp. Using the placement controls arrows, position the ship in your clearing, then click the green checkmark to finalize the placement. If it won’t place, then the terrain is in the way, and you may need to clear the area more. Red lines will appear showing you the areas that need to be cleared."]
	quest.0F4A8482026EE4BD.quest_subtitle: "Used in most of the Endgame Crafts!"
	quest.0F56F31F2751A477.quest_desc: ["An amazing form of &btransport&r on the planets. &lRight-Click&r to enter &lShift&r to exit and &lShift-Right-Click&r to open its &einvertory.&r"]
	quest.0F5EC96CAAA5302B.quest_desc: ["This block has &asix filter&r, &binput&r, and &eoutput slots&r, each &binput slot&r will only take in &bitems&r set in the &afilter row&r, and once it has the &6same quantity and type&r of &bitems&r as the &afilter&r the &bitems&r will move to the &eoutput slots&r to be &ccollected.&r"]
	quest.0F740C8970428753.quest_desc: ["Crafted from &eferroslime,&r these boots &bprevent fall damage&r, and make you &abouncy!&r"]
	quest.0F75D7B9F4FF2459.quest_desc: ["&rThe Building Gadgets 2 mod speeds up building by letting players quickly place or remove large areas of blocks."]
	quest.0F75D7B9F4FF2459.title: "Building Gadget"
	quest.0F77A9AD1F422537.quest_desc: ["A generaly good &6Bookshelf,&r however these shelves have a &aaverage Max&r &aEterna,&r so get ready for stronger shelves in your setup with this one."]
	quest.0F89BFD4A3F63A48.quest_desc: ["Applying the &eIgnore Light Spawner Rune&r forces the spawner to ignore all light level requirements, allowing hostile mobs to spawn in broad daylight."]
	quest.0F89BFD4A3F63A48.title: "Ignore Light Rune"
	quest.0F9B3AD28BA138CA.quest_desc: ["Use in a &aSmithing table&r with an item to add a &esocket&r to that item so it can hold more &dGems.&r"]
	quest.0FA2D721EFBA7DC0.quest_desc: [
		"The &bEnchantment Sorter&r organizes &aenchanted items&r by their enchantments."
		""
		"Place the &aenchanted items&r into the input slots and provide it with &dpower&r."
		""
		"The &bEnchantment Sorter&r will sort the items into different categories based on their &aenchantments&r, making it easier to manage and utilize them."
	]
	quest.0FCD5DFA1F96F41D.quest_desc: [
		"The &bLaser Lens&r is used with the &dLaser Drill&r to specify the type of &amaterial&r to mine."
		""
		"Place the &bLaser Lens&r into the &dLaser Drill&r's interface."
		""
		"Different colors of &bLaser Lens&r correspond to different &amaterials&r, influencing the &dLaser Drill&r's output."
	]
	quest.0FCD5DFA1F96F41D.title: "Laser lens"
	quest.0FD54A3728F4D93E.quest_desc: ["The very best &dSpell book&r with many &espell slots&r and a &6low cooldown&r."]
	quest.0FF49F7DD4D172CF.quest_desc: [
		"&#DD5EFFArs Nouveau&r is a magic mod that allows players to craft their own spells, create magical &ba&r&brtifacts&r, perform &crituals&r, and much more."
		""
		"With &cArs Nouveau&r you will learn to harness the mana infused in all things to cast powerful &dspells&r, drive arcane &emachinery&r, and even to empower some cute &afriends&r along the way."
	]
	quest.0FF49F7DD4D172CF.title: "Welcome to &eArs Nouveau"
	quest.0FF852DE33E41C90.quest_desc: [
		"If we want to create massive amounts of &4Power&r, we'll need a way to store all of it, and those &aEnergy Cubes&r just won't cut it."
		""
		"We're going to create a customizable multiblock used to store large amounts of power, but first, we need to make some &3Lithium Dust&r!"
		""
		"You should have some &eBrine&r being made from a previous quest using the &cThermal Evaporation Plants&r."
		""
		"Run the &eBrine&r through another &cThermal Evaporation Plant&r to get &7Lithium&r, then through a &9Chemical Crystallizer&r to get &aLithium Dust&r."
	]
	quest.0FF852DE33E41C90.title: "Advanced Power Storage"
	quest.0FFFAB42C8994C3B.quest_desc: [
		"&l&lRight-Click&r&l&r the &dScribes Table&r with your &dspellbook&r and a menu will appear in which you can view know and unknown &aglyphs&r for you to craft, just click on the glyph you want to craft, view its &brequierments&r (&oeither floating above the table after selecting or in the bottom of the menu&r) and with the cost of &aXP&r and &lRight-Clicking&r the table with the necessary &bmaterials&r it will write you the glyph! &lRight-Click&r with a glyph to unlock it."
		""
		"&cNote&r: you can only use glyphs if your &ds&r&dpellbook&r is a high enough tier    &aNovice&r = 1  &bMage's&r = 2  &dArchmage&r = 3"
	]
	quest.1002F4E426C36598.quest_desc: [
		"The &dFermentation Station&r converts &aorganic materials&r into &aEthanol&r."
		""
		"Place &aorganic items&r into the input slots and provide it with &dpower&r."
		""
		"It produces &aEthanol&r, which can be used as fuel or in crafting recipes."
	]
	quest.1031061467ECD680.quest_desc: ["You will find &epillars of neodymium&r throughout the &dmagnetic caves&r, the &9Azure version&r has the ability to &apush you&r while holding or wearing &dmagnetic items&r."]
	quest.104EBBC08B4733F5.quest_desc: [
		"Once your model is Basic or higher, you can use the simulation chamber to run simulations of your model. "
		""
		"Simulations will always produce a generalized prediction, and may also produce a Mob Prediction, based on the accuracy of the model. "
		""
		"The higher tier of the model, the higher the accuracy, up to 99.5% at Self Aware. Running simulations requires energy (based on the model type) and a catalyst item, which is usually a Prediction Matrix."
	]
	quest.1065B5980FAF5937.quest_desc: [
		"Pipe crude oil into the Distillation Controller and collect products from each output."
		""
		"Blaze Burner heating is required. Steel tanks can be 1x1, 2x2, or 3x3, with larger sizes allowing more heating, which can increase the distilling rate."
		""
		"The minimum height tower has three outputs and produces Heavy Oil, Diesel, and Gasoline."
		""
		"Adding two more outputs allows production of LPG and Kerosene."
		""
		"Adding one more output lets you extract Naphtha."
		""
		"Outputs can be configured to void excess fluid or stop refining when full to prevent wasting oil."
	]
	quest.1070E5EB5869C5DB.title: "&eElite Crafting&r"
	quest.1081BFCAB3F07FFF.quest_desc: [
		"&lFirst:&r Place a &l3x3 square&r of &cheatproof&r &cmachine casing&r on the ground."
		"&lSecond:&r Place the&6 Bronze plated bricks&r in a &lhollow 3x3x3 Cube&r on &ntop&r with your &eSteam boiler&r in one side."
		"&lThird:&r place &aPipe machine casing&r &lINSIDE&r the cube and replace some of the &cheatproof casing&r with &6hatches.&r"
		""
		"In the&b item input&r add &ccoal,&r &9water&r in the&9 fluid input, &rand &bsteam&r out the &aoutput hatch.&r"
	]
	quest.1081BFCAB3F07FFF.title: "Large Steam Boiler"
	quest.1094111FB9512D75.quest_desc: ["Generates &eelectricity&r based on the &6oil/diseal&r inside."]
	quest.109AD73F016D576B.quest_desc: [
		"Productive Bees has excellent JEI integration, so you can learn a lot about bees by looking them up in JEI. They all have “bee” in the name, so they’re easy to search for. "
		""
		"Once you find the bee you want, left-clicking will give you information about how to get the bee (what nest type it likes, or what other bees you need to interbreed, or the like), while right-clicking will show you information about what the bee does once you have it what food it needs, what resources it produces, what blocks (if any) it can destroy/alter, and what other bee species can be bred from it. There’s usually also an “info” tab (marked with a 🛈) with general information."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"This also works for most non-bee things; for example, left-clicking on a nest will give you its recipe, while right-clicking on it will tell you what biomes it supports and what sorts of bees it can attract."
		""
		"If you’re already familiar with JEI, these are the “recipe for” and “uses of” views."
	]
	quest.109AD73F016D576B.title: "Learning about bees"
	quest.10A4748598F5EE60.quest_desc: ["This storage cell allows you to store all types of items, fluids, and chemicals in one cell. No longer do you need separate storage cells for items, fluids, and chemicals."]
	quest.10B3C9982C378951.quest_desc: ["The &aAuto Fire Module&r enables auto fire with your bow."]
	quest.10B7BB5203B5E615.quest_desc: ["Apply special upgrades to your gear using &6sigils of Enhancement&r. Insert Sigil → &aboost&r or &creroll&r existing powerful &bpassive bonuses&r. Simple, elegant, and a core part of late game optimization."]
	quest.10C527C66EE4E95A.quest_desc: ["Has an &aamazing max&r with crazy &dstat buffs&r plus extra &eRectifaction&r."]
	quest.10EF77AB8EF3EEF7.quest_desc: [
		"Once you have a &61k Storage Component&r, you can craft a &b1k ME Item Storage Cell&r to begin your digital item storage journey. For most of your storage needs, you'll want to create several &bME Item Storage Cells&r."
		""
		"Each &bME Item Storage Cell&r can store up to &d63 different item types&r. When you add a new item type to a cell, it uses part of the cell's total &acapacity in bytes&r. Each type already stored uses &a1 byte&r for every &d8 items&r of that type."
		""
		"For example, a &b1k ME Item Storage Cell&r filled with only cobblestone can hold up to &d8,128 cobblestone&r (&d8*1024 bytes&r total capacity - &d8 bytes&r for the single item type)."
		""
		"If you need to repurpose an empty cell, you can disassemble it back into its component parts and housing. To do this, sneak and &aright-click in the air&r with the cell in your hand."
	]
	quest.10F23B659055346C.quest_desc: ["UFO™ is not responsible if the user ascends to a higher plane."]
	quest.10F556BBB559E13F.quest_desc: ["The &dbest&r of the &dbest,&r &6no one can match you&r. You can bring &agrowth&r and &alife&r to the world around you"]
	quest.10F556BBB559E13F.quest_subtitle: "Planets would grow from this, if you let them."
	quest.1104AA174B3ADFA6.quest_desc: ["By placing &0coal&r or other &csmeltable items&r into this, it will &eburn them&r for &apower&r in use for &dother machines!&r"]
	quest.1112E4E2CCEB2467.quest_desc: [
		"So now, you should have 5 machines ready to go to process your Ores. "
		""
		"Your factory should be something like this:"
		"Chemical Injection Chamber to Purifying Chamber to Crusher to Enrichment Chamber to Smelter."
	]
	quest.1112E4E2CCEB2467.title: "Ore Factory: Tier 3"
	quest.1118F827D5CCFB65.quest_desc: [
		"Solidifies Fluid XP."
		"Requires an XP Moult and Fluid XP in its tank."
	]
	quest.113E1D3C37C63088.quest_desc: ["Obtained by putting a Gold Sheet in a Rolling Mill."]
	quest.113E1D3C37C63088.quest_subtitle: "Crafting component."
	quest.114A296C740C26F8.quest_desc: ["This is the&6 normal progression&r of the shelves to reach &llevel 50&r. There is not much to describe. Just follow the quests, choosing whichever is easiest, starting with &chellshelves&r or &bseashelves.&r You do not need to use both together."]
	quest.1162544BA1B2B0F3.quest_desc: ["An upgrade to the &aBasic Chemical tank&r."]
	quest.11832E837D9EBCDA.quest_desc: [
		"You can’t breathe in space! Use &bOxygen&r &bloader&r for your &asuit,&r and &6Tanks.&r"
		""
		""
		"Place &9water&r in the left slot which will turn it into &boxygen&r which is collected via a &6gas&r &6tank&r or &bsuit&r in the right slot."
	]
	quest.11832E837D9EBCDA.title: "Loading oxygen"
	quest.118714D6A53388D1.quest_subtitle: "Even poseidon himself fears whoever holds this trident."
	quest.1188D57C76DBD215.quest_desc: [
		"Potentiometers allow a percentage of the input voltage to pass to the output side. Unlike in real life, they do not waste power."
		""
		"For example, if your base is wired at 3 kV but your lights only require 150 V, you can set a potentiometer for the lights at 5%. This way, they don’t consume several kW for no benefit."
	]
	quest.119CB7DC2A3AD8B6.quest_desc: ["Drop &5Quantum Foam&r in &2Overworld&r at y coordinate above &c1000.&r"]
	quest.119CB7DC2A3AD8B6.quest_subtitle: "Heaven"
	quest.11B42EB302FA9DDF.quest_desc: ["Used in crafting and for a block that provides &aEterna&r to &dEnchanting tables&r."]
	quest.11B642D71326CB26.quest_desc: [
		"The &dSludge Bucket&r contains &dSludge&r collected from machines like the &bPlant Gatherer&r."
		""
		"It can be processed in a &bSkudge Refiner&r to obtain useful &amaterials&r."
	]
	quest.11C065375DF7AC3E.quest_desc: [
		"To create an Arcane Crystal Obelisk, place down an Arcane Polished Darkstone block, then place two Arcane Crystal Blocks on top of it."
		""
		"Right-click with Mundabitur Dust and you'll create the obelisk."
		""
		"When placed on a Arcane Chiseled Polished Darkstone block on the Hephaestus Forge structure, it will slowly generate Aureal over time."
	]
	quest.11D8E015814D44F8.quest_desc: ["Goes on top of the vat and takes different attachments. Requires rotational power."]
	quest.11E16D072634AAF5.quest_desc: [
		"The &aEnder Crafter&r will launch the &9Ender Alternators&r power in a 7x7x7 area around it. The Ender Crafter is the center block."
		""
		"If you have more Ender Alternators in the zone, you can produce faster."
	]
	quest.11E16D072634AAF5.title: "&3The Ender Crafter"
	quest.120152510AD4B59A.quest_desc: ["While you might think your builder needs glasses sometimes, these goggles won’t help them. The Builders googles are for you. When you put them on your head or in a curio head slot they allow you to preview your buildings at level 5 which is helpful when fitting one building next to another."]
	quest.120152510AD4B59A.quest_subtitle: "It’s A Samsquanch!"
	quest.120B72E8FF699F50.quest_desc: [
		"Insulated alloy plates engineered to withstand the extreme heat, pressure, and radiation of celestial environments."
		""
		"Used as the primary protective material for crafting Thermal Resistor gear and UFO suit components."
	]
	quest.120B72E8FF699F50.quest_subtitle: "Extreme-Environment Alloy"
	quest.120B72E8FF699F50.title: "Thermal Resistor Plating"
	quest.1210C5B720AE249F.quest_subtitle: "Just crush some dirt i guess."
	quest.12282CBB658F1132.quest_desc: ["&6Charms&r give you &dpotion effects&r just by sitting in your inventory. &nNo need to wear them&r just carry and enjoy. Great for stacking niche bonuses or getting utility effects without sacrificing armor slots. You can &lRight-Click&r to turn them on or off."]
	quest.122ADB52566ED255.quest_desc: ["After placing this block &eabove&r or &einside&r &bwater&r, it will &6harvest crops&r in a &aconfigurable&r &arange&r around it."]
	quest.122EDEC12C9A05D2.quest_desc: ["Add safety to your machines with Security Upgrades. These prevent overpressure explosions and are vital in large or automated setups."]
	quest.123995A28774EFE0.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.124958C6D93E97CC.quest_desc: [
		"The &bScreen Link&r in &5RFTools&r is used to link multiple screens together, allowing them to share information and display &bsynchronized data&r."
		""
		"To use the &bScreen Link&r:"
		"1. &n&bRight-click&r the screen you want to link with another screen to open its &6GUI&r."
		"2. Insert the &bScreen Link&r module into the screen's module slot."
		"3. Configure the &bScreen Link&r to connect with the other screen(s) you want to synchronize."
		"4. The linked screens will now display &bsynchronized information&r, providing a cohesive display setup."
	]
	quest.124D0AB2864B4EE8.quest_desc: ["Has 18 filter slots and works 2x faster."]
	quest.128C850EFE438E33.quest_desc: ["This can be used as a normal &6crafting table&r, or crafted for &6crafting table storage&r, similar to blocks of &bDiamond&r and &egold.&r"]
	quest.12A43F82FC67A289.quest_desc: ["To store your items, you'll need to create disks that are stored in a &aDisk Drive&r. You can attach this to your network by placing it beside your Controller, or by using pipes. \\\\n \\\\n These have 8 slots for Storage Drives."]
	quest.12A43F82FC67A289.quest_subtitle: "Floppy time!"
	quest.12A43F82FC67A289.title: "Creating Virtual Storage"
	quest.12AA4397C05B59F8.quest_desc: ["Allows you to put&a your XP&r into &aXP&r &6jars&r and &econtainers,&r simply &lshift-right-click&r on a block that can hold &aXP&r to &9store&r &aXP&r and &lRight-Click&r to &aretrieve&r it back."]
	quest.12BC85DE4BD4D22D.quest_desc: [
		"This bizarre oven doesn’t bake cookies it brews chaos. Essential for crafting little gingerbread  people that do far more than rot your teeth."
		""
		"&6Gingerbread Men spawned from a Confection Oven are hostile towards any mob, even attacking Gingerbread Men that aren't of the same color - their attack patterns are also more aggressive, as they will not flee after hitting a mob. In addition to this, they will grab any item off the ground, immediately seeking out a Gingerbarrel to deposit their loot if one is within range. Once the Confection Oven that spawned them heats back up after a 15-second cooldown, they will immediately die&f."
	]
	quest.12D271359D48210E.quest_desc: [
		"&6Fusion Reactors&r require a very special fuel: &dD-T Fuel&r to be exact."
		""
		"There are two ways to fuel the &6Reactor&r: Either by pumping in &dD-T Fuel&r directly into the &6Reactor&r at &b&o1,000mb/t&r, or by pumping each of the two fuels  in separately at controlled rates."
		""
		"For starters, let's pump them in separately."
	]
	quest.12D271359D48210E.title: "&dD-T Fuel&r"
	quest.12E132BD1A31FB8D.quest_desc: ["You've &aawakened it&r, now &cdestroy it&r."]
	quest.12EA6EFDCFB18A5C.quest_desc: ["A conductive compound used to craft energy related components. Essential for progressing through Powah’s tech tree."]
	quest.12EA6EFDCFB18A5C.title: "&2The Dielectric Paste"
	quest.12F3B542158E90ED.quest_desc: ["Summoned when the &dunderzealots&r grab a &cVesper&r and &aperform the ritual&r."]
	quest.12F3B542158E90ED.quest_subtitle: "Defeat the forsaken boss"
	quest.12F4980CB3BFCE0D.quest_desc: ["&dEnchanting clues&r is just more info on what you enchant. If you get &l+4&r you can usually see everything you'll get."]
	quest.130E8FC7479E4271.quest_desc: [
		"The Shepherd’s Hut is where the Shepherd will breed and butcher sheep for food and wool. You will have to capture and bring in two sheep to the Shepherd’s Hut, as the Shepherd will not catch and bring in any sheep."
		""
		"The Shepherd will only keep two sheep alive per hut level, so at level 5 they will have ten sheep in their holding pens."
	]
	quest.130FA1CC4CB1E05F.quest_desc: ["It transmits energy like any power cable but the player can pass through it freely. Better tiers transmit more energy."]
	quest.131904442C9523F4.quest_desc: [
		"Training a Data Model can be done in one of two ways, with a Deep Learner or with a Simulation Chamber. "
		""
		"The deep learner allows you to store a few data models within, and kills you receive will begin to train the model. "
		""
		"All models start out in the Faulty state, and must be trained up to Basic in the deep learner."
	]
	quest.13297FADD13D3A84.quest_desc: ["A simple fluid storage."]
	quest.132AF80A62FFF98D.quest_desc: [
		"Cliches aside, the tavern should be a high priority building in the early game for several reasons. A tavern can house four colonists. Exactly the number that spawned when you created your village. "
		""
		"After completing the tavern, visitors will stop by to hang out in hopes of being recruited into your colony. You can recruit these visitors by giving them the items they request. "
		""
		"You may want to check out their stats before recruiting a visitor because nobody wants to pay too much for a rubbish colonist."
		""
		"&o&8PRO TIP: You can tell a lot about a potential recruit by looking at their boots. Fancy boots, better stats.&r&r"
	]
	quest.132AF80A62FFF98D.title: "You All Meet In a Tavern..."
	quest.132DF9ECEFFB3B71.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.132F18F4FDF51813.quest_desc: [
		"&6Multiblock structure&r capable of &4tick-accelerating&r everything enclosed by it."
		"Minimum size of &23x3x3&r. No maximum size."
		"To build the structure, edges and corners are built using &dSakuradite Casings&r. Walls and faces are filled with any &5Sakuradite block&r. "
		"Requires energy input hatch to power the structure."
		"To form the multiblook must click with &eBabylon Key&r."
	]
	quest.132F18F4FDF51813.quest_subtitle: "Warning: May cause severe lag if not used carefully"
	quest.133CCF87F542BEB6.quest_desc: [
		"The &bXNet Antenna&r, &bAntenna Base&r, and &bAntenna Dish&r in &5XNet&r are components used to set up long-range wireless communication within your XNet network."
		""
		"To set it up:"
		"1. Place the &bAntenna Base&r in the world."
		"2. Attach the &bAntenna Dish&r to the base."
		"3. Configure the &bXNet Controller&r to link with the antenna for extended range and wireless capabilities."
	]
	quest.1357102EC118E363.quest_desc: ["Provides 1 Trillion bytes of crafting storage, large enough for even the most demanding late-game autocrafting queues."]
	quest.1357102EC118E363.quest_subtitle: "1,000,000,000,000 Byte Storage Cell"
	quest.1357102EC118E363.title: "1T Mega Crafting Storage"
	quest.1359A69F4F6B6CF1.quest_desc: [
		"&4Data Entanglers&r are a special block that affect all storage blocks present in the multi-block. They enable storage"
		"blocks to store data in several dimensions, effectively multiplying their storage by 4. Only one of these can be placed"
		"in each quantum computer multiblock."
	]
	quest.135E27A19B935CD7.quest_desc: [
		"Right-click the chain of a Chain Conveyor to set the frogport’s target, then place the frogport. Frogports can be placed up to 4 blocks to the side and down from their target chain."
		""
		"The frogport will only take packages that match its address. The address can be set by right-clicking the placed frogport or in it's UI. "
		""
		"The frogport will only send packages that don’t match its address unless its set to “only send packages” in its UI."
	]
	quest.135FBE79D4415F15.quest_desc: ["An &aexpensive version&r of the &ctnt&r used in the implosion chamber to craft &dpowerful items,&r such as &3singularities.&r"]
	quest.135FBE79D4415F15.quest_subtitle: "WHY CAN'T I BLOW THIS UP?!?"
	quest.137E376E22A64C8D.quest_desc: ["This belt reduces fall damage and allows the user to levitate by shifting while falling or jumping."]
	quest.138404C3E1120F74.quest_desc: ["Provides huge parallel computing power for your ME network, cutting crafting calculation delays down to almost nothing."]
	quest.138404C3E1120F74.quest_subtitle: "Hyper-Thread Compute Core"
	quest.138404C3E1120F74.title: "300M Mega Co-Processor"
	quest.138B96B20044ED12.quest_desc: ["A coil of constantan wire known for its stable electrical resistance. It’s used in crafting electronic components and machinery that require precise power control."]
	quest.13931F57613DCC60.quest_desc: ["Generates &9Neutron Ingots&r faster."]
	quest.13B436AF3BD57E53.quest_subtitle: "Tip: UFO armor to fight Ignis "
	quest.13B495F64F5C9D48.quest_desc: ["A refined fuel made by heating coal without oxygen. It burns hotter and longer than regular coal, making it ideal for powering furnaces, engines, and heavy industrial machinery."]
	quest.13C766B7286C0293.quest_desc: ["Both used to make the &4Blade of the arcane eclipse&f."]
	quest.13C766B7286C0293.title: "Prism"
	quest.13CAA74DEE1F21A3.quest_desc: ["A reinforced container designed to safely hold and process volatile or high-temperature substances. Its heat-resistant structure makes it ideal for chemical reactions, refining, and industrial production."]
	quest.13CCF5BDF2BD03CE.quest_desc: ["The &aShield Recovery Module&r increases your shield recharge on your Chest Piece."]
	quest.13D5B942165B8A98.quest_desc: ["The &dPink Generator&r uses &aPink Dye&r and &bPink Items&r to generate &cEnergy&r. It’s a colorful and whimsical way to produce power, perfect for those who want to add a splash of pink to their setup."]
	quest.13E0633592FE5DF0.quest_desc: ["Blow up a rainbow furnace to obtain a rainbow coal"]
	quest.13EDFA9124D60D53.quest_desc: ["Moves items."]
	quest.13EDFA9124D60D53.title: "Item Conduit"
	quest.1404BB8956D5F8C7.quest_desc: [
		"Determines which weather conditions a bee can work in."
		""
		"The best being Any."
	]
	quest.1404BB8956D5F8C7.title: "Weather Tolerance"
	quest.140DE53DC0FCD9F4.quest_desc: [
		"The Annihilation Plane breaks blocks and picks up items. It works similarly to an ME Import Bus, pushing things into network storage. For items to be picked up, they must collide with the face of the plane, it does not pick up in an area."
		""
		"Annihilation planes can be enchanted with any pickaxe enchantment, so yes, you can put crazy levels of fortune on a few and automate ore processing if your modpack allows it. In addition, silk touch does what you'd expect it to, efficiency reduces the energy cost of breaking a block, and unbreaking gives a chance of not using any energy."
		""
		"REMEMBER TO ENABLE FAKE PLAYERS IN YOUR CHUNK CLAIM"
	]
	quest.140EA40A9ABA65DB.quest_desc: ["An upgraded, high-performance drill built for maximum efficiency and durability. Its diamond-tipped head cuts through even the toughest materials, making it perfect for advanced automation and large-scale mining operations."]
	quest.1418D6ED5D87C9E9.quest_subtitle: "Ritual Mobs"
	quest.1418D6ED5D87C9E9.title: "Easy Resources"
	quest.141E3D92CBA9F1B3.quest_desc: ["Transforms &bitems&r into &9other items&r or &aplant oil.&r"]
	quest.1427B3AB09510D20.quest_desc: ["The completed Printed Circuit Board, ready to be used in advanced machines and upgrades. Requires a fully functional Assembly System."]
	quest.142C67218BD16867.quest_desc: ["The ammunition for the Minigun. Craft it in bulk and keep it stored in your Charging Station or inventory."]
	quest.142C67218BD16867.title: "Minigun ammo"
	quest.14566943B4AE74A9.quest_desc: ["Unlocks travel to &cMars.&r Requires&6 Desh&r to be built."]
	quest.145C8235BCCB9BA8.quest_desc: [
		"No, not that kind."
		""
		"&cAfrit Demons&r are Demons of &cFire&r. They are more advanced Demons, which some are friends and some are....not."
		""
		"If we want to collect all of the Chalks, we'll need to summon a not-so friendly Ifrit. And kill it."
		""
		"This specific Ritual will need a live sacrifice. Once you've placed all of the items needed and the Book of Binding into the Golden Sacrificial Bowl, the Ritual will not start until you sacrifice the living creature nearby it. In this instance, we'll be sacrificing a cow. Sorry again, Betsy."
	]
	quest.145C8235BCCB9BA8.title: "&cHot Demons&r"
	quest.1472CCB84AB8C6AC.quest_desc: [
		"The &eEnchantment Applicator&r applies specific &aenchanted books&r to items."
		""
		"Provide it with the &aitem&r to be enchanted, the &aenchanted book&r, and &dpower&r."
		""
		"The &eEnchantment Applicator&r will transfer the enchantment from the book to the item, combining them if necessary."
	]
	quest.147FC2959F9FC5F5.quest_desc: [
		"Trains are Contraptions that travel on Train Tracks."
		""
		"Assembly"
		"Place the track and right-click it with a station block. Place the station block near the track."
		""
		"Right click on the station and select \"Create Train\" to enter assembly mode (blue flag shown on station)."
		""
		"Place one or more Train Casings on the track where indicated with blue. The casings will turn into bogeys."
		""
		"When assembled, each bogey will automatically become coupled together as part of the train."
		" "
		"Place a Train Controls block facing the direction dictated by the station. Place a Seat or Blaze Burner behind the controls for the driver."
		""
		"Use Block Attachment Utilities such as Super Glue to connect all parts together (green highlight)."
		""
		"When finished, use the Station's interface to attempt to assemble the Train. If a Train fails to assemble, an error will be shown in the Station's interface. Common errors are detailed below."
	]
	quest.1482F2D45E8F761D.quest_desc: [
		"Just like most &dMekanism&r multiblocks, reactors can be a custom size depending on your needs. They must be cuboid, with the minimum outside size being &b&o3 wide&r, &b&o4 tall&r, and &o&b3 blocks&r deep. The maximum size is &b&o18x18x18&r."
		""
		"The edges of the outer shell &bmust&r be made out of &aFission Reactor Casings&r, while the faces can be either casings or &bReactor Glass&r, &7Reactor Ports&r, or &3Reactor Logic Adapters&r. We'll get to those later."
		""
		"For now, let's build a basic &b&o5x5x5&r &6Fission Reactor&r!"
	]
	quest.1482F2D45E8F761D.title: "&3The Fission Reactor"
	quest.14857DBF1DCBF100.quest_desc: ["Cresting the waves like a shadow of the past, this cursed vessel is crewed by skeletons that seem impossible to keep down. Every deck hides danger, every hold whispers of lost treasure and every strike you land may be fleeting. Only the bold (or the foolhardy) dare to face its relentless undead crew."]
	quest.14857DBF1DCBF100.quest_subtitle: "Find an Undead Pirate Ship"
	quest.14B3542ECB59869C.quest_desc: [
		"Mob Predictions will need to be processed in a Loot Fabricator, a device which uses power to convert predictions to mob drops. "
		""
		"The drops which are available are based on a list of pre-defined items, and a target can be selected for each type of model. "
		""
		"The loot fabricator will remember your choices for each type, so you can feed multiple types of predictions into a single fabricator."
	]
	quest.14D772808D1BEAE2.quest_desc: [
		"The &9Induction Matrix&r allows you to customize how much power you can store and transfer by adding &aCells&r and &eProviders&r inside of the multiblock structure."
		""
		"&aInduction Cells&r increase the total amount of power that can be stored."
		""
		"&eInduction Providers&r increase the total transfer speed both in and out of the &9Matrix&r."
		""
		"You can customize how many you want of each &b&oinside&r of the multiblock, but you will need &b&oat least&r one of each."
		""
		"These also have higher tiers to increase your overall storage and transfer capacity."
		""
		"{image:kubejs:textures/item/induction_inside.png width:200 height:100 align:1}"
	]
	quest.14D772808D1BEAE2.title: "Customizing Power Limits"
	quest.14DE16A40532206D.quest_desc: ["Has 27 more filter slots and is 5x faster than the regular Exporter. Also has the Stack Upgrade integrated."]
	quest.14F6CF9A5F807A51.quest_desc: ["Right click on a tank of lubrication to fill the can. Applying this to engines grant a 30% fuel saving."]
	quest.15057E6D3D02CEA5.quest_desc: [
		"&bBookwyrm&r charms can be acquired be agumenting a &critual of awakening&r with a &eBook and quill&r. Using the charm on a &astorage lectern&r increases the invertory of the lectern and &bBookwyrms&r can be &ddyed&r many different colors."
		""
		"When a &bBookwyrm&r dies or is dispelled it will drop its charm."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&6Storage lecterns&r can be used to view, craft, and manage, &econnected inventories&r. Place an &aunbound&r chest next to the lectern (this is were you place the items) then &dbind&r inventories, like some chests, withen &l30 blocks&r of the &6lectern&r using a &dDominion wand&r, &lShift-Right-Click&r the a chest, then &lRight-Click&r the lectern. after Right-Clicking the lectern with &bBookwyrm&r charms you can place items in the &aunbound&r chest and they will be moved to the other chests."
		""
		"Named inventories will have a tab you can search through in the lectern, and you can chain &6lecterns&r together, each &6lectern&r has to be withen &l30 Blocks&r of each other, other then the first lectern chained lecterns can't accept more &bBookwyrms&r or link inventories."
		""
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&bFamiliar form&r: Will Pick up &bitems&r and &aXP&r withen &l5 blocks&r of the player, can be &cdisabled&r with &6magnet&r hotkey. Thrown items will not be picked up at all."
	]
	quest.155AD7F62D76E812.quest_desc: ["The &aWyvern Fusion Crafting Injector&r is the second &btier&r in the Fusion Crafting process. Its ability to draw energy quickly makes crafting operations in the &dFusion Crafting Core&r more efficient."]
	quest.156575F76CAB51A0.quest_desc: ["&bReplicates&r &bitems&r using &dUU Mater.&r"]
	quest.156E41193C265303.quest_desc: ["Provides &aEterna&r to &dEnchanting tables&r when used in place of a bookshelf."]
	quest.158D1029B64302D6.quest_desc: [
		"Right Click the replicator with the resource you would like to produce."
		""
		"You need a valid storage besides it to work."
	]
	quest.158D1029B64302D6.quest_subtitle: "Can't be easier than that"
	quest.158D1029B64302D6.title: "Replication"
	quest.159D89CAA7B6D641.quest_desc: [
		"Plunge into abyssal trenches and defeat 5 &1Leviathans&r."
		""
		"The supreme sovereign of the oceans shall bow before your might!"
	]
	quest.159D89CAA7B6D641.title: "🌊 &1Lord of the Seas (5x The Leviathan)"
	quest.15A87099A99C029E.quest_desc: ["Another rocket that allows you to reach more planets, made from materials from &eJupiter&r."]
	quest.15B077DEA396BECF.quest_desc: [
		"The recipe of the Altar has been changed so YOU won't be able to craft it in the first day and get all seeds."
		""
		"Check Mystical questline btw"
		""
		"[ { \"text\": \"Click me!\", \"underlined\": true, \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"6D750A38944E9B68\" } }, \"\" ]"
	]
	quest.15B51FB56A64C303.quest_desc: [
		"Many new buildings and upgrades are locked behind university research so it is worth getting a university built as soon as possible. Researcher will research various upgrades to your colony, and each level unlocks an additional researcher for a total of 5 researchers. Each Researcher can start their own research, but more Researchers does not lower the amount of time each individual research takes."
		""
		"Note: Research time is real-world time spent in-game. However, after level 3, Researchers will sometimes use offline time to work on researches."
	]
	quest.15D764CAF047EA7A.quest_desc: ["&dMystical agriculture&r adds new &aagumentable&r &aarmor!&r Crafted with &dgems&r from this &ctier,&r and &aarmor&r from the &cprevious tier&r you can craft &epowerful sets&r!"]
	quest.15ECBC8E174FA39B.quest_desc: ["Allows you to access your storage wirelessly."]
	quest.15ECBC8E174FA39B.title: "Wireless Grid"
	quest.15F03A5E7E14C022.quest_desc: ["The stonemason is another key profession in the colony. They craft items commonly required by the builder. The stonemason will craft 3x3 recipes made entirely out of cobblestone, stone, andesite, diorite, granite, quartz, purpur, nether bricks, prismarine, sandstones, blackstone, and basalt. They can also craft end stone from cobblestone and an ender pearl after you complete the research."]
	quest.15F03A5E7E14C022.quest_subtitle: "Build a Stonemason's Hut"
	quest.15F7524D7B3E023C.quest_desc: [
		"The &bME Storage Bus&r, when facing an external storage container, treats the container as part of the &dME network&r. This allows items to be inserted into or extracted from the container via &aME&r."
		""
		"&bStorage buses&r can be &afiltered&r and &aprioritized&r, making specific items go to the attached storage first. However, they won't retroactively move filtered items from elsewhere in the network."
	]
	quest.1610C8F55F59E82F.quest_desc: [
		"The Quartz Fiber."
		""
		"A part designed to share energy between two ME Networks without sharing anything else, also used to craft Fluix ME Glass Cablr."
	]
	quest.162CE44400A63575.quest_desc: [
		"The Metallurgic Infuser is the first step in the Mekanism tech tree. The Metallurgic Infuser is a machine used in the production of Steel Ingots, Bronze Ingot, Enriched Alloy, and Obsidian Ingots."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"Infusing"
		"In the purple slot the infusion material can be inserted, depending on the recipe for the item you are creating:"
		""
		"Redstone (Redstone, Block of Redstone or Enriched Redstone)"
		"Diamond (Diamond Dust or Enriched Diamond)"
		"Obsidian (Refined Obsidian Dust or Enriched Obsidian)"
		"Carbon (Coal/Charcoal or Enriched Carbon)"
		"Tin (Tin Dust or Enriched Tin)"
		"Bio Fuel (Bio Fuel)"
		"Mushroom (Red or Brown Mushrooms)"
	]
	quest.162CE44400A63575.quest_subtitle: "The Starting Machine"
	quest.162DD68C3B91FC5E.quest_desc: ["You will use these &acables&r to transport &eelectricity,&r plus the &btin cable&r is use in &6crafting.&r"]
	quest.163BCEEEE08F3898.quest_desc: ["Pretty much makes some items &6magnetic.&r"]
	quest.163EAC56DF270BDF.quest_desc: [
		"2x &fCompressed Iron Block 6x&r represent nearly &e10 Million ingots of pure iron&r!"
		""
		"An impenetrable fortress of industrial automation."
	]
	quest.163EAC56DF270BDF.title: "⚙️ &fSteel Wall: ~10 Million Iron"
	quest.164604C02613AA58.quest_desc: [
		"The &bUFO Staff&r is an all-in-one morphing multi-tool with infinite durability."
		""
		"It automatically adapts into a pickaxe, hammer, axe, shovel, or sword depending on what block or mob you are targeting."
		""
		"Check your controls menu to bind the tool configuration keys to customize its reach and modes."
	]
	quest.164604C02613AA58.quest_subtitle: "Morphing Universal Multi-Tool"
	quest.164604C02613AA58.title: "UFO Staff"
	quest.164F4710E109F7F2.quest_desc: ["The first &bmain&r &bitem(s)&r you will be using to craft until you reach &asteel.&r"]
	quest.1651E315517369BD.title: "&fFlux Configurator"
	quest.16665DE6F0921C26.quest_desc: ["A powerful kinetic generator that converts heat into rotational energy. By harnessing temperature differences, it provides a steady power source for your machines and automation systems."]
	quest.166971866A9234C7.quest_desc: ["Made from a &8Metallurgic Infuser&r this item is used in a few crafting recipes."]
	quest.167E1474644C9908.quest_desc: ["Hold &fNether Quartz&r in your &loffhand&r while applying any spawner rune with your main hand to &creverse or remove&r that modifier from the spawner!"]
	quest.167E1474644C9908.title: "Inverting Modifiers (Nether Quartz)"
	quest.168187D7A0036A6B.quest_desc: ["The &5Disenchanting Generator&r extracts &aPower&r from &bEnchanted Items&r. By feeding it items with enchantments, you can generate &cEnergy&r. It’s a great way to repurpose unwanted enchanted gear into something useful."]
	quest.168ECD28A336F077.quest_desc: ["If you ever thought that there can't be anything worse than a dragon, then you are surely mistaken."]
	quest.1694601100476AF7.quest_desc: ["&bEggs&r are &cbroken&r when &ejumped on&r, and if you place &bice&r or &6amber&r beneath them they will &anot grow up&r."]
	quest.1695706A70AA37E6.quest_desc: [
		"The &dMob Duplicator&r is used to spawn &amobs&r using &aEssence&r."
		""
		"Place it in the desired location and provide it with &dpower&r and &aEssence&r."
		""
		"Insert a &dMob Imprisonment Tool&r containing the &amob&r you want to duplicate."
		""
		"The &dMob Duplicator&r will spawn copies of the &amob&r as long as it has &aEssence&r and &dpower&r."
		""
		"This is useful for creating &dmob farms&r for resource generation."
	]
	quest.16A6C47E35F3B9D0.quest_desc: [
		"Once we have an &9Isotopic Centrifuge&r, we can run our &2Uranium Hexafluoride&r in and create &3Fissile Fuel&r!"
		""
		"That wasn't really that bad, right?"
	]
	quest.16A6C47E35F3B9D0.quest_subtitle: "You did it!"
	quest.16A6C47E35F3B9D0.title: "&3Fissile Fuel&r"
	quest.16A97D04ED52478A.quest_desc: ["An &6expensive chest&r with a lot of &astorage.&r"]
	quest.16AAEB122CDC1A46.quest_desc: ["Mixes &bmultiple items&r into other &9items&r like."]
	quest.16C065EA59F9F415.quest_desc: [
		"The central interface for accessing your entire ME network inventory. This panel displays all items stored in connected ME Drives and allows searching, sorting, and item withdrawal/insertion. Functions as the primary control hub for the storage system."
		""
		"The &6ME Crafting Terminal&r is an enhanced version that includes a crafting grid, enabling convenient crafting using any network-contained items visible through the terminal."
	]
	quest.16E5B09AA7E6A487.quest_desc: ["A useful &6crafting component&r automated in the &cassembler.&r"]
	quest.16EE370FE0789F32.quest_subtitle: "“Even nothing has a heart.”"
	quest.16F081A90848DBB1.quest_subtitle: "You will need A LOT of these trust me."
	quest.171151FF83288178.quest_desc: ["After completing the &eprimordial cave tablet&r puzzle in a &aspelunking table&r three times, you will be given an &6cave codex&r which you can &lRight-Click&r to learn more about this cave and have it added to your &6Cave Compendium&r. Or you can craft a &bmap&r to this cave with the codex."]
	quest.1716ED717CDD90DC.quest_desc: ["cool shirt."]
	quest.172D2A634E849562.quest_desc: [
		"With our ability to harvest &cIesnium&r, we can call upon the Demons to do our bidding in the mines... I mean.... help us gather ores. Definitely not exploiting Demons or anything."
		""
		"For this, we'll need to create a &dDimensional Mineshaft&r to access the Demon Mining World. You'll also need a Mining Demon confined to a lamp, which you'll place inside of the Mineshaft for it to work. While any tier will complete this quest, higher tiers work faster and have a higher chance at mining Iesnium for you."
		""
		"The Mineshafts do not auto-export on their own. You will need to extract the items out using either Hoppers, Transporting Demons, or some other method like Item Pipes. It will void any items over its storage limit."
	]
	quest.172D2A634E849562.title: "&cDemon Mining&r"
	quest.1758D38A1FA881C2.quest_desc: ["Energy capacity modules that define the tier of Powah machines."]
	quest.176524D0E4475298.quest_desc: [
		"Changes &bsome liquids &rinto &9other liquids.&r"
		""
		"To select what &bfluid&r to create, open &lJEI,&r type the &ename&r of the &bfluid&r you want, and&a drag it&r into the &lright slot.&r"
	]
	quest.17709C4D6222244B.quest_desc: ["Connects forge energy compatible blocks with wires to transfer energy, provides light when reciving power."]
	quest.177C0E37A35A14F4.quest_desc: [
		"When Powered by kinetics:"
		""
		"Starts rotating the attached structure towards the current hour. If an independent second structure exists in front of the first one, it will serve as the minute hand."
		""
		"The Value Settings Screen can be accessed from the side of the block, and can be used to change the order of the hands or switch to a 24-hour reading resembling the Clock item."
	]
	quest.17953D4234D44C01.quest_desc: [
		"Place the drilling machine on the ore vein chunk you found and place a drill on it."
		""
		"The ore/fluid will come out in the output of the multiblock."
		""
		"Fluid can be extracted in the copper pipe."
		""
		"The machine requires RPM to work."
	]
	quest.1796CD7D8F3612C1.quest_desc: [
		"The &bItem Transporter&r moves &aitems&r between machines and storage units."
		""
		"Connect it to an &aitem source&r and a &destination&r."
		""
		"It ensures efficient item movement, supporting various automation setups."
	]
	quest.17CA9D80D8EC3EF7.quest_desc: [
		"The Harbinger is a mechanical boss in the Cataclysm mod. It is one of three bosses that spawn in the Overworld, specifically within the Ancient Factory structure. "
		""
		"The Harbinger spawns within the Ancient Factory. This structure is located in the Overworld and is a dungeon that is found deep underground. So get your best Pickaxe, as you will need to do some mining. "
	]
	quest.17D6CF535F3B71F5.quest_desc: [
		"&6Crafted&r from different &bingredients&r found throughout these &ecaves&r, you will use this to craft the &bbest&r this cave has to offer."
		"&o(Beside the &cnuke&r)&r"
	]
	quest.17FA831BAD7F6CA2.quest_desc: [
		"Drain &6100 Billion FE&r directly into the Singularity."
		""
		"A feat worthy of civilizations capable of building Dyson Spheres and commanding black holes!"
	]
	quest.17FA831BAD7F6CA2.title: "⚡ &6&lElectric Singularity: 100 Billion FE"
	quest.180206DDBD6B2D59.quest_desc: [
		"The Pattern Encoding Terminal is similar to a regular terminal, with all the same settings and sections, but with an added pattern encoding interface. It looks similar to a crafting terminal's UI but this crafting grid doesn't actually perform crafts."
		""
		"You should have one of these in addition to a crafting terminal."
	]
	quest.182525B7EDF23BB5.quest_desc: ["Same old &dnetherite,&r though it can be obtained in new ways."]
	quest.18289605711FE891.quest_desc: ["The &9Ender Generator&r is powered by &aEnder Pearls&r and &5Eyes of Ender&r, producing significant amounts of &cEnergy&r. This generator is ideal for players with access to the &bEnd&r and its resources, offering a powerful energy source."]
	quest.1837076B0EA3C11A.quest_desc: [
		"A Mechanical Belt is a mechanical component that conveys rotation and moves items and entities."
		""
		"Placing a Belt requires at least two Shafts. Place the Belt by right-clicking on the first shaft and then right clicking the second. Regardless of the length, this only consumes one mechanical belt. Both shafts must face the same direction."
		""
		"A Mechanical Belt can be placed over any number of Shafts arranged horizontally, vertically, or diagonally (45° towards the y axis) in a single line, provided that no obstructions are present and that the total length is no longer than twenty blocks. The Mechanical Belt also require that the two shafts face the same direction."
	]
	quest.184528671B22DDDE.quest_desc: ["You get it at this point just hover above the item."]
	quest.186593EBCE3FE8D8.quest_desc: ["Applying the &aSpawn Range Spawner Rune&r increases the horizontal block radius where mobs can spawn by &b+2 blocks&r (up to 32 blocks max)."]
	quest.186593EBCE3FE8D8.title: "Spawn Range Rune"
	quest.186731580B14F9D2.quest_desc: [
		"The &9Fluid Port&r is used &o&bto insert&r vapors like &3Steam&r, or &o&bextract&r the product of the turbine, like &1Water&r if inputing &7steam.&r Because of this, you'll need &ntwo&r for your &2Turbine&r."
		""
		"The &cPower Tap&r extracts power, and is &nrequired&r to complete the multiblock."
	]
	quest.186731580B14F9D2.title: "Turbine Ports"
	quest.186F257352F2E844.quest_desc: [
		"Like a &l3x3x4&r &arectangle,&r except the &bcorners&r are cut out, add &6casing&r for the &etop&r and &ebottom,&r with&9 pipe casing&r in the &emiddle layers,&r hold a &6wrench&r after placing the &dpressurizer&r block if you are confused."
		""
		"Use this &dmulti-block&r to &bpressurize liquids&r inputted through a &6hatch&r in the &etop layer,&r and a &6hatch&r in the &ebottom&r &elayer.&r"
		""
		"&o*can also unpressurize fluids&r"
	]
	quest.186F257352F2E844.title: "Pressurizer"
	quest.187011CD52066727.quest_desc: [
		"Tired of waiting on slow single-item inscribers? The &bQuantum Processor Assembler&r stamps out processors in rapid batches."
		""
		"Needs coolant and FE power piped into adjacent hatches."
	]
	quest.187011CD52066727.quest_subtitle: "Batch Circuit Fabrication"
	quest.187011CD52066727.title: "Quantum Processor Assembler"
	quest.187A3F5B41D1C923.quest_desc: ["Let's take our &2Sulfuric Acid&r and combine it with &bFluorite&r in a &9Chemical Dissolution Chamber&r to make &bHydrofluoric Acid&r."]
	quest.187A3F5B41D1C923.title: "&bHydrofluoric Acid"
	quest.189018F641FBB44E.quest_desc: ["An upgraded crafter that holds more patterns and has an increased crafting speed."]
	quest.189018F641FBB44E.title: "&bDiamond Crafter&r"
	quest.189C3AF8899FBFFE.quest_desc: ["Has 45 more filter slots and is 6.5x faster than the regular Importer. Also has the Stack Upgrade integrated."]
	quest.18A75E664BAC6425.quest_desc: ["Power is output via the three copper looking dots on the top of the multiblock, and the machine can be turned off by applying a redstone signal to the red dot on the front of the machine face. It does not have a GUI, so all input/output must be triggered manually."]
	quest.18A75E664BAC6425.title: "Diesel Generator"
	quest.18BCBC9235B04BE8.quest_subtitle: "“To live forever… at what cost?”"
	quest.18D88932916C7A98.quest_desc: [
		"Electrolytic Separator"
		""
		"The Electrolytic Separator sends controlled amounts of direct current into a fluid, breaking the bonds between its atoms. This process, known as electrolysis, allows you to produce useful gases from ordinary liquids."
		""
		"As the fluid is electrolyzed, the resulting gases are stored in the machine’s internal tanks. If either tank becomes full, the Separator will automatically shut down. To keep it running, connect Pressurized Tubes or any compatible gas transport system to both tanks."
		""
		"If you only need one type of gas, you can set the unused gas output to Dump to vent it into the environment. This prevents the machine from stopping when a tank fills up."
		""
		"You’ll need several of these if you plan to build a Tier 2 Ore Processing Factory later on. For now, start by creating one and using it to electrolyze the most basic fluid: Water."
	]
	quest.18D88932916C7A98.quest_subtitle: "Time to Break It Down"
	quest.18D88932916C7A98.title: "The Start of a Ore Factory"
	quest.18DA07CE1ACC69EF.quest_desc: [
		"In order to teach the &4ME Advanced Pattern Provider&r where to send your items, a special device is needed to encode that"
		"information. You can use a right-click with it in hand to open its GUI."
		""
		"Encoded Processing Patterns can be inserted into the left slot, which will be decoded and all raw ingredients then"
		"displayed in a list."
		""
		"Each row contains a set of buttons that represent all possible block faces to which the ingredient"
		"can be sent to. Leaving the Selection in the \"A\" button will send it to whatever face is directly connected to the"
		"Pattern Provider, while choosing a specific face will force that to be where items will be inserted. It's important to"
		"note that advanced patterns can only be decoded properly by a small Adv Pattern Provider"
		"or Adv Pattern Provider and will behave like a normal pattern if used in other types of"
		"pattern provider. Additionally, if a single item cannot be inserted in the specified face, no items will be inserted"
		"directionally and standard pattern provider behaviour will be applied."
	]
	quest.18EB86F91CBBCCC6.quest_subtitle: "You can use each eye to find the respective boss dungeon. Or just use the structure compass"
	quest.18FBAD6FAA74B08D.quest_desc: [
		"&eWhat Is the Fluid Package Filler?&r"
		""
		"The &eFluid Package Filler&r is a machine used to create &6Volume Packages&r filled with &bfluids&r."
		""
		"These fluid packages can then be used in &ePackagedAuto&r workflows just like item-based packages."
		""
		"The Fluid Package Filler &crequires power&r to operate."
		""
		"&eHow It Works&r"
		""
		"• Place the Fluid Package Filler next to a &bfluid container&r"
		"• Insert a &etemplate fluid container&r into the machine"
		""
		"• Configure how much fluid the &6Volume Package&r should contain"
		""
		"&eCreating Fluid Packages&r"
		""
		"• Apply a &credstone signal&r to the machine"
		"• The configured amount of fluid is packaged"
		"• The created Volume Package is &eejected&r into adjacent inventories"
		""
		"&eImportant Notes&r"
		""
		"• The machine does &cNOT&r run automatically"
		"• A redstone signal is &erequired&r"
		"• Output is always ejected to adjacent inventories"
		""
		"&eWhy Use the Fluid Package Filler?&r"
		""
		"• Convert fluids into portable packages"
		"• Integrate fluids into PackagedAuto systems"
		"• Enable precise fluid amounts"
		"• Useful for advanced processing chains"
	]
	quest.18FBAD6FAA74B08D.title: "&eFluid Package Filler&r"
	quest.18FCB1DAD9572A00.quest_desc: [
		"The &bMob Detector&r detects nearby &amobs&r and sends a &dredstone signal&r."
		""
		"Place it in areas where you need to monitor &amob activity&r."
		""
		"It can trigger alarms or automated defenses when &amobs&r are detected."
	]
	quest.191A2F855396BDCD.quest_desc: ["Automatically refills gadgets and armor that use fuel."]
	quest.195729280394ABFB.quest_desc: [
		"The Osmium Compressor is used to create Refined Obsidian Ingots from Refined Obsidian Dust and Glowstone Ingots from Glowstone Dust."
		""
		"It fuses liquid Osmium (melted down Osmium Ingots placed in the machine's bottom slot) with the originating materials to create their corresponding ingots."
	]
	quest.195F63EAD8194971.quest_desc: ["&6Rugged legwear&r from &aprimitive times&r. As strong as &6leather.&r"]
	quest.196E55B64667AE35.quest_desc: ["Place at the bottom of the Beehive and place inside it the item required for the respective bee start \"pollinating\" and producing combs."]
	quest.196FD91EC6A7B73A.quest_desc: ["Same as the other rock&cets,&r except it is crafted with &cCalorite,&r lets you travel to more planets,"]
	quest.19754AE8C11A6317.quest_desc: [
		"The Deployer simulates player actions on blocks or entities exactly 2 blocks away from it."
		""
		"The Deployer can be given items to use with machines or by right clicking the items into the hand."
		""
		"The Deployer can be stopped with a Redstone signal."
		""
		"The Filter on the side of the Deployer can be adjusted to only use certain items. The filter is also essential when using a Deployer in a Contraption."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"The Deployer has 2 inventory slots; the held item and one extra internal slot. As well as unusable items, items harvested by the Deployer will be transferred to the extra slot to be removed by machines, during which time the Deployer will stall. Items cannot be extracted from the extra slot directly by the player."
		""
		"The Deployer simulates right clicks by default. It can be adjusted to left click instead by right clicking the front with a Wrench. While in left-click mode, the Deployer can use normal tools, such as pickaxes and swords. The tools will behave as if the player was holding them, including mobs dropping rare items when slain by a Deployer."
	]
	quest.197AB0E07A40512F.quest_desc: ["The Water Wheel is a source of rotational power. It generates Rotational Force when water flows over it."]
	quest.1987DF7742136DC4.quest_desc: [
		"A &l3x3&r &lrectangle&r of &evarying heights,&r based on what you want to create. in the middle add the&b pipe machine casing.&r"
		""
		"The &eheight&r does not count the &cvery bottom layer,&r which has the &bdistillation tower block&r and &ecasing&r in the &emiddle&r of the square."
		""
		"Place &6output hatches&r on the sides of &bhigher squares.&r"
	]
	quest.19936E26E71B5F68.quest_desc: ["Energy is input through the bottom face and output from the top. "]
	quest.199B092BC9116A0A.quest_desc: ["shoes"]
	quest.199B092BC9116A0A.quest_subtitle: "shoes"
	quest.19A9DA93FF046BD9.quest_desc: ["A sturdy yet lightweight frame used to encase and protect mechanical or electrical components. Its durability and resistance make it perfect for building advanced industrial machinery."]
	quest.19B5CFD1781BE157.quest_desc: [
		"This advanced material is used for crafting strong and durable components."
		" It's made using plant oil and plastic high-tech meets eco-friendly."
	]
	quest.19BAE924E8965920.quest_desc: [
		"Make a &5Obsidian Nest&r and place in the End Dimension use a &dDragon's Breath&r to attract a draconic bee to it and start harvesting draconic dust."
		""
		"Draconic Dust mainly used in the best upgrades for Productive bees."
	]
	quest.19D03831EB5EED02.quest_desc: ["The Blacksmith is a 3x3 crafter and can make any vanilla tools, armor, swords, and shields (no bows or redstone items). You will need to teach the Blacksmith the recipes of the items you want them to create. "]
	quest.19D03831EB5EED02.quest_subtitle: "Build a Blacksmith Hut"
	quest.19F6AA2773B46E1A.quest_desc: [
		"A metal plate used in the &bInscriber&r to craft &eProcessors&r. Each press type corresponds to a specific processor tier:"
		""
		"&bLogic Press&r"
		""
		"Crafts &5Logic Processors&r"
		""
		"&6Engineering Press&r"
		""
		"Crafts &eEngineering Processors&r"
		""
		"&dCalculation Press&r"
		""
		"Crafts &aCalculation Processors&r"
		""
		"*(Presses are &9reusable&r and must be placed in the Inscriber's top/bottom slots.)*"
		""
		"&e\"The stamp that shapes AE2 technology\"&r"
	]
	quest.19F6AA2773B46E1A.title: "&5Inscriber Press &r"
	quest.19F70C37419802B0.quest_desc: [
		"The core device that bridges external power systems (&6RF&r/&cFE&r) with your &5ME Network&r."
		""
		"Functions:"
		""
		"Converts &6RF/FE&r → &5AE2 Power&r"
		""
		"Must connect to &eME Cables&r or &aME Controller&r"
		""
		"Enables non-AE2 power sources (like &dSolar Panels&r) to fuel your network"
		""
		"Key Properties:"
		"&a✔&r Works &eautomatically&r (zero configuration)"
		"&a✔&r No channel consumption"
		"&c!&r &4One-way conversion only&r (cannot extract AE2 power as RF/FE)"
	]
	quest.19F70C37419802B0.title: "&bEnergy Acceptor &r"
	quest.1A15FD4ACEBEFB36.quest_desc: ["cool shoes."]
	quest.1A1CA2E527B0F450.quest_desc: [
		"2x &bCompressed Cobblestone 7x&r equal over &69.5 Million stone blocks&r compressed to near-stellar density!"
		""
		"Your quarrying operations have reached continental proportions."
	]
	quest.1A1CA2E527B0F450.title: "🪨 &bCrushed Mountain: ~10 Million Cobblestone"
	quest.1A2C0FC9378B9857.quest_desc: ["&9Mage armor&r with a few &abuffs&r for &dIron's Spells&r These are crafted at the &esmithing table&r."]
	quest.1A36CF372E3E1B09.quest_desc: [
		"The &dDissolution Chamber&r is used to craft advanced items and machines."
		""
		"Place the required &aresources&r into the chamber's slots, and ensure it has &dpower&r."
		""
		"It will process the resources and produce the desired &aoutput&r."
	]
	quest.1A61ABEC34369F47.quest_desc: ["A gearshift that changes rotation direction unless powered."]
	quest.1A63583AA53ABD33.quest_desc: ["The &aUndying Module&r is essentially a totem of undying installable on your Chest Piece."]
	quest.1A72F7DA24E1BB09.quest_desc: ["A better tier of pipe with more storage."]
	quest.1A72F7DA24E1BB09.title: "&cAdvanced Mechanical Pipe"
	quest.1A7D9B32BD59417B.quest_desc: [
		"Mostly &bdecorative&r powered &elight&r source that can be attached to &9Fluix ME Glass Cable&r or other non dense cables."
		""
		"Also used as crafting &ningredient&r."
		""
		"{image:kubejs:textures/item/illuminated_panel.png width:160 height:100 align:1}"
	]
	quest.1A7E55C8D92456F2.quest_subtitle: "May be broken"
	quest.1A8A78BB89CBF5E0.quest_desc: ["A &anew alloy&r with many uses, smelted with the &6alloy smelter&r."]
	quest.1A9985E695021F9E.quest_desc: ["Boosts &6attack knockback&r, &erunning speed&r, and &8air spell damage&r."]
	quest.1AB535653DB036CB.quest_desc: [
		"Rarity Materials (&7Common&f → &6Godforged&f)"
		""
		"These &bessences&r define how strong your reforged items can be. Higher rarities increase the chance of powerful &6affixes&r during &breforging&r and &aaugmenting.&r Stock up on these if you’re chasing &6mythical&r grade loot."
	]
	quest.1AB535653DB036CB.title: "Rarity Materials"
	quest.1AB91E25D6AA637E.quest_desc: [
		"&aDemon's Dream Fruit&r is not different from any other crop. Plant the &2Demon's Dream Seeds&r on a farmland and harvest it when it is fully grown."
		""
		"After consuming there is a chance to get &cThird Eye&r effect, that is very crucial for further progression."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"To summon the &dSpiritfire&r, throw the &aDemon's Dream Fruit&r on the ground and set it in fire,"
		"{image:ftb:textures/quests/spiritfire.png width:192 height:108 align:center}"
	]
	quest.1AB91E25D6AA637E.quest_subtitle: "Unique Mechanic"
	quest.1AB91E25D6AA637E.title: "Third Eye"
	quest.1AC3485AB2EA13E5.quest_desc: ["Different &ctiers&r of &bwatering cans&r hold more water. &lRight-Click&r water to fill the can up, &lShift-Right-CLick&r to water &acrops&r around you."]
	quest.1AC6F14C218DD46A.quest_desc: [
		"The &4Auto Stock Card&r also requires the equipment piece to be linked to the AE2 system and the proper range to the access point."
		""
		"It enables the configuration of a few stacks to be always kept at specific amounts in the user inventory."
		""
		"The slots are not limited to a stack, so you can set them to have more than one slot filled in inventory at all times if you so desire."
	]
	quest.1AD87CB3226ED224.quest_desc: ["Applying the &fSilent Spawner Rune&r silences all sounds made by the spawner and the mobs it spawns."]
	quest.1AD87CB3226ED224.title: "Silent Spawner Rune"
	quest.1AE719655A757BF1.quest_desc: ["Used in a &equarry&r for &badvanced ore.&r"]
	quest.1AF3D7D0FEB98133.quest_desc: ["Solaris Plana is a kind of infinite void dimension where it is always midday, so it is a great dimension for machines that need constant sunlight, such as the &6Dyson Cube Project&r or the &bSolar Neutron Activator (mekanism)&r, or for those who want to create a base that is always bathed in sunlight!"]
	quest.1AF3D7D0FEB98133.quest_subtitle: "Endless day"
	quest.1AF3D7D0FEB98133.title: "Solaria Plana"
	quest.1AF9598470EABCEA.quest_desc: ["Upgraded magnetic coils that allow the Stellar Nexus to handle hotter reactions and higher energy inputs."]
	quest.1AF9598470EABCEA.quest_subtitle: "Overcharged Magnetic Confinement"
	quest.1AF9598470EABCEA.title: "Stellar Field Generator Mk.II"
	quest.1AFBE29BB6CC2C0D.title: "Mechanical Componets"
	quest.1B0028B5F47CB5F1.quest_desc: ["Combine &bLiquid Starlight&r, &7White Dwarf Fragment&r, &5nether star&r and &6obsidian matrix&r to obtain the &1Neutron Star Fragment&r."]
	quest.1B04A295850D0F00.quest_desc: ["The Train Observer is used to detect passing Trains."]
	quest.1B2DE63560613385.quest_desc: ["Grown form &dmagebloom seeds&r, these are used in many crafting recipes including &dmagebloom fiber&r."]
	quest.1B2DE63560613385.title: "Magebloom"
	quest.1B4B29415499CE8E.quest_desc: [
		"The &bFilter Module&r is a crucial component in &5RFTools&r used to control the flow of items and fluids in your automation networks."
		""
		"To use a &bFilter Module&r, insert it into a &6machine&r or &econtainer&r that supports filtering, such as a &bCrafter&r or &6Storage Module&r. &n&bRight-click&r to open the &6GUI&r and configure the filter by specifying the items or fluids you want to allow or block."
		""
		"You can set the filter to &4whitelist&r specific items, ensuring only those items can pass through, or &8blacklist&r items to block them. Additionally, the &bFilter Module&r can be configured to be &nNBT&r and &bdamage-sensitive&r, allowing for fine-tuned control over your automation processes."
		""
		"This module is essential for maintaining organized and efficient item and fluid management in your &5RFTools&r setups."
	]
	quest.1B4ED65C614B102F.quest_desc: [
		"Two revenants appear in the burning arena"
		""
		"It blocks attack with shields"
		""
		"But you can either pierce the shield or break it with a critical axe attack"
		""
		"It shoots out its Ashen breath every certain time"
		""
		"It also throws bones while flying"
		""
		"Dedicate the ashes it drops to the altar"
	]
	quest.1B5177A774FCEF64.quest_desc: [
		"Before we start enlisting the help of our Demon friends, we will need to create the most important item needed for Rituals: &aChalk&r."
		""
		"There are several colors of chalk needed, with higher level Rituals requiring several to activate. To start with, &bWhite Chalk&r is the easiest to get."
		""
		"Start by tossing Otherstone in a furnace, and tossing Otherworld Logs into &dSpiritfire&r. With the items you create, you'll be able to make the Impure White Chalk."
		""
		"To purify any piece of Chalk, simply throw it into &dSpiritfire&r to cleanse it. Using the Purified Chalk on the ground will draw &mdemonic&r pretty symbols on the ground. These are a pain to remove, unless of course, you make yourself the &aChalk Brush&r. Do it, it's worth it."
	]
	quest.1B5177A774FCEF64.title: "Preparing for a Ritual: &eChalk&r"
	quest.1B5B02B717D10175.quest_subtitle: "Summons the Extreme Wither"
	quest.1B60491EDE73447B.quest_desc: [
		"Used to Store Energy in the network"
		""
		"Energy Capacity: 2,000,000 FE"
	]
	quest.1B60491EDE73447B.quest_subtitle: "Tier 1"
	quest.1B60491EDE73447B.title: "&fFlux Storage"
	quest.1B65E8BE91A087DA.quest_desc: [
		"After placing a Chain Conveyor, they can be connected to other Chain Conveyors by right-clicking them with a Chain. The selection can be cleared by right-clicking the Chain Conveyor again. "
		""
		"The maximum distance at which chain conveyors can be placed is 32 blocks, can add 8 blocks to the side if it is 32 blocks away."
		""
		"The maximum angle at which chain conveyors can connect with elevation difference is 45°, this allows an approximate ratio of 2 horizontal blocks to one vertical block. the maximum possible straight slope is 30L by 14H center to center."
	]
	quest.1B79F794EDAA810A.quest_desc: [
		"This Block is an Alternative to In-World Bee Breeding, and is entirely optional. The Breeding Chamber Requires the Parent Bee's Breeding items to function. Typically this is Flowers, but there are notable outliers. Check by Clicking \"U\" on a bee in Jei!"
		""
		"Not All bees can be Bred! This is usually reserved for bees whos combs are used for valuable resources."
	]
	quest.1B7A6E394D17A5F9.quest_desc: ["The &6best&r of the &6best,&r &dno one can match you&r, You will see through all."]
	quest.1B7A6E394D17A5F9.quest_subtitle: "See beyond reality. No illusion can deceive you now."
	quest.1B82B4629245EC26.quest_desc: ["A &avery tough block&r that has the &bpower&r to resist attacks form the &cWither.&r"]
	quest.1B855E9478095343.quest_desc: ["The &aAwakened Item Dislocator&r is a magnet with a range of &d32 blocks&r."]
	quest.1B9851CDDC2EC912.quest_desc: [
		"The &bBlazing Infuser&r is a powerful &9infusion machine&r in &5RFTools&r used to enhance and upgrade various items and blocks."
		""
		"To use the &bBlazing Infuser&r, place it in your world and connect it to your power network using &9energy cables&r. &n&bRight-click&r to open the &6GUI&r, where you can place the item you wish to infuse along with the required &aDimensional Shards&r."
		""
		"The &bBlazing Infuser&r will consume energy and &cDimensional Shards&r to apply powerful upgrades to the item, enhancing its capabilities or adding new functionalities. This process is essential for creating high-tier equipment and improving the efficiency of your &5RFTools&r machines."
	]
	quest.1B9DDF8A12434E1F.quest_desc: ["Crafted from &cnetherite,&r an &boxygen can&r, and &dOstrum plates&r, this can hold more &boxygen.&r"]
	quest.1BB571557F74D3A1.quest_desc: ["As you have explored, you may have encountered abandoned colonies. If you like, you can take over an abandoned colony and repair it. This can be a good way to jumpstart your colony. However, if you want the full colony experience, then it’s recommended that you find a good place to settle your colony and start the old fashioned way. Blood, sweat and tears. "]
	quest.1BD956EF7376C51C.quest_desc: ["Found in &9The Other&r dimension in the library, on the &62nd floor&r there will be a &3trial spawner&r with &4evokers&r, when you clear the &3trial spawner&r it will drop 1 smithing template."]
	quest.1BEEB1B3081EA395.quest_subtitle: "Used to maintain any temperature you want"
	quest.1BFFBDE6FB0F5476.title: "Defeat the Netherite Monstrosity"
	quest.1C16AEE8E29FB5A0.quest_desc: [
		"The rallying banner will summon your Guards to you when used. It’s especially useful in raids, as Guards don’t automatically know where to find the raiders. You must shift + right-click the banner on a Guard tower or Barracks Tower to assigns the Guards in that tower to the rallying banner."
		""
		"Note: Your Guards will not follow you outside the colony border. To bring Guards outside the border, set them to Follow you on the second page of their tower GUI."
	]
	quest.1C214DD51C58BE4D.title: "&fFlux Controller"
	quest.1C25114D2AF71C35.quest_desc: ["A &l3x3x4&r &lrectangle,&r with &ablast proof casing&r in the &emiddle section,&r and &dtitanium casing&r for the &etop&r and &ebottom,&r again, you can hold a &6wrench&r to view the placement of required blocks for &dmulti-blocks.&r"]
	quest.1C29C4D117761F30.quest_desc: [
		"The core crafting machine for &bME Networks&r, capable of &einstantaneous item production&r when provided with &6Encoded Patterns&r and materials. Functions as a &dhigh-tech workbench&r that pulls ingredients directly from connected &5ME Storage&r."
		""
		"Key Traits:"
		""
		"Requires &bCrafting Patterns&r"
		""
		"Needs &9co-processors&r for parallel crafting"
		""
		"Uses &5AE2 power&r during operation"
		""
		"&aYour ME Network's robotic crafting arm&r"
	]
	quest.1C29C4D117761F30.title: "&5Molecular Assembler&r"
	quest.1C4ABF4518638A82.quest_desc: ["A type of &aapple&r with &dmore effects&r then the&c previous tier&r"]
	quest.1C91BD525C91FD73.quest_desc: [
		"This stuff is everywhere."
		""
		"It can be used to give yourself experience, or used to make the Stella Eternal."
	]
	quest.1CA2825FFA775BBE.quest_desc: ["Changes &amaterials&r into &2other materials,&r or &echarges them.&r"]
	quest.1CB243F7E197B883.quest_desc: ["Displays the top level job and its current progress so you can see what a particular Crafting CPU is currently working on."]
	quest.1CBE8399B440A1FD.quest_desc: ["A powerful multi-cylinder engine arranged in a circular pattern for balanced motion and high torque. Its efficient design provides strong, consistent power for advanced industrial machinery."]
	quest.1CC35C01F13AE8EF.quest_desc: [
		"The &ePackage Crafting Machine Proxy&r allows &6Unpackagers&r to send items to &aspecialized package crafting machines&r"
		"&aremotely&r."
		""
		"This means crafting machines do &cNOT&r need to be placed directly next to an Unpackager."
		""
		"&eHow the Crafting Proxy Works&r"
		""
		"• The proxy acts as a &eremote endpoint&r"
		"• Unpackagers send packages to the proxy"
		"• The proxy forwards them to the bound machine"
		""
		"This enables clean layouts and long-distance automation."
		""
		"&eBinding a Crafting Machine&r"
		""
		"• Bind a &eProxy Marker&r to a package crafting machine"
		"• Insert the bound marker into the &eCrafting Proxy&r"
		"• The proxy now knows where to send packages"
		""
		"&eManaging Proxy Markers&r"
		""
		"• &aSneak + Right-click&r with a bound marker to unbind it"
		"• You can copy a bound marker by crafting it"
		"  together with empty markers"
		""
		"&eAdvanced Setup&r"
		""
		"• Use the &ePackaging Settings Cloner&r"
		"  to copy proxy targets"
		"• Paste settings into another proxy"
		"  using an empty Proxy Marker"
		""
		"&eWhy Use the Crafting Proxy?&r"
		""
		"• Keep crafting machines far away from Unpackagers"
		"• Build clean, modular factories"
		"• Reduce cable and pipe clutter"
		"• Ideal for large &ePackagedAuto&r setups"
	]
	quest.1CC35C01F13AE8EF.title: "&bWhat Is the Crafting Proxy?&r"
	quest.1CC4F8570A7A99EB.quest_desc: ["Useful for &6crafting many items&r, you can get this from &ckilling mobs&r, &agrowing it&r, or &bmining some&r."]
	quest.1CC910880728D896.quest_desc: ["Essentially a very large &9doughnut&r with the ability to transform some &bliquids&r into the very &cbest fuel.&r"]
	quest.1CC910880728D896.quest_subtitle: "Can I eat it?"
	quest.1CCA31D9352C60E6.quest_desc: ["Clustered around a towering central “grandmother” mushroom, these villages appear quaint from afar. Yet the villagers within are far more aggressive than their old-world counterparts, hiding a cunning fierceness beneath their colorful caps. Approach with caution as this village may welcome the unwary only to spring its traps."]
	quest.1CCA31D9352C60E6.quest_subtitle: "Find a mushroom village"
	quest.1CDBE274A0E9E725.quest_desc: ["The simplest option. Place it next to a furnace burning coal or on top of a bucket of lava, and it will start generating a small amount of RF. It's enough to power your first two machines."]
	quest.1CF03401525F18B6.quest_desc: [
		"This &amodpack&r started as a simple &bproject&r, a style of &amodpack&r that's rarely seen these days with so many &4Kitchensink&r modpacks crowding the &6CurseForge&r page. "
		""
		"I thought about making my own &aexpert modpack&r, and today it has &3developed&r into a project that I &9manage&r and &3maintain&r with an incredible community. "
		""
		"So I can only &5thank everyone&r who downloaded, played, and gave their &efeedback&r. Thank you!"
		""
		"And if you ever feel lost… keep exploring."
		"Or join our Discord server to share the journey!"
	]
	quest.1CF03401525F18B6.title: "What is Infinity Legacy II?"
	quest.1CF0D347EBEB72CB.quest_desc: [
		"The &bME Annihilation Plane&r automatically breaks blocks in front of it and returns dropped items directly to the &dME network&r."
		""
		"The &bAnnihilation Plane&r can be &aenchanted&r like a regular tool, affecting block drops similarly. This makes it ideal for processing ore blocks when enchanted with &dFortune&r."
		""
		"Enchantments increase the &aenergy use&r of the plane per block broken. Enchanting with &eEfficiency&r reduces overall energy use, while &eUnbreaking&r gives a chance to save energy, similar to regular tools."
	]
	quest.1CF8263756EE8F2A.quest_desc: ["Dropped by the &5Ender dragon&r and &0Wither&r, you will sue this to create &6awakened gear&r."]
	quest.1D00D782B8F0B6D6.quest_desc: [
		"The Mechanical Mixer is powered by an internal cogwheel, and will behave as one to any adjacent components, relaying and reversing rotation sideways."
		""
		"The Mixer requires a minimum rotational speed of 30 RPM from its power source to work. Mixers will process ingredients faster the more speed it is given."
		""
		"To work, a Mixer must be placed directly above a Basin, with a 1 block gap. When a valid recipe is inserted by throwing the ingredients in the Mixer, the Mixer will automatically combine the ingredients."
	]
	quest.1D06097B6206BA60.quest_desc: ["Some bookshelves have a more &cpowerful&r &bInfused&r version, these are bookshelves that have been &denchanted&r with a specific &eInfuse&r &denchant&r at a specific stat level."]
	quest.1D06097B6206BA60.title: "Infusion"
	quest.1D0939A8B41C72BF.quest_desc: [
		"Stores up to 200,000 AE."
		""
		"They do not accept power directly, but are used to add additional power storage to an already existing ME Network."
	]
	quest.1D10D63725698BED.quest_desc: [
		"&0Dark matter pedestals&r are used to activate the &cextra ability&r withen &6trinkets &o(usally rings&r)&r added with &dProjectE&r, "
		""
		"&lRight-Click&r with the &aitem&r you want to put on the &0pedestal,&r &lRight-Click&r again to &aactivate&r or &bdeactivate&r it, and &lLeft-Click&r to &cremove the item&r."
		""
		"You can view what the &aitem&r does by &ehovering over it&r with your &amouse&r and &bblue text&r should appear."
	]
	quest.1D1174EBE379B36D.quest_desc: [
		"The &dMycelial Reactor&r is a &bpowerhouse&r that combines the outputs of multiple &aMycelial Generators&r to produce immense amounts of &eenergy&r. This setup is perfect for high-demand energy needs, utilizing a variety of fuel types to keep everything running smoothly."
		""
		"&6How It Works:&r"
		"The &dMycelial Reactor&r itself doesn’t need power to operate but instead relies on the &cenergy&r produced by connected &aMycelial Generators&r. When fully set up, it can output a tremendous amount of &9power&r, enough to fuel your most demanding machinery and systems."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&aMycelial Generators&r"
		""
		"These unique generators come in various types, each using different &efuel sources&r to produce &cpower&r. They are designed to work in tandem with the &dMycelial Reactor&r, contributing to its overall energy output."
	]
	quest.1D197B1919452187.quest_desc: ["A compact Redstone Link that adds wireless redstone to buttons, levers, and linked levers."]
	quest.1D22136BD093C348.quest_desc: [
		"&oFed up with farming &aDemon's Dream Fruits&r &ofor Otherworld Wood?&r "
		""
		"This is when rituals come in handy. This Foliot would allow you to exchange your &z\"Oak Saplings\"&r for &eOtherworld Saplings&r, so you no longer need &cThird Eye&r effect to get the wood."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&oTip&r: &dContainment Jar&r prevents Foliots from disappearing and keeps their functionality."
	]
	quest.1D22136BD093C348.quest_subtitle: "Your first companion"
	quest.1D22136BD093C348.title: "Otherworld Sapling Trader"
	quest.1D2ED78CD7DEA8E2.quest_desc: ["The &aWyvern Tools/Weapons&r have a grid of &b4x4&r for modules."]
	quest.1D2ED78CD7DEA8E2.title: "Wyvern Tools \\& Weapons"
	quest.1D45085F4D187E92.quest_desc: ["To obtain the &2Demon's Dream Seeds&r, simply punch some grass. It should not take a long time, as it has pretty decent chance of being dropped. "]
	quest.1D45085F4D187E92.quest_subtitle: "Welcome to Occultism"
	quest.1D45085F4D187E92.title: "Beggining"
	quest.1D57C823A1F0203C.quest_desc: ["After &lRight-Clicking&r a &bwater source&r with this to fill it, and &lRight-Clicking&r a &ccoal&r in your &einventory&r to fuel it, you can use this as a &apickaxe&r with the ability to press &lY&r to &6change mining mode&r, and &lShift-Right&r click to disable &bsilk touch&r&b.&r"]
	quest.1D861612DC79A95D.quest_desc: ["Didn't like the enchantment? no problem use the dis-enchantment table"]
	quest.1DA4B337940EFC2D.quest_subtitle: "You can use Mystical Agriculture!"
	quest.1DBA8DD396081924.quest_desc: ["The Interfaces must be placed facing each other at 1-2 blocks apart, one on a Contraption with Fluid Tanks and one stationary. A Fluid Pump is required to insert or extract liquid from the Contraption. To pump liquids to another tank, simply connect the stationary interface and the fluid tank with fluid pipes, although pumps are required to move the liquids."]
	quest.1DBB7232A529A7E6.quest_desc: [
		"The heavy industrial big brother of the DMA. It handles large-batch conversions and parallel synthesis recipes with significantly higher speed."
		""
		"Supply it with coolant and power via hatches placed next to the controller."
	]
	quest.1DBB7232A529A7E6.quest_subtitle: "Industrial Matter Synthesis"
	quest.1DBB7232A529A7E6.title: "Quantum Matter Fabricator"
	quest.1DC40420068AD5DD.quest_desc: ["This weapon shoots blasts of&9 high knockback electricity&r that does &azero damage&r, and will &drecharge&r if depleted while you have a &btesla bulb&r in your inventory."]
	quest.1DCDA89DA49A8EF0.quest_desc: ["Refinery is a structure added by the Immersive Engineering mod. It uses energy and combines Ethanol (8 mb) and Plant Oil (8 mb) to create Biodiesel (16 mb), a combustible fuel for Diesel Generator."]
	quest.1DCDA89DA49A8EF0.title: "Refinery"
	quest.1DD861102962056D.quest_subtitle: "A somewhat good option for mining."
	quest.1DE0F289821F55D1.quest_desc: ["Now that we have a Foliot Crusher, we can &muse&r politely ask it to crush down some &eEnd Stone&r and &9Obsidian&r for us. We'll use these to make some new Chalk!"]
	quest.1DE0F289821F55D1.title: "&aChalking It Up&r"
	quest.1DE428DE5A0AB47C.quest_desc: ["When it's finished processing the coal, the front doors will open and it will spit the coal coke out the front. It's a good idea to have hoppers or a belt there to catch it."]
	quest.1DE8B0C9A7195720.quest_desc: [
		"Once you've finish placing in all of the required blocks to build the &6Reactor&r, it should give off &cred&r particles to show that it is &ncomplete&r."
		""
		"&eRight clicking&r anywhere on the Reactor will open up the &aInterface&r. This will have all of the information you need to run the &6Reactor&r properly, as well as two buttons to turn &9on&r and &coff&r the &6Reactor&r."
		""
		"On the left, you have &o&b2 tanks&r: One for &bCoolant&r and one for &3Fissile Fuel&r. On the right, you have one for &8Nuclear Waste&r, and one for &bHeated Coolant&r, which will most likely be &bSteam&r."
		""
		"The &cTemperature&r bar will show you how hot the Reactor is. After a certain temp, the Reactor will start taking &4Damage&r, which will eventually cause the Reactor to explode."
		""
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"To adjust the &cBurn Rate&r of the &3Fissile Fuel&r and see more statistics, click on the (I) tab on the left side. Here, you can adjust the Rate Limit, which controls how much fuel the Reactor burns per tick."
		""
	]
	quest.1DE8B0C9A7195720.title: "&3Completed Fission Reactor"
	quest.1DEB8D39E8484973.quest_desc: ["[ { \"text\": \"Click Me!\", \"underlined\": true, \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"232F28C7B5A9F4DD\" } } ]"]
	quest.1DEB8D39E8484973.quest_subtitle: "Don't forget to check our farming mod MFM!"
	quest.1E01AC22D5903AD1.quest_desc: ["Hand cranks with a cogwheel installed."]
	quest.1E0AE46BB87E6C09.quest_desc: [
		"&bCrafter Tier 1&r, &6Tier 2&r, and &cTier 3&r are versatile &dcrafting machines&r in &5RFTools&r that automate crafting processes with increasing efficiency and capacity at each tier."
		""
		"The &bCrafter Tier 1&r can hold up to &a2 recipes&r, while the &6Crafter Tier 2&r can hold up to &d4 recipes&r, and the &cCrafter Tier 3&r can hold up to &b8 recipes&r. These crafters automate the crafting of items, allowing you to set up complex crafting chains without manual intervention."
		""
		"To use a &bCrafter&r, place it in your world and connect it to your power network using &9energy cables&r. &n&bRight-click&r to open the &6GUI&r, where you can place the necessary ingredients and set up the desired recipes. Once configured, the &bCrafter&r will automatically craft items based on the recipes provided whenever it receives the required materials."
		""
		"The higher the tier, the more recipes the crafter can handle simultaneously, making the &cCrafter Tier 3&r ideal for large-scale automation setups."
	]
	quest.1E1016523BF3849D.quest_desc: ["A refined material obtained from crushing bauxite ore. It serves as a key ingredient in producing aluminum and other advanced industrial alloys."]
	quest.1E1870FAD295DEDE.quest_desc: ["Clear out and flatten an area roughly 20x20 blocks to make room for your camp. The camp will not place if there are objects in the way. Right clicking the supply camp on the ground will show a 3D preview of the camp. Using the placement controls arrows, position the camp in your clearing, then click the green checkmark to finalize the placement. If it won’t place, then the terrain is in the way, and you may need to clear the area more. Red lines may appear showing you the areas that need to be cleared."]
	quest.1E1EF430810D08BF.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Solar Neutron Activator&r is a machine that directs the neutron radiation of the sun into its internal reservoir, allowing for the slow creation of various isotopes."
		""
		"The &9input&r is at the &o&bbottom&r, the &coutput&r is at the &o&bfront&r."
		""
		"It does not need &nenergy&r except for &ndirect sunlight&r which can be intercepted by transparent blocks such as glass, cables, pipes, etc."
	]
	quest.1E31F400E47B0D34.quest_desc: ["The first &aore&r of your journey, found within the &9deep dark&r (and &emining dimension in the&r  &lDeep Slate layor&r) , you will use this for your first set of &6ATM&r &cgear.&r you need &dNetherite&r to mine this ore."]
	quest.1E3A0029B8A7826A.quest_desc: ["Crafted from &0plates of an ancient beast&r, &cpowerful&r yet&b can break&r."]
	quest.1E414D285E7A5FE2.quest_desc: ["Tools stronger then the &cprevious tier&r of &aessence.&r"]
	quest.1E5C1E40BC116DEC.quest_desc: ["Those small little fellas create their own mushroom tiny villages where they can be found. Trap them in jars and collect dust from them."]
	quest.1E62FF75E939AD80.quest_desc: [
		"The &aChaotic Capacitor&r has a grid of &b8x6&r for modules."
		""
		"It can charge your &dheld item&r, &darmor&r, &dhotbar&r, &dmain inventory&r, and your &dcurios slots&r."
	]
	quest.1E6717073A2504CA.quest_desc: ["Combine &0coal&r, &5obsidian&r and &7iron&r in the &#144032alloy smelter&r to obtain Dark steel used in many recipes."]
	quest.1E6717073A2504CA.title: "Dark Steel Ingot"
	quest.1E7401AD76624DEB.quest_desc: ["Acquired through &lRight-Clicking&r a &egeothermal vent&r with an &bempty bottle&r, you will use this new found gas to create &dcolored lights&r! "]
	quest.1E8744C1B5BF390B.quest_desc: [
		"From here you can choose two paths to focus on, or both at the same time, but it may take longer. "
		""
		"One of them is Mystical Agriculture, with which you can grow most vanilla resources in the form of seeds and essences, being faster if used in a hydroponic bed. "
		""
		"Or you can choose the Productive Bees path, which also has most of the normal resources but with some extras such as items that would normally require quarries, manual mining, and crafting."
	]
	quest.1E8744C1B5BF390B.quest_subtitle: "Or just do both"
	quest.1E9AB7114C5ADDB9.quest_desc: ["&5A lot more storage.&r"]
	quest.1EBA6436DEBB02CC.quest_desc: [
		"The &eME Conversion Monitor&r is the upgraded version of the &2ME Storage Monitor&r."
		""
		"It adds the ability to &ndirectly&r withdraw from or store &aItems&r into the &dME Network&r."
		""
		"In addition to the &2Storage Monitor's&r interactions, conversion monitors support the following actions:"
		""
		"&bLeft-click&r &nExtracts&r a stack of the shown item into &nyour inventory&r"
		""
		"&bRight-click&r with &eItem&r &nInserts&r the held item into &nthe network&r"
		""
		"&bRight-click&r with &7Empty Hand&r will &ninsert&r all of the shown item from &nyour inventory&r into &nthe network&r."
	]
	quest.1EF51C312AAA3437.quest_desc: [
		"Graviton casings form the chassis for early UFO machines and crafting storage blocks."
		""
		"Surround an obsidian matrix with iron blocks and engineering processors to put them together."
	]
	quest.1EF51C312AAA3437.quest_subtitle: "Heavy Structural Frame"
	quest.1EF51C312AAA3437.title: "Graviton-Plated Casing"
	quest.1F10BC33D22328BD.quest_desc: ["Time has claimed this once-sacred site, leaving its halls cracked and overgrown. Now, ghostly skeletons and trickster illusioners linger within, guarding little more than shadows of former glory. Though its dangers are real, the temple’s sturdy walls make it a tempting refuge for those seeking a foothold in this hostile world."]
	quest.1F10BC33D22328BD.quest_subtitle: "Find an Abandoned Temple"
	quest.1F1EC80441892760.quest_desc: [
		""
		"{ \"text\": \"CLICK ME!\", \"underlined\": true, \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"0FF49F7DD4D172CF\" } }"
	]
	quest.1F1EC80441892760.quest_subtitle: "Check out the ars nouveau questlines."
	quest.1F24D9BBA0E58F57.quest_desc: [
		"The &bMarine Fisher&r automates &afishing&r."
		""
		"Place it in a body of &awater&r and provide it with &dpower&r."
		""
		"It will catch &afish&r and other aquatic items, collecting them for easy access."
	]
	quest.1F36CF5D11E08839.quest_desc: ["Connects forge energy compatible blocks with wires to transfer energy."]
	quest.1F4EBEDFCB7ED937.quest_desc: ["The &6ME Storage Component&r is a vital item in the &bApplied Energistics 2&r mod, used to store items within your &dME Network&r."]
	quest.1F55CDDE9366D686.quest_desc: ["Use this to trap your dragon. How does enormous dragon fits into this thing? Magic I guess, have you ever seen dragons irl? Pfff"]
	quest.1F6954F09D38C83C.quest_desc: ["The &cPromethium Pickaxe&r and &6Promethium Axe&r represent the highest tier of Oritech equipment, requiring Promethium Ingots from the Atomic Forge."]
	quest.1F6954F09D38C83C.title: "Promethium Tools"
	quest.1F7265FE8C269446.quest_desc: [
		"The &aAdvanced Dislocator&r is a device that can store a lot of &dTP points&r. "
		""
		"&bShift+Right Click&r to register your teleportation point in it, you can rename it and lock. It uses &cEnder Pearls&r for fuel."
	]
	quest.1F7591DB6D8EC1E7.quest_desc: ["A type of &aapple&r with &dmore effects&r then the&c previous tier&r"]
	quest.1F87798C942B893F.quest_desc: [
		"To quickly install insert/extract"
		"upgrade, just &aShift + Right Click&r on the"
		"machine."
	]
	quest.1F87798C942B893F.quest_subtitle: "Powering Up"
	quest.1F88C697817A7680.quest_desc: ["&cNew apples!&r Crafted with different &atiers of essence&r and &eG-apple&r you will get new types of &capples&r more types of &dpowerful effects&r."]
	quest.1F8A7D8A2690A89D.quest_desc: ["Generates energy from the temperature from a heat source on the bottom of the generator."]
	quest.1F9411E20E806B1E.quest_desc: ["The &aDraconium Core&r is an important crafting ingredient. It's used in many recipes and it is also used to stabilize a mob spawner into a &bStabilized Mob Spawner&r."]
	quest.1F980CFE55E589A6.quest_desc: [
		"The Industrial Squeezer is a 3x3x3 multiblock added by Immersive Engineering. It is used to make Plant Oil or HOP Graphite Dust"
		""
		"The following list shows various items that can be squeezed into Plant Oil."
		""
		"Melon Seeds -> &o&b20&rmB"
		"Pumpkin Seeds--> &o&b40&rmB"
		"Tomato Seeds -> &o&b60&rmB"
		"Beetroot Seeds -> &o&b60&rmB"
		"Wheat Seeds -> &o&b80&rmB"
		"Cabbage Seeds -> &o&b80&rmB"
		"Industrial Hemp Seeds -> &o&b120&rmB"
	]
	quest.1F980CFE55E589A6.title: "Industrial Squeezer"
	quest.1FAAF8216CDC3AC6.quest_desc: [
		"Pumping &0Nuclear Waste&r into a &9Solar Neutron Activator&r will give you &dPolonium&r. "
		""
		"Run the &dPolonium&r through a &2Pressurized Reaction Chamber&r with some &bFluorite Dust&r and you'll get &9Polonium Pellets&r."
		""
		"This will also create a byproduct of &7Spent Nuclear Waste&r, which needs to be pumped into a &6Waste Barrel&r for storage."
	]
	quest.1FB657F4DEC4885C.quest_desc: ["Crafting Storage provides 1k - 265M of storage for crafting."]
	quest.1FC7E9DBF92BE6AA.quest_desc: ["The Energy Tablet is a portable, rechargeable battery pack that can be charged with up to 1,000kJ of energy and can then be used to power other devices. It is also an ingredient in many recipes."]
	quest.1FC7E9DBF92BE6AA.quest_subtitle: "Portable Battery Pack"
	quest.1FCBEAF699ADAD94.quest_desc: ["The &6Industrial Grade Assembler&r is primarily used to craft the&z Core of Industrial Perfection&r, but it can also be used for bulk crafting basic &9AE2 components&r."]
	quest.1FCF804CD8660DAD.quest_desc: ["&6Head protection&r made from ancient &ehides and bones&r. As strong as &bdiamond.&r"]
	quest.1FDBB75ECD39FB24.quest_desc: [
		"The Item Drain can hold up to 1500mb of fluid at a time. A Fluid Pump is needed to extract the fluid."
		""
		"A Basin will automatically deposit output fluids into an Item Drain placed near it."
	]
	quest.1FE3645BC1E7689F.quest_desc: ["Push mobs. Need redstone signal."]
	quest.2001C60DBF7DF81F.quest_desc: ["Start you journey by checking the various quests in the quest book."]
	quest.201CB898A399F1D5.quest_desc: [
		"The Swineherd’s Hut is where the Swineherd will breed and butcher pigs for food. You will have to capture and bring in two pigs to the Swineherd’s Hut, as the Swineherd will not catch and bring in any pigs."
		""
		"The Swineherd will only keep two pigs alive per hut level, so at level 5 they will have ten pigs in their holding pens."
	]
	quest.202B1F54D3F06DAB.quest_desc: ["A new &cti&r&cer&r of &aessence!&r Used to craft many &eitems&r."]
	quest.203249D87278BAD6.quest_desc: [
		"Welcome to the &5&lInfinity Challenges&r — the ultimate test of automation, power, and combat in &6Version 4.5&r!"
		""
		"Here lie the greatest milestones a modded player can achieve:"
		"• &e100 Billion and 1 Trillion FE&r"
		"• &b10 Million compressed items&r"
		"• &cSlaughter of the Multiverse's greatest Bosses&r"
		"• &dColossal EMC reserves&r"
		""
		"Prove that you have mastered every single production line in this modpack!"
	]
	quest.203249D87278BAD6.title: "🌌 &#D4AF37&lInfinity Challenges (v4.5)&r"
	quest.2033C1F285C61154.quest_desc: [
		"The &dEnchantment Factory&r automates the enchanting process."
		""
		"Provide it with &abooks&r or &aitems&r to be enchanted, &aLapis Lazuli&r, and &dpower&r."
		""
		"The &dEnchantment Factory&r will apply random &aenchantments&r to the items, similar to an &aEnchanting Table&r."
		""
		"Configure it to prioritize certain &aenchantments&r if desired."
	]
	quest.203600FDAB9A148A.quest_subtitle: "Final ingot"
	quest.206159A3C7A78447.quest_subtitle: "Build a Mystical Site"
	quest.2066C45ACAA7E7B8.quest_desc: ["The base for creating the &delemantal bangles&r. Can randomly boost spell damage."]
	quest.209438A4F154203C.quest_subtitle: "A easy way to get infinite water"
	quest.209438A4F154203C.title: "Infinite Water"
	quest.20A093E5684D2E30.quest_desc: ["The next &bitem&r you will be using a lot of to craft &cnew&r &cmachines.&r"]
	quest.20B495B4B8B95636.quest_desc: ["Combining a Dragon Head with a Mystical Dagger will give you Dragon Scales."]
	quest.20B495B4B8B95636.title: "Dragon Scales"
	quest.20C24A8F55709AC6.quest_desc: [
		"&4Quantum accelerators&r add &28 co-processors&r to the Quantum Computer multiblock. It's important to note that all crafting"
		"patterns being run by the quantum computer are able to share all co-processors, so it's probably a good idea to invest"
		"in a great amount of these."
	]
	quest.20CA94E3263FCA5E.quest_desc: ["Different &ctiers&r of &bwatering cans&r hold more water. &lRight-Click&r water to fill the can up, &lShift-Right-CLick&r to water &acrops&r around you."]
	quest.20EF6077B71569AA.quest_desc: ["A rigid structural lattice used to house dense quantum circuitry and high-frequency co-processors."]
	quest.20EF6077B71569AA.quest_subtitle: "High-Frequency Compute Matrix"
	quest.20EF6077B71569AA.title: "Quantum Lattice Frame"
	quest.20F4CBC52CD12260.quest_desc: ["The &6Tempad&r mod introduces a device inspired by the \"Loki\" series, allowing players to save specific locations and teleport to them from anywhere in the game world. Users can customize the color of the portals and the interface, with 30 available options."]
	quest.210137C6556CA68B.quest_desc: ["Right click on a chicken to get Golden Egg."]
	quest.212EF8601746C500.quest_desc: ["A type of &aapple&r with &dmore effects&r then the&c previous tier&r"]
	quest.21426F5EEC922866.quest_desc: ["Half-submerged in the oceans lie the petrified remains of a colossal beast, its skeletal form stretching farther than the eye can follow. Was it a creature of the deep, dragged ashore in ages past—or did it fall from the heavens themselves? No records remain, only questions carved into stone."]
	quest.21426F5EEC922866.quest_subtitle: "Find a Typhon"
	quest.215606B3A894512E.quest_desc: ["Input your &6bronze drill&r into your item&e input hatch,&r and &bsteam&r in the &9fluid hatch&r, then you will &dreceive ores&r in the &aitem output!&r"]
	quest.215D766150B54B17.quest_desc: ["Low current"]
	quest.21624A6500545C42.quest_desc: ["Makes crops grow faster"]
	quest.2179C9F691BDBB0E.quest_subtitle: "sneaky sneaky"
	quest.21800FC0CDC937CB.quest_desc: [
		"Produces much higher voltages and power than a basic generator."
		""
		"Components are assembled in a Mechanical Crafter using plenty of Aluminum and Steel."
		""
		"Surround the rotor with the stators to complete the multiblock."
		""
		"Operational details:"
		""
		"0 RPM - 70 RPM: No electricity generation"
		""
		"71 RPM - 256 RPM: Voltage rises linearly from 12V to 2232 kV. Current is limited to 24.6A, giving power output from 295W to 54.9kW"
	]
	quest.218803812A9C332B.quest_desc: ["&cStronger&r &cHellshelves&r &eInfused&r in a &denchant&r table with at &lLeast 45&r &aEterna&r and at &lLeast 30&r &cQuanta.&r"]
	quest.21939E58707A7756.title: "Large steam macerator"
	quest.2199F0DE2FBE29E3.quest_desc: [
		"The Mechanical Arm can interact with Cooking Pot, Skillet, Stove, Cutting Board, Chiller, Oven."
		""
		"And the Mechanical Arm can work on stations which have Packager unpacking support for container slot only, as the ingredient slots is properly handled by Packager unpacking."
	]
	quest.21A830CC8DAD6566.quest_desc: [
		"Right-click a Train Track, then place the Station within 15 blocks of the track. It can only create Trains if placed on a straight Track, and Bogeys may only be placed on a 3 block long straight track."
		""
		"In the interface, the Station can be named; these names are how non-player conducted Trains will identify stations. A conductor cannot be instructed to navigate to a station that is named the same as the station they are currently at, and will otherwise choose the closest accessible station out of multiple stations with the same name."
		""
		"The name will also show up on a Map if it is used on the station, similarly to Banners."
	]
	quest.21B40BEC30B40491.quest_desc: [
		"While held, funnels prevent the player from accessing inventories, instead placing them. Sneak right clicking with a Funnel places it in input mode."
		""
		"Using a Wrench on the funnel switches it between input and output mode. Redstone can be applied to stop the funnel from inputting or outputting. Right-clicking a funnel on a Mechanical Belt causes it to extend one block forward."
	]
	quest.21B40BEC30B40491.title: "Funnel"
	quest.21CCBEBD84A4C4A5.quest_desc: [
		"The &bShape Card (Void)&r is a variant of the &bShape Card&r in &5RFTools&r designed to remove blocks or liquids within a specified area without dropping items."
		""
		"This card is particularly useful for clearing large areas quickly, without worrying about item drops."
	]
	quest.21CED51F547085CE.quest_desc: [
		"Tier 4 and 5 Female dragons (yeah dont check between the legs, you won't find anything there) protect their laid eggs. Kill the mother to steal the egg.. Yeah well don't feel bad, they burnt down like 4 villages. "
		""
		"Tip: Swab the dragon for DNA to make its egg. Put it in the spawner and kill as many as you can. They seem to keep their AI despite spawner upgrades, so better kill them fast."
	]
	quest.21D45D2B85002B6E.quest_desc: ["A thick, tar-like substance derived from crude oil. It’s used as a base material for producing asphalt, fuel, and other industrial resources essential for large-scale factory operations."]
	quest.21EDEEE1A1B82B53.quest_desc: ["A new useful &ematerial&r acquired through the &6quarry.&r"]
	quest.21EE456F005D0343.quest_desc: [
		"The &9Water Condensator&r generates &3Water&r by condensing moisture from the air."
		""
		"Place it with empty tanks or pipes connected to collect the generated &3Water&r."
	]
	quest.21EE522DDBF0BF72.quest_desc: ["An enhanced version of the vanilla &dDragon's Breath&r, infused with &darcane&r power. Used for crafting the &bEndshelf.&r It's rare, &cvolatile&r, and &nabsolutely essential&r if you're aiming for &9peak magical performance&r."]
	quest.21EE72B7EC064BCB.title: "Kill a shulker"
	quest.2229840A38178686.quest_subtitle: "Best midgame flight method."
	quest.2239CC2E6B914090.quest_desc: ["A powered device that moves fluids through pipes using electrical energy. It provides precise and consistent flow control, perfect for automation systems and industrial machinery."]
	quest.22420EF3089DD7F6.quest_desc: [
		"Uses &9multiple materials&r to craft &buseful items,&r it is recommended to have &emany &rof these for &cautomation&r of these items."
		""
		"Some &bitems&r need &eone row&r to fit the requirements, some need &ethree,&r if you have can fit them, you can have say, one &bitem&r needing &etwo materials&r in the top, &clock it, &rthen a &etwo layers&r of &bitems&r in the &alast&r &atwo rows.&r"
	]
	quest.2242CC4BAB25C4B9.quest_subtitle: "Requires a MASSIVE amount of matter"
	quest.226171470A06E7E8.quest_subtitle: "Get 4 planks"
	quest.226171470A06E7E8.title: "Craft some planks"
	quest.2264770B8E993774.quest_desc: ["Internal thermal shielding used within the Stellar Nexus chamber to stabilize condensing stellar plasma."]
	quest.2264770B8E993774.quest_subtitle: "Internal Thermal Shielding"
	quest.2264770B8E993774.title: "Condensation Matrix Casing"
	quest.2278992080010A80.title: "See a Enderman"
	quest.22AC3C79141AB3FC.quest_desc: ["Obtained by putting an Electrum Sheet in a Rolling Mill."]
	quest.22AC3C79141AB3FC.quest_subtitle: "Crafting component."
	quest.22B958727A3B170A.quest_desc: ["Useful for &6crafting&r &anew armour&r and a &bnew bow&r."]
	quest.22C1FDD2FC9A3AC2.quest_desc: [
		"Recipes can be set inside of the Assembler. The fluid tanks in the Assembler will automatically fill liquid containers used in recipes, such as Water Buckets."
		""
		"The Assembler will automatically craft the set recipes if it has the correct materials. Crafted items will remain into the inventory of the Assembler."
		""
		"If an inventory is connected to the end of the Assembler, the crafted item will move into that inventory."
	]
	quest.22C1FDD2FC9A3AC2.title: "Assembler"
	quest.22C5D2CD84E6E9EF.quest_desc: [
		"The &dModification Station&r is used for applying modular upgrades to the &3Meka-Suit&r and the &aMeka-Tool&r in exchange for energy."
		""
		"A part of the &3Meka-Suit&r (which the upgrade is compatible with) is inserted into the station along with the &aupgrade&r, resulting in the upgrade being applied to the &3Meka-Suit&r."
		""
		"It functions similarly to an &0Anvil&r or a &6Power Armor Tinker Table&r from the &9Modular Powersuits&r mod."
	]
	quest.22C5D2CD84E6E9EF.title: "&eModification Station"
	quest.22E01FE041DE9C54.quest_desc: ["A compact power source that transforms water pressure into rotational energy. It provides smooth and consistent motion, ideal for efficiently running mechanical systems."]
	quest.22E15D3CC2162F60.quest_desc: [
		"The &bEnvironmental Controller&r in &5RFTools&r is a powerful device that creates and maintains specific &aenvironmental effects&r within a defined area, such as &chealth regeneration&r or &9speed boosts&r."
		""
		"To use the &bEnvironmental Controller&r:"
		"1. &n&bRight-click&r the environmental controller to open its &6GUI&r."
		"2. Insert &dmodules&r (e.g., &aRegen Module&r, &bSpeed Module&r) into the controller to define the desired environmental effects."
		"3. Configure the &brange&r and &eintensity&r of each effect in the &6GUI&r."
		"4. The environmental controller will apply the configured effects within the defined area, enhancing the environment for players."
	]
	quest.22F4C38E79DEFF1E.quest_desc: ["When placing any building, including your supply camp or ship. You will have the option to change your colony style. Click the “Switch Pack” button to open a menu with many styles to choose from. If you want to get an idea of the styles before you build, go to youtube and search \"&eMineColonies Build Styles&r\". Note: This pack includes a number of additional styles not shown in the video."]
	quest.23012F6C4C522CEB.quest_desc: ["The Forester is an essential worker in your colony. They will chop down trees and replant a sapling in the tree’s place. Foresters will chop any tree in the immediate area. However, this area can be restricted using a &ezoning tool&r available in the hut block. "]
	quest.230463E830D6FFEB.quest_desc: ["The first step in making Printed Circuit Boards. Crafted in a Pneumatic Chamber and later processed with UV, acid, and assembly machines."]
	quest.232EA3CC5C2990E1.quest_desc: ["Maximum-tier containment coils required for running the most intense end-game stellar reactions."]
	quest.232EA3CC5C2990E1.quest_subtitle: "Pinnacle Field Confinement"
	quest.232EA3CC5C2990E1.title: "Stellar Field Generator Mk.III"
	quest.232F28C7B5A9F4DD.quest_desc: ["Welcome to &#FF2E62MFM&r! This mod is designed to eliminate the grind by turning energy into resources. To get started, you will need a source of Forge Energy (FE) from another mod. Your journey begins with understanding the world around you."]
	quest.232F28C7B5A9F4DD.quest_subtitle: "Minimum Effort, Maximum Output"
	quest.232F28C7B5A9F4DD.title: "Introduction"
	quest.2331FCDD2F2B709A.quest_desc: [
		"The &9Supercharged Coil&r is placed on an &3SPS Port&r in the center of two faces, like the image below. When given power, these will supercharge &dPolonium&r into &5Antimatter&r. Only &o&b1&r is required, but you can use &o&b2&r if you want."
		""
		"To produce &o&b1mb&r of &5Antimatter&r, you need &o&b400MRF&r of power. If you haven't started making a &6Fusion Reactor&r, now's a good time to make it!"
		""
	]
	quest.2331FCDD2F2B709A.title: "The Supercharged Coils"
	quest.233E438357CD89F6.quest_desc: [
		"&9Turbine Valves&r are used to pump in &bSteam&r, as well as pumping out the power that the &9Turbine&r creates when cords and pipes are attached."
		""
		"&8Turbine Vents&r are used to pump out excess water when using &aSaturating Condensers&r. Otherwise, these help increase the overall flow of steam within the &9Turbine&r. The total number of Vents also limit the total Steam Flow Rate. Vents can also be used on the top face of the &9Turbine&r, but for this build, we'll just be using them on the &loutside faces.&r"
		""
		"&aSaturating Condensers&r are used to convert &bSteam&r back into water. These are placed on or above the layer containing the &6Electromagnetic Coils&r."
	]
	quest.233E438357CD89F6.title: "The Ports"
	quest.235103831F094D3F.quest_desc: ["Feeling like Poseidon? Well at the least you will be looking like one.."]
	quest.2389EB06F7BFCAC8.quest_desc: ["More storage."]
	quest.239D0B5CA70AA4C5.quest_desc: ["&bA second chance...&r &apowered by the infinite.&r &cJust don’t die 99 times.&r"]
	quest.23A9A2D399A7BF94.quest_desc: [
		"The Elevator Pulley moves much like the Rope Pulley and shares certain functionalities. Unlike the Rope Pulley, it can phase through blocks, and will not turn back into blocks unless the Pulley is right-clicked."
		""
		"An Elevator Pulley requires a single horizontal Redstone Contact to be on the contraption in order to assemble. If more than one is added, the Elevator will not assemble. If either of these conditions are not met, a corresponding error message will be displayed while looking at the Elevator Pulley."
	]
	quest.23F165DEAD225B10.quest_desc: ["Universal Cables are Mekanism's way to transfer power."]
	quest.23F165DEAD225B10.title: "&aBasic Universal Cable"
	quest.2408BDBEDC0C2AD6.quest_desc: ["With this armor will provide &bresistance&r to some of &eirradiated's&r effects and will &creduces&r &aacid's destructive effects&r against this &6armor&r. "]
	quest.2408BDBEDC0C2AD6.title: "Hazmat set"
	quest.24092320E90F15B5.quest_desc: ["Has a &bchance&r to drop from a &6dinosaur&r I am not naming &o(Click on the leather to see what you have to kill).&r You will use this to &ccraft primal armor&r."]
	quest.24174700F7FB771C.quest_desc: [
		"As a recap, we've set up an advanced Ore Processing facility using several gases, machinery, and more."
		""
		"In this chapter, we'll be using more of those to create powerful multiblock &aReactors&r, as well as advanced ways to create and store power. This will also lead to making &dAntimatter Pellets&r, as well as some of the strongest tools and weapons in the pack."
	]
	quest.24174700F7FB771C.title: "Welcome to&r &dMekanism 2&r "
	quest.24422A6ACA45CC63.quest_desc: [
		"&eWhat Is Ender Crafting?&r"
		""
		"&eEnder Crafting&r is a high-tier crafting recipe type used to automate recipes from the &eEnder Crafting Table&r."
		""
		"It is designed for &elate-game&r and complex crafting recipes."
		""
		"&eHow It Works&r"
		""
		"• Uses the &eEnder Package Crafter&r"
		"• Supports recipes from the &eEnder Crafting Table&r"
		"• Crafted items are &eejected&r into adjacent inventories"
		""
		"The Ender Package Crafter &crequires power&r to operate."
		""
		"&eEnder Alternators&r"
		""
		"Ender Crafting requires &eEnder Alternators&r to function."
		""
		"• Alternators must be placed within a &a7×7×7&r area"
		"• Alternators do &cNOT&r need items, but must be &apresent&r"
		"• Missing alternators will prevent crafting"
		""
		"&eUse Cases&r"
		""
		"• Automating Ender Crafting Table recipes"
		"• Late-game crafting chains"
		"• Advanced PackagedAuto setups"
		"• Integration with &3AE2&r factories"
		""
		"&eWhy Use Ender Crafting?&r"
		""
		"• Enables automated Ender Crafting"
		"• Handles very complex recipes"
		"• Removes manual crafting steps"
		"• Scales well into late-game automation"
	]
	quest.24422A6ACA45CC63.title: "&eEnder Crafting&r"
	quest.2457221FA3BDC0CB.quest_desc: ["Infinite &1AE2&r Energy, &bOLNY WORKS FOR AE2 CONTROLLERS!&r"]
	quest.245B6C714D755030.quest_subtitle: "“That’s one small step for a man, one giant leap for mankind.”"
	quest.248E87A37BBE1B4B.quest_desc: [
		"Craft the majestic &5Colossal Star Omega&r from Project Expansion!"
		""
		"Near-infinite condensation capacity for universal matter itself."
	]
	quest.248E87A37BBE1B4B.title: "🌌 &5Colossal Star (Project Expansion)"
	quest.24A4F1AA0BFFE867.quest_desc: [
		"Pretty much the same as the&b steam version &rwith the &ccasing&r square on the &etop and bottom,&r with &6coil&r in the &emiddle layers.&r"
		""
		"&6Bauxite&r in the item &binput hatch,&r for &aaluminum&r in the &boutput.&r"
	]
	quest.24A4F1AA0BFFE867.title: "Electric Blast Furnace"
	quest.24B3F8554E46922F.quest_desc: ["Use the &aFusion Crafting Core&r to combine a &aDragon Heart&r, some &aDraconic Cores&r, and &aDraconium Blocks&r to get the &bAwakened Draconium Blocks&r."]
	quest.24BD32102AFA1691.quest_desc: ["An upgraded crafter that holds more patterns and has an increased crafting speed."]
	quest.24BD32102AFA1691.title: "&5Netherite Crafter&r"
	quest.24CFA0022432887E.quest_desc: [
		"When placed by the player, the Threshold Switch will attempt to orient itself toward an adjacent inventory. If multiple or no inventories are present, the Threshold Switch may orient itself toward the player and can be adjusted as normal using the Wrench. At present, it cannot be oriented vertically."
		""
		"Item thresholds can be set to determine when the redstone signal turns on or off. When the Switch is first placed, it stays off until it reaches 75% inventory, then stays on until it reaches 25% inventory."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"The chest icon represents how full the inventory is, as well as the current signal state (on/off) depending on which lane the chest icon is in. The arrows represent inventory thresholds, illustrated by the chest icon switching lanes upon reaching the arrow."
		""
		"The signal can be inverted by clicking the button showing two opposing arrows next to the lower threshold bar."
	]
	quest.24DB954ED93BE6EE.quest_desc: [
		"Use on dirt to create Delightful Dirt."
		"(make a 5x5 of dirt and use it in the middle)"
		""
		"Passive mobs spawn on this."
		""
		"As time goes on it will grow grass and the like, if all the Delightful Dirt is covered, it will not spawn passive mobs so make sure to check on that."
	]
	quest.24DBBC97F8635A16.quest_desc: [
		"&4ME Advanced Pattern Provider&r is a new type of &3Pattern Provider&r that upgrades"
		"a standard version or an &cExtended Pattern Provider&r with the capability to configure the face to"
		"which any individual item in a pattern will be pushed to. This powerful addition allows for automation of machines that"
		"require specific sides for specific inputs to be done with a single block and no pipes!"
		""
		"*Looking at you, Mekanism.*"
		""
		"To be able to use this feature, you'll need to insert an &2Advanced Processing Pattern&r created"
		"by inserting an encoded pattern in a &aAdvanced Pattern Encoder&r and taking out the advanced"
		"version."
	]
	quest.24DDED464AE48E05.quest_desc: ["Reverses outgoing Rotational Force when a Redstone signal is applied."]
	quest.24E50A3AF87B2283.quest_desc: [
		"The &bScreen&r in &5RFTools&r is a versatile display device used to show information from your network, such as energy levels, item counts, or even custom text."
		""
		"To use the &bScreen&r:"
		"1. &n&bRight-click&r the screen to open its &6GUI&r."
		"2. Insert &dmodules&r (e.g., &aEnergy Module&r, &bText Module&r) into the screen to display different types of information."
		"3. Configure each module in the &6GUI&r to show the desired information from your network."
		"4. The screen will now display the configured data, providing a real-time overview of your network's status."
	]
	quest.2507593830977B88.quest_desc: ["Transfer your xp to the tank by standing on it."]
	quest.250D1E2BFE6E0D50.quest_desc: ["A&e better version&r of the &bsteam boiler,&r however it is &lfive blocks tall. &r"]
	quest.253657BE5D9D9162.quest_desc: ["This type of cable interface is probably the most important item one can make in their Refined Storage journey. \\n \\n This type of cable interface connects an external storage to your Refined Storage Network. It basically lets RS look into the storage container to let you access it within your grid! \\n \\n This works on many things, including but not limited to: Chests, Barrels, Drawers, Drawer Controllers, and more! \\n \\n If you can't make drives and have a bunch of chests everywhere, this is your best bet in creating a storage Network!"]
	quest.253657BE5D9D9162.title: "External Storage"
	quest.253B13051E4540FB.quest_desc: ["You are making progress, &agood,&r but you must &6improve.&r"]
	quest.2580602D7B567F11.quest_desc: ["A reinforced handle crafted for advanced tools, offering improved grip, durability, and performance. Essential for creating high-quality mechanical instruments and machinery parts."]
	quest.2598273041353196.quest_desc: [
		"When building the &6Reprocessor&r, you will need &o&bat least&r one &aCollector&r and &3Waste Injector&r."
		""
		"The &aReprocessor Collector&r must be placed &o&bin the center of the bottom face&r of the structure."
		""
		"The &cWaste Injector&r must go &o&bin the center of the top face&r, which is where you'll &npipe in&r or &ninsert waste&r like &dCyanite Ingots&r."
	]
	quest.2598273041353196.title: "Importing Waste"
	quest.25BF6CC5C779BB4C.quest_subtitle: "Lunar or later, we all laugh."
	quest.25BF6CC5C779BB4C.title: "Visit the Moon"
	quest.25C93EDEDDF8CBE4.quest_desc: [
		"The &2Toggle Bus&r. "
		""
		"A bus which functions similarly to &9Fluix ME Glass Cable&r or other &eCables&r, but it &nallows&r its connection state to be toggled via &credstone&r."
		""
		"This allows you to &ncut off&r a section of a &dME Network&r."
	]
	quest.25D4406CB86C8CBB.quest_desc: [
		"The &2Fluidizer&r is a &o&bcustomizable multiblock&r that has a &nminimum&r size of &o&b3x3x3&r."
		""
		"You can transport the &bfluids&r with pipes from &cMekanism&r"
	]
	quest.25D4406CB86C8CBB.title: "The Fluidizer"
	quest.25DF45F80400A12F.quest_subtitle: "Allows you to extract any amount of any item from it!"
	quest.25E319AF3615E44D.quest_desc: [
		"Orcus Info:"
		"&aGravity:&r 0.196 m/s"
		"&bOxygen:&r none"
		"&cTemperature:&r -240 °C"
	]
	quest.25E585C8AE7430DC.quest_desc: ["You can change the ingots from one mod to another when you find a bad input."]
	quest.260118836093B260.quest_desc: ["Dropped form a&c horrid rat&r, you will use these to craft a &bnew arrow&r and a &6haste potion&r!"]
	quest.2601B9836D1049DB.quest_desc: ["More storage."]
	quest.260F19B468957BCD.quest_desc: [
		"Have you seen the random floating island in the sky? Not the slime one, but the tiny one?"
		""
		"These have the Nipa plant on them. You can break these and relocate them."
		""
		"They produce Arcane Crystal Dust Specks over time, which can be used to create Arcane Crystal Dust."
	]
	quest.260F19B468957BCD.title: "Nipa Plants"
	quest.261ABBDC3DABD8B3.quest_desc: ["A clutch that is only coupled if the input spins in the correct direction as configured."]
	quest.263220DCCDB90E29.quest_desc: [
		"So far, to double your ingot output, your setup should look something like this:"
		""
		"Raw ores go into the Purification Chamber, which receives Oxygen from an Electrolytic Separator."
		"The processed material is then sent to the Crusher, which turns the ore clumps into Dirty Dust."
		"Next, the Dirty Dust is fed into an Enrichment Chamber, refining it into regular Ore Dust."
		"Finally, the Ore Dust is sent into a Smelter, producing your ingots."
		""
		"This system completes the Tier 2 ore processing chain, giving you twice the output from every ore."
	]
	quest.263220DCCDB90E29.title: "Ore Factory: Tier 2"
	quest.263CB49ECB027811.quest_desc: ["Same thing as mystyian apiary but instead a 5x5 multiblock and does not require every single input/output block from the mod."]
	quest.263CB49ECB027811.quest_subtitle: "Check the mod book guide."
	quest.264031CD6078FBBE.quest_desc: ["One bite of this strange confection and the Candy Cavity will welcome you. It’s not a trap. Probably."]
	quest.264E6FD715F41414.quest_desc: ["A standard power unit that converts fuel or pressure into rotational energy. Reliable and versatile, it’s suitable for powering a wide range of mechanical systems and factory machines."]
	quest.26509373BF382E95.quest_desc: ["&eStores power&r which can be &atransported with conduits.&r"]
	quest.26A58E2711BC7B28.quest_desc: [
		"The Spatial IO Port is used in spatial IO to hold the spatial cell and control the spatial IO operation."
		""
		"The cell can be inserted and extracted by any item logistics like hoppers or ae2 busses, if you want to automate it."
	]
	quest.26BABA2D55F284FB.quest_desc: [
		"Industrial-grade item transport for heavy automation."
		""
		"These input and output hatches move huge batches of items directly between machines and network storage, bypassing the speed limits of standard pipes and hoppers."
	]
	quest.26BABA2D55F284FB.quest_subtitle: "Unthrottled Item Logistics"
	quest.26BABA2D55F284FB.title: "Massive ME Hatches"
	quest.26C75F1FF8C42228.title: "Find the stronghold"
	quest.26D97FEDA88228AC.quest_desc: ["The &dAE Infinity Booster&r add-on provides bespoke wireless boosters that grant &dinfinite connectivity range&r, with optional &across-dimensional support&r."]
	quest.26FD82026FBAE2D9.quest_desc: ["Provides the wearer a random positive effect."]
	quest.270E0BC2E8565FFE.quest_desc: [
		"Pulls items from the inventory it is pointed at and places them into the &dME Network's&r Networked Storage."
		""
		"You can &nspecify&r which items it will pull out via the &bUI&r, else it tries to pull out any item in the adjacent inventory."
		""
		"The &aME Import Bus&r will attempt to import any possible options, even if &o1&r or more of the &nconfigured&r items cannot be stored."
		""
		"The &aME Import Bus&r requires a &eChannel&r to function."
		""
		"This is the functional opposite of the &6ME Export Bus&r."
	]
	quest.271721E1A9779959.quest_desc: ["Place this next to your &crocket&r and fill this machine with a &efuel&r &ebucket&r to also fill your &crocket.&r"]
	quest.273B2D8529BAFC0C.title: "Defeat the Ender Golem"
	quest.274355D740D7D4AF.quest_desc: ["Each &credstone filter&r has unique effects for creating &6complex circuits&r, these &bfilters&r are used to save you room from building out &ecircuits&r to do the &atasks&r you want, you can just put the &efilter&r for the &deffect&r you want."]
	quest.274355D740D7D4AF.title: "&cRedstone Filters"
	quest.2745297337E13E9E.quest_desc: ["An upgraded version of the Air Compressor. More efficient, faster, and capable of higher pressures."]
	quest.275F53FE2A231771.quest_desc: ["More storage."]
	quest.276379D643EFC5AD.quest_desc: ["A &dCollapse QIO Drive&r can contain &o&b512,000,000,000&r &nitems&r and &o&b131,072&r &nitem types&r."]
	quest.276C2B065F519379.quest_desc: [
		"You might encounter a &4common issue&r with the &cMMR&r where, upon completing the &6multiblock&r, it indicates that some casings or other blocks are &2missing&r; however, if the controller displays \"&6no matching recipe found&r,\" the &amultiblock&r has been successfully assembled and is &bready for use&r you can simply ignore the message. "
		""
		"&cIf you attempt to assemble it anyway, the blocks in your inventory will disappear.&r"
	]
	quest.2774D37126FE6785.quest_desc: [
		"The piston's and the Conveyor Belts' direction matters. The piston should face downwards. The Conveyor Belts should both travel down the length or up the machine."
		""
		"After the blocks are in place, use an Engineer's Hammer on the piston whichever side the control panel should be on to complete the multiblock."
		""
		"The Metal Press requires a Mold in order to function. Right clicking a Metal Press with a Mold will attach the Mold to the Metal Press. The mold can be detached by shift right clicking with an Engineer's Hammer."
	]
	quest.2774D37126FE6785.quest_subtitle: "The Metal Press is a 3x1x3 multi-block"
	quest.2774D37126FE6785.title: "Metal Press"
	quest.27A11A6ED27A72D2.quest_desc: [
		"Transformers can raise or lower voltage based on the ratio of turns on their electromagnetic coils. For example, an input coil with 100 turns and an output coil with 400 turns gives a turn ratio of 4, boosting the voltage by 4×."
		""
		"Coils are added by right-clicking them onto the transformer. The input coil is always placed first, followed by the output coil."
		""
		"Currently, there’s no clear way to distinguish input from output aside from the noise texture on top. Transformers are not bidirectional. The top part of the \"handle\" with the checkerboard pattern marks the input side, which will be on the left when the block is placed."
	]
	quest.27A396E8628B269E.quest_desc: ["When inside your &aquarry&r it will generate&c Nether items.&r"]
	quest.27B28A53F0EFE604.title: "Enter &dThe Nether&r"
	quest.27BE23C8489886AF.quest_desc: [
		"This checkmark is to help if you don't want to have to do the progress of seashelf and hellshef together, so you can follow just one of them."
		""
		"Maybe I should have warned you beforehand."
	]
	quest.27C34EDA36455548.quest_desc: [
		"Made at an &denchanting apparatus&r with &ediamond armour&r and &dmagebloom fiber&r, can be imbued with &bthread&r, the higher tier armour the higher tier and more quantity of &bthreads&r you can add, you can increase the tier of your armour in the &denchanting apparatus&r."
		""
		"To apply the &bthread&r, place the armour piece you want to upgrade in an &eAlteration table&r then &lRight-Click&r with the &bthread&r you want to add, &lRight_Click&r the &bthread&r while your armour is in the table to remove that thread."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Cool hat"
	]
	quest.27F1BFDA949F8005.quest_desc: ["Found throughout these &6caves&r are &core&r, you will use this &aradioactive rock&r for &ecrafting&r."]
	quest.280288D5E3221C1B.quest_desc: ["Moves energy."]
	quest.280288D5E3221C1B.title: "Energy Conduit"
	quest.281C68F6B89A7168.quest_desc: ["&5An item that when placed on the ground is used to attract the Gum Worm to it&f."]
	quest.282994DE03384B38.quest_desc: ["The &dbest&r of the &dbest,&r &6no one can match you&r."]
	quest.282994DE03384B38.quest_subtitle: "A shovel that doesn't dig it devours."
	quest.28597C28BC8F0FE7.quest_desc: [
		"It grows as any other plant, but its roots reach through the veil, soaking in more of the mana that infuses the earth. Growing these will serve two purposes to a budding practitioner."
		""
		"Crafted at a &dEnchanting apparatus&r, source gems in the corners, and a seed in the middle."
	]
	quest.28597C28BC8F0FE7.quest_subtitle: "The Magebloom sits at the border between the mundane and the magical"
	quest.285D8B9EA835DD43.quest_desc: ["Increases mana regen."]
	quest.286B5D17664C4760.quest_subtitle: "\"Since when do we have gregtech in the pack?\""
	quest.2874646A910EA889.quest_desc: ["&rThe Torchmaster mod adds special light sources like the Mega Torch that prevent hostile mobs from spawning within a certain radius."]
	quest.2874646A910EA889.title: "Torchmaster"
	quest.2894F11A73335179.quest_desc: [
		"Smelting down Arcane Crystals will give you Arcane Crystal Dust."
		""
		"This is used for most of the items in the mod."
	]
	quest.28B8783DFF26A854.quest_desc: ["Crafted with &biron&r and &9azure neodymium&r, this is the base for some &6crafting recipes&r."]
	quest.28B88FFE1B735E3E.quest_desc: ["A vital mechanical component used in the operation of a pumpjack. It converts rotational force into vertical motion, enabling the extraction of fluids like oil from underground reservoirs."]
	quest.28DCEC2D45A88C6A.quest_desc: ["Again, just armor stronger then &6ATM&r and &bvanilla,&r this time for &bmages&r providing &dmore mana&r."]
	quest.28F1702618BF23DD.quest_desc: [
		"One does not simply walk into Mordor... and one does not simply command the dragon. To ensure your reptilian friend obeys you right click it with this staff."
		""
		"On the second thought, they could have used eagles to fly into mordor."
	]
	quest.29099185E69DAFCD.quest_desc: [
		"A specialized memory unit that &btemporarily holds items&r during &eautocrafting processes&r. Comes in tiered capacities (1k to 256M) to handle complex recipes."
		""
		"Key Functions:"
		""
		"Buffers &6ingredients&r and &dintermediate products&r"
		""
		"Links to &9Crafting CPUs&r for multi-step crafts"
		""
		"Prevents &cnetwork clogging&r during large jobs"
		""
		"(The &a\"scratchpad\"&r for your ME Network's crafting calculations!)"
		""
		"&e\"Where unfinished crafts wait patiently\"&r"
	]
	quest.29099185E69DAFCD.title: "&5Crafting Storage&r"
	quest.29164630E1BD76B5.quest_desc: ["This is the main resource in the mod. Go out and mine some!"]
	quest.29164630E1BD76B5.title: "Arcane Crystals"
	quest.292C729230F5259E.quest_desc: [
		"An upgrade component that &bboosts processing speed&r for &5ME Machines&r when installed in compatible devices. Each card provides a &e+25% speed increase&r (stackable up to 4 cards)."
		""
		"Compatible Machines:"
		""
		"&bMolecular Assemblers&r"
		""
		"&6Inscribers&r"
		""
		"&dPattern Providers&r"
		""
		"Trade-off:"
		""
		"Increases &cpower consumption&r proportionally"
		""
		"(The &9overclocking chip&r for AE2 automation systems.)"
		""
		"&e\"More speed, more power, more efficiency\"&r"
	]
	quest.292C729230F5259E.title: "&5Acceleration Card&r"
	quest.2951D84F8F0F389A.quest_desc: ["An electronic screen made up of individual light segments used to show numbers or simple symbols. Perfect for building clocks, counters, or digital readouts in advanced machinery and control panels."]
	quest.295618B74C1FED6C.quest_desc: [
		"The &bQuartz Cutting Knife&r is a crafting tool available in both &6Nether Quartz&r and &6Certus Quartz&r variants. It's useful for various tasks, including crafting &bCable Anchors&r."
		""
		"&bCable Anchors&r, crafted with the knife, can separate cables without dyeing. They can also be used to make &bCable Facades&r, which disguise cables within walls by covering them with the face of any block. While facade recipes are hidden in JEI, they can be crafted by placing any block surrounded by 4 &bCable Anchors&r in the crafting grid."
		""
		"Additionally, the knife can craft &bInscriber Name Presses&r by right-clicking to open a GUI. These presses can rename items in an &bInscriber&r, with two presses combining their names in sequence."
	]
	quest.2956AF6FF3F119B2.quest_desc: [
		"These blocks expand the crafting storage of the quantum core. They effectively increase the amount of concurrent tasks"
		"the quantum computer is able to run. There are two variations, with &4128M&r and &2256M&r of capacity."
	]
	quest.2976203B1081D414.quest_desc: ["Massive 250 Trillion byte storage block designed for endgame mega-factories."]
	quest.2976203B1081D414.quest_subtitle: "250,000,000,000,000 Byte Storage Cell"
	quest.2976203B1081D414.title: "250T Mega Crafting Storage"
	quest.2978E3692E772978.quest_desc: ["After using an &6ATM portal&r in the &cnether,&r you will be transported to this &drealm.&r"]
	quest.2979C84CDED4119B.quest_desc: ["More storage."]
	quest.29C7DC6D524A125E.quest_desc: ["Boosts &cfire spell&r damage anywhere and &cignites&r enemies on touch. Gives speed while you are in &6hot&r biomes."]
	quest.29D05998ADC8ACF5.quest_desc: ["A more &bexpensive item&r used in &6crafting.&r"]
	quest.29EE878BC8D3A742.quest_desc: [
		"Productive Bees adds additional bees and advanced beehives allowing you to put your bees to work creating resources in a fully automated setup. Productive bees are just as derpy as their vanilla cousins, but makes up for it in usefulness and beeuty."
		""
		"This mod adds bees for most vanilla resources as well as all your favorite modded resources like copper, lead, silver etc. There are also a lot of bees for mod specific resources like Mystical Agriculture essence, Silents Gems, Powah, Tinkers Construct, Thermal and many more. In total you can find more than 200 bees if the relevant mods are installed."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"Also there are up to 32 variants of a new advanced beehives for the bees to live in, most of which are made from wood added by other mods."
		""
		"It is recommended to use JEI for looking up breeding recipes and Patchouli for ingame documentation."
	]
	quest.29EE878BC8D3A742.title: "Bee cages"
	quest.2A0A01BE836BB2AB.quest_desc: ["A monument of grandeur and mystery, the Shiraz Palace sprawls in every direction, its halls twisting and turning beyond comprehension. Its purpose remains unknown, but its size and opulence are undeniable. Travelers beware: without a companion, it’s all too easy to lose your way in this labyrinthine estate."]
	quest.2A0A01BE836BB2AB.quest_subtitle: "Find the Shiraz Palace"
	quest.2A1B0386B7987DD3.quest_desc: ["Vast and dreamlike, the Aviary stretches high into wtilight sky, its halls divided into four whimsical quadrants. Each one unfolds as a surreal scene—bright, strange, and perilous in its own way. To wander here feels like stepping beyond reality itself. Is this the journey’s end… or just another beginning?"]
	quest.2A1B0386B7987DD3.quest_subtitle: "Find an Aviary"
	quest.2A20000FAEC2E16A.quest_desc: ["The &dSolid access port&r allows for fuel to be &cinputed&r and waste &aoutputed&r from the reactor, while the &eEnergy tap&r stores and outputs the &creactors&r energy."]
	quest.2A20000FAEC2E16A.title: "Reactor Interacting Components"
	quest.2A2CE255693B7495.quest_desc: ["The Engine Base will prompt you to right-click each required part onto it. Once all components are added, the engine will request as many pistons as needed to complete the configuration you selected."]
	quest.2A2D5DC9B5474841.quest_desc: [
		"What’s left after killing a &0Brainiac&f."
		""
		"Not to be confused with DC Comics' &0Brainiac&r."
	]
	quest.2A2E1C7C34C9A4AA.quest_subtitle: "Destroys almost any block"
	quest.2A404708E175235F.quest_desc: [
		"Fluids can be stored and extracted from fluid tanks via Fluid Pipe. The fluid pipes can be placed on any face of the fluid tank: top, bottom, or sides. The window of a tank can be toggled with a Wrench."
		""
		"The direction of flow in the fluid pipe indicates whether fluids will be put into the tank or extracted from the tank; if fluid is flowing towards the tank, the fluid will be stored in the tank. Likewise, if a fluid pipe is flowing away from the tank (via Mechanical Pump), then fluid from the tank will be extracted into that pipe."
	]
	quest.2A5004EB99AE4F96.quest_desc: [
		"There are more Otherworld items you will need to gather, and eating &cDemon's Dream Fruit&r every time you need the &7Third Eye&r effect gets annoying."
		""
		"This is what the &dOtherworld Goggles&r are for! When equipped (even in your Curios slot), it gives the Third Eye effect!"
	]
	quest.2A5004EB99AE4F96.title: "Quit Eating That Fruit!"
	quest.2A55024C0BA2F4EA.quest_desc: ["A &cHyper-Dens QIO Drive&r can contain &o&b128,000&r &nitems&r and &o&b256&r &nitem types&r."]
	quest.2A6ECCE28B9C64FB.quest_desc: ["An aerial brass companion that follows the player if they hava a controller."]
	quest.2A71A8C85EC08868.quest_desc: ["&6Links&r from&d project Expansion&r are used to&a transport items&r, &bliquids&r, and &eEMC&r. Place one &6link&r and &ainput items&r through &ehoppers&r or &bpipes&r, &9liquids&r through clicking on the &6link&r with a &abucket&r of the &bfluid&r you want to transport to make a &efilter&r, then using &bpipes&r to insert the rest of the &bfluid,&r Then place another &6link&r &esomewhere else&r and extract the &atransported items&r with &bpipes&r set to extract or with &ehoppers&r, &eEMC&r will be turned into &aitems&r when transported, you need to choose what to transport by &lRight-Clicking&r with the item and &lShift-Right-Clicking&r to remove it if you need to &aswitch&r it for something else."]
	quest.2A71A8C85EC08868.quest_subtitle: "Did you read that?"
	quest.2A71A8C85EC08868.title: "EMC Link"
	quest.2A7E3F2CD335EAD0.quest_desc: ["&dMystical agriculture&r adds new &aagumentable&r &aarmor!&r Crafted with &dgems&r from this &ctier,&r and &aarmor&r from the &cprevious tier&r (in this case &bdiamond armor&r) you can craft &epowerful sets&r!"]
	quest.2A8FA05582ACC3FE.quest_desc: [
		"Have you ever wondered what would it be like to wear you AE System?"
		""
		"Well, you don't have to wonder anymore. The &4quantum armor&r set is a highly technological stealthy apparel that connects to the AE2 system to provide convenient access to everything on the go! By default, it's an energy powered suit with defenses comparable to Netherite gear."
		"It is capable of using its buffer to create an energy shield, providing a healthy amount of damage absorption. "
		""
		"The boots also provide all damage negation while the chestplate can eliminate flying mining penalties. However, the true power of this suit is"
		"only unlocked when you fill it with upgrades!"
		""
		""
		"To install &5upgrades,&r you need to have the pieces equipped and then open the Quantum Armor Configuration Menu, by"
		"pressing the hotkey, (N by default)."
		""
		"In this screen you will be able to add/remove upgrades as well as toggle them on/off and configure settings for the"
		"upgrades that have them."
	]
	quest.2A8FA05582ACC3FE.title: "Quantum Armor"
	quest.2A9FAF18AD150A7C.quest_desc: ["Filters &bitems&r."]
	quest.2AC48A0D4CA24084.quest_desc: ["Combine &6Lightning Rods&r, &8Lodestones&r and &1Neutron Star Fragment&r to get &2Pulsar Fragment Ingot&r."]
	quest.2ADDA74C73C08DB2.quest_desc: ["A gearbox where the rotation direction of all 4 sides are independently configurable."]
	quest.2AEBE3F28996A6ED.quest_subtitle: "Faster furnaces!"
	quest.2AF31F1769085641.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Reprocessor&r is a &o&b3x3x7&r multiblock structure that has &o&bspecific rules&r to complete the construction of the multiblock."
		""
		"The heart of this multiblock is the &dController&r, and can be placed in &o&bany vertical face&r as long as it is not an &bedge/frame&r."
	]
	quest.2AF85A5EE9A8CCBA.quest_desc: ["A clutch that is only coupled if the input RPM is faster than a configurable threshold."]
	quest.2AFDEEA844B0DC0B.quest_desc: ["A block that enables wireless ME network access for devices like Wireless Terminals or ME Chests. Requires power and boosts signal strength for extended range."]
	quest.2B01B964638DFBD1.quest_desc: ["The Crusher’s Hut is where the Crusher will take items and crush them into other blocks. Most notably cobblestone = gravel, gravel = sand, sand = clay. One important factor to know is that the crusher has a daily limit based on the hut level. Level 1 has a daily max of 16, level 2 has 64. At level 5 it’s daily max is 999. "]
	quest.2B01B964638DFBD1.quest_subtitle: "Build a Crusher's Hut"
	quest.2B115519A21F9CB7.quest_desc: [
		"The Ender Guardian, being the final boss of the Ruined Citadel,"
		""
		"is much more powerful than its Ender Golem cousin,"
		""
		"boasting higher stats and more attack patterns."
		""
		"Its powerful attacks harness the Void's energy to attract and move nearby entities."
		""
		"This boss also has certain weaknesses: when it reaches half health, its helmet breaks, also halving its defense."
		""
		"Who knows what kind of vile and horrible creature lies behind its helmet..."
	]
	quest.2B1717F5D6E20B79.quest_desc: ["Gathered form &dsingularities,&r use this to &bcraft items&r and&9 power the replicator.&r"]
	quest.2B27E4E04A628C60.quest_desc: ["The &9Speed Upgrade&r does exactly what it says it does. It will increase the speed at which the interface/block works. Need an importer to pull faster? Want your crafters to work faster? This is the upgrade! \\\\n \\\\n The &6Stack Upgrade&r increases the speed of transfer by a stack of items rather than just one. Combine with Speed Upgrades!"]
	quest.2B27E4E04A628C60.title: "Speeding Everything Up!"
	quest.2B29DDBADF11195E.quest_subtitle: "Charges your gadgets"
	quest.2B3A70E34CB0CE21.quest_desc: ["Automatically refills gadgets and armor that use fuel."]
	quest.2B3F2F470E06BC40.quest_desc: [
		"The &6SPS&r will be &o&b7x7&r when built, but it isn't a cube. It follows a simple pattern, which you can follow the images below as a build guide."
		""
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Each side, including the bottom and top, will follow this pattern. The &dSupercharged Coils&r should be placed across from each other in &o&bthe center&r of their respective sides, and the remaining two ports will be used to pump in &5Polonium&r, and pump out &3Antimatter Gas&r."
	]
	quest.2B3F2F470E06BC40.title: "&dCompleted SPS"
	quest.2B4BFD88DF1A934D.quest_desc: ["Obtained form the &lEBF,&r you will use this in &6crafting.&r"]
	quest.2B56AEA32C0C43FD.quest_desc: ["The &dbest&r of the &dbest,&r &6no one can match you&r. The power to destroy all."]
	quest.2B56AEA32C0C43FD.quest_subtitle: "Mines everything. Breaks everything. Probably too much."
	quest.2B6E2CD796D4ADF3.quest_desc: ["A heavy metal ingot used in crafting industrial components and machinery parts. Its density and conductivity make it valuable for advanced mechanical and electrical creations."]
	quest.2B70445E6CD99EDB.quest_desc: [
		"Strange structures have begun rising from the land. Mysterious dungeons, fortresses, and towers that pierce the skies. No one knows where they came from, only that they’re teeming with hostile creatures, forgotten treasures, and powerful secrets."
		""
		"Your task is to venture forth and uncover the mysteries of these ancient places. Each dungeon holds new dangers, but also the keys to survival: weapons, artifacts, and knowledge that will aid you in the trials ahead."
		""
		"Prepare yourself adventurer. &6Exploration&r and courage are the only ways to thrive in this world where the land itself rises against you."
	]
	quest.2B76B2F18C2C47D2.quest_desc: [
		"When the &cFission Reactor&r burns fuel, it generates intense heat. To prevent a &dmeltdown&r (and possible explosion), it must be properly &bcooled&r."
		""
		"The simplest cooling method is using Water from a &3Sink&r, an infinite water source. Pump this water into a &aReactor Port&r set to &binput&r. The &cReactor&r heats the water into &bSteam&r, which can then power an &eIndustrial Turbine&r."
		""
		"For better efficiency, &6Sodium&r can also be used as a coolant, allowing &chigher burn rates&r and keeping core temperatures lower."
	]
	quest.2B76B2F18C2C47D2.title: "Cooling a Fission Reactor"
	quest.2B8E1CBA2BB77B86.quest_desc: ["More storage."]
	quest.2B94BD0F7A5D46C3.quest_desc: [
		"Hostile Neural Industrialization closes off one of Modern Industrialization's blind spots: mob farming. "
		""
		"By harnessing Hostile Neural Networks's mechanics, you'll be able to fully automate mob loot with ease. The Neural Network must grow. "
	]
	quest.2BB30AED452773EB.quest_desc: ["A portable device that lets you access your entire storage network remotely. It combines multiple functions into one interface, allowing seamless item management, crafting, and monitoring from anywhere within range."]
	quest.2BC64E1EB1BCE14D.quest_desc: ["A new drill made of &bstainless steel&r to gather &anew ores&r and shall oil when placed in the &cquarry&r or &eoil drill.&r"]
	quest.2C09CD9B5A1E51B3.quest_desc: [
		"Mekanism Digital Miner: This is the game changing machine. You place it in the world, power it, and it can mine an area of up to 128x128 blocks, searching for exactly the ore you choose."
		""
		"Want just diamonds and osmium? It only takes those and ignores the rest. It's your primary source of minerals from now on."
	]
	quest.2C09CD9B5A1E51B3.quest_subtitle: "No more manual mining. Let's let the machines do the work."
	quest.2C0A45666CCB62BE.quest_desc: [
		"An upgrade that adds &credstone control&r to compatible &5ME Devices&r, enabling activation/deactivation based on signals."
		""
		"Compatible Devices:"
		""
		"&bImport/Export Buses&r (toggle item transfer)"
		""
		"&6Molecular Assemblers&r (disable crafting)"
		""
		"&dLevel Emitters&r (chain conditions)"
		""
		"Modes:"
		""
		"&aActive on High&r"
		""
		"&1Active on Low&r"
		""
		"&eIgnore Redstone&r (default)"
		""
		"*(The &9\"on/off switch\"&r for smart ME systems!)*"
		""
		"&b\"Logic meets logistics\"&r"
	]
	quest.2C0A45666CCB62BE.title: "&4Redstone Card&r"
	quest.2C0E51F90A72C16C.quest_desc: ["Dropped from the &eGloomoths&r of these caves, you will use this to &ccraft three items&r."]
	quest.2C1AB8A598E5BFB3.quest_desc: ["&bStore&r &dinfinite&r &epower&r."]
	quest.2C284001988DF201.quest_desc: ["&eA lot more storage.&r"]
	quest.2C4CA092A557205E.quest_desc: ["A &6chestplate&r that allows the use of &dflight&r when you press a &bkeybind.&r"]
	quest.2C53C8A3322CAB88.quest_desc: ["Forged from &aeverything.&r Infused with &einfinity.&r This is the &6metal of gods&r."]
	quest.2C603F39F80D3267.quest_desc: ["Used to &edetonate explosives&r from a &bdistance&r, simply &lRight-Click&r &ctnt&r or a &dnuke&r, then &lRight-Click&r the air to &cdetonate it&r."]
	quest.2C6A8E61F9FEEFD8.quest_desc: [
		"Regarding the Naquadah Reactor, it is very similar to a fusion reactor."
		""
		"The reactor uses enriched naquadah fuel, enriched uranium fuel, and naquadah-uranium fuel as reactants."
		""
		"If water cannot be injected, you may need to adjust the flow rate to 6 or higher."
	]
	quest.2C9C9CB71941DC01.quest_desc: ["A new &cti&r&cer&r of &aessence!&r Used to craft many &eitems&r."]
	quest.2CA78C74FC24502D.quest_desc: ["A &anew alloy&r with many uses, smelted with the &6alloy smelter&r."]
	quest.2CA7B7158BE3A3D4.quest_desc: ["The &dbest&r of the &dbest,&r &6no one can match you&r. Everything will die at your touch."]
	quest.2CA7B7158BE3A3D4.quest_subtitle: "One hit. That’s all it takes. No exceptions."
	quest.2CC1D393E3A7EFFC.quest_desc: [
		"&lShift&r + &lRight Click&r on the &4Netherrack&r with &dDivination Rod&r in hand to to attune it to &3Iesnium Ore&r."
		""
		"To use it just hold the &lRight Mouse Button&r. The &3Iesnium Ore&r will be highlighted with white frame. Make sure to have &cThird Eye&r effect in order to mine it."
		"{image:ftb:textures/quests/divination_rod.png width:192 height:108 align:center}"
	]
	quest.2CC1D393E3A7EFFC.quest_subtitle: "Nether"
	quest.2CC1D393E3A7EFFC.title: "Iesnium"
	quest.2CC2D2C475F8E758.quest_desc: ["Capable of creating some of the most &5powerful&r items using &dantimatter&r"]
	quest.2CC56A4F06E53307.quest_desc: ["Exposes Empty PCBs using UV light. This process is required before the etching stage. Make sure it's powered and properly configured."]
	quest.2CCAA7C0FEDEB573.quest_subtitle: "Your best early game friend."
	quest.2CCDBD3E57F1BD87.quest_desc: [
		"Fills &nenclosed areas&r with &bbreathable air&r. Vital for making &6space stations&r and planetary bases livable."
		""
		"Requires &apower&r and &bwater&r pumped in from the &nbottom&r."
	]
	quest.2CCDBD3E57F1BD87.title: "Oxygen in your base"
	quest.2CD6597AE3312F20.quest_desc: ["Will form nearly instantly in the naphtha vat, so you can think of liquid plastic being a direct result of naphtha."]
	quest.2CD70FCC8B119D7A.quest_desc: ["The Brown arrow symbols on the pump indicate the direction of flow. The flow direction can be changed by using a Wrench. When a wrench is used, the entire valve will appear to have rotated 180 degrees. The brown directional arrows will appear on the other side of the pump's gear."]
	quest.2CD754C4B15B480F.quest_desc: ["The &aProjectile Accuracy Module&r improves your accuracy with the bow."]
	quest.2CDB914E84D00B66.quest_desc: ["Moves fluids."]
	quest.2CDB914E84D00B66.title: "Fluid Conduit"
	quest.2CE2A196359A53AA.quest_desc: ["Has 4 slots for Constructing."]
	quest.2CE3008EE0CDFD64.quest_desc: [
		"The &bCharged Staff&r is a simple powered staff that deals &c3 hearts&r of damage and consumes &d300AE&r per hit. It uses pre-1.9 combat mechanics, allowing you to &aspam-click&r like in the good old days."
		""
		"The &bEntropy Manipulator&r, when &oused&r on certain blocks in the world, will &asmelt them in-place&r, such as &dsand to glass&r and &dmetal ores to metal ingots&r. If used on other blocks, it will simply &alight a fire&r on the block."
		""
		"The &bMatter Cannon&r functions similarly to the &bColor Applicator&r as a dedicated cell for holding \"ammo\" items such as &dMatter Balls&r and &diron/gold nuggets&r. These can then be fired to deal &adamage to mobs&r or &abreak blocks&r. Heavier \"ammo\", like &dmetal nuggets&r, will deal more damage and destroy harder blocks."
		""
		"&dMatter Balls&r in a &bMatter Cannon&r can be substituted with &bPaint Balls&r, which will apply a paint splatter effect on the face of the block being fired at. &bLumen Paint Balls&r are a variant of paint balls exclusively used by the &bMatter Cannon&r, whose paint splatters also give off light once present in the world."
	]
	quest.2CE3008EE0CDFD64.title: "Weapons!"
	quest.2CFEE04BA574921E.quest_desc: ["This interface will place the designated block in the direction it is pointed. \\n \\nYou can designate the block within the GUI. This is useful for automation!"]
	quest.2CFEE04BA574921E.quest_subtitle: "Placing Blocks!"
	quest.2CFEE04BA574921E.title: "Constructor"
	quest.2D4170B5AD28DCBF.quest_desc: ["A better &6diesel generator.&r"]
	quest.2D592669F4D41793.quest_desc: ["Just like the &2Reactor&r, the frame must be built out of &eCasings&r, but the walls can be &3Turbine Glass&r instead!"]
	quest.2D592669F4D41793.title: "Turbine Construction Parts"
	quest.2D665540B859B8BE.title: "Alloy Ingots"
	quest.2D7605FB3D8E1F85.quest_desc: [
		"&4Don't build it next to other blocks, the structure checks in a square around so it will count blocks right next to it too&r"
		""
		"[ \"Tip build it in \", { \"text\": \"The Other\", \"underlined\": true, \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"2978E3692E772978\" } }, \" dim\" ]"
		""
		"Due to how (&6MMR&r) works, for both of the &4Catalyst Forge&r and &#9510A7Darkness Forge&r multiblocks on top of the &dantimatter block&r you must place 2 stacked 3x3 &#FF6209Energy Core Stabilizers&r to form a ring just like so:"
		""
		""
		"{image:ftb:textures/quests/corestab.png width:250 height:100 align:center}"
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"{image:ftb:textures/quests/corestab2.png width:300 height:150 align:center}"
	]
	quest.2D7605FB3D8E1F85.quest_subtitle: "Important Notice!"
	quest.2D94489E09F8DD9C.quest_desc: [
		"The steel mechanism is used in many machines."
		""
		"Like the precision mechanism, it requires a heavy plate to have various items deployed onto it:"
		""
		"Steel cogwheel"
		"Nickel plate"
		"Large steel cogwheel"
		"Lead plate"
		"Screws"
		"Screwdriver"
		""
		"Doing this twice with a 94% chance of getting a steel mechanism."
	]
	quest.2D950D37BA27DF62.quest_desc: [
		"To create a multiblock quantum computer, some rules must be followed:"
		""
		"- The maximum size is &17x7x7&r (external dimensions);"
		"- &cNo empty spaces&r can be present inside the multiblock. They can be filled with Quantum Unit for no additional benefits;"
		"- Exactly &2one Quantum Core&r;"
		"- At most &6one Data Entangler&r;"
		"- At most &aone Quantum Multi Threader&r;"
		"- All blocks on the &boutside layer must be Quantum Structure&r;"
		"- No block on the inside can be Quantum Structure."
		"{image:kubejs:block/screen/advanced_ae_multiblock width:200 height:200 align:center}"
	]
	quest.2D950D37BA27DF62.title: "Advanced AE Multiblock"
	quest.2DB4F395EA26DF4B.quest_subtitle: "Find a Coliseum"
	quest.2DD3DE061E0BD676.quest_desc: ["Generates &9Neutron Ingots&r faster."]
	quest.2DEF6ABC9BCBEB82.quest_desc: [
		"Used to make many recipes that can give certain buffs to the player or for decorating a kitchen."
		""
		"Here are some examples:"
	]
	quest.2DEF812916A51C34.quest_subtitle: "Found in the nether."
	quest.2E10AFB432824AB1.quest_desc: ["A durable alloy wire made from copper and nickel, valued for its consistent electrical resistance. Commonly used in advanced circuits and precision engineering applications."]
	quest.2E20069AE6C51ADF.quest_desc: [
		"&6Cardboard Box&r is used for &o&bboxing up&r other blocks to move them, preserving the inventory while being &o&bmoved&r."
		""
		"By &eRight-Clicking&r it on any &o&bblock&r, &o&btank&r, &o&bchest&r or &o&bmachine&r, you &nwrap&r it in this protective box that you can break while still preserving everything about that &o&bblock&r, &o&btank&r, &o&bchest&r or &o&bmachine&r. This includes its &o&binventory&r, &o&borientation&r, &o&binstalled upgrades&r, and &o&bmore&r. You can later place it safely into the world. &eSneak+Right-Click&r to &nunwrap&r a box, causing the &6Cardboard Box&r to drop as an item."
		""
		"With &6Cardboard Boxes&r you can pick up &nspawners&r too."
	]
	quest.2E274BEEF2B0B8C7.quest_desc: [
		"The Chemical Oxidizer is used for making gases from materials. It is a crucial machine needed for Mekanism's 5x ore production system."
		""
		"Okay, let's start with making Sulfur Dioxide first."
		""
		"Feeding the Sulfur Dust into this machine, the Chemical Oxidizer, will create Sulfur Dioxide. "
		""
		"Now we need to create Sulfur Trioxide. Send the Sulfur Dioxide into a Chemical Infuser to combine it with Oxygen to create Sulfur Trioxide."
		""
		"Send the Trioxide to another Chemical Infuser to combine it with Water Vapor to create Sulfuric Acid."
	]
	quest.2E2811D1A0F2A492.quest_desc: ["To increase the range of your wireless connection to your system, you'll need to craft &9Range Upgrades&r. \\n \\nThe Wireless Transmitter can only hold 4 total. Here's one on the house."]
	quest.2E2811D1A0F2A492.quest_subtitle: "I mean Transmitting Range"
	quest.2E2811D1A0F2A492.title: "Increasing Wifi Range"
	quest.2E4361DA4E4F0874.quest_desc: [
		"&eFusion Crafting&r is an &eextreme endgame&r crafting recipe type used to automate recipes from a &eFusion Crafting Core&r."
		""
		"It is based on the powerful fusion system and is intended for the most complex recipes."
		""
		"&eHow It Works&r"
		""
		"• Uses the &eFusion Package Crafter&r"
		"• Supports recipes from the &eFusion Crafting Core&r"
		"• Crafted items are &eejected&r into adjacent inventories"
		""
		"The Fusion Package Crafter &crequires power&r to operate."
		""
		"&eMarked Injectors&r"
		""
		"Fusion Crafting requires &eMarked Injectors&r of sufficient tier."
		""
		"• Injectors must be placed at least &a3 blocks&r away"
		"• Injectors must face the crafter"
		"• No blocks may obstruct the connection"
		"• All injectors must be &apowered&r"
		""
		"Different recipes require different &etiers&r of injectors (Draconium, Wyvern, Draconic, Chaotic)."
		""
		"&eChecking Injector Requirements&r"
		""
		"You can &aSneak + Right-click&r with an empty hand on an &eidling&r Fusion Package Crafter to view the required number and tier of Marked Injectors."
		""
		"&eWhy Use Fusion Crafting?&r"
		""
		"• Fully automates the most powerful recipes"
		"• Removes manual Fusion Crafting"
		"• Handles injector tiers automatically"
		"• Essential for late- and endgame progression"
	]
	quest.2E4361DA4E4F0874.title: "&eFusion Crafting&r"
	quest.2E44DE5AB631D67A.quest_desc: [
		"The &aReactor Energy Injector&r is used to supply energy to the reactor."
		""
		"Features of the &aReactor Energy Injector&r:"
		"&6-&r Injects energy into the reactor to power its processes."
		"&6-&r Ensures efficient energy transfer to the reactor core."
		"&6-&r Essential for initiating and maintaining reactor operations."
	]
	quest.2E4671264448F7E9.quest_desc: ["Filters &esoul vials&r."]
	quest.2E6B809BDF02CE75.quest_desc: [
		"Cabable of harnessing more powerful &dspells&r, this book alows you to create &emore&r commbination of ideas."
		""
		"Don't forget to add custom &asounds&r and &avisuals&r to your spell!"
	]
	quest.2E8B0B59ACD1F35B.quest_desc: [
		"The &bSkudge Refiner&r processes &dSludge&r into useful &amaterials&r."
		""
		"Place it near a &dSludge source&r and provide it with &dpower&r."
		""
		"It will convert the &dSludge&r into valuable &amaterials&r like &dClay&r, &aSand&r, and &bDirt&r."
	]
	quest.2E8B8DBE61162084.quest_desc: [
		"They can be filtered to only allow certain items through, and be stopped with a redstone signal. Unlike funnels, they can insert and extract at the same time, but can only function vertically."
		""
		"When directly below an inventory, the Filter slot doubles as a Value Settings diode, much like the Brass Funnel. The Chute can be adjusted to extract up to or exactly a set amount of items. The Value Settings of a Smart Chute will be saved even when the inventory above is destroyed, though this has no effect on the Chute's behavior when not under an inventory."
	]
	quest.2E9C478E71901CFE.quest_desc: ["Just a faster minecraft i guess?"]
	quest.2E9C478E71901CFE.quest_subtitle: "\"What is the rarest...\""
	quest.2E9FC7DC2AC6FD8E.quest_desc: [
		"&8Nuclear Waste&r can be sent into an &dIsotopic Centrifuge&r to create &9Plutonium&r."
		""
		"Sending the &9Plutonium&r into a &2Pressurized Reaction Chamber&r with some &1Water&r and &7Fluorite Dust&r will give you &9Plutonium Pellets&r."
		""
		"This will also create a byproduct of &7Spent Nuclear Waste&r, which needs to be pumped into a &6Waste Barrel&r for storage."
	]
	quest.2EA3E6C82DA79317.quest_desc: [
		"Uses a Mob Egg on the top slot."
		"Fuelled by solid XP. Create Egg Mob with \"GM Chicken Feed\""
	]
	quest.2EC13B39D90021B7.quest_desc: ["Unlocks travel to &eVenus.&r Requires &dostrum&r to be built."]
	quest.2EC4BA00CE42B1DC.quest_desc: ["An automated version of the &bNASA Workbench&r. Speeds up rocket production by allowing input from &eexternal inventories&r (FE is needed)."]
	quest.2EE671E474C6CD26.quest_subtitle: "When right clicking and controller from MMR with this item you will be able to see a 3D preview of the multiblock."
	quest.2EF4DD5CC254CC80.quest_desc: [
		"Mechanical Pipe is the fluid pipe for Mekanism."
		""
		"It can be used to connect to any blocks with Fluid Handlers in them."
	]
	quest.2EF4DD5CC254CC80.title: "&aBasic Mechanical Pipe"
	quest.2EFC5DBD8122A0AE.quest_desc: ["Far below the surface lies a twisted network of chambers, where the air is thick with disease and shadow. Once a place of treatment, it now resembles a burial ground for forgotten rulers, its halls echoing with the whispers of those long lost. Only the brave (or the desperate) dare to tread these haunted corridors."]
	quest.2EFC5DBD8122A0AE.quest_subtitle: "Find a Plague Asylum"
	quest.2F0B0D4401AA455E.quest_desc: [
		"A Wrench can be used to give the tunnel windows."
		""
		"The Tunnel does not stop items on the belt from being processed by an Encased Fan, but does stop the airflow from going beyond the belt."
		""
		"Andesite Tunnels can also be used to separate single items from passing stacks to side outputs."
	]
	quest.2F0B0D4401AA455E.title: "Tunnel"
	quest.2F66F85A601AC908.quest_desc: ["&cCrushes items,&r &9cobblestone&r to &bgravel,&r or &dflowers&r to &edye,&r or &cmetal&r items to &adust&r stuff like that."]
	quest.2F6B432512FA2A65.quest_desc: ["Attach to any inventory to expand its surface area. Great for access in tight spaces and smart setups with threshold switches."]
	quest.2F6E8A0DFB555ED6.quest_desc: ["&e&oYou are what you eat and this time&r&r, you're becoming a &dstar.&r Another amazing &6food source&r, though &aexpensive.&r"]
	quest.2F74E955A2455025.quest_desc: [
		"When electrical components are connected directly without any diodes they share the voltage between them. The more devices you add, the less current each one receives. In other words, don’t overload your line unless you like watching things fizzle out."
		""
		"Diodes, on the other hand (along with potentiometers and transformers), act as circuit splitters. Anything on the output side gets the full voltage all to itself clean, isolated, and ready for action."
	]
	quest.2F8B1B5084313565.quest_desc: [
		"Immersive Engineering is a tech mod."
		""
		"It is best known for its multiblock machines, characterized by their industrial look. Both single and multiblock machines operate on three tiers of power, low voltage being 256 RF/t, medium being 1024 RF/t and high corresponding to 4096 RF/t."
		""
		"The most important tool for this mod is the Engineer's Manual, created by crafting together a book and a lever. It contains recipes and instructions for everything in the mod."
	]
	quest.2F8B1B5084313565.title: "Welcome to Immersive Engineering"
	quest.2F8F54A16D09A07F.quest_desc: [
		"Formed by assembling a printed dimensional circuit, printed silicon, and redstone."
		""
		"These high-frequency chips power advanced UFO machines, mega co-processors, and multiblock logic units."
	]
	quest.2F8F54A16D09A07F.quest_subtitle: "High-Frequency Quantum Logic"
	quest.2F8F54A16D09A07F.title: "Dimensional Processor"
	quest.2F9B52EA41B4DFF0.quest_desc: ["A conductive wire made from refined copper, used to transmit electrical energy between machines and components. Essential for building power networks and automation circuits."]
	quest.2FA6B8A1C8713DE0.quest_desc: ["Different &ctiers&r of &aseeds&r need different &ctiers&r of &aessence&r and &6farmland,&r &dmake some&r&d!&r"]
	quest.2FB2FE782B1103D6.quest_desc: ["To craft a steam &cblast furnace,&r you need to place each block in a &l3x3 4 block tall&r &ehollow rectangle.&r"]
	quest.2FC6539688E453D7.quest_desc: ["Some of the&9 best gear&r, untill &dAvaritia&r where you gain &ccontrol of the&r &0universe.&r"]
	quest.2FD77E58D9FF8877.quest_desc: [
		"The &bMechanical Dirt&r spawns &amobs&r when provided with &aLiquid Meat&r and &dpower&r."
		""
		"Place it in a suitable spawning area and connect it to a &aLiquid Meat&r source."
		""
		"It will spawn &amobs&r for farming resources."
	]
	quest.2FE8D5CAE4FEC6AF.quest_desc: [
		"A heavy neutronium sphere infused with quantum anomalies and celestial fluids."
		""
		"Used to catalyze Proto-Matter and high-energy matrix reactions without collapsing internal spacetime."
	]
	quest.2FE8D5CAE4FEC6AF.quest_subtitle: "Stabilized Containment Core"
	quest.2FE8D5CAE4FEC6AF.title: "Enriched Neutronium Sphere"
	quest.2FED203901B58547.quest_desc: [
		"The &dMeat Feeder&r automatically feeds the player with &aLiquid Meat&r."
		""
		"Fill it with &aLiquid Meat&r and keep it in your inventory."
		""
		"It will automatically consume &aLiquid Meat&r to keep you &afeeding&r."
	]
	quest.2FF641C1FD519E5D.quest_desc: [
		"A high-tier storage device that captures and stores entire spatial regions as portable dimensional pockets. These cells work with Spatial I/O Ports to save and restore custom-built areas (like rooms or machines) in your world. Larger cells (16³, 128³) require significant power and proper Spatial Pylon framing."
		""
		"(Note: Some blocks like spawners or bedrock cannot be stored. Handle with care to avoid world corruption.)"
	]
	quest.30216E581E97F05B.quest_subtitle: "Used to input energy into Multiblocks"
	quest.302553C58A76A140.quest_desc: ["[ { \"text\": \"Click Me!\", \"underlined\": true, \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"78545503CE761C3F\" } } ]"]
	quest.302D29E43E9C9A94.quest_desc: [
		"When placed adjacent to any inventory, Packagers can create Cardboard Packages from the inventory they’re attached to. The process does not require extra materials."
		""
		"When powered with a redstone signal, the packager attempts to fill the package as much as possible. A Cardboard Package has 9 slots of inventory. Placing a written sign on the Packager labels the created Cardboard Package with an address to be sent to."
	]
	quest.3030A68A0EA81C54.quest_desc: ["This is a new &ddimension&r visited through a &eAllthemodium portal&r, full of &arocks&r and &6ores&r for your &cmining necessities&r!"]
	quest.3035A949E710CCCB.quest_desc: ["This &bblueprint&r holds the shape of &0impossible&r creations. Place it in the right station... and &drewrite creation&r. Use in the&b Extreme Smithing&r for some of the&a best utility gear&r."]
	quest.3041273D3B7942CA.quest_desc: ["The &bFuzzy Card&r allows items to match filters regardless of &ametadata&r (like damage or enchantments). The &bInverter Card&r toggles bus filters from a &awhitelist&r to a &ablacklist&r."]
	quest.30478230148F08CB.quest_desc: [
		"An upgraded version of the fusion reactor"
		""
		"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism-extras/gallery"
	]
	quest.30478230148F08CB.quest_subtitle: "good luck"
	quest.305B3D42F8B290B0.quest_desc: [
		"&dAmythest golems&r can be obtained by performing a &cRitual of Awakening&r near &5budding amythest&r for the token, then craft the &dAmythest golems&r charm."
		""
		"&dAmythest golems&r collect &dAmythest&r near its home."
	]
	quest.305C778D5538E46F.quest_desc: ["The Ultimate processing unit for all known ores. Faster, easier, more productive. For the little cost of energy, you extract from ore maximum."]
	quest.305C778D5538E46F.quest_subtitle: "Extracting Maximum value"
	quest.30700E99091B712A.quest_desc: ["The &9Regulator Upgrade&r allows you to maintain a certain amount of items within a block or machine. A great example of this is telling your network that you want to keep 64 Coal within a Furnace. You'd place the upgrade in the exporter attached to the furnace, and set it to 64. Your system will then try to keep the furnace full of fuel! \\\\n \\\\n But what if you need an item that is crafted? The &9Crafting Upgrade&r does exactly this. If you have the recipe learned inside of a crafter, adding this upgrade to an interface will let it know to craft it if you run out. \\\\n \\\\n Using our example from before, let's say we have a Mystical Ag farm going and have Coal Essence. We can then put the Coal recipe in a crafter connected to our system, then place this upgrade in the same exporter that is keeping the Furnace fueled. If you run out of Coal in your system, the crafting upgrade allows your system to craft some more!"]
	quest.30700E99091B712A.title: "Regulating Items in Interfaces"
	quest.3081877A09CE2A60.quest_desc: [
		"The &aDraconic Capacitor&r has a grid of &b6x5&r for modules."
		""
		"It can charge your &dheld item&r, &darmor&r, &dhotbar&r, &dmain inventory&r, and your &dcurios slots&r."
	]
	quest.3086EB50617AE8BE.quest_desc: ["Reduces the cost of spells by a moderate amount."]
	quest.30A1DEBBC212EDF1.quest_desc: [
		"The &bQuantum Slicer&r slices dense cosmic ingots into plates, rods, and fine powders needed for advanced circuits."
		""
		"Requires coolant and FE power supplied through adjacent hatches to activate."
	]
	quest.30A1DEBBC212EDF1.quest_subtitle: "Precision Component Milling"
	quest.30A1DEBBC212EDF1.title: "Quantum Slicer"
	quest.30A238E87F013CBB.quest_desc: [
		"Apart from the 5 main genes, there is a 6th gene, the bee specific gene. "
		""
		"These are used to make spawn eggs of that bee. "
		""
		"Most major mods use bee spawn eggs to connect themselves to Productive Bees. "
	]
	quest.30A238E87F013CBB.title: "Genes"
	quest.30A84C6A54BD336E.quest_desc: [
		"A stationary Mechanical Drill will break blocks in the block in front of it with a time in seconds of (45 x Hardness)/RPM and will hurt entities in an area around it."
		""
		"A Mechanical Drill moved by Contraptions will break blocks and damage entities with which it collides without needing a direct supply of Rotational Force."
		""
		"The time it takes for a Mechanical Drill to break a block is based on the Contraption's speed and the block's Hardness value. The damage dealt to entities is also based on the Contraption's speed."
	]
	quest.30B3469DAA8D5A0A.quest_desc: ["A better tier of transporter with more storage."]
	quest.30B3469DAA8D5A0A.title: "&cAdvanced Logistical Transporter"
	quest.30BA459B25CF0912.quest_subtitle: "Found in the Depths of the Nether"
	quest.30BEE6FCFFC78A63.quest_desc: [
		"&eWhat Is the Settings Cloner?&r"
		""
		"The &ePackaging Settings Cloner&r is a utility tool that allows you to &acopy&r and &apaste&r configuration settings between supported &ePackagedAuto&r machines."
		""
		"&eHow to Use&r"
		""
		"• Hold the &eSettings Cloner&r in your hand"
		"• &aSneak + Right-click&r a supported machine to &acopy&r its settings"
		""
		"• &aRight-click&r another machine of the &esame type&r to &apaste&r the copied settings"
		""
		"• &aSneak + Right-click&r on &eair&r or on an &eunsupported block&r to clear the stored configuration"
		""
		"&eWhy Use the Settings Cloner?&r"
		""
		"• Quickly replicate complex setups"
		"• Avoid manual reconfiguration"
		"• Maintain consistent automation behavior"
		"• Essential for large &ePackagedAuto&r factories"
	]
	quest.30BEE6FCFFC78A63.title: "&eSettings Cloner&r"
	quest.30C7553B5832D22A.title: " Raw Iron"
	quest.30CB226DAA54E6EA.quest_desc: ["The &a&lEternal Generator&r is the core of your automation. It converts pure energy into physical drops using data."]
	quest.30CB226DAA54E6EA.quest_subtitle: "FULL STEAM AHEAD"
	quest.30CB226DAA54E6EA.title: "Matter from energy"
	quest.30D6BFA1A3B6B205.quest_desc: ["A gearbox where the rotation direction of all 4 sides are independently configurable."]
	quest.30E9255DEC69C061.quest_desc: ["Tools stronger then the &cprevious tier&r of &aessence.&r"]
	quest.30EB438C66324213.quest_desc: ["Applying the &dIgnore Players Spawner Rune&r allows the spawner to run continuously even when no player is nearby."]
	quest.30EB438C66324213.title: "Ignore Players Rune"
	quest.30F8BA43B1BB9035.quest_desc: ["An upgrade to the &3Basic Fluid Tank&r."]
	quest.310969B8FE0A94DE.quest_desc: [
		"In &bApotheosis&r monster spawners are fully customizable!"
		""
		"Spawners can no longer be modified with loose items. Instead, you must forge specialized &6Spawner Runes&r and apply them directly to the spawner."
		""
		"Spawner attributes (delays, spawn count, nearby limits, range) can be improved through 4 tiers of &eUpgrade Runes&r, while special behaviors are granted using &dBehavior Runes&r."
	]
	quest.310969B8FE0A94DE.title: "Obtain a Spawner"
	quest.314068155E263985.quest_desc: [
		"The &bPlant Gatherer&r automates the harvesting of &acrops&r."
		""
		"Place it in front of the crops and provide it with &dpower&r."
		""
		"It will harvest fully grown &acrops&r and collect the &ayield&r for easy access."
	]
	quest.3143EA7DF096CE61.quest_desc: ["&6Combines&r items inside, used for &aautomation&r and &epowered&r with st&beam.&r"]
	quest.314E41B84C8DD464.quest_desc: [
		"Your personal &earchive&r of &denchantments.&r"
		""
		"This block lets you &6store&r, &eview,&r and &bextract&r &denchantments&r using &aXP.&r Found a perfect &denchant&r but not the right item? &eSave it&r for later! Also great for transferring &eenchantments&r from &csalvaged&r &cgear.&r"
		""
		"Open the menu, here you can &binsert&r the &denchantment&r you want to store, &lShift-left-Click&r on a book to store it, &lLeft-Click&r on a stored &denchant&r to &edraw one level&r back, &lShift-Right-Click&r to draw the &6max level available&r."
	]
	quest.316399F0B5F729CA.quest_desc: ["It can be used like a normal crafting table. Additionally it has 18 storage slots additionaly it keeps the items you put inside it."]
	quest.31B396E100E83098.quest_desc: [
		"The &aChaos-Entangled Quantum Energy Tunnel&r is an advanced device for &benergy transfer&r across vast distances without any loss. "
		""
		"Features of the &aChaos-Entangled Quantum Energy Tunnel&r:"
		"&6-&r It utilizes &bquantum entanglement&r to link two points, allowing &dinstant energy transfer&r."
		"&6-&r Capable of handling &cmassive amounts of energy&r transfer, suitable for high-end setups."
		"&6-&r Requires &cChaos Shards&r to create the entanglement link."
		"&6-&r Can be configured through its &dGUI&r for precise energy management and routing."
		""
		"Usage:"
		"&6-&r Place one &aQuantum Energy Tunnel&r at each &elocation&r you wish to connect."
		"&6-&r Use the &cChaos Shards&r to establish a link between the two tunnels."
		"&6-&r Once linked, the &benergy transfer&r is instantaneous and lossless, ensuring efficient energy distribution across your network."
	]
	quest.31B73D16C0199785.quest_desc: [
		"The &dRefined Obsidian Ingot&r is used to create the most durable and powerful &aTools&r and &aArmor&r in the game as well as a few other items."
		""
		"However, it also the most expensive to obtain."
	]
	quest.31D603B530071AB9.quest_desc: [
		"Once your model is Basic or higher, you can use the simulation chamber to run simulations of your model. Simulations will always produce a generalized prediction, and may also produce a Mob Prediction, based on the accuracy of the model. "
		""
		"The higher tier of the model, the higher the accuracy, up to 99.5% at Self Aware. "
		""
		"Running simulations requires energy (based on the model type) and a catalyst item, which is usually a Prediction Matrix."
	]
	quest.31EEE2875595F315.quest_desc: [
		"You should have already made &2Sulfuric Acid&r for your &b&oTier 4&r &6Ore Processing Factory&r, but here is a reminder on how to get it."
		""
		"Start by getting &eSulfur Dust&r either by crushing Sulfur from &9Thermal&r, or by mixing &bHydrogen Chloride&r with &3Gunpowder&r in a &dChemical Dissolution Chamber&r."
		""
		"Take the &eSulfur Dust&r and run it through a &9Chemical Oxidizer&r to get &eSulfur Dioxide&r. Combine that with &bOxygen&r in a &cChemical Infuser&r to get &eSulfur Trioxide&r."
		""
		"Next, we'll combine &bWater Vapor&r with the &6Sulfur Trioxide&r to make &2Sulfuric Acid&r."
	]
	quest.31EEE2875595F315.quest_subtitle: "A Quick Recap"
	quest.31EEE2875595F315.title: "&2Sulfuric Acid"
	quest.3204A2F62F67F397.quest_desc: ["Yeah im not typing all that."]
	quest.320C8B5D62920E21.quest_desc: ["After &csmelting&r your &6Raw Allthemodium ore&r, you will get ingots! You use the &aingots&r to craft &cweapons&r and when used in a &esmithing table&r and with the &6Allthemodium template&r you can craft new &aarmor&r and a new &dspell book&r."]
	quest.320CC038A64A3195.quest_desc: [
		"The goal is to aim each &9Laser&r into a &2Laser Amplifier&r. Using one is pretty slow, so we're going to make a few."
		""
		"Sticking the &9Lasers&r directly on a power source like an &aEnergy Cube&r works, or you can have them on pipes or cables. You want to give it a block of empty space between the &9Lasers&r and the &2Laser Amplifier&r."
		""
		"The &2Laser Amplifier&r has a red dot on one of the faces. This is what you want to point towards the &3Laser Focus Matrix&r."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Make sure to turn the &2Laser Amplifier&r &noff&r (or activate &cRedstone&r control) and wait for it to store &nat least&r &o&b400MRF&r, then it'll be ready."
		""
	]
	quest.320CC038A64A3195.title: "Jumpstarting Method: &dLaser Focus Array&r"
	quest.321D86476FFACDFF.quest_desc: ["The base of the mod used in a couple of machines and used to make the &5Reinforced machine casing&r."]
	quest.32439CCC802C8041.quest_desc: [
		"Allows you to &etransport&r &bmultiple chemicals&r through the &csame line!&r"
		""
		"You can also &6filter&r in or out chemicals with the &dfilter options&r and a &dfilter chip&r. To configure what chemicals you want to filter use a &econtainer&r of the chemical, then change the white or black list mode on the &aright of the filter UI.&r "
		""
		"Access the &emain UI&r by &lRight-Clicking&r on the part of the &cconduit&r attached to a machine."
	]
	quest.32439CCC802C8041.title: "Ender Chemical Conduit"
	quest.324947891E0AF04A.quest_desc: [
		"Mekanism Ethylene Gas: This is by far the most efficient energy system in the mid-game."
		""
		"The Setup: You'll use plants (potatoes, carrots, etc.) to create Ethylene and burn it in a Gas-Burning Generator."
		""
		"Required Machines: Crusher (to make bio fuel), Pressurized Reaction Chamber (PRC) to convert biogas into Ethylene."
		""
		"A single generator burning Ethylene can generate thousands of RF/t, more than enough energy for this phase of the game."
		""
		"Extreme Reactors: A great source of energy for the midgame and \"cheap\" for the midgame."
		""
		"Setup: Initially, we'll use the smallest possible size, 5x5, which in itself generates a lot of RF/t."
	]
	quest.324947891E0AF04A.quest_subtitle: "Your base will start asking for more and more energy."
	quest.324AD7BD3B5735F8.quest_desc: ["If you aren't a fan of brainwashing, use this to cancel out sirens singing."]
	quest.325D7C592E2FB05A.quest_desc: ["Used to craft machines and items that will greatly boost your power."]
	quest.325D7C592E2FB05A.quest_subtitle: "Not to be confused with Avaritia"
	quest.32615D0EAB219E27.quest_desc: ["Triples the processing capacity of the previous tier. Essential once your autocrafting recipes start chaining dozens of intermediate components together."]
	quest.32615D0EAB219E27.quest_subtitle: "High-Capacity Thread Array"
	quest.32615D0EAB219E27.title: "150M Mega Co-Processor"
	quest.3289FED615552BF0.quest_desc: ["A &anew alloy&r with many uses, smelted with the &6alloy smelter&r."]
	quest.32958EB1EFD3FD4C.quest_desc: ["The &bCoal Generator&r in &5RFTools&r is a basic energy-producing machine that generates &cRF energy&r by burning coal and other solid fuels."]
	quest.3297BA81BC5156DE.quest_desc: ["Crafted from a &acave codex&r, this map will lead you to the &bcave&r the &acodex&r was &elinked to&r."]
	quest.3297BA81BC5156DE.quest_subtitle: "Craft a magnetic cave map"
	quest.32BEB0B1FD068CA5.quest_desc: [
		"End Remastered overhauls the way players get to the End and makes the experience way more interesting by forcing them to fully explore the beautiful world of Minecraft. "
		""
		"Adding 16 totally new Ender Eyes hidden all around your world, this mod will make your playthrough a lot more enjoyable."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"1. Old Eye - Found in Desert Pyramids"
		""
		"2. Nether Eye - Found in Nether Fortresses"
		""
		"3. Cold Eye - Found in Igloos"
		""
		"4. Rogue Eye - Found in Jungle Pyramids"
		""
		"5. Black Eye - Found in Buried Chests"
		""
		"6. Magical Eye - Dropped by Evokers"
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"7. Lost Eye - Found in Mineshafts"
		""
		"8. Corrupted Eye - Found in Pillager Outposts"
		""
		"9. Wither Eye - Dropped by The Wither"
		""
		"10. Guardian Eye - Get it by Killing Elder Guardian"
		""
		"11. Witch Eye - Craft it using the witch pupil"
		""
		"12. Cursed Eye - Found in Bastions treasure chest"
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"13. Exotic Eye - Craft it using aquatic item"
		""
		"14. Evil Eye - Buy it from a master cleric"
		""
		"15. Undead Eye - Craft it using an Undead Soul"
		""
		"16. Cryptic Eye - Have a small chance to get it when enchanting"
	]
	quest.32BEB0B1FD068CA5.quest_subtitle: "Vanilla eyes won't work "
	quest.32BEB0B1FD068CA5.title: "End Remastered?"
	quest.32C3E14578D48E6C.quest_desc: ["An upgrade to standard tubes. These can handle much higher pressures without exploding ideal for advanced or large scale systems."]
	quest.32DB0017CBB58B6E.quest_desc: [
		"Defeat 3 &5Chaos Guardians&r in the outermost reaches of the End."
		""
		"Even the most lethal and unpredictable apex beast of the modpack cannot breach your armor."
	]
	quest.32DB0017CBB58B6E.title: "🐉 &5Chaos Slayer (3x Chaos Guardian)"
	quest.32E093F004E8CAC6.quest_desc: ["&dUltimate Universal Cables&r are a version of &bElite&r cables with more storage."]
	quest.32E093F004E8CAC6.title: "&dUltimate Universal Cables"
	quest.32F6CFAE3FA204EB.quest_desc: ["Combine a bunch of singularities and fuse them into the ultimate symbol of grind."]
	quest.32F6CFAE3FA204EB.quest_subtitle: "Have another one on the house."
	quest.32F6CFAE3FA204EB.title: "Singularity"
	quest.33058894ACD9CB06.quest_desc: ["The Graveyard is where the Undertaker will bury your deceased citizens. When a citizen dies, a grave will spawn at the location of death. The Undertaker will attempt to recover the grave before it despawns. If successful, the Undertaker will return to the graveyard and attempt to revive the citizen. If the citizen cannot be revived, the Undertaker will bury them in the Graveyard. Another grave will be placed with the citizen’s name on it."]
	quest.33058894ACD9CB06.quest_subtitle: "Build a Graveyard"
	quest.33070518A73B4EDE.quest_desc: [
		"An arrow designed to &cdig into flesh&r &6and earth&r alike. Especially effective in &etight spaces&r."
		""
		"Will destroy &l5&r &ablocks&r below it when fired."
	]
	quest.330EE51410D88BFD.quest_desc: ["The &bCapacity Card&r upgrades a bus to carry a larger filter. With &acapacity cards&r, Import and Export buses can support up to &anine slots&r from a single slot, and Storage buses can go from &d18 slots&r to a maximum of &d63 slots&r."]
	quest.33106E24A3B5DDD8.title: "&cIesnium: Ore of the Otherworld&r"
	quest.331934749C1DE9A0.quest_desc: ["A mechanical component used for mixing and processing materials. It’s essential in crafting setups where ingredients need to be blended or stirred using rotational energy."]
	quest.3324DF0C217C024C.title: "&2The Dielectric Trio"
	quest.3339445194568D77.quest_desc: ["Tools stronger then the &cprevious tier&r of &aessence.&r"]
	quest.333D3DB292D5506A.quest_subtitle: "This block may be broken"
	quest.3353D17D82959D0C.quest_desc: ["Useful for &6crafting giant recipes&r from a few mods."]
	quest.3353D17D82959D0C.quest_subtitle: "Hey this is not from Avaritia!"
	quest.3357A8B614D477B6.quest_desc: ["&6Breaks apart&r items inside, used for &aautomation&r and &epowered&r with st&beam.&r"]
	quest.335BFE2345DAFE03.quest_desc: ["Same as the &bsteam tools&r except they use &eelectricity.&r"]
	quest.336282FB5DD2C5F3.quest_subtitle: "“Everything, everywhere, all at once.”"
	quest.33790B5459C49550.quest_desc: [
		"&dProjectE&r adds &anew items &ruseful for all your &cdestructive intentions&r. "
		"&6New tnt&r, for &cbigger explosions&r! &o"
		"(has a &eVERY short fuse&r though, be carful!)&r"
		"The &edestruction catalyst&r mines in a straight &l3x3&r line based on its &6charge.&r"
		"&o(&lV&r to &acharge,&r &lShift-V&r to &clower charge&r)&r"
		"The &6Hyperkinetic lens&r is a bomb, you throw it, it blows up."
		"(You can create a &4catalytic lens&r with the &6hyper lens&r and &ecatalyst.&r The &4catalytic&r lens is just a &ecatalyst&r but longer)"
	]
	quest.33790B5459C49550.quest_subtitle: "Have fun!"
	quest.338E4A4F41889959.quest_desc: [
		"The ME Crafting Terminal is the upgraded version of the ME Terminar which has an integrated crafting grid with access to a ME Network's Networked Storage."
		""
		"Like the ME Terminal it also requires a Channel to function."
	]
	quest.33A0E06FE5CFD8F3.quest_desc: [
		"The Centrifuge requires nothing to function! Very slow, though"
		""
		"The Powered Centrifuge requires Powerto function! Faster than the Normal version"
		""
		"The Heated Centrifuge requires Power to function! Faster than the Normal version, produces NO Wax from Combs"
	]
	quest.33A0E06FE5CFD8F3.title: "Centrifuges"
	quest.33B1D3FD4C0B5514.quest_desc: ["The Ancient Remnant is a colossal skeletal dinosaur that serves as the primary boss of the Cursed Pyramid structure. With its imposing frame and ornate golden harnesses, this ancient beast commands respect and requires careful preparation from anyone brave enough to confront it."]
	quest.33D0760B5FEF7C46.quest_desc: ["A &bturbine&r that uses &dhelium plasma &rto create &eenergy.&r"]
	quest.33D23C65E7274A8F.quest_desc: ["You will use the &6awakening alter&r to craft &cawakened items&r, place them the same way you placed the&a Infusion alter&r, except in the &ediagonals&r you will place &bessence vessels&r."]
	quest.33DD68B85F163F50.quest_desc: ["The &bME Import Bus&r periodically pulls items from an &6external storage&r it faces. It can be &afiltered&r to only accept certain items from the connected inventory."]
	quest.33F44B87C5496158.quest_subtitle: "Dragon Tools"
	quest.33F44B87C5496158.title: "&1Draco Tools"
	quest.33FE53F9B5BA0001.quest_desc: ["A throwable grenade with a copper casing designed to deal area damage upon detonation. Its metal body makes it sturdy and slightly heavier, ideal for clearing groups of enemies or breaking through obstacles."]
	quest.340688B72BFADF54.quest_desc: [
		"Build your own &6orbital outposts!&r They provide a base of operations in &dspace&r and can be customized however you want."
		"Great for huge builds also."
		""
		"You can create them from the &dspace UI&r after launching a &crocket&r you are in, if you have the correct &6materials&r in &lyour&r &einventory&r then click the &lplus button (+)&r in the right section of the &ainteractable menu&r."
	]
	quest.340688B72BFADF54.title: "Space Stations"
	quest.340BCA3B946CB5CF.quest_desc: ["Applying the &6Burning Spawner Rune&r causes all spawned mobs to spawn ignited on fire."]
	quest.340BCA3B946CB5CF.title: "Burning Spawner Rune"
	quest.3416441A94958EA1.quest_desc: ["&dThe final forge&r. Fuses power from the&a ancient tables&r into one &6absolute workstation&r."]
	quest.3424B27C62D3D2CF.quest_desc: [
		"Allows wireless access via a Wireless Terminal. Range and power usage is determined based on the number of Wireless Booster installed."
		""
		"A network can have any number of wireless access points with any number of Wireless Booster in each one, allowing you to optimize power usage and range by altering your setup."
		""
		"Requires a channel."
		""
		"Also used to bind wireless terminals"
	]
	quest.342A1EF584823D2C.quest_desc: ["Okay this achievement is kind of a lie. It might be more analogous to “teach a man to fish”.  Regardless, the point is that if you teach your builder to make simple items that fit in a 2x2 crafting grid (like torches) they can craft the item themselves instead of asking for help."]
	quest.342A1EF584823D2C.title: "Never Craft Again"
	quest.3433EB3FCE83D609.quest_desc: [
		"Mobility upgrades for your &bUFO Armor&r."
		""
		"Astral Wings give you creative flight across all dimensions, Void Flight prevents void damage if you drop below the world, and Kinetic Overdrive boosts your ground sprinting speed."
	]
	quest.3433EB3FCE83D609.quest_subtitle: "Dimensional Mobility Upgrades"
	quest.3433EB3FCE83D609.title: "Propulsion and Flight Modules"
	quest.3446238EBC7583E9.quest_subtitle: "“Knowledge devours its reader.”"
	quest.3453BED15C59327F.quest_desc: ["Crafted with a &bDiamond block&r and &eAeternalis fuel&r, you will use &0Dark matter&r for many crafting recipes. And you can craft the &dtransmutation tablet&r with &lblocks of dark matter&r, which is a &aportable version&r of the &5transmutation table&r."]
	quest.3453BED15C59327F.quest_subtitle: "chocolate?"
	quest.34592A8F4B661D8D.quest_desc: ["You'll find the Stella Arcanum ore deep underground."]
	quest.346860B8EBC4C28C.quest_subtitle: "A good start on energy generation"
	quest.346860B8EBC4C28C.title: "Magmator"
	quest.346BAC4D951FB684.quest_desc: [
		"Crafted from the &cphilosophers stone&r, you will place items in the &6fire slot&r to collect its &eEMC&r in the table's storage and &a\"learn\"&r the item. or you can place items in the &emiddle&r of the right slot just to &alearn&r it, and items in the left slot to &echarge.&r"
		""
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&dKnown items&r will appear in the &eright circle&r and when &aclicked upon&r will give you that item if the table has sufficient &eEMC.&r"
	]
	quest.346BAC4D951FB684.quest_subtitle: "We may have buffed the recipe... a little"
	quest.347A46447A7C3635.quest_desc: [
		"A powerful multiblock generator that produces massive amounts of Forge Energy (FE) using Uraninite as fuel, along with Water, Coal, Redstone, and Dry Ice for improved efficiency. As you upgrade to higher tiers, the reactor becomes more efficient and capable of sustaining even the most demanding power systems."
		""
		"You need to have 36x reactor blocks in your inventory in order to assemble it just right click it"
		"on a avalible 3x3 spot and it will auto build. "
	]
	quest.347C16F0F7CFAACF.quest_desc: ["Made from a &4Advanced Control Circuit&r this item is used in a few crafting recipes."]
	quest.348C4C8C2072D70A.quest_desc: ["Forged from frozen mint and twisted intent, this spear is as chilling as it is sweet. Handle with care."]
	quest.348E851939EFF3EB.quest_desc: ["A spark of &6divine potential&r. Everything &mimpossible&r &9begins here&r. &eYou have come far&r, use this to craft the &9best&r of the &9best.&r"]
	quest.3491637B3786B5C7.quest_desc: ["Ah the dragonforge, pride of the Obsidian Kingdom. They discovered that if you let dragon breath into a forge, while there is iron inside, the outcome is dragonsteel. Each type of dragon requires its own forge. "]
	quest.3491637B3786B5C7.title: "Fire Dragonforge"
	quest.34937B332C62C0D7.quest_desc: ["Reinforced heavy casings capable of withstanding the gravitational pull of simulated miniature stars."]
	quest.34937B332C62C0D7.quest_subtitle: "Gravitational Containment Shell"
	quest.34937B332C62C0D7.title: "Singularity Casing"
	quest.349A2AF6970E3CAB.quest_desc: ["A &anew alloy&r with many uses, smelted with the &6alloy smelter&r."]
	quest.34C083430AB4C8A7.quest_desc: ["Part grappling tool, part twisted decoration. Surprisingly sturdy, and disturbingly festive."]
	quest.34CC84EAF74CD6FF.quest_desc: ["Your personal index is useful, although you need the machine to extract the data in real world. This machine would allow you to write that data on &lMemory Shard&r. Use EMI/JEI(key \"U\") to see all of ths supported mobs."]
	quest.34CC84EAF74CD6FF.quest_subtitle: "The Index Inscriber"
	quest.34EDA172D455F7A7.quest_desc: [
		"Craft the majestic &5Colossal Star Omega&r from Project Expansion!"
		""
		"Near-infinite condensation capacity for universal matter itself."
	]
	quest.34EDA172D455F7A7.title: "🌌 &5Colossal Star (Project Expansion)"
	quest.34F4B347F845C6FB.quest_desc: ["Compressed in the DMA using White Dwarf matter and dimensional processors. Required for 50B storage cells and mid-tier quantum machinery."]
	quest.34F4B347F845C6FB.quest_subtitle: "Condensed Graviton Core"
	quest.34F4B347F845C6FB.title: "Hyper-Dense Component Matrix"
	quest.3513D89C6FD2D852.quest_desc: ["The Scepter shoots out energy orbs when charged up with Right-Click. If a mob is hit, it'll strike it with lightning."]
	quest.3513D89C6FD2D852.quest_subtitle: "Go Pew Pew"
	quest.3513D89C6FD2D852.title: "&1Draco Weapons"
	quest.351D597D786C4254.title: "Defeat the Ignited Revenants"
	quest.35296382603A6E78.quest_desc: ["A lightweight throwable explosive with a zinc casing that favors portability and quick deployment. Its lighter shell means slightly reduced raw blast power compared to heavier metal grenades, but it’s easier to carry and toss repeatedly—useful for fast skirmishes or clearing small groups of foes."]
	quest.35365535ED46DAD0.quest_desc: ["Applied Energistics 2 (AE2) is a comprehensive mod for Minecraft that introduces a unique approach to in-game inventory management. Its theme is centered around the concept of converting matter into energy and vice versa, to store and transport your items and fluids instantaneously!"]
	quest.35365535ED46DAD0.title: "Welcome to &eApplied Energistics 2"
	quest.353C7440B32F0A5E.quest_desc: ["The bread and butter of &denchanting&r power. The higher your &aEterna,&r the more &cpowerful&r your &denchantments&r can be. Think of it as the raw strength of your enchanting setup."]
	quest.353C7440B32F0A5E.title: "Eterna"
	quest.354086C858E10154.quest_desc: [
		"Now that we have some &dCyanite&r from our &o&bsmall reactor&r, we'll want a way to &o&breprocess&r that &o&3waste&r into &nsomething useful&r. To do this, we'll need to build the &6Reprocessor&r."
		""
		"This takes a lot of &dCyanite&r, so start &o&bstocking up&r! You might want to upgrade to a &o&bbigger reinforced reactor&r as well."
	]
	quest.354086C858E10154.title: "Reprocessing the Waste"
	quest.3562111D841CF498.quest_desc: [
		"The Sequenced Gearshift allows finer control over Rotational power, allowing multiple changes to the rotation over a period of time."
		""
		"The Sequenced Gearshift can be given up to 5 commands at a time. Each command can be adjusted by hovering over them and scrolling in the interface."
		""
		"The first column consists of the commands Turn by angle, Turn by Piston, Timed Delay, Await New Redstone Pulse, and End. The first two are simply different measurements of rotation corresponding to Mechanical Pistons and Mechanical Bearings, the third makes the Gearshift wait before proceeding to the next command, while the fourth stops the sequence until the Gearshift receives another pulse. End signifies the end of a sequence, but is not necessary for a sequence to be completed."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"The second column adjusts the measurements for each command. Up to 360 Degrees for Turn, 128 blocks for Piston, and 30 seconds for Wait."
		""
		"The third column adjusts speed and direction. Here, rotation can be doubled, reversed, both, or neither."
		""
		"A Redstone Comparator can be used to detect what instruction a Sequenced Gearshift is on. It will output a signal strength of up to 5, regardless of how many instructions are in the Gearshift."
	]
	quest.35639D4A6DDF6FF9.quest_desc: [
		"The Clutch stops outgoing rotation when a redstone signal is applied."
		""
		"When the Clutch is not activated, it will transfer rotation like a Shaft. When it is activated, it will stop transferring rotation."
	]
	quest.357E50BEAF1E8F74.quest_desc: ["A special book that stores information about discovered ore veins. It allows you to track and locate valuable resources easily, making mining and excavation more efficient and organized."]
	quest.358C8577CE86AF68.quest_desc: [
		"The first tier of mega co-processors. Adding this to your crafting CPU cluster provides massive thread acceleration, letting AE2 calculate and dispatch multi-step crafting trees much faster."
		""
		"&7Fun fact: While classical computers process data in single bits of 0 or 1, quantum processors use qubits that exist in a superposition of both states at once, allowing them to test countless calculation paths simultaneously.&r"
	]
	quest.358C8577CE86AF68.quest_subtitle: "Accelerated Thread Engine"
	quest.358C8577CE86AF68.title: "50M Mega Co-Processor"
	quest.3591EAA8E397F992.quest_desc: [
		"Let's go through the checklist &b&oone more time&r to ensure we have everything ready to go before we boot it up:"
		""
		"1. &6Hazmat Suit&r On (Safety First!)"
		"2. &9Water/coolant&r pumping into an input Port."
		"3. &3Fissile Fuel&r pumping into an input Port."
		"4. A Port set to output the Heated Coolant, either to a trashcan or an &2Industrial Turbine&r."
		"5. A Port set to output &0Nuclear Waste&r leading to &eRadioactive Waste Barrels&r or machines to process it, or both!"
		""
		"If you're ready to go, hit that &eActivate&r button!"
		""
		"You can also adjust the &3Burn Rate&r to produce more Nuclear Waste, but start slow."
	]
	quest.3591EAA8E397F992.title: "Booting Up The Reactor"
	quest.3593D955361B0C6D.quest_desc: [
		"To start the &6Fusion Reactor&r, we'll need a quick-shot of &dD-T Fuel&r. This is made by combining &cDeuterium&r and &eTritium&r together in a &eChemical Infuser&r."
		""
		"Start by making a &4Hohlraum&r and place it into the Infuser (where the plus symbol is) to fill it with &dD-T Fuel&r. Now we're ready to &b&nSTART&r the &6Reactor&r!"
	]
	quest.3593D955361B0C6D.title: "The Fuel Injector"
	quest.35C37231C1C86294.quest_desc: [
		"uper glue has two modes of application: Block by Block Mode and Area Mode. These modes can be intermixed on the same contraption."
		""
		"Each use of the super glue decreases its durability by one. (Durability in this case means the number of times that a tube of super glue can be used. The glue attaching blocks is permanent until removed.) Super Glue can be Enchanted with unbreaking and mending to extend its life."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"Block by Block Mode"
		"In block-by-block mode, super glue is used just like a Slimeball. Right clicking on a Linear Chassis or Radial Chassis while holding the super glue, coats the face of a chassis with green glue allowing other blocks to be attached."
		""
		"Super glue can also be held in the off hand while placing blocks to automatically glue each block individually. Note that the edges of chassis cannot be coated with glue like the face can. However, while holding super glue in the off-hand, blocks can still be attached to the edges of chassis."
		""
		"Remove glue coatings from the faces of chassis by right clicking with an empty hand while sneaking."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"Area Mode"
		"Area mode is used to glue collections of blocks together after they have been placed. Glue a 3-D section of blocks by right clicking a block on one corner of the section while holding the super glue. Move the cursor to the opposite corner of the section. A green box will appear indicating the blocks which will be glued together. Right click again to complete the glueing process. To abort the process, right click while sneaking."
		""
		"The second block can be up to 24 blocks away from the initially selected block and the maximum volume of selection is 2312. No matter the size of the selection, only 1 durability will be used. Overlapping instances of super glue will combine while keeping their shape. Note that the game will not allow you to select the face of a chassis in area mode, it will instead revert to block by block mode. To select a chassis in area mode, click on the side rather than the face."
		""
		"Glued areas can be seen simply by holding the super glue in the main hand. Glued areas will be outlined in green. Note that blocks glued by first coating a surface with glue and then attaching a block (as in the Block by Block Mode) will not show a green outline. However, blocks attached with the super glue in the off hand will show a green outline."
	]
	quest.35C37231C1C86294.title: "&aSuper Glue"
	quest.35C503046753163F.quest_desc: [
		"Extreme reactors are also a decent for power generation, though not most conventional."
		"Albeit they have been buffed so the numbers are upped to those in default setting. "
		"Keep in mind, like in real life the reactor itself isn't there for power but the turbines."
	]
	quest.35C503046753163F.title: "Extreme reactors"
	quest.35EC08D610382860.quest_desc: ["The &9Filter&r is an item used in a Grid to specify which items or fluids can be visible."]
	quest.35EC08D610382860.title: "Filter"
	quest.35F24F6E403AADA1.quest_desc: ["A gearbox with shafts on all 6 sides. Conceptually uses the same internal mechanism as Parallel Gearbox, so top and bottom spins at half speed."]
	quest.360B4A5D7EAC3024.quest_desc: ["Used to move &credstone currents&r &efar distances&r &awithout losing power!&r Don't forget to toggle &e\"Input\"&r on the &credstone conduit&r connected to the block you wish to power."]
	quest.360B4A5D7EAC3024.title: "Redstone Conduit"
	quest.36118FAB0964F805.quest_desc: ["The &aDraconium Ingot&r is a vital item used extensively in crafting and upgrading various items."]
	quest.3617DE87C4E1BCB9.quest_desc: ["The Hand Crank generates a small amount of Rotational Force through player interaction."]
	quest.3623D4179724500D.quest_desc: ["The &6Covered Cable&r is an upgraded version of the &6ME Glass Cable&r. It also supports up to &d8 channels&r but provides additional &aprotection and durability&r. &6Covered Cables&r can be further upgraded to &6Dense Covered Cables&r."]
	quest.3658B862EEE320BD.quest_desc: ["A &dSupermasiv QIO Drive&r can contain &o&b16,000,000,000&r &nitems&r and &o&b8,192&r &nitem types&r."]
	quest.3663E93E169EF8E3.quest_desc: ["Using another &9Chemical Infuser&r, we want to combine our &bHydrofluoric Acid&r with &eUranium Oxide&r to make &2Uranium Hexafluoride&r."]
	quest.3663E93E169EF8E3.title: "&2Uranium Hexafluoride"
	quest.36766831FDA775FD.quest_desc: ["Made in a heated basin with a press."]
	quest.3686BAC07C9F5E22.title: "Make a crafting table"
	quest.3697EC3B1B47C9F4.quest_desc: ["Tier II instead of I"]
	quest.36B1995B495AA674.quest_desc: [
		"To start our journey into the world of Mekanism Reactors, we'll start by making a &aFission Reactor&r. These are multiblock structures that generate massive amounts of heat by burning &3Fissile Fuel&r. This reactor does not produce power on its own, but the heat generated can be used to heat &bCoolant&r to be used to generate power in an &aIndustrial Turbine&r."
		""
		"The &aFission Reactor&r can be very dangerous, as a meltdown can cause an &cexplosion&r as well as &2Radiation&r spreading over a &o&b5 chunk radius&r, which lasts for several &nin-game weeks&r. "
		""
		"But we're going to be prepared for that. Let's make a &6Hazmat Suit&r, just in case."
	]
	quest.36B1995B495AA674.title: "Hazmat Suit"
	quest.36D1E3949C956DF8.quest_desc: ["&bEggs&r are &cbroken&r when &ejumped on&r, and if you place &bice&r or &6amber&r beneath them they will &anot grow up&r."]
	quest.36D74C310EBF1C95.quest_desc: ["The &aEnergy Transfuser&r is used to rapidly recharge your draconic items. You can charge up to &b4 items&r or &bblocks&r inside."]
	quest.36FBCDC302FDB52A.quest_desc: ["Amass two fully charged &dKlein Star Omega&r items (over 100 Million EMC)!"]
	quest.36FBCDC302FDB52A.title: "🔮 &dThe Cosmic Bank: 100M+ EMC"
	quest.371A34B297C8A8EF.quest_desc: ["The first step in Pneumatic is to blow up some iron (or find it on chests)"]
	quest.3734081CB77CDBB5.quest_desc: [
		"Matter Balls in a Matter Cannon can be substituted with Paint Balls, which will apply a paint splatter effect on the face of whatever block being fired at."
		""
		"Lumen Paint Balls are a variant of paint balls exclusively used by the Matter Cannon, whose paint splatters also give off some light once present in the world."
	]
	quest.3734081CB77CDBB5.title: "Matter/Paint/Lumen Paint Balls"
	quest.373592864A465D37.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.373D74E97D193169.quest_desc: ["Dragon bone is a sturdy material, perfect for making tools and weapons. You can also further strengthen it by combining with one of the dragon bloods. "]
	quest.3751015CD5C84134.quest_desc: ["The 4096k Fluid Storage Part is used to craft the 4096k Fluid Storage Disk."]
	quest.3751015CD5C84134.title: "&b4096k Fluid Part&r"
	quest.3761B64135EA94C0.quest_desc: [
		"Similar to a &l5x5x5&r &lcube&r with the &ecorners&r cut out at the &bsmallest size,&r Though I recommend using a &6wrench&r after placing the &2Nuclear Reactor&r two blocks high in the &bair.&r"
		""
		"Place &6hatches&r in the &emiddle parts&r of the &broof&r in order to view them in the &2Nuclear Reactor.&r Both &9fluid&r and &bitem&r &6hatches&r are acceptable."
		""
		"In the &bitem hatches&r you would place your &auranium fuel rods.&r"
	]
	quest.3761B64135EA94C0.quest_subtitle: "Apparently these don't blow up"
	quest.376BAC497511F067.title: "Iron Furnace"
	quest.378BF828DC931F0C.title: "CRAFTING ON A STICK!"
	quest.37BB72D33F766C9F.quest_desc: ["Allows you to &astore experience&r within this block."]
	quest.37E43341FA234E84.quest_desc: [
		"The Flower Shop is where your Florist will grow flowers for your colony, if given compost and an axe. "
		""
		"One important factor to know is that the flower shop has a daily flower limit based on the hut level. Level 1 has a daily max of 4, level 2 has 8. At level 5 it’s daily max is 20. "
	]
	quest.37E43341FA234E84.quest_subtitle: "Build a Flower Shop"
	quest.37EBB8E0D6E5F821.quest_desc: [
		"&#02FFC1Hostile Neural Networks&r is a mob based on Deep Mob Learning. It allows you to train data models and run simulations, producing mob predictions, which can be used to generate mob loot."
		""
		"The fundamental unit of this mod is the Data Model an item which holds information about an entity that you can utilize to generate their drops. "
	]
	quest.37F3ABF113A1D399.quest_desc: ["A &ehatch&r for a &dmultiblock&r that allows you to provide the &cmachine&r with power by attaching&6 powered cables&r to this."]
	quest.383D6F1A001A0AEC.quest_desc: ["Chutes transport items vertically, generally downward unless an encased fan is used to blow items upward. There are two varieties: Chute and Smart Chute. Smart Chutes allow the player to control the types of items passed and their stack size."]
	quest.384436003FDA9258.quest_desc: [
		"Use on dirt to create Dreadful Dirt."
		"(make a 5x5 of dirt and use it in the middle)"
		""
		"Hostile mobs spawn on this."
		""
		"They will only spawn if there is no light."
		"You could use Tinted Glass to see them spawn."
	]
	quest.387392E5B6A4F98E.quest_desc: ["&cSmelt raw ore&r to get these &aingots,&r which are mainly used in the &esmithing table&r."]
	quest.3878C5C2024F29A8.title: "&eUltimate Crafting&r"
	quest.387FC4D9C4010FD8.quest_desc: ["The Automated Engineer's Workbench is a 3x2x3 multiblock. It is an automated version of the Engineer's Workbench."]
	quest.387FC4D9C4010FD8.title: "Automated Engineer's Workbench"
	quest.388457A6A61896BA.quest_desc: ["Crush 5 &4Netherite Monstrosities&r deep within the Nether's underground fortresses."]
	quest.388457A6A61896BA.title: "🔥 &4Forged Terror (5x Netherite Monstrosity)"
	quest.38A28A6BCA401D6F.quest_desc: ["Respawned the same way as normal placing an end crystal on the exit portal's outer rim."]
	quest.38A28A6BCA401D6F.title: "Defeat the &8&lEnder Dragon"
	quest.38C3598203D0E017.quest_desc: ["The &aAOE Module&r increases the AOE (&darea of effect&r) of your tools and weapons."]
	quest.38D14675BA200B0E.title: "Processing Upgrades"
	quest.38D5E571A36F12E4.quest_desc: ["These crafting ingredients are the base for createing the powerful &etrinkets&r from this mod."]
	quest.38D5E571A36F12E4.title: "The Trinkets"
	quest.38E84EA139A2316C.quest_desc: [
		"The Drive is the device you plug your storage cells into in order to use them for network storage. It has 10 slots which each accept a cell."
		""
		"If for some reason you want to, you can push and pull the cells from its inventory with any item logistics like hoppers or ae2 busses."
		""
		"It can be rotated with a Certus Quartz Wrench."
	]
	quest.38E9C4DB82B1279A.quest_desc: [
		"While stationary, certain items can be applied to the block's filter. If it has a filter, it will only affect that contraption actor. If powered with a redstone signal before and while it is assembled, the contraption actors will start out disabled. Keep in mind that redstone and levers assembled on Contraptions have no effect."
		""
		"While on an assembled Contraption, Contraption Controls can be right-clicked to enable and disable certain Contraption Actors."
	]
	quest.39124F73B82400F4.quest_desc: ["Converts rotational energy from Create machines into FE at around 75% efficiency."]
	quest.3931273289B3A68C.quest_desc: [
		"Fluix ME Glass Cable is the simplest cable to make, transfers power and up to 8 channels. It comes in 17 different colors, the default being Fluix, and can be dyed any color using any of the 16 dyes."
		""
		"To craft colored cables surround a dye of any type with 8 cables of the same type ( color of the cables dosn't matter, but they must be the same type, glass, smart, etc ). You can also paint cables with any forge compatible paint brush in world."
		""
		"You can craft any colored cable with a water bucket to remove the dye."
		""
		"You can cover the cable with wool to create Fluix ME Covered Cable, and craft Fluix ME Smart Cable to get a better idea of what is going on with your channels."
	]
	quest.3940E67F7AB07D8D.quest_desc: [
		"They replace all your chalks"
		""
		"&lUnbreakable&r"
	]
	quest.3940E67F7AB07D8D.quest_subtitle: "Make it easy"
	quest.3940E67F7AB07D8D.title: "God's chalks"
	quest.396804B13ECF09ED.quest_subtitle: "Make a Diamond pickaxe"
	quest.3979E578C63823DB.quest_desc: ["More storage."]
	quest.398F2CE7DBE4A31B.quest_desc: ["The &aChaotic Fusion Crafting Injector&r is the highest &btier&r available, offering unmatched energy intake speed. This results in the quickest crafting times when used with the &dFusion Crafting Core&r."]
	quest.39959176F27817A1.quest_desc: ["The &aChaotic Chest Piece&r has a grid of &b10x8&r for modules."]
	quest.3999760881C855FA.quest_desc: [
		"The Chemical Crystallizer turns Clean Slurry into Crystals, Lithium into Lithium Dust and Antimatter into Antimatter Pellet. This is one of the select many machines in Mekanism to have dedicated, unchangeable sides, for input and output, with the exception of Item's config sides."
		""
		"Input is gas (uses Pressurized Tube) and output is items (uses Logistical Transporter)"
	]
	quest.3999760881C855FA.quest_subtitle: "Turns Ore Slurry into Crystals"
	quest.39AC44DD78BB695F.quest_desc: ["A basic yet robust power unit built for generating strong rotational energy. It’s reliable and easy to maintain, making it suitable for medium to large mechanical systems."]
	quest.39ADBE9A60170296.quest_desc: ["Has 27 more filter slots and is 5x faster than the regular Importer. Also has the Stack Upgrade integrated."]
	quest.39C8CD6102B26BFE.quest_desc: ["It is widely used to construct the items described in Engineer's Blueprints. A wide variety of blueprints bcan be crafted, as detailed in the respective manual entry, whereas a few select ones can bonly be discovered in the world or purchased from villagers."]
	quest.39C8E1705EF1CD31.quest_desc: ["The 256k Fluid Storage Part is used to craft the 256k Fluid Storage Disk."]
	quest.39C8E1705EF1CD31.title: "&e256k Fluid Part&r"
	quest.39CACA9B9A3FC911.quest_desc: ["Allows you to get exactly the right &denchantment&r you want at the &6cost of materials&r."]
	quest.39CF27CAC4EE33DB.quest_desc: ["An &6axe&r that requires &bwater&r an &cflammables&r to use."]
	quest.39D9A9B5A8D29FD8.quest_desc: ["Although associated with providing enormous amount of items, Minimum for Maximum offers the single most powerful energy generation that is Pandora Box. With enough overload in Eternal Generations you can pump up tens if not hundred, thousands of Billions of FE/t, it is a must have later on."]
	quest.39F0944503669D86.quest_desc: ["The Digital Miner from Mekanism is a high-tech, customizable mining machine that can automatically scan and mine specific blocks from a large area, even through obstacles."]
	quest.39F0944503669D86.title: "Digital Miner"
	quest.39FCE3168C26B863.quest_desc: ["Efficient fuel from the &bitem output!&r"]
	quest.39FFA83723143D47.quest_desc: ["Turns out the &dcake&r was not a lie. &eInfinite food&r, &6never hunger.&r"]
	quest.39FFA83723143D47.quest_subtitle: "The solution to world hunger"
	quest.3A059BC37D957B99.quest_desc: ["A core mechanical part used to transmit rotational force between connected machines. Essential for linking engines, gearboxes, and other moving components in automation systems."]
	quest.3A06A34514B2F406.quest_desc: [
		""
		"{ \"text\": \"CLICK ME!\", \"underlined\": true, \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"4BB13C80196FD034\" } }"
	]
	quest.3A06A34514B2F406.quest_subtitle: "Check out the create questlines."
	quest.3A06A34514B2F406.title: "Create"
	quest.3A10AB80CC8F46A8.quest_desc: [
		"Automation machines for base management:"
		""
		"- &aTree Feller&r: Automatically chops down entire trees."
		"- &cBlock Destroyer&r: Mines blocks in a configurable area."
		"- &9Drone Port&r: Moves items and fluids over unlimited distance using animated drones! Bind Takeoff Port and Landing Port with the Target Designator. Place ports at least 50 blocks apart."
	]
	quest.3A10AB80CC8F46A8.title: "Automation: Tree Feller, Block Destroyer, Drone Ports"
	quest.3A14F2313050D25F.quest_desc: ["Loads an &dinscribed spell&r at the cost of &bmana&r and an &6arrow&r, and can be fired with that &9Spell-arrow&r for &ofree&r later. can fire &dagumented arrows&r."]
	quest.3A1D74301CC5C1BE.quest_desc: ["Holds &dsource&r for other &bmachines&r to use, simply place near a &bsourcelink&r to gather source."]
	quest.3A2633B6030BBC52.quest_desc: ["While worn, the Engineer's Goggles will show the stress impact of the viewed machine while it is running. They will also give numbers and highlight the current rotation when looking at a Stressometer or Speedometer. Additionally, they show how much fluid is in a tank along with the total storage capacity of the tank."]
	quest.3A4B5A9B432576AD.quest_desc: ["Different &ctiers&r of &bwatering cans&r hold more water. &lRight-Click&r water to fill the can up, &lShift-Right-CLick&r to water &acrops&r around you."]
	quest.3A536C1DF0FD517C.quest_desc: [
		"What is dyson hmmmm.... right imagine a huge solar power covering the sun, taking directly power out of it."
		"It may seem as costly and time consuming but its considerably cheap for 1B/t FE production, must have for a midgame IMO."
	]
	quest.3A536C1DF0FD517C.title: "Dyson Cube Project"
	quest.3A7C1931B394082F.quest_desc: [
		"The &aAgronomic Sourcelink&r creates &dsource&r from crops or &bSourceberries&r within a &c17 x 17&r area around this sourcelink whenever the plants recive a &agrowth tick&r, don't use bonemeal. (&bsourceberries&r are the best for this)"
		""
		"Placing a &bsource jar&r nearby allows you to collect the &dsource&r for use in other machines."
	]
	quest.3A814EC89CD7E435.quest_desc: ["&bEggs&r are &cbroken&r when &ejumped on&r, and if you place &bice&r or &6amber&r beneath them they will &anot grow up&r."]
	quest.3A87F281627E29DA.quest_desc: [
		"The &bBuilder&r is an incredibly versatile &9construction tool&r in &5RFTools&r used for &dautomating building and mining&r tasks."
		""
		"To use the &bBuilder&r, place it in your world and connect it to your power network using &9energy cables&r. &n&bRight-click&r to open the &6GUI&r, where you can select the operation mode such as &6Quarry&r, &aShape Card&r, or &eTemplate&r mode."
		""
		"In &6Quarry Mode&r, the &bBuilder&r can mine out large areas, collecting resources and placing them in an attached &dstorage&r container. In &aShape Card Mode&r, you can specify a shape (e.g., a cube, sphere) and the &bBuilder&r will construct or remove blocks within that shape. In &eTemplate Mode&r, the &bBuilder&r can replicate structures based on a saved template."
		""
		"Insert the appropriate &6card&r or &9template&r into the &bBuilder&r and configure the desired parameters in the &6GUI&r. Once set, the &bBuilder&r will perform the specified task, automating large-scale construction and mining projects with precision and efficiency."
	]
	quest.3A984DEC00459804.quest_desc: [
		"The &dHydroponic Bed&r grows &acrops&r using &1Water&r and &3Ether&r (optional) instead of soil."
		""
		"Provide it with &1Water&r and &dpower&r."
		""
		"It ensures rapid and efficient crop growth, ideal for high-yield farming."
	]
	quest.3A9AC6AB4407DC32.quest_desc: ["Yeah im not guiding you on how to use them use your brain for once."]
	quest.3A9AC6AB4407DC32.title: "Don't feel like it"
	quest.3AB541A2323AF3B3.quest_desc: [
		"&6QIO&r is a way of storing large amounts of items that can be stored, searched, and accessed remotely in late game."
		""
		"It's comprised of at least one &aQIO Drive&r (to store items), a &9QIO Drive Array&r (to hold the &aQIO Drives&r), and at least one &3QIO Dashboard&r (to access items in the &2QIO Drive Array&r)."
		""
		"Both the drive and drive array must be set to &o&bthe same frequency&r in order to work together."
	]
	quest.3ACBE9B17453B4B5.quest_desc: ["Sleep at night without setting spawn"]
	quest.3ACBE9B17453B4B5.title: "Craft a sleeping bag"
	quest.3AD4622409437713.quest_desc: [
		"The Excavator is made of two parts:"
		"The Bucket Wheel is the center part, and is formed by Right Clicking with an Engineers Hammer on the the middle Block of Steel."
		"The Engine is the other part, and is formed by Right clicking the Engineers Hammer on the Heavy Engineering Block in the center of the back side."
		""
		"The energy input for the engine is on its side, the back features a redstone control panel and the item output."
	]
	quest.3AD4622409437713.title: "Excavator"
	quest.3ADC8C0B1350925F.quest_desc: ["Can be inscribed with a spell at an &dScribe's table&r, you can use that spell whenever by using the &6horn&r, and you can hold down the horn to&e charge &ra stronger attack, at max charge the player also takes a little &cdamage&r."]
	quest.3AE2172B95B58B99.quest_desc: [
		"&aQIO Drives&r are inserted into a &9Drive Array&r, allowing it to store more items."
		""
		"Each drive has a number of items and item types it can contain. A &aBasic QIO Drive&r can contain &o&b16,000&r &nitems&r and &o&b128&r &nitem types&r."
	]
	quest.3AF4E5D4839CEF8B.quest_desc: ["Once we have our hands on &eYellow Cake Uranium&r, we can send it through a &aChemical Oxidizer&r to create the gas, &2Uranium Oxide&r. "]
	quest.3AF4E5D4839CEF8B.title: "&eUranium Oxide"
	quest.3B02277DB476C566.quest_desc: ["&eCharges items&r from&c other mods&r while the item is inside this machine. "]
	quest.3B118C4351749B71.quest_desc: ["Allows you to create&d any spell&r."]
	quest.3B2204B624FDC91E.quest_desc: ["More storage."]
	quest.3B30F2220336DC8B.quest_desc: [
		"The &aFluid Gate&r is used to control the flow of fluids in your system."
		""
		"Features of the &aFluid Gate&r:"
		"&6-&r Regulates the &cinput&r and &coutput&r of fluids between tanks and machines."
		"&6-&r Can be configured to allow or restrict fluid flow."
		"&6-&r Ensures efficient fluid management and prevents overflow or shortages."
	]
	quest.3B3C89649DF57161.quest_desc: [
		"Quantum Network Bridges can extend a network over infinite distances and even between dimensions. They can carry 32 channels in total (regardless of how cables are connected to each face), essentially acting like a wireless dense cable."
		""
		"Eight of these quantum rings placed around a ME Quantum Link Chamber will create a Quantum Network Bridge. Only the 4 ME Quantum Ring blocks adjacent to the ME Quantum Link Chamber will accept network connections, the 4 corner blocks cannot connect to cables."
	]
	quest.3B3C89649DF57161.title: "&6The Quantum Bridge"
	quest.3B3CE67AEFC00327.quest_desc: ["Unlock the &6Tome of Knowledge&r, holding the blueprint for every transmutable material in existence!"]
	quest.3B3CE67AEFC00327.title: "📖 &6Material Omniscience: Tome of Knowledge"
	quest.3B40A769EDB26EA2.quest_desc: [
		"Got your eye on a new recruit and need some hay bales? If you place a postbox outside your tavern you can request items from the warehouse and a courier will deliver them to the postbox."
		""
		"Similarly, if you have items you want taken to the warehouse, place them in a Stash and a courier will be along shortly to pick them up."
	]
	quest.3B40A769EDB26EA2.title: "Postbox and Stash"
	quest.3B43DB1A6B0A7B44.quest_desc: ["Bio Fuel is added by Mekanism and is a type of fuel used inside of a Bio-Generator. Beyond that Bio Fuel is used in the Pressurized Reaction Chamber to create Ethylene."]
	quest.3B43DB1A6B0A7B44.title: "Bio Fuel"
	quest.3B7111D31002BDC4.quest_desc: [
		"/trashcan - Opens an inventory where items get deleted when placed in and closed."
		""
		"/hat - Puts item currently in main hand in helmet slot making it your 'hat'."
		""
		"/back - Teleports to previous location. Can be used multiple times."
		""
		"/spawn - Teleports you to spawn."
		""
		"/rtp - Teleports you to random location in world, tries to find a non-ocean, safe place to land."
		""
		"/home [name] - Teleports to a home."
		""
		"/sethome <name> - Sets home."
		""
		"/delhome <name> - Deletes a home."
		""
		"/listhomes [player] - Lists all player homes."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"/tpa <player> - Requests teleportation to player."
		""
		"/tpahere <player> - Requests player to teleport to you."
		""
		"/tpaccept <id> - Accepts request (will have a button for it on screen)."
		""
		"/tpadeny <id> - Denies request (will have a button for it on screen)."
	]
	quest.3B73F2EBCCD1884C.quest_desc: ["Automatically refills gadgets and armor that use water."]
	quest.3B81800EE6E77EF2.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Fission Reactor&r needs &3Fissile Fuel&r to run. If you look up &3Fissile Fuel&r right now in &bJEI&r, I bet you'll get overwhelmed with everything you need to make it. It's okay, you've got this. Let's take it one step at a time."
		""
		"It all boils down to creating &eUranium Hexafluoride&r. To do this, let's focus on making these two gases: &bHydrofluoric Acid&r, and &eUranium Oxide&r."
	]
	quest.3B81800EE6E77EF2.quest_subtitle: "Calm down"
	quest.3B84215240D9F2CB.quest_desc: ["The &9Security Manager&r allows you to grant access and permissions to users within your network. \\\\n \\\\n When placed in your system, you'll need to create a &9Security Card&r for each player you'd like to configure permissions for. When no cards are present, everyone has access to all permissions. \\\\n \\\\n To restrict permissions and access to all unconfigured players, configure a card that isn't bound to a player and put it into the manager. The person who placed the Security Manager will always have access to it."]
	quest.3B84215240D9F2CB.quest_subtitle: "Secure your grid!"
	quest.3B84215240D9F2CB.title: "Security Manager"
	quest.3B91163DE3DA885C.quest_desc: [
		"Possibly one of the most dangerous jobs, especially early on. The Nether Miner travels to the Nether to mine resources. When the miner travels through the portal, there is a chance they may die. So choose your worker carefully."
		""
		"The portal in the Nether Mine will transport players to the Nether. However, the Nether Miner does not actually travel into the Nether, nor do they actually mine any blocks in the Nether."
	]
	quest.3B91163DE3DA885C.quest_subtitle: "Build a Nether Mine"
	quest.3BB133018966E4FF.quest_desc: ["The &aSpeed Module&r gives you more speed."]
	quest.3BB3AA6C29285837.quest_desc: ["A type of &aapple&r with &dmore effects&r then the&c previous tier&r."]
	quest.3BD5FB4D0526A4F6.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.3BDF340E0327AEE4.quest_desc: ["Provides &epower&r to &dEnder IO&r &cmachines&r around it."]
	quest.3BFC57385C345E2D.quest_desc: ["The &cMeatallurgic Generator&r uses &aMeat Items&r to produce &cEnergy&r. It’s an efficient way to turn your surplus meat, whether from farming or hunting, into a valuable power resource."]
	quest.3C09EDD821E4995D.quest_desc: ["For a just a &l&olittle extra&r fluid storage..."]
	quest.3C3519AFEBBAEC70.quest_desc: ["A useful &6crafting component&r automated in the &cassembler.&r"]
	quest.3C3FE45CEF5E242B.quest_desc: [
		"These three parts can be placed on &o&bany vertical face&r as long as they aren't on the frame!"
		""
		"The &cPower Port&r is used to &o&bgive power&r to the multiblock machine to process waste."
		""
		"The &9Fluid Injector Port&r is used &o&bto inject&r the liquid needed, which will depend on the type of waste injected. For &dCyanite&r, that means &o&1water&r!"
		""
		"The &cOutput Port&r is used &o&bto output&r the reprocessed material. You can &eRight-click&r it &o&bto grab&r the material out by hand, or &o&bpipe it out&r for automation."
	]
	quest.3C49F2EEDCCAF1DF.quest_desc: [
		"A basic layout of your factory should be like this: "
		""
		"Raw Ore goes into your Chemical Dissolution Chamber then pumps A GAS to Chemical Washer then pumps A GAS to Chemical Crystallizer then outputs crystals to Chemical Injection Chamber then outputs shards to Purification Chamber then outputs clumps to Crusher then outputs dirty dusts to Enrichment Chamber then outputs clean dust to Smelter."
	]
	quest.3C49F2EEDCCAF1DF.title: "Ore Factory: Tier 4"
	quest.3C59084FEF875C41.quest_desc: [
		"The &dWashing Factory&r cleans &aitems&r and &amaterials&r."
		""
		"Provide it with &aWater&r and &dpower&r."
		""
		"It removes &aimpurities&r from ores and other materials, improving their quality and yield."
	]
	quest.3C59FB74C4ABFDB2.quest_desc: ["Commontly found in the jungles. Those majestic birds fly high and remind us that not all flying creatures are bad (dragons)."]
	quest.3CA5DFF1105281D6.quest_desc: [
		"This is a multiblock battery."
		"You can input and output FE using a small connector."
	]
	quest.3CA5DFF1105281D6.quest_subtitle: "Big battery"
	quest.3CCB560EC216F826.quest_desc: ["A &anew alloy&r with many uses, smelted with the &6alloy smelter&r."]
	quest.3CE5A863271DF6D2.quest_desc: [
		"The &bPotion Brewer&r automates the brewing of &apotions&r."
		""
		"Provide it with &dWater Bottles&r, &aBrewing Ingredients&r, and &dpower&r."
		""
		"The &bPotion Brewer&r will follow the standard brewing process to create &apotions&r."
		""
		"Configure it to brew specific &apotions&r by placing the ingredients in the correct order."
	]
	quest.3CED53CE6C425AD2.quest_desc: [
		"The &ePackager&r is the machine responsible for turning real items into &6Recipe Packages&r."
		""
		"These packages are later processed by an &eUnpackager&r to complete crafting or processing."
		""
		"The Packager &crequires power&r to operate."
		""
		"&eHow the Packager Works&r"
		""
		"• Insert an encoded &ePackage Recipe Holder&r"
		"• The Packager reads the available recipes"
		"• Items are taken from inventories or networks"
		"• Matching items are bundled into &6Recipe Packages&r"
		"• Requires an &3AE2&r channel"
		""
		"Created packages are &eejected&r into adjacent inventories by default."
		""
		"Inputs can be extracted from the &etop side&r."
		""
		"&ePackaging Modes&r"
		""
		"The Packager supports different matching modes:"
		""
		"• &eRequire Exact&r"
		"  – Only creates a package if the inventory exactly matches the recipe"
		""
		"• &eRequire Disjoint&r"
		"  – Creates a package only if items do not overlap"
		"  – Falls back to &eRequire Exact&r if needed"
		""
		"• &eFirst Match&r"
		"  – Creates the first package that can be made from the available items"
		""
		"&eWhy Use the Packager?&r"
		""
		"• Converts complex recipes into simple packages"
		"• Reduces item transport overhead"
		"• Essential for all &ePackagedAuto&r systems"
		"• Scales extremely well with &3AE2&r automation"
	]
	quest.3CED53CE6C425AD2.title: "&ePackager&r"
	quest.3D1C0F80B74B27D5.quest_subtitle: "Arrive at a Lighthouse"
	quest.3D1DE77C9F5606F7.quest_desc: ["The &cPromethium Pickaxe&r and &6Promethium Axe&r represent the highest tier of Oritech equipment, requiring Promethium Ingots from the Atomic Forge."]
	quest.3D1DE77C9F5606F7.title: "Promethium Tools"
	quest.3D41D0092D94636B.title: "The Flames of &9The Otherworld&r"
	quest.3D45A7056A783591.quest_desc: ["Yeah besides those flying, burning, freezing and lightning monsters we also have sea serpents :D. They are easier to defeat, especially if you force them to jump on land. Sadly you won't be able to tame those ones, they only listen to the seas."]
	quest.3D82F9E035BE899E.quest_subtitle: "Say my name"
	quest.3D8E75FBD89040AA.quest_desc: ["&eAlmost every machine&r in &9Ender IO&r requires a &acapacitor&r to function, simply make one and put it &cinside the machine&r to run it."]
	quest.3D9A982B63582765.quest_subtitle: "The Ultimate Singularity"
	quest.3D9A982B63582765.title: "&5&l&oOne to rule them all"
	quest.3DA004149051AEF6.quest_desc: [
		"The &cconduit probe&r has &etwo modes&r that can be switch through by pressing&l Y&r."
		""
		"the first mode, &cprobe,&r is used to &lRight-Click&r a few types of &cconduits,&r &lRight-Clicking&r on an &aenergy&r or &credstone&r &cconduit&r provides &binformation&r about it, while the &bitem conduit&r runs a &6simulation&r on the item in your &aother hand&r running through its system. "
		""
		"The second mode, &eCopy and paste&r, allows you to &lShift-Right-Click&r on an &cconduit&r to &6copy&r its &bsettings&r and &lRight-Click&r to &epaste&r the &bsettings&r in another &cconduit.&r"
	]
	quest.3DA71E83EE2BAB7C.quest_desc: [
		"The &bCell Workbench&r is used to &apartition&r cells to hold specific items, creating a &dwhitelist filter&r. It also allows cells to be upgraded with cards like the &bInverter Card&r, which changes the whitelist to a &ablacklist&r."
		""
		"Additionally, cells can have their &apriority&r adjusted via the workbench, determining if they receive items first or wait until higher-priority cells are filled."
	]
	quest.3DB4820E671C641B.quest_desc: ["&9Avaritia&r returns, &ereforged&r and &cdeadlier.&r This isn't just endgame anymore. It's &dbeyond endgame&r. Brace yourself."]
	quest.3DB4DABA9BB774C8.quest_desc: ["The &aDamage Module&r increases the damage done by your weapons."]
	quest.3DBDD509A49CDBF4.quest_subtitle: "“Unlimited energy, unlimited potential.”"
	quest.3DC75B276FB694C9.quest_desc: [
		"The Gag mod introduces an item that passively accumulates time while in your inventory."
		""
		"You can use this stored time to accelerate block processes, such as speeding up furnaces or crop growth."
		""
		"Right-clicking a block with the bundle increases its tick rate, with each successive click doubling the speed but requiring more stored time."
	]
	quest.3DD5BCC22C6E2115.quest_desc: ["A &ccursed blade&r dropped from the&d underzleaot&r, you can use this in &6occult rituals&r."]
	quest.3DE2A8EB8E71BD98.quest_desc: ["This book can hold them most &dpowerful&r spell modifiers in this mod, oh yeah cast with &lRight-click&r btw, probobly should have told you that in the begining."]
	quest.3DE753D68B8335C8.quest_desc: ["A structural block used to define the boundaries of a spatial storage area. When arranged in a cube formation around a region, they allow Spatial I/O Ports to capture or deploy that space using Spatial Storage Cells. Acts as both a marker and stabilizer for dimensional storage operations."]
	quest.3DF6354F7AC8D4A4.quest_desc: ["Increases&c machine overclock &rwhile &binside it.&r"]
	quest.3DF8B525061EC953.quest_desc: ["After placing this inside the &eCurio slot&r in your&b inventory&r, it will provide &eenergy&r to your &cdraconic evolution&r."]
	quest.3E1695A1D5FA81AD.quest_desc: ["A signal device that controls movement with red, yellow, and green lights. It’s perfect for managing automated transport systems or adding realism to city and road builds."]
	quest.3E16CF590C911129.quest_desc: ["This is your main method of generating pressure. Feed it coal or other burnables to produce compressed air. Be careful too much pressure can be dangerous!"]
	quest.3E2A411FF5B4B0E7.quest_desc: [
		"An advanced rune created via &dEnchanting Infusion&r of a standard Spawner Rune."
		""
		"Requires an enchanting setup with at least:"
		"• &bArcana: 50%&r"
		"• &aEterna: 70%&r"
		"• &cQuanta: 30%&r"
		""
		"Used for higher-tier runes such as Summit & Pinnacle upgrades and the Ignore Players rune."
	]
	quest.3E2A411FF5B4B0E7.title: "Infused Spawner Rune"
	quest.3E301F3EEC8C763A.quest_desc: ["This Block vastly speed up Baby Bee growth. It requires Power and 20 Honey Treats to operate!"]
	quest.3E3CBDCEAB0FF28F.quest_desc: [
		"Training a Data Model can be done in one of two ways, with a Deep Learner or with a Simulation Chamber. "
		""
		"The deep learner allows you to store a few data models within, and kills you receive will begin to train the model. "
		""
		"All models start out in the Faulty state, and must be trained up to Basic in the deep learner."
	]
	quest.3E4DE91429668E5B.quest_desc: ["Another rocket that allows you to reach more planets"]
	quest.3E4E7CA872010D5D.quest_desc: [
		"Also has &lRight-Click&r functions, though &dmore potent&r and have &abetter stats&r."
		""
		"You can also craft the &6Morningstar&r and &cKatar&r which is crafted with the &cred matter&r &ctools,&r they will act like a &6multitool&r based on what tools where used to craft them."
		""
		"All of the tools &dnever break&r."
	]
	quest.3E555B364FD88B43.quest_desc: [
		"&bGrowth accelerators&r are placed &ebelow plants&r to &aspeed up growth&r of &ethat plant&r, &ceach tier&r has a different &9\"Range\"&r of how far down you can place it, the &6more accelerators you place&r below the &cfaster&r that &aplant grows&r. "
		"(the &9range&r is basically how many can place below the plant.)"
	]
	quest.3E5F5337378F85A2.quest_subtitle: "With the sleeping bag you can sleep wherever you want without setting the spawn."
	quest.3E5F5337378F85A2.title: "Sleeping bags"
	quest.3E671B3A7EAE23C1.quest_desc: ["The most simple &dspell book&r in this mod, opened with &6C&r You can make custom &dspells&r by choosing a &bForm&r, &aEffects&r, and even &cAugments&r later, you can make amazing things, let your &dcreativity&r run wild!"]
	quest.3E890BABC4C41370.quest_desc: ["Because of the Controller limit, you'll probably end up wanting to connect different systems to your main hub without a billion cables connecting them. \\\\n \\\\n This is done using &6Network Transmitters&r and &6Receivers&r. \\\\n \\\\n &9Transmitters&r should be connected to your main system, wherever your Controller is. \\\\n \\\\n The &9Receiver&r should go wherever you want your external network to be. For example, this can be a separate part of your base where you have Bees, a mob farm, etc. \\\\n \\\\n To connect the Receiver to your main network, you'll need to use a &eNetwork Card&r. To bind the Network Card, right-click on the Network Receiver, and then place the Network Card into the Network Transmitter that is attached to your main system."]
	quest.3E890BABC4C41370.quest_subtitle: "Wirelessly Connecting Networks!"
	quest.3E890BABC4C41370.title: "Grid Networks"
	quest.3E9C362382A9B36A.quest_desc: [
		"The &bShape Card (Pump)&r is a variant of the &bShape Card&r in &5RFTools&r that allows the &bBuilder&r to pump liquids from a defined area."
		""
		"This card is useful for draining lakes, emptying pools, or collecting large amounts of liquid for storage."
	]
	quest.3EC9D0DA61B45328.quest_desc: [
		"A &6Gas-Burning Generator&r creates power by consuming any burnable gas for example the &3Hydrogen&r produced by an &aElectrolytic Separator&r or &7Ethylene&r."
		""
		"The &6Gas-Burning Generator&r has its own internal storage tank with a capacity of &o&b18,000&r units. &9Gas Tanks&r can be used to expand the &3Hydrogen&r storage capacity of your system."
		""
		"&4Note&r: &3Hydrogen&r is burned at a maximum rate of &o&b256 mB/t&r, generating up to &o&b20,480 RF/t&r, and &7Ethylene&r is burned at a maximum rate of &o&b6.4 mB/t&r, generating up to &o&b72,192 RF/t&r. So, burning &3Hydrogen&r will not produce more power than it costs to run an &6Electrolytic Separator&r. Use for &7Ethylene&r instead."
	]
	quest.3EC9D0DA61B45328.quest_subtitle: "Burn Gases into Power!"
	quest.3F249BE37B1BB214.quest_desc: [
		"This mod adds hidden infinite ore veins to your world. You can extract these ores using machines. This mod requires Create"
		""
		"Features:"
		""
		"Adds hidden ore veins and fluid reservoirs that has a random chance to spawn in a chunk. Only one ore vein can exist in each chunk"
		""
		"The veins are infinite"
		""
		"Harvest the ores using Drilling Machine, and Fluid Extractor"
		""
		"The machines are powered by Rotational Force"
		""
		"Use the 'Ore Vein Finder' item to find ore veins and fluid reservoirs"
	]
	quest.3F28748E2A3794ED.quest_desc: ["You are making progress, &agood,&r but you must &6improve.&r"]
	quest.3F2E1DC279182965.quest_desc: [
		"Handles cryogenic synthesis and extreme sub-zero metallurgy."
		""
		"Build the frame with Quantum Hyper Mechanical Casings, Blue Ice cores, and a Stellar Field Generator Mk.I. Place an ME Massive Fluid Hatch for coolant and an FE Energy Hatch directly next to the controller."
	]
	quest.3F2E1DC279182965.quest_subtitle: "Sub-Zero Thermal Metallurgy"
	quest.3F2E1DC279182965.title: "Quantum Cryoforge"
	quest.3F5010269469EBE0.quest_desc: [
		"The inside of the reactor is built up of pillars using several &9Fission Fuel Assembly&r blocks, with a single &eControl Rod Assembly&r placed at the top of each pillar. These can be anywhere from &b&o1&r to &b&o15&r blocks in height, depending on the size of the reactor."
		""
		"For this build, we'll put &b&o2&r of the &9Fission Fuel Assemblies&r in the &ncenter&r of our multiblock, and then put the &eControl Rod Assembly&r right on top of it."
	]
	quest.3F5010269469EBE0.title: "Fuel Control"
	quest.3F657CF4EBDDC3C4.quest_desc: ["Used to generate plastic, a key component in plastic making. Can be automated with Mystical Agriculture."]
	quest.3F7A85FF551781EA.quest_desc: [
		"The &bTablet&r in &5RFTools&r is a portable device that allows you to monitor and interact with your network from anywhere."
		""
		"To use the &bTablet&r:"
		"1. &n&bRight-click&r the tablet to open its &6GUI&r."
		"2. Insert &dmodules&r into the tablet to access different functionalities (e.g., &aStorage Module&r, &bText Module&r)."
		"3. Configure each module in the &6GUI&r to link with your network."
		"4. The tablet will display the configured data, allowing you to monitor and control your network &bon the go&r."
	]
	quest.3F85C2E198ACEE74.title: "Upgrading your pickaxe"
	quest.3F8EEE1AD4420702.quest_desc: ["The 64k Storage Disk can store 64000 items."]
	quest.3F8EEE1AD4420702.title: "&b64k Storage Part&r"
	quest.3F925BFD3CF1DC0B.quest_subtitle: "Used to increase the range of the wireless access point."
	quest.3F9CCCFEF4E84166.quest_desc: ["Helps manage excess heat in thermal systems. Place these to dissipate heat and maintain optimal operation temperatures."]
	quest.3FAD086F7D9CCAE9.quest_desc: ["To connect the Receiver to your main network, you'll need to use a &eNetwork Card&r. To bind the Network Card, right-click on the Network Receiver, and then place the Network Card into the Network Transmitter that is attached to your main system."]
	quest.3FAD086F7D9CCAE9.quest_subtitle: "Distant Networking"
	quest.3FAD086F7D9CCAE9.title: "Transmitter"
	quest.3FAD179E1ABC2039.quest_desc: ["Used in &6crafting&r the &0thornwood&r &0sapling&r amoung other things. "]
	quest.3FBC56547DA80C0E.quest_subtitle: "But why tho?"
	quest.3FC002E5A6C08DCC.quest_desc: [
		"The Simple Magnets mod introduces items that automatically attract nearby items and experience orbs to the player. "
		""
		"It features two main magnets:"
		""
		"&4Basic Magnet&f: Attracts items and experience within a 5-block radius."
		""
		"&2Advanced Magnet&f: Offers a configurable range and filtering options, allowing for more precise control over which items are attracted."
		""
		""
		"Additionally, the mod includes &dDemagnetization Coils&f, which create areas where magnets are ineffective, preventing unwanted attraction of items in specific zones."
	]
	quest.3FC002E5A6C08DCC.title: "Magnet"
	quest.3FC7FDAF84871963.quest_desc: [
		"&2Turbine Coils&r are blocks placed around the end of the &9Turbine Shaft&r, closest to the &eHousing&r block roof."
		""
		"These are &nrequired&r to generate power from the turbine. You can have up to &o&b3&r coils per turbine, and &o&bcan mix and match different coil&r blocks."
	]
	quest.3FC7FDAF84871963.title: "Turbine Coils"
	quest.3FCBC107DC9DA4F9.quest_desc: ["A better &esolar panel &rthen the two before it."]
	quest.3FCC4625C89D279C.quest_desc: ["&cA lot more storage.&c&r"]
	quest.3FD801D7DE9176FB.quest_desc: ["The 4k Storage Disk can store 4000 items."]
	quest.3FD801D7DE9176FB.title: "&e4k Storage Part&r"
	quest.3FDA0D970B6C6227.quest_desc: [
		"A redstone control device that emits a &esignal strength&r based on &5ME Network&r conditions. Can monitor:"
		""
		"&bItem quantities&r (e.g. emit when <64 iron)"
		""
		"&6Energy levels&r (emit when power <25%)"
		""
		"&dCrafting status&r (active jobs)"
		""
		"Key Use:"
		""
		"Controls &9automatic factories&r via redstone"
		""
		"Pairs with &cExport Buses&r for smart restocking"
		""
		"Configurable with &eME Storage Monitor&r"
		""
		"*(The &b\"if-then\" brain&r for AE2 automation!)*"
		""
		"&aRedstone meets quantum computing&r"
	]
	quest.3FDA0D970B6C6227.title: "&5ME Level Emitter&r"
	quest.3FE03140AF69D284.quest_desc: ["Created with &0Dark matter&r and &eAeternalis fuel&r, you will use this to create even &cstronger&r &atools&r and &barmor.&r"]
	quest.3FFF9018DA2A2763.quest_desc: [
		"Once we start burning up &3Fissile Fuel&r in the &6Reactor&r, we'll get heated &bCoolant&r and &8Nuclear Waste&r."
		""
		"This is where the &4Radiation&r kicks in. As long as it stays &b&osafely in some container or machine&r, you won't have any spills... right?"
		""
		"The best way to store any &4Radioactive&r substance is using a &2Radioactive Waste Barrel&r. These will safely store the waste, while slowly decaying the gas without causing a &4Radiation&r spill. You don't want your &8Nuclear Waste&r sitting in your &6Reactor&r as it causes it to produce more heat, so set a port to output &8Waste&r and ship it to a barrel!"
		""
		"&cImportant Note&r: Breaking &nany&r machine, barrel, pipe, or &nanything&r that has a &4Radioactive&r gas inside of it &nwill cause a Radiation leak&r. That includes the products of &8Nuclear Waste&r, like &5Polonium&r or &ePlutonium&r."
	]
	quest.3FFF9018DA2A2763.title: "&8Nuclear Waste"
	quest.40096ED0B04C3EC5.quest_desc: ["Applying the &9Ignore Conditions Spawner Rune&r bypasses terrain, collision, and biome requirements (such as animals needing grass blocks to spawn)."]
	quest.40096ED0B04C3EC5.title: "Ignore Conditions Rune"
	quest.40148704F9175B05.quest_desc: ["&cExpensive armor&r with &dspecial abilities!&r"]
	quest.40148704F9175B05.title: "Nano Armor"
	quest.4016DCA58E347F31.quest_desc: ["&eBinder&r is used to craft &cconduits,&r which are like &bpipes,&r to &6transport fluids&r, &epower,&r &dand more&r! Plus &cconduits&r from &dEnder IO&r can be placed&e inside each other.&r"]
	quest.40189B0631062098.quest_desc: ["Welcome to the Rise of Be.. I mean Ice and Fire! Since the fall of the Obsidian Kingdom dragons have started to dominate the overworld. Their scales are harder than metal, their fire burns whole civilizations and their hunger? Immeasurable. Now it is your time to bring the end of this catastrophy. The Overworld needs your help. Gear up and arise Dragon Master!"]
	quest.40392CF41E5B333F.quest_desc: [
		"The &aGenerator&r is a device that produces energy for your machinery and systems."
		""
		"Features of the &aGenerator&r:"
		"&6-&r Converts various fuel sources into &benergy&r."
		"&6-&r Can be connected to energy storage devices and machines."
		"&6-&r Essential for powering your base and automated systems."
	]
	quest.405369118613F935.quest_desc: ["It boosts &aEterna&r and &dArcana&r with an good Max"]
	quest.405A318D640D514E.quest_desc: [
		"The blast stove can take in furnace gas, so your furnace can be self sufficient without sacrificing more coal to make creosote."
		""
		"Place a hatch on top of the furnace hole to collect the gas."
	]
	quest.405B74B7CD6314C9.quest_desc: [
		"Used to perform &crituals&r with ritual &7tablets&r and &dsource&r. Simply &lRight-Click&r with the &7tablet&r of the &critual&r you want to start it, then click it with an &nempty hand&r to activate it. Some &crituals&r can be agumented with &lRight-Click&r of the necessary item."
		""
		"             &o Familiars next page&r"
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"If you use a &8tablet of binding&r on a &critual brazier&r with a tamable &acreature&r from this mod (i.e a Starbuckle, Amethyst golem, or Wixie) It will turn the creature into a &dbound script&r."
		""
		"&dBound Scripts&r can be used as a &aGlyph&r for use in spells to summon the creature you turned as a &bfamiliar&r, these &bfamiliar&r have special effects and abilities."
	]
	quest.407EFAF528871014.quest_desc: [
		"To start breaking down &9water&r, we'll need a &nwater source&r."
		""
		"The &2Kitchen Sink&r provides &ninfinite water&r, and can easily be set up to pump out &9water&r."
		""
		"Of course you can always use the &oclassic&r infinite water source with a &ePump&r from &dMekanism&r."
		""
		"Pump the water into your &aElectrolytic Separator&r to split the water into &3Hydrogen&r and &7Oxygen&r."
	]
	quest.407EFAF528871014.title: "&9Infinite Water Source"
	quest.407FBBE12EA9ED9B.quest_desc: ["A high-performance engine component built to handle intense pressure from diesel combustion. It delivers strong and efficient power output, perfect for heavy-duty machinery and advanced automation setups."]
	quest.40915337B7E427F8.quest_desc: ["A powerful &9SV cable,&r abable of &cpowering machines&r from&a all mods.&r"]
	quest.40952B7721569DE2.quest_desc: ["The &dbest&r of the &dbest,&r &6no one can match you&r."]
	quest.40952B7721569DE2.quest_subtitle: "Turns trees into dust. Turns enemies into memories."
	quest.40A6F41B5B02D9E4.quest_desc: [
		"Automation machines for base management:"
		""
		"- &aTree Feller&r: Automatically chops down entire trees."
		"- &cBlock Destroyer&r: Mines blocks in a configurable area."
		"- &9Drone Port&r: Moves items and fluids over unlimited distance using animated drones! Bind Takeoff Port and Landing Port with the Target Designator. Place ports at least 50 blocks apart."
	]
	quest.40A6F41B5B02D9E4.title: "Automation: Tree Feller, Block Destroyer, Drone Ports"
	quest.40BEBD299B406E1A.quest_desc: ["A versatile machine that converts rotational or kinetic energy into electricity. Essential for powering electrical systems, machinery, and automated setups efficiently."]
	quest.40F1315207ADEB80.quest_subtitle: "Allows you to cut and paste any type of build"
	quest.40F634AC38F42B88.quest_desc: ["Basic Pressure Tubes are used to connect pneumatic machines. They transfer compressed air but can be fragile at high pressures."]
	quest.40F8FF1E85694FD4.quest_desc: ["Obtained by putting a Copper Sheet in a Rolling Mill."]
	quest.40F8FF1E85694FD4.quest_subtitle: "Crafting component."
	quest.410077C7B973F318.quest_desc: [
		"Made at an &denchanting apparatus&r with &egold armour&r and &dmagebloom fiber&r, can be imbued with &bthread&r, the higher tier armour the higher tier and more quantity of &bthreads&r you can add, you can increase the tier of your armour in the &denchanting apparatus&r."
		""
		"To apply the &bthread&r, place the armour piece you want to upgrade in an &eAlteration table&r then &lRight-Click&r with the &bthread&r you want to add, &lRight_Click&r the &bthread&r while your armour is in the table to remove that thread."
	]
	quest.4101F8275B41C79B.quest_desc: ["The 1k Storage Disk can store 1000 items."]
	quest.4101F8275B41C79B.title: "&61k Storage Part&r"
	quest.411C46F666CE2E79.quest_desc: ["The &aLarge Shield Capacity Module&r increases your Energy Shield but takes up less space in your grid of modules."]
	quest.413C2915D27F0D99.quest_desc: ["At first glance, it's just a harmless holiday treat. But down here? It's, sticky, and slightly cursed."]
	quest.4181323BF72047A9.quest_desc: [
		"Rightclick a valid conductor with a schedule to give it to them. A conductor must either be a mob Seated directly in front of Train Controls on an assembled Train or a Blaze Burner positioned similarly."
		""
		"3 types of commands can be added."
		""
		"Travel to Station - Navigate to a specified Train Station."
		"Update Schedule Title&r - Name of route as displayed by the Train Station summary in the Display Link."
		"Limit Max Speed - Change max speed when traveling to a station."
	]
	quest.4189BC3DFB551F4C.quest_desc: [
		"If you've built the &9Industrial Turbine&r properly, you will see &cred&r particles around the structure. &eRight clicking&r on the &9Turbine&r will open up the &ainterface&r."
		""
		"This will tell you all of the &binformation&r that you need to know, including the total &7Steam Flow Rate&r, as well as the total &bSteam&r inside of the &9Turbine&r."
		""
		"On the right, you will have a bar that shows you the &cPower&r that is stored inside of the &9Turbine&r. If this gets full, the &9Turbine&r will turn &coff&r, unless you set it to &3Vent Overflow&r."
		""
		"Let's get it running!"
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Once you have a fully functioning &6Fission Reactor&r, pump out the &bSteam&r directly into a &dTurbine Valve&r on your &9Turbine&r. Since we're using &2Saturating Condensers&r in this build, you can pump out &1Water&r from a &3Turbine Vent&r back into your &6Reactor&r if you want. "
		""
	]
	quest.4189BC3DFB551F4C.title: "&9Completed Industrial Turbine"
	quest.419BBE875D40B1D6.quest_desc: [
		"The ME Export Bus extracts items from the ME Network's Networked Storage and places them into the inventory it faces."
		""
		"You must configure which items it will insert, leaving the configuration blank will result in nothing."
		""
		"The ME Export Bus will try to export any of the items on its list skipping over those it cannot fit into the destination."
		""
		"The ME Export Bus&r requires a Channel to function."
		""
		"This is the functional opposite of the ME Import Bus."
	]
	quest.419DD6FE84B91749.quest_subtitle: "Mixes the matching genes"
	quest.41A3DDA294728106.quest_desc: [
		"Create Stuff 'N Additions is a mod that uses the resources of Create to offer a new set of equipment, tools and gadget! "
		""
		"Equipments that increase your physical abilities (Your Strength or Mining Speed) but also give you new ways to move like floating, bouncing and even flying! Depending on your type of equipment (brass, andesite or copper) you will need different fuels such as steam (using water and fuel), heat energy (using fuel) or hydraulic energy (using water)! "
		""
		"This mod also adds a lot of recipes that make certain Minecraft items (Chainmail Armor, Coral, Netherrack, Crying Obsidian and Magma Cream...) craftable with the new ways added by Create such as haunting and filling!"
	]
	quest.41AED1C20749E824.quest_desc: ["&bA lot more storage.&b&r"]
	quest.41D1344A31FEA6DF.quest_desc: ["Used in replacing the &emiddle section&r of the &celectric blast furnace&r to upgrade it. Make sure to change the&b furnace menu&r settings to use them."]
	quest.41E91ED150046688.quest_subtitle: "You can use Mystical Agriculture!"
	quest.41EB0C570FC54F43.quest_desc: [
		"&aChemical Tanks&r are used to store &7Gases&r."
		""
		"They can be placed as a block and can interact with &dPressurized Tubes&r."
		""
		"They come in the four tiers, each tier being double the capacity and output rate of its predecessor."
	]
	quest.41F93E64432175D5.quest_desc: ["Store large amounts of fluid in a single block. Stack them up for even more capacity practical and good looking."]
	quest.41F93E64432175D5.quest_subtitle: "The Tank is a 3x3x5 multi-block used for storing liquids"
	quest.41F93E64432175D5.title: "&aTank"
	quest.4204702AA6FBF40B.quest_desc: [
		"The Chargepad is a wireless electric charging station. Any rechargeable items you have in your inventory will be charged while standing on it."
		""
		"The Chargepad can recharge any item that requires any form of energy. It also functions as the deployment and teleportation point for your Robit."
	]
	quest.42125A0E7E0AAFAF.quest_desc: [
		"Forged from White Dwarf alloys and graviton casings, &bUFO Armor&r offers near invulnerability and includes internal sockets for upgrade cards."
		""
		"Put the armor on, then craft blank upgrade cards to install flight, regeneration, and utility modules."
	]
	quest.42125A0E7E0AAFAF.title: "UFO Armor"
	quest.421851D4D39910DB.quest_desc: [
		"Affects the bee’s max health."
		""
		"The best being Strong."
	]
	quest.421851D4D39910DB.title: "Endurance"
	quest.42195C45933ACA1E.quest_desc: ["Welcome to Create: Central Kitchen, a mod offering more tools and methods to automate food processing for other mods in Create."]
	quest.421EA2CE61003DA1.quest_desc: ["Allows the player to fly, move and swim faster. Works with fuel."]
	quest.4236B9F071BE18F3.quest_desc: [
		"The Rotary Condensentrator (pronounced \"con-DEN-sen-traitor\") is used for converting substances between liquid and gaseous forms at a rate of 1:1. It has two modes: Decondensentrating, which turns Liquids into Gases, and Condensentrating, which turns Gases into Liquids."
		""
		"In Decondensentrating mode:"
		""
		"Liquid→Gas"
		"Water→Water Vapor"
		"Liquid Sulfuric Acid→Sulfuric Acid"
		"Liquid Hydrogen Chloride→Hydrogen Chloride"
		"Liquid Oxygen→Oxygen"
		"Liquid Hydrogen→Hydrogen"
		"Liquid Ethylene→Ethylene"
		"Liquid Chlorine→Chlorine"
		"Liquid Sulfur Dioxide→Sulfur Dioxide"
		"Liquid Sulfur Trioxide→Sulfur Trioxide"
		"Brine→Gaseous Brine"
		"Liquid Lithium→Lithium"
		"and the opposite is true in Condensentrating mode."
		""
		"Extract liquids with Mechanical Pipe by setting them to \"pull\" (use a Configurator and Shift+Right click the outer edges of the pipe)."
	]
	quest.4266BF7FCE3B4330.quest_desc: [
		"The Cogwheel is a basic mechanical component in Create that relays rotation."
		"The Large Cogwheel is a larger variant of the cogwheel that can relay rotation around corners and power Rotation Speed Controllers."
	]
	quest.4266BF7FCE3B4330.title: "Cogwheels"
	quest.4276B941670CE0E2.quest_desc: [
		"P2P tunnels are a way to move things like items, fluids, redstone signals, power, light, and channels around a network without them directly interacting with the network. There are many variants of P2P tunnel but each only transports its specific type of thing. They essentially act like portals that directly connect two block faces at range. They are not bi-directional, there are defined inputs and outputs."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"There are many types of P2P tunnel. Only the ME P2P tunnel is directly craftable, the others are made by right-clicking other P2P tunnels with certain items:"
		""
		"ME P2P tunnels are selected by right-clicking with any cable."
		"Redstone P2P tunnels are selected by right-clicking with a variety of redstone components."
		"Item P2P tunnels are selected by right-clicking with a chest or hopper."
		"Fluid P2P tunnels are selected by right-clicking with a bucket or bottle."
		"Energy P2P tunnels are selected by right-clicking with almost any energy-containing item."
		"Light P2P tunnels are selected by right-clicking with a torch or glowstone"
		"Some tunnel types have quirks. For instance, ME P2P tunnels' channels cannot pass through other ME P2P tunnels, and Energy P2P tunnels indirectly extract a 2.5% tax on FE flowing through themselves by increasing their energy draw."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"The most common use case of P2P tunnels is using a ME P2P tunnel to compact the density of channel transport. Instead of a bundle of dense cable, a single dense cable can be used to carry many channels around."
	]
	quest.4291A72FF87220D5.quest_desc: [
		"There is also an inverted version of the toggle bus that &ndisables&r the connection when a &credstone&r signal is supplied."
		""
		"When &credstone&r signal supplied the part &nenables&r the connection, &6ME Inverted Toggle Bus&r provides the &nreverse&r behavior by &ndisabling&r the connection instead."
	]
	quest.42951D14ADCD9332.quest_desc: ["Delicious and satisfying! A recipe created using PneumaticCraft’s food processing chain. Not just tasty—this also demonstrates machine integration."]
	quest.42A3D1BBCF05AEF9.quest_desc: ["Has &einfinite storage&r for a &bliquid&r."]
	quest.42BF0D7E017F718B.quest_desc: ["A vibrant purple crystal used as a core component in AE2 recipes. Naturally generates in the world but can also be crafted by combining Certus Quartz, Redstone, and Nether Quartz in water."]
	quest.42D6CC67AB29D7DA.quest_desc: ["A more &bexpensive item&r used in &6crafting.&r"]
	quest.42D7C8CD8E6F5CD7.quest_desc: [
		"Applying the &5Summit Spawner Upgrade Rune&r upgrades the spawner's core stats to Tier 3:"
		""
		"• &eMin Spawn Delay:&r 50 ticks (2.5s)"
		"• &eMax Spawn Delay:&r 200 ticks (10s)"
		"• &bSpawn Count:&r 13 mobs"
		"• &cMax Nearby Entities:&r 24"
		"• &dPlayer Activation Range:&r 40 blocks"
	]
	quest.42D7C8CD8E6F5CD7.title: "Tier III: Summit Upgrade Rune"
	quest.42DF944251E8538F.quest_desc: ["It condenses &9pure neutron energy&r from the &0void,&r one particle at a time. &cHigher tiers&r mean faster &ageneration&r and more &dmadness.&r This will &epassively&r generate &9Neu&9trons&r&r over a long period of time."]
	quest.42F50CE7FE715583.quest_desc: [" "]
	quest.42F50CE7FE715583.title: "&aUpgrading Our Magical Storage&r"
	quest.430475E11D259B74.quest_desc: [
		"The Stone Smeltery is where the Stone Smelter will smelt cobblestone into stone, stone bricks into cracked stone bricks, clay balls into bricks, clay blocks into terracotta, terracotta into glazed terracotta, all types of stone into all types of smooth stone, and logs into charcoal. They can also pop chorus fruits! "
		""
		"Be sure to teach the Stone Smelter recipes needed by your colony. Also, be sure to set a fuel type. "
	]
	quest.430475E11D259B74.quest_subtitle: "Build a Stone Smelter"
	quest.436231715C11E3BA.quest_desc: ["Scattered across the wilds, small bands of Illagers set up camp beneath their distinctive purple tents. Though their supplies are meager and their loot scarce, their presence is a warning, the Illagers’ reach grows wider with every outpost."]
	quest.436231715C11E3BA.quest_subtitle: "Find an Illager Campsite"
	quest.4378B53C7BB2D518.quest_desc: [
		"To begin generating massive amounts"
		"of power, &aShift + Right-Click&r an &eEternal"
		"Generator&r with an &5Motorola&r to link"
		"them. Once linked, place the &5Motorola&r"
		"into a &4Pandora's Box&r."
		""
		"The &4Pandora's Box&r will then bleed off"
		"the \"overload\" from all linked Eternal"
		"&9Generators&r every minute. Each unit of"
		"overload grants a permanent"
		"generation increase of &e1 FE/t&r."
		"Additionally, you can further boost"
		"energy production by supplying XP"
		"directly into the &4Pandora's Box&r."
	]
	quest.4378B53C7BB2D518.quest_subtitle: "Can generate up to BILLIONS of RF/t"
	quest.439600B9E9FC5C6E.quest_desc: ["Construction Sticks allow you to place multiple blocks at once, up to 1024 at a time, extending your build in the direction you're facing. You can upgrade your stick to enhance its abilities, making construction faster and more efficient."]
	quest.439600B9E9FC5C6E.title: "Construction sticks"
	quest.439AB4ACFC0FF768.title: "Faster Rituals"
	quest.439C6C61A5263D31.quest_desc: [
		"Go to the Bedrock level."
		""
		"Place a obsidian above it, leaving one block space in between."
		""
		"Throw as much redstone dust in the gap left by the Bedrock and Obsidian as you want."
		""
		"Left-click the Obsidian. The Obsidian will crush the Redstone Dust against the Bedrock and create Flux!"
	]
	quest.439C6C61A5263D31.quest_subtitle: "Flux Networks lets you send, receive, and store energy across dimensions without cables."
	quest.439C6C61A5263D31.title: "&fFlux"
	quest.439D48E9647FC8C2.quest_desc: ["Boils &9water&r into &bsteam,&r can be filled with a bucket or &epipes.&r"]
	quest.43ABE0538875B85B.quest_desc: [
		"The &bMatter Transmitter&r is a &n&cteleportation device&r in &5RFTools&r that allows players to instantly &dtravel&r between different &4locations&r and &9dimensions&r."
		""
		"To use the &bMatter Transmitter&r, place it in your world and link it to a &6Matter Receiver&r by &n&bright-clicking&r the receiver with a &bSmart Wrench&r. &n&bRight-click&r the transmitter to open its &6GUI&r, where you can select the &9destination receiver&r."
		""
		"Once configured, stand on the &btransmitter pad&r and activate it to be &4teleported&r to the linked &6receiver&r. This device is essential for &n&ffast travel&r and efficient &abase management&r, especially in large or &dmulti-dimensional setups&r."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"The &6Matter Receiver&r is a &n&dteleportation endpoint&r in &5RFTools&r that works in conjunction with the &bMatter Transmitter&r to enable &ainstant travel&r across &9locations&r and &cdimensions&r."
		""
		"To use the &6Matter Receiver&r, place it in your world and configure it to link with a &bMatter Transmitter&r. &n&bRight-click&r the receiver with a &bSmart Wrench&r to link it to the transmitter. You can also give the receiver a unique name for easy identification."
		""
		"When a &bMatter Transmitter&r sends a player, they will arrive at the configured &6Matter Receiver&r. This setup is ideal for creating &dteleportation networks&r, allowing for &n&fast and efficient travel&r between different points in your world."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"The &eDialing Device&r in &5RFTools&r is a &n&ccontrol unit&r for managing connections between &bMatter Transmitters&r and &6Matter Receivers&r."
		""
		"To use the &eDialing Device&r, place it in your world and connect it to both your &bMatter Transmitter&r and &6Matter Receiver&r using &9energy cables&r. &n&bRight-click&r the &eDialing Device&r to open its &6GUI&r, where you can see a list of all available &6Matter Receivers&r and their respective &9coordinates&r."
		""
		"Select the desired &6Matter Receiver&r from the list and press the &n&bdial&r button to establish a connection. The &eDialing Device&r allows you to &ddynamically control&r your teleportation network, making it easy to switch destinations and manage multiple receivers."
	]
	quest.43B97CC9BC94CD24.quest_subtitle: "Allows you to fly freely in cost of RF."
	quest.43D2DA2B87AADDF5.quest_desc: ["Your main tool for rituals is chalk. There are 16 chalks in total used for different rituals. To obtain the chalk, simply throw its impure version in the &dSpiritfire.&r"]
	quest.43D2DA2B87AADDF5.quest_subtitle: "Your First Chalk"
	quest.43D2DA2B87AADDF5.title: "Basics"
	quest.43D31DAC4737005E.quest_subtitle: "Byproduct of coke oven"
	quest.43DB398322EF99BD.quest_desc: ["Allows you to create &dspecial alloys&r using &cmetals.&r"]
	quest.43E02E5DBDE6F0D2.quest_desc: ["An industrial structure used to safely burn excess gases and byproducts. It helps manage waste output in large-scale factories, ensuring cleaner and more efficient production systems."]
	quest.43E216268701FCD6.quest_desc: ["The 16384k Fluid Storage Part is used to craft the 16384k Fluid Storage Disk."]
	quest.43E4EE94BB396A7C.quest_desc: ["Used to make rods and wires."]
	quest.43E8912CB307E421.quest_desc: ["Great! We can store items virtually, but how do we see what is on the network? \\\\n \\\\n To access the system, you'll need to create a &9Grid&r. The Grid is the most basic form of 'Display' for the items in your inventory."]
	quest.43E8912CB307E421.title: "Accessing Our Network Storage"
	quest.43EF5513A1C52A37.quest_desc: ["A multi functional machine that combines heat and pressure to create complex products like Plastic, Yeast, or Vegetable Oil."]
	quest.43F28CD6CB3D6523.title: "&eAdvanced Crafting&r"
	quest.43FBFDBCDB69E7EE.quest_desc: [
		"The &ePortable Teleporter&r is a player kept teleportation device."
		""
		"It can store power and like all &dMekanism&r teleporters, energy drain increases with the distance the player teleports to. &aRight-clicking&r with this device in hand will open a &o&bGUI&r&b similar to that of the &9Teleporter Portal&r, allowing instant travel to any &3Teleporter Portals&r that the player has set up. The &ePortable Teleporter&r is capable of multidimensional travel."
		""
		"Note that in order for the &ePortable Teleporter&r to be functional, the complete &9Teleporter Portal&r structure does not need to be built; only the &o&bTeleporter block&r must be present (and supplied with &npower&r)."
	]
	quest.441202CC380854DF.quest_desc: [
		"Similarly to the Data Entanglers, &4multi-threaders&r enable accelerators to run extra threads in separate dimensions,"
		"multiplying their co-processing power by 4. Only one of these can be placed in each quantum computer multiblock."
	]
	quest.4415C9F8DA2D7E68.quest_desc: [
		"When your &2Reinforced Reactor&r turns its coolent to &7vapor,&r you can send it to a &aturbine&r to &egenerate power&r and turn it into &bwater.&r"
		""
		"You can make &bturbines&l&r 5x5x10&r with &abasic parts&r, but much &ebigger&r with &6reinforced parts&r."
		""
		"Just like the &creactor,&r you will need to place the &bturbine&r controller in the wall."
	]
	quest.4415C9F8DA2D7E68.title: "Turbines"
	quest.442BB17AE7AC4936.quest_desc: ["A fragment of &dinfinite power&r, with more you can create the&a very best&r this &buniverse&r has to offer."]
	quest.4431F1144F0C5C0C.quest_desc: ["Crafted from &bDiamond lattice&r, this is used in a few &6crafting recipes.&r"]
	quest.4434D7B66521D69A.quest_desc: ["Pressurized Tubes are used to transport Gases."]
	quest.4434D7B66521D69A.title: "&aBasic Pressurized Tube"
	quest.445ACC0E40DB3D96.quest_desc: ["A partially assembled electrical component awaiting final processing. It’s used in crafting complete resistors and other advanced electronic parts."]
	quest.4487635C822086E0.quest_desc: ["Using &bIce shards&r from &cmars&r ore, these machine will generate &bCryofuel&r, a more efficient fuel source then &6oil.&r"]
	quest.44881E39AB1D62AA.quest_desc: ["The &9Crafter&r is how we store patterns for our Network to know how to craft items. Once a recipe is placed into the crafter, you'll be able to 'Request' an item to be crafted from your Grid. You can do this by hitting CTRL+Shift when clicking on the item you have a recipe for to bring up the crafting GUI. \\\\n \\\\n This block can also be placed facing a machine to use &6Processing Patterns&r. For example, if you point the Crafter at a Furnace, you can put a recipe inside for a recipe you need a furnace for, like smelting raw processors. As long as the crafter is attached to your system and the Furnace has an importer attached to it, the Crafter will allow you to request the smelted version of the Processor!"]
	quest.44881E39AB1D62AA.quest_subtitle: "Automated crafting!"
	quest.44881E39AB1D62AA.title: "Crafter"
	quest.4489EFA2FFA1584C.quest_desc: ["Another rocket that allows you to reach more planets"]
	quest.449C41A3AFBBE8E9.quest_desc: ["It uses Iron and Coal Coke to generate Steel Ingots and Slag. Unlike with the Improved Blast Furnace, slag may not be removed limiting its automation capabilities."]
	quest.449C41A3AFBBE8E9.title: "Crude Blast Furnace"
	quest.44B0E00B7465F278.quest_desc: ["A &dauto-repairing shield&r (at the cost of mana). Also gives &bmana regen&r and &cspell damage&r buff &nupon blocking&r."]
	quest.44B1B147CDAC4E36.quest_desc: ["This gives X-Ray vision for mobs, highlighting them from afar to make it easier to spot them."]
	quest.44CD6DD20F51123F.quest_desc: ["&lShift-Right-Click&r to &9teleport&r in the direction &eyou are looking&r at the cost of &a1,000 ui.&r"]
	quest.44D115281B0BFB75.quest_desc: ["Whispers speak of a &9flying vessel&r that hovers above the world, shimmering with strange energy. Few dare approach, for those who return tell of eerie lights, warped corridors, and guardians not of this realm. Seek it out, if you dare—and uncover the secrets hidden within its metallic shell."]
	quest.44D115281B0BFB75.quest_subtitle: "Find a Giant Mushroom"
	quest.44DA7BE0F0E3E529.quest_subtitle: "The Nether!"
	quest.44DA7BE0F0E3E529.title: "Visit The Nether"
	quest.44E8D5277063565A.quest_desc: ["A monitoring device that measures and displays the voltage within an electrical circuit. Useful for diagnosing power fluctuations and ensuring your systems run at optimal efficiency."]
	quest.4512B97451C2221F.quest_desc: ["The Mechanical Arm can take or deposit items from various blocks within a 5 block radius of where it is placed. A placed Mechanical Arm's selected blocks can be viewed by hovering over it with a Wrench. The Mechanical Arm is capable of transferring up to a stack of items at once."]
	quest.451517C833D25E1A.quest_desc: [
		"The &aFusion Crafting Core&r is the center of the multi-block Fusion Crafting setup, its purpose is to hold the item to be transformed."
		""
		"It crafts by pressing the button on the &dGUI&r or by a &cRedstone signal&r."
	]
	quest.453B1A596BE686ED.quest_desc: [
		"&eWhat Is Flux Crafting?&r"
		""
		"&eFlux Crafting&r is a high-end crafting recipe type used to automate recipes from the &eEnder Crafting Table&r."
		""
		"It is designed for &elate-game&r and &eendgame&r crafting."
		""
		"&eHow It Works&r"
		""
		"• Uses the &eFlux Package Crafter&r"
		"• Supports recipes from the &eEnder Crafting Table&r"
		"• Crafted items are &eejected&r into adjacent inventories"
		""
		"The Flux Package Crafter &crequires power&r to operate."
		""
		"&eFlux Alternators&r"
		""
		"Flux Crafting requires powered &eFlux Alternators&r."
		""
		"• Alternators must be placed within a &a7×7×7&r area"
		"• All alternators must be &apowered&r"
		"• Missing power will prevent crafting"
		""
		"&eUse Cases&r"
		""
		"• Automating Ender Crafting Table recipes"
		"• Late-game item production"
		"• High-tier PackagedAuto setups"
		"• Integration with &3AE2&r factories"
		""
		"&eWhy Use Flux Crafting?&r"
		""
		"• Enables fully automated endgame crafting"
		"• Handles extremely complex recipes"
		"• Removes manual Ender Crafting"
		"• Perfect for large-scale automation"
	]
	quest.453B1A596BE686ED.title: "&eFlux Crafting&r"
	quest.453C36B78EB4B311.quest_desc: ["&eBreak down&r &denchanted gear&r and extract valuable materials. It’s the magical version of recycling. Great for clearing out that chest of \"almost good\" loot."]
	quest.454812A6E386C6D0.quest_subtitle: "sneaky sneaky, they can't find this subtitle"
	quest.454F315FF637EA84.quest_desc: ["The high-speed pattern distribution interface for the endgame autocrafting system, feeding orders directly into connected fabrication matrices."]
	quest.454F315FF637EA84.quest_subtitle: "Instantaneous Pattern Bus"
	quest.454F315FF637EA84.title: "Quantum Pattern Hatch"
	quest.454FF6E2926163F7.quest_desc: [
		"&2Nuclear Reactor hatches&r will naturally &cheat up&r when in use, and if the&b tempurature gadge&r at the bottom of one of thier &bmenus&r is to high, it will &emelt&r the &bitems&r inside."
		""
		"&cHeat&r can be &6extracted&r naturally through the &esides&r of the &2Rector,&r or through &9fluids hatches&r making &bsteam.&r"
	]
	quest.4561FE8367CD8216.quest_desc: ["The &aProjectile Immunity Cancellation Module&r cancels enderman teleportation when you shoot them."]
	quest.456E6532B7FBA2EA.quest_subtitle: "\"The power of the sun in the palm of my hands.\""
	quest.459AA2AD67CA6AAA.quest_desc: ["Mix aluminum and crimsite."]
	quest.45B26D389684EF9B.quest_desc: ["More storage."]
	quest.45BA5B8A785E1B82.quest_desc: [
		"Using a Wrench on a component will rotate the component around the face with which you interacted."
		""
		"Using a Wrench on a component, redstone component, rail or vanilla rail variant will dismantle it and place it in your inventory. Any block which can be rotated or otherwise interacted with using right click must be dismantled while sneaking."
		""
		"Hovering over certain configurable components will allow configuration by scrolling."
		""
		"For certain components such as the Linear Chassis, ctrl can be held to configure all connected components at once."
	]
	quest.45C02BA617A092FC.quest_desc: [
		"The Pumpjack allou you to get the oil that is in the chunk."
		"First, check with the Oil Finder if oil is in the chunk. "
		""
		"Then place the Pumpjack and start pumping oil."
	]
	quest.45CEF843FA33853F.quest_desc: ["You can grab and move blocks and launch them into the air!"]
	quest.45D20904723662F8.quest_desc: [
		"You cannot replicate what you do not understand. Take your Scanner and use it on a mob (Right-Click). This will add the entity's data to your personal &a&lPlayer Index&r."
		"{image:minformax:textures/quests/scanner.png width:190 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.45D20904723662F8.quest_subtitle: "First steps"
	quest.45DDCE3FF2E6A4F8.quest_subtitle: "Pulsar Fragment mixed with Obsidian Matrix"
	quest.45F0194CF3DCA5DD.quest_desc: ["An important &eresource&r used in crafting and can be &csmelted&r for the &bsame duration&r as &cnormal coal&r&c.&r"]
	quest.45FEB8DE88CE4920.quest_desc: [
		"The &aDraconium Fusion Crafting Injector&r is the initial tier of Fusion Crafting Injectors for the Fusion crafting process."
		""
		"Place it at least &b2 blocks&r away from the &dFusion Core&r, with a maximum configuration of &b3x3&r on any side."
		""
	]
	quest.45FF08E4DB6F7F0E.quest_desc: ["An upgraded crafter that holds more patterns and has an increased crafting speed."]
	quest.45FF08E4DB6F7F0E.title: "Iron Crafter"
	quest.46004D01A142777E.quest_desc: ["Smart Fluid Pipes can be used to allow only a certain liquid to pass through them."]
	quest.462D63532B4C7D54.quest_desc: ["Reduces the cost of spells by a small amount."]
	quest.46315A83942FFE6E.quest_desc: [
		"The &aEnergy Core&r is the center of your energy ball. The &bEnergy Pylons&r are used to insert or extract energy, you need to place a &cglass block&r on top or below the pylon to activate it. The &dEnergy Core Stabilizers&r are used to stabilize your energy ball."
		""
		"You can create energy balls ranging from a &bsmall ball (Tier 1)&r to a &bgiant ball (Tier 8)&r. Higher tiers are larger and store more energy."
		""
		"Place the &dEnergy Core Stabilizers&r between &b1 block&r and &b8 blocks&r away from your energy ball."
		""
		"You can customize the color of the ball's outline in the &dGUI&r of your stabilizers."
	]
	quest.466A8F97AB868986.quest_desc: ["A more &6powerful&r version of the &avanilla&r coal also used in &bvarious&r recipes."]
	quest.469641436BC858D3.quest_desc: ["&cModern Industrialization&r is a large mod adding many machines from &bSteam&r, &eElectric&r, and &dFusion&r \"ages\""]
	quest.469641436BC858D3.title: "Modern Industrialization"
	quest.46AB23E922C51517.quest_desc: ["A better tier of transporter with more storage."]
	quest.46AB23E922C51517.title: "&9Elite Logistical Transporter"
	quest.46BCDA0F17AE2073.quest_desc: [
		"The &aDraconium Chest&r is a versatile storage solution with unique features."
		""
		"Features of the &aDraconium Chest&r:"
		"&6-&r &eMassive storage capacity&r, significantly larger than standard chests."
		"&6-&r Built-in &bitem search functionality&r to quickly locate stored items."
		"&6-&r Integrated &dcrafting table&r, allowing you to craft items directly within the chest."
		"&6-&r Automatic &csmelting&r of items placed in designated slots, eliminating the need for a separate furnace."
		"&6-&r &bEnergy storage&r capability, powering the chest’s advanced functions."
		""
		"Usage:"
		"&6-&r Simply place the &aDraconium Chest&r in your base or storage area."
		"&6-&r Utilize the &dcrafting table&r and &bitem search&r functions as needed."
		"&6-&r Load items into the &csmelting slots&r for automatic processing."
		"&6-&r Ensure the chest is supplied with &benergy&r to enable all advanced features."
	]
	quest.46EBE6B0E06D750D.quest_desc: ["Used with &6Spatial IO Port&r to store spatial regions."]
	quest.470B1F84D01E4F7A.quest_desc: ["Charged Certus Quartz is crafted by insterting an Certus Quartz Crystal into the Charger, and powering it."]
	quest.47106CE1937C4340.quest_desc: ["To get an HDPE Sheet, place 3 HDPE Pellets in an Enrichment Chamber."]
	quest.4722157BC8D3B965.quest_desc: ["&dEfficiently&r &bcuts&r items like &cmetals,&r though it requires &aLubricant&r from a &6mixer.&r"]
	quest.472C30DE79844F67.quest_desc: ["Raw unformed cosmic fluid. Synthesized from condensed matter and used as a base medium for advanced matter enrichment."]
	quest.472C30DE79844F67.quest_subtitle: "Unformed Cosmic Substrate"
	quest.472C30DE79844F67.title: "Primordial Matter Fluid"
	quest.472EBB6F6C957211.quest_subtitle: "“Beauty never dies.”"
	quest.47358ADC1470C82A.quest_subtitle: "Get Ready for a Trip"
	quest.47358ADC1470C82A.title: "&cDemon Fruit&r"
	quest.47379E2C3068985D.quest_desc: ["The &calloy smelter&r has the ability to function as a &enormal furnace&r, and can smelt &amultiple materials&r to create &dalloys!&r"]
	quest.4745152F6FF242B3.quest_desc: [
		"When the reactor &o&6burns&r up fuel, it creates &o&dwaste&r that you will want to collect. That is what the other &3Solid Access Port&r is for!"
		""
		"Make sure to set it to &o&coutput&r, then &o&9pipe it&r into some type of storage."
	]
	quest.4745152F6FF242B3.title: "The Waste"
	quest.4750465C622D4C63.quest_desc: [
		"You won't have troubles finding them, as their smell is horrendous. Their brains aren't well developed but they a punch."
		"Their skin is tough, might be useful for making some sort of armor.."
	]
	quest.4752CD3375835EC9.quest_desc: ["Smelted &bVibranium ore&r."]
	quest.475B63AF0E87E318.quest_desc: ["Different &ctiers&r of &bwatering cans&r hold more water. &lRight-Click&r water to fill the can up, &lShift-Right-CLick&r to water &acrops&r around you."]
	quest.475DC864A0BC0F1F.quest_desc: ["Craft with &6bronze machines&r to &bupgrade&r them. Or just &lShift-Rigth&r click them."]
	quest.476755275B948A5F.quest_desc: [
		"&cReactors&r can also be used to &o&bheat up&r coolants like &o&bwater&r to create &o&bvapor&r, like &7Steam&r."
		""
		"To do this, you'll need to build a &2Reinforced Reactor&r. I'd also suggest on it being bigger than a &o&b3x3x3&r."
		""
		"To input a &o&bcoolant&r to the &creactor,&r you'll need two &9Forge Fluid Port&r. This will port in &nany fluids&r into the reactor. This will also be used to &o&bexport the vapor&r created in the reactor."
		""
		"If you want, you can create a &eMekanism Fluid Port&r to convert the &o&bfluid steam&r into the mekanism &o&bgas steam&r instead."
	]
	quest.476755275B948A5F.title: "The Actively Cooled Reactor"
	quest.476816C0C7B4205A.quest_desc: ["Has 2 slots for Constructing."]
	quest.47783AA841823B0E.quest_desc: ["Prints the &ecoordinates&r of the block you &lRight-Click&r onto a &bpiece of paper&r in your &6inventory.&r"]
	quest.47783AA841823B0E.quest_subtitle: "May be broken"
	quest.4791FC0A2E834D85.quest_desc: ["Dark magics linger in the depths of these dungeons, woven into items, halls, and even the very air. Power awaits the bold, but so do twisted fates for the careless."]
	quest.4791FC0A2E834D85.quest_subtitle: "Find a Bathhouse"
	quest.47A8E5DC11E846C5.quest_desc: ["A &anecessity&r to have, you can use this for &dduplicating &rraw ore mined with &bsilk touch,&r you can also &6craft&r a few &bitems&r on this, if you use this block with a &chammer,&r it will &eincrease its output.&r"]
	quest.47ACCCE2F34C5B99.quest_desc: [
		"To use it, items are dropped into the top of the multiblock structure, and can be removed from the black item port at the base. It does not have a GUI instead, the crushing wheels rotate while it is working. It can also be used to crush mobs, outputting the corresponding drops. If the Crusher is ever fed an item that it cannot process, it will destroy that item."
		""
		"Power is input via the copper looking dot, and the machine can be turned off by applying a redstone signal to the red dot on the front of the machine face."
	]
	quest.47ACCCE2F34C5B99.title: "Crusher"
	quest.47BABC95C5A372B8.quest_desc: ["The &5Halitosis Generator&r uses the &aDragon’s Breath&r to produce &cEnergy&r. By capturing the essence of the Ender Dragon’s breath, this generator offers a unique and potent power source for your most advanced needs."]
	quest.47C1108CF46C81FC.quest_desc: ["Provides  &ccrude oil&r while inside an &boil rig.&r"]
	quest.47C4B38EB962CEC8.quest_desc: [
		"When both the&a Hood&r and &bCloak of Darkness&r are equipped, a &emeter&r appears above the hotbar. This &emeter&r slowly &6fills over time&r, depicting a &cbleak red eye&r. &eOnce full&r, it glows &cred&r with a bright white pupil if the player is in &6light level&r &l14&r &bor lower&r, indicating the &dspecial ability&r is ready."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Pressing &lG&r while the &emeter&r is glowing activates &0Darkness Incarnate&r for &l10&r seconds, hiding the &emeter.&r This effect grants the user &6increased speed&r and transforms them into a &cdark form&r."
		""
		"After the effect ends, the &emeter&r &areappears&r empty and&d begins refilling&r."
	]
	quest.47C4B38EB962CEC8.title: "Darkness set"
	quest.47CEFA06392C4211.quest_desc: ["The expansion box is a must have! since it increases the max amount of bees from 3 to 5 and allows you to install upgrades in the hive."]
	quest.47CEFA06392C4211.quest_subtitle: "Place on top of a Beehive"
	quest.47CEFA06392C4211.title: "The Expansion Box"
	quest.47D1190F36C49C34.quest_desc: ["A &dportable&r &astorage unit&r which can be opened with &lRight-Click,&r also holds &emany items&r."]
	quest.47D1190F36C49C34.title: "Alchemical bags"
	quest.47E07B4997E901E3.quest_desc: [
		"To start the reactor. "
		"In a pressurized reaction chamber, liquid fluorinated naquadah uranium fuel, gaseous osmium, and osmium dust must be mixed to produce naquadah uranium fuel. "
	]
	quest.47F7DC87790D5064.quest_desc: [
		"Using a &a64k storage component&r or higher, the &bMatter Condenser&r can produce a &bSingularity&r. A single singularity requires &d256,000 items&r to be voided, equivalent to &o4,000 stacks&r!"
		""
		"To see its true potential, throw the singularity on the ground with a piece of &6Ender Dust&r. This will cause some damage to the surroundings, but AE2 offers &bTiny TNT&r to minimize the impact."
	]
	quest.480036468A6A5A4E.quest_desc: ["Combine &5White Dwarf Fragment&r, &1Neutron Star Fragment&r and &2Pulsar Fragment Dust&r to get &#FF670ERaw Star Plasma&r!"]
	quest.4821419D44F8083F.quest_desc: [
		"&bGrowth accelerators&r are placed &ebelow plants&r to &aspeed up growth&r of &ethat plant&r, &ceach tier&r has a different &9\"Range\"&r of how far down you can place it, the &6more accelerators you place&r below the &cfaster&r that &aplant grows&r. "
		"(the &9range&r is basically how many can place below the plant.)"
	]
	quest.4844DEF57A2287B4.quest_desc: ["Allows you to take items and fluids from one disk into another grid's disks."]
	quest.4844DEF57A2287B4.title: "Disk Manipulator"
	quest.486457F40D2A1D29.quest_desc: ["key crafting ingredient of the mod"]
	quest.486457F40D2A1D29.title: "&fFlux Core"
	quest.4869C413646CC4CC.quest_subtitle: "Can transport anything."
	quest.4869C413646CC4CC.title: "Cables"
	quest.487D717B87795D2F.quest_desc: [
		"A late-game block that slowly compresses stacks of identical items (1,000 units) into Singularities, which are used for crafting high-tier AE2 components like Quantum Bridges. Requires continuous AE2 power and outputs to adjacent inventories."
		""
		""
		"Matter Ball:"
		"A dense sphere of compressed matter created by the Matter Condenser when processing 1,000 units of any item."
	]
	quest.488DBE69595F38F8.quest_desc: ["The energized smelter is your basic electric furnace that uses energy instead of fuel to smelt items."]
	quest.488DBE69595F38F8.quest_subtitle: "Mekanism's Powered Furnace"
	quest.48A3A6BBE4725AD2.quest_desc: [
		"&dWhere raw ingredients melt into magical madness. It’s less cooking... more candy alchemy&f."
		""
		"Conversion Crucibles have a 100% chance to generate within Licowitch Towers. Only 1 Conversion Crucible will spawn in each Licowitch Tower."
		""
		"The Conversion Crucible has the magical ability to change the biome around it if the correct ingredients are tossed into it."
		""
		"To start, the player must eat a Biome Treat in the biome they want while starving, binding the Biome Treat to that biome. Then the cruciable will show a \"hologram\" of an item to throw inside it.After all items are deposited into the crucible, the Crucible will convert the surrounding area into the wanted biome in a 12x12 range."
	]
	quest.48AC8545D66B71B7.quest_desc: ["Congratulations! Getting the builder upgraded is an important step. The Builder can only build or upgrade any other hut up to the level of their own hut. So, in order for the Builder to upgrade any building, the Builder’s Hut must be upgraded first. Then the Builder will be able to upgrade any other building(s)."]
	quest.48AC8545D66B71B7.quest_subtitle: "Level Up a Builders Hut"
	quest.48BF71269DEA1AB1.quest_desc: ["Different &ctiers&r of &aseeds&r need different &ctiers&r of &aessence&r and &6farmland,&r &dmake some&r&d!&r"]
	quest.48E3F10CDF8AE115.quest_desc: ["&9Ad Astra!&r &7(To the Stars)&r is a &dspace mod&r with a focus on &ctechnology&r, &btravel&r and &aexploration&r. We've got everything you need to become an astronaut: &erockets,&r &bspace suits,&r &cspace stations&r and &cmachines&r. Why not take a stroll on the &bMoon&r? Build a self-sustaining bunker on &cMars?&r Go mining on &eVenus?&r the &9Milky Way&r is at your disposal!"]
	quest.48E3F10CDF8AE115.title: "Welcom to Ad Astra"
	quest.48F4D5E88C907E51.quest_desc: ["You are making progress, &agood,&r but you must &6improve.&r"]
	quest.4905CD63121F13EA.quest_desc: ["Automatically refills gadgets and armor that use fuel."]
	quest.490628CE108A833A.quest_desc: [
		"The Courier runs back and forth from the Warehouse to all the worker huts in your colony, delivering materials to workers and putting finished products in the Warehouse. The level of the Courier’s Hut will dictate how many items the Courier can carry and the amount of requests they can keep track of at a time."
		""
		"Courier’s don’t just work on their own. You must build a warehouse, and assign the courier to work at a warehouse. "
		""
		"Note: If you have multiple Warehouses, Couriers will only see the items in the Warehouse they are assigned to. This is helpful in the late game when troubleshooting requests."
	]
	quest.490628CE108A833A.quest_subtitle: "Build a Courier Hut"
	quest.491C1EDC53F1CCED.quest_desc: ["robes with an extra tier level"]
	quest.4932FAE86B6262BE.quest_desc: [
		"The &aEntity Detector&r is used to detect entities in a specified area."
		""
		"Features of the &aEntity Detector&r:"
		"&6-&r Senses the presence of &dentities&r within its range."
		"&6-&r Can be configured to detect specific types of entities."
		"&6-&r Useful for automation tasks and triggering events based on entity presence."
	]
	quest.493B9FC17C3CF3CA.quest_desc: [
		"The Rabbit Hutch is where the Rabbit Herder will raise and butcher rabbits. You will have to capture and bring in two rabbits to the Rabbit Hutch, as the Rabbit Herder will not catch and bring in any rabbits."
		""
		" The Rabbit Herder will only keep two rabbits alive per hut level, so at level 5 they will have ten rabbits in their holding pens."
	]
	quest.493BCE6F7191D267.quest_desc: [
		"The &eBlock Placer&r automatically places blocks in front of it."
		""
		"Provide it with &ablocks&r and &dpower&r, and it will place the &ablocks&r as specified."
		""
		"Useful for &dautomated building&r and &afarming setups&r."
	]
	quest.49492BE19F4A1021.quest_desc: ["The 262m Fluid Storage Part is used to craft the 262m Fluid Storage Disk."]
	quest.495DCA49B4E80852.quest_desc: ["A powerful air-powered weapon. It requires pressure and proper ammo to operate. Great for defense or just having fun with tech."]
	quest.495E3735F234617B.quest_subtitle: "Don't forget the upgrades for beehives and centrifuges."
	quest.495ED54AC102B1FD.quest_desc: ["The &6Dense Covered Cable&r can carry up to &d32 channels&r, making it ideal for &alarger and more complex networks&r. This type of cable is used for the &dmain data trunks&r where a higher channel capacity is required. Due to its high capacity, &6Dense Cables&r are perfect for connecting to an &bME Controller&r or distributing channels to multiple sub-networks."]
	quest.49793060345FB28C.quest_desc: [
		"The Cowhand’s Hut is where the Cowhand will milk, breed, and butcher cows for leather. The Cowhand will only keep two cows alive per hut level, so at level 5 they will have ten cows in their holding pens to breed and butcher."
		""
		"Note: &eYou must bring your own cows to the pen.&r"
	]
	quest.497A879543460123.quest_desc: [
		"A more advanced &dSource Relay&r capable of pulling from and sending to multiple locations. &lRight-Click&r the &djar&r your taking from then the &arelay&r. And &lRight-Click&r the &arelay&r first then the &djar&r to deposit the &dSource&r."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"There is also the &edepositor&r which gives &djars&r withen a &l5 block range&r source from its invertory, yes you need to fill this relay with source."
	]
	quest.4980C231ECDB0BF2.quest_desc: ["A new drill for the &eelectric quarry, &rused to&b gather ores.&r"]
	quest.499A392498931C69.quest_desc: ["A glowing glob of concentrated sweetness. It hums with unnatural energy and the scent of a thousand desserts."]
	quest.49E36D3C3092346E.quest_desc: [
		"The IO Port allows you to rapidly fill or empty storage cells to or from network storage."
		""
		"It can be rotated with a Certus Quartz Wrench."
		""
		"The IO Port can be set to move the cell to the output slots when the cell is empty, full, or when the work is done."
		"If a Redstone Card is inserted, there will be options for various redstone conditions"
		"In the center of the GUI, there is an arrow to set which direction to transfer items, from the cell to network storage, or from storage to the cell."
		"Upgrades"
		"The IO Port supports the following upgrades:"
		""
		"Acceleration Card increases the amount of stuff moved per operation"
		"Redstone Card adds redstone control, allowing active on high signal, low signal, or once per pulse"
	]
	quest.49ED53D162564102.quest_desc: ["The &fRocket Generator&r uses &aFireworks&r to create &cEnergy&r. It’s a fun and explosive way to turn your stockpile of fireworks into a practical power source, adding a bit of flair to your energy production."]
	quest.4A06EDE9CD0C65D9.quest_desc: ["Here you will be able to restore the knowledge of the Obsidian Kingdom with manuscripts."]
	quest.4A198E875A6B0A64.quest_desc: ["An upgraded crafter that holds more patterns and has an increased crafting speed."]
	quest.4A198E875A6B0A64.title: "&eGold Crafter&r"
	quest.4A19E3387DBD7FB0.quest_desc: [
		"The Winder consumes spools of wire to wrap around items."
		""
		"Crafting recipes that use the Winder (such as generators or potentiometers) will always use exactly the amount required."
		""
		"For winding magnetic coils, a winding percentage can be set out of 1000 turns, with a minimum of 100 turns (10% = 100 turns). Any turns beyond 100 are used only for transformer coils. The remaining turns on the wire spool can be checked using Goggles."
		""
		"Items cannot be extracted manually (except for the wire spool), and there is no filter for unfinished items. For manual winding, use a Funnel and a Lever."
	]
	quest.4A22534045841AE4.quest_desc: ["Low current"]
	quest.4A47E558AD90EB64.quest_desc: ["Provides an interface to access two inventories simultaneously. Also comes with filter slots to quickly sort incoming items."]
	quest.4A538D3FEC4D94D3.quest_desc: [
		"The &aQuantum Energy Tunnel&r is a powerful device for transferring energy over long distances."
		""
		"Features of the &aQuantum Energy Tunnel&r:"
		"&6-&r Uses &bquantum entanglement&r for instant energy transfer between two points."
		"&6-&r Handles &cmassive volumes of energy&r efficiently, making it ideal for large setups."
		"&6-&r Requires precise configuration through its &dGUI&r for optimal performance."
		""
		"Usage:"
		"&6-&r Place a &aQuantum Energy Tunnel&r at each location you want to connect."
		"&6-&r Establish a link between the tunnels using &cChaos Shards&r for seamless energy transfer."
	]
	quest.4A5466E364B85AEF.quest_desc: ["Slowly smelted at the &csteam blast furnace,&r though it can be &bspeed up&r by &lRight-Clicking&r the furnace with &egunpowder.&r"]
	quest.4A59DF02128DA9F3.quest_desc: ["Provides high &dArcana&r and some useful &cQuanta,&r while &6minimizing negative effects&r. Ideal for chasing &drare&r &denchantments&r without risking too much &cchaos&r in the mix."]
	quest.4A6FD039DFAD7464.quest_desc: [
		"&ePushes&r &dmagnetic blocks&r toward the magnet while powered with &credstone.&r"
		""
		"The &arange&r can be &aincreased&r and &cdecreased&r by clicking on it with &bingots&r of the &asame type (Increase)&r or the &cdifferent type (Decrease)&r."
	]
	quest.4A6FD039DFAD7464.quest_subtitle: "Craft a azure magnet"
	quest.4A7F96E62A5845C5.quest_desc: [
		"Mechanical Pistons are a Contraption that will collide with unmovable blocks."
		""
		"To extend, the Piston must have Piston Extension Poles at the end as well as Rotational power. The maximum extension pole length is 64 blocks, and this can be changed in the Config."
		""
		"When the rotation is reversed, the piston will retract. The end must be made sticky with a Slimeball to bring the pushed blocks back with it."
	]
	quest.4A859875AFC89A13.quest_desc: ["A key mechanical component that compresses and channels energy within an engine. It’s essential for converting fuel or pressure into smooth, consistent rotational motion."]
	quest.4A961ADDC8054AA1.quest_desc: ["A magnetic device that attracts nearby items toward it using rotational energy. Perfect for automation setups where item collection needs to be fast and efficient."]
	quest.4AA150A009E904DA.quest_desc: ["Made from a &bElite Control Circuit&r this item is used in a few crafting recipes."]
	quest.4ABF0727AA569DD9.quest_desc: [
		"To make &cDeuterium&r, we'll need some &eElectric Pumps&r and give them a &3Filter Upgrade&r. Place them over a source block of water, give them some power, and they'll pump out &1Heavy Water&r."
		""
		"Pump the &1Heavy Water&r into an &dElectrolytic Separator&r to get &cDeuterium&r."
	]
	quest.4ABF0727AA569DD9.title: "&cDeuterium&r"
	quest.4AD6B31B2ACFD56E.quest_desc: [
		"&eWhat Is the Package Recipe Holder?&r"
		""
		"The &ePackage Recipe Holder&r is the item that stores &erecipe data&r for &ePackagedAuto&r machines."
		""
		"Recipes are encoded into it using the &ePackage Recipe Encoder&r."
		""
		"&eHow It Is Used&r"
		""
		"• Insert encoded Recipe Holders into PackagedAuto machines"
		"• Machines read the stored recipes directly from the holder"
		""
		"Without a Recipe Holder, most PackagedAuto machines cannot function."
		""
		"&eManaging Recipe Holders&r"
		""
		"• &aSneak + Right-click&r an encoded holder to &cclear&r all stored recipes"
		""
		"• Place an encoded holder in a crafting grid to clear it as well"
		""
		"• Combine an encoded holder with empty holders in a crafting grid to &acopy&r all recipes"
		""
		"&eWhy It Matters&r"
		""
		"• Central storage for PackagedAuto recipes"
		"• Makes recipe reuse and duplication easy"
		"• Essential for scalable automation"
	]
	quest.4AD6B31B2ACFD56E.title: "&ePackage Recipe Holder&r"
	quest.4AD8363D7359A072.quest_desc: [
		"Your first&c basic reactor&r has a max size of &l5x5x5,&r though they &ecan be smaller&r, you can make by following these directions:"
		""
		"&lFirst:&r Make the &6walls&r and &6floor&r of &abasic Reactor Casing&r and &aGlass.&r"
		""
		"&lSecond:&r Add a &bbasic Reactor controller&r to one wall."
		""
		"&lThird:&r add &dtwo basic Reactor Solid Access Ports&r, one set to &cInlet (red)&r the other &aOutlet (green)&r you can attach &epumps&r from other mods to these."
		""
		"&lFourth:&r Add a &ebasic Reactor Active Forge Energy Power Tap&r, which will &astore&r and &apipe out&r &eenergy&r from the &creactor.&r"
		""
		"&lFifth:&r Then you want &9basic Reactor Fuel Rod&r in a &ediagonal&r pattern across the floor and build them up till &eone block&r from the roof where on top of the&9 Fuel rods&r you put &bbasic Reactor Control Rods.&r"
		""
		"Then fill in the empty spots of the roof with &aReactor casing&r. if done correctly the &etextures&r will change slightly to show it has become a &4Multi-block reactor.&r"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"You can build &cbigger reactors&r with &9reinforced forms&r of the previously mentioned blocks instead of &abasic ones&r, also the &etaller&r a &creactor&r is, the &emore fuel&r it will use and hold while the &6energy&r it will make increases, but the &awidth&r will help it &bcool.&r"
	]
	quest.4AD8363D7359A072.title: "The First Reactor"
	quest.4AF83801E0F700E8.quest_desc: [
		"The &bShape Card (Quarry)&r is a powerful version of the &bShape Card&r in &5RFTools&r that enables the &bBuilder&r to mine large areas, collecting resources."
		""
		"This card is ideal for large-scale mining operations, automating the collection of vast amounts of resources."
	]
	quest.4AFF81D3D0E78255.quest_desc: ["The Chemical Washer turns Slurry into Clean Slurry using Water. The clean slurry then needs to be further refined by pumping it into a Chemical Crystallizer. Note that unlike most Mekanism machines this one has fixed \"in\" and \"out\" sides for the mineral flow. \"In\" will be on the left when first placed and \"out\" is on the right. It can of course be rotated with the Configurator. Water is piped in through the top of the machine."]
	quest.4AFF81D3D0E78255.quest_subtitle: "Giving Ores a Bath"
	quest.4B492F4CA6EBC3E8.quest_desc: ["Found within the &aToxic caves&r, only &cdeath&r (and a new&6 cat variant&r within these caves) can stop the &cexplosion&r once it has &ebegan&r."]
	quest.4B4FD4F240F79E11.quest_desc: [
		"Saturn Info:"
		"&aGravity:&r 10.395 m/s"
		"&bOxygen:&r none"
		"&cTemperature:&r -154 °C"
	]
	quest.4B77657055E0D36A.quest_desc: ["But this one does! \\n \\nThis allows your RS system to be accessed wirelessly from any dimension."]
	quest.4B77657055E0D36A.title: "Dimension Card"
	quest.4B81E84CAE814BA9.quest_desc: ["The 64k Fluid Storage Part is used to craft the 64k Fluid Storage Disk."]
	quest.4B81E84CAE814BA9.title: "&664k Fluid Part&r"
	quest.4B83CFF3601C34C7.quest_desc: ["Run your &bDimensional Processor Press&r with a White Dwarf Ingot in an inscriber or the Quantum Processor Assembler to stamp out printed circuits."]
	quest.4B83CFF3601C34C7.quest_subtitle: "Intermediate Processor Die"
	quest.4B83CFF3601C34C7.title: "Printed Dimensional Circuit"
	quest.4B8CB53818688501.quest_desc: [
		"The &bFluid Extractor&r is used to extract fluids from blocks."
		""
		"Place it facing a block like &n&boak wood&r to start extracting &dLatex&r."
		""
		"The extracted fluid can be transferred using &eFluid Pipes&r."
	]
	quest.4B976C143EDA4317.quest_desc: [
		"Casings are blocks used throughout many crafting recipes in Create, as well as for decoration and aesthetic purposes."
		""
		"There are four types of Casings: Andesite Casings are mainly used in basic Contraptions."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Casings can only be crafted through physically applying a valid alloy or ingot to any Stripped variant of Log or Wood. The logs will convert themselves into the casing."
		""
		"Mechanical Belts, Shafts, and Cogwheels can be encased in most casings, creating a decoration around the encased block. Copper casings, however, can be used only on Fluid Pipes. Likewise, a fluid pipe will not accept any other kind of casing."
	]
	quest.4B976C143EDA4317.title: "Andesite Casing"
	quest.4B9E9497E44D0096.quest_desc: [
		"These are the used to create &cbasic reactors&r, and will be used for the &6outer walls&r and &6edges.&r"
		""
		"&cReactors&r are mainly built from &areactor casing&r which utilize &0Black Iron&r instead of &egraphite.&r"
	]
	quest.4B9E9497E44D0096.title: "Reactor Casings"
	quest.4BAA0DCA042ED9D7.quest_desc: ["Useful in many recipes and is a big step toward making this mods armour."]
	quest.4BB13C80196FD034.quest_desc: [
		"The &#FFB616Create&r mod brings true engineering to Minecraft!"
		"Instead of simple machines, you’ll use rotational power generated by water wheels, windmills, and other types of contraptions."
		""
		"With Create, you can automate farms, build factories, or even design moving machines that run smoothly and look beautiful doing it."
	]
	quest.4BB13C80196FD034.quest_subtitle: "Create"
	quest.4BB13C80196FD034.title: "Create"
	quest.4BBA254500807468.quest_desc: ["Its a nugget"]
	quest.4BDE773C3359D584.quest_desc: [
		"Robit is Mekanism's mechanical companion. It can act as a crafting grid, a furnace, an anvil, a chest, or simply a cute little buddy. It is immune to fire, including the Flamethrower."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"To bring your personal robotic friend into the world, you'll have to craft it. Once Robit is in your inventory, right click a Chargepad with it in hand. This will spawn Robit and assign it to the pad. Oh, and make sure the Chargepad is supplied with power. Otherwise, he won't be able to follow you around!"
		""
		"If at any time you want to pick Robit up, simply shift right-click it with a Configurator."
		""
		"Don't worry about losing your Robit as whenever it runs out of charge/health it will automatically teleport back to its charging pad. It does not have conventional health: instead, taking damage will deplete its charge. A fully charged Robit has an effective health of 100 or 50 hearts."
		""
		"When the chargepad is broken, Robit will turn into an item to be picked up. It keeps its items but it may despawn if it's not picked up."
	]
	quest.4C08C3777E037EBE.title: "Instant Rituals"
	quest.4C09EB1987587A3E.quest_desc: ["The &aDraconic Fusion Crafting Injector&r represents the third &btier&r of Fusion Crafting Injectors. Its superior energy absorption rate accelerates the crafting process within the &dFusion Crafting Core&r."]
	quest.4C0D00B5305117A1.quest_desc: [
		"Autonomous air-powered turret. Defend your base from mobs or intruders using programmable targeting and loaded Minigun Ammo."
		""
		""
		"{image:pneumaticcraft:textures/patchouli/sentry_turret.png width:100 height:100 align:left fit:true}"
	]
	quest.4C1E1604FD00EE5A.quest_desc: ["One of the main crafting ingredients for &dArs Nouveau&r, Put a &9lapiz lazuli&r in a &bImbuement chamber&r and wait to gather some, when the chamber is done crafting it, juts Right-Click it."]
	quest.4C1E1604FD00EE5A.title: "&6The Source Gem"
	quest.4C46167641F9BB20.quest_subtitle: "\"The pinnacle of modern engineering\""
	quest.4C4B1602E2AFC314.quest_desc: ["An upgrade to the &cAdvanced Fluid Tank&r."]
	quest.4C57DF99E9A0BF6A.quest_desc: [
		"The Meteorite Compass points at the nearest Mysterious Cube, which thus points it at the nearest meteorite. Its one of"
		"the first AE2 items you should make."
	]
	quest.4C57DF99E9A0BF6A.title: "Meteorite Compass"
	quest.4C725130784DC554.quest_desc: ["Ah the dragonforge, pride of the Obsidian Kingdom. They discovered that if you let dragon breath into a forge, while there is iron inside, the outcome is dragonsteel. Each type of dragon requires its own forge. "]
	quest.4C725130784DC554.title: "Ice Dragonforge"
	quest.4C73A3B0E4396B29.quest_desc: [
		"The &cMob Imprisonment Tool&r captures and releases mobs."
		""
		"&bRight-click&r on a &dmob&r to capture it, and &bRight-click&r again to release it."
		""
		"Useful for transporting &dmobs&r without the need for &aleads&r or &aminecarts&r."
	]
	quest.4C7455970DDABF24.quest_desc: ["You are making progress, &agood,&r but you must &6improve.&r"]
	quest.4C786266B391B772.quest_desc: ["Upgraded storage block offering 50 Billion crafting bytes for heavy multi-crafting operations."]
	quest.4C786266B391B772.quest_subtitle: "50,000,000,000 Byte Storage Cell"
	quest.4C786266B391B772.title: "50B Mega Crafting Storage"
	quest.4C7CD3858A2BE870.quest_desc: [
		"The Mechanical Press is a mechanical component that applies Pressing, Packing, and Compacting recipes to items below it. It is used to press Ingots into Sheets, which are important ingredients for higher-level components."
		""
		"The Mechanical Press is powered by an internal Shaft, accessed from two opposite sides. Much like Shafts, Presses will relay rotation along their axis. It processes items faster when it receives faster rotational power."
	]
	quest.4C80D71EE7CFD378.title: "&6Reinforced Deorum Sword \\& Blacksmith Gavel"
	quest.4C873491F6F0FFAF.title: "&dSpiritfire&r Conversions"
	quest.4CA17B0A80020B2F.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.4CA92D60BED7D478.quest_desc: ["One of the &bpieces of gear&r crafted from the &cTelecore,&r This helmet will allow you to &astick to the roof&r if under &emagnetic blocks&r. (Like iron)"]
	quest.4CC229C23E5AC155.quest_desc: ["Energy Capacity: 16,000,000&r FE"]
	quest.4CC229C23E5AC155.quest_subtitle: "Tier 2"
	quest.4CCA40FAB3230C75.quest_desc: ["Accsess the dashboard from anywhere!"]
	quest.4CD83943865018EA.quest_desc: ["The &9Exporter&r is used to push items from your system into a block from your Network storage. \\\\n \\\\n This can be used to fill Furnaces with ores or fuel, push materials into designated chests, etc. \\\\n \\\\n You can also filter what items are pushed. Need more filter slots? Upgrade it!"]
	quest.4CD83943865018EA.quest_subtitle: "Exporting Items!"
	quest.4CD83943865018EA.title: "Exporter"
	quest.4CDB3F8E217ADC8E.quest_desc: ["A specialized metal ingot infused with magnetic properties. It’s used in crafting advanced machinery, motors, and components that rely on magnetic energy or attraction."]
	quest.4CE350628327599A.quest_desc: [
		"The &eME Level Emitter&r can indicate either the level of a specified item or the &dME Network&r energy level."
		""
		"You can set the threshold and if the&e ME Level Emitter&r will emit a redstone signal or turn it off."
		""
		"Does not require a &eChannel&r to function, if its power is lost the emitter will switch to an off state."
		""
		"These can tap into the &bcrafting system&r when a crafting card is installed, allowing you to output redstone while an item is being crafted, or even configure the system to output redstone to preform a crafting task, its important to note that you cannot mix level emitter craft via &credstone&r with &binterface patterns&r."
	]
	quest.4CEF6501FCD7D58D.quest_desc: ["A basic yet functional engine component that helps convert pressure or combustion into motion. Ideal for early-stage machinery and low-power mechanical systems."]
	quest.4CFE8B1C53B429E9.quest_desc: ["Crafter Slot Covers are used to denote empty spaces in Mechanical Crafter setups."]
	quest.4D04830CBA2E04AF.quest_desc: ["Can transport &cchemicals,&r such as those from chemical tanks."]
	quest.4D04830CBA2E04AF.title: "Chemical Conduit"
	quest.4D059A8B3F97649A.quest_desc: [
		"The &aWyvern Energy Relay Crystal&r is used to make a relay between I/O Crystal and Energy Crystal. It can store &b16M RF&r and has &c16 links&r, with a range of &d64 blocks&r."
		""
		"The &aWyvern Energy I/O Crystal&r can store &b16M RF&r and has &c3 links&r, with a range of &d64 blocks&r."
		""
		"The &aWyvern Wireless Energy Crystal&r is used to power machines wirelessly. It can store &b16M RF&r and has &c8 links&r, providing wireless RF to &d32 machines&r within a range of &e128 blocks&r."
	]
	quest.4D07B0A4A2E77CDA.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Spawner Rune&r is the fundamental crafting component for almost all spawner modifications."
		""
		"Crafted with &eSpawner Chains&r, &dGem Fused Slate&r, and &aGem Dust&r."
	]
	quest.4D07B0A4A2E77CDA.title: "Spawner Rune"
	quest.4D10C0FCFAFD5DE7.quest_desc: [
		"Now that you know what the genes are, you need to know how to get the genes. "
		""
		"When you squash a bee to get genes, you will get all of its 6 different genes. The bad news? You only get a small percentage of the gene. "
		""
		"The percentage dictates the chance that another bee has to get that gene. "
		""
		"To give genes to a different bee, combine a Honey Treat with your chosen gene(s) in a crafting grid and then Right Button on a bee to give them that trait."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"Get a bee you wish to get the genes of"
		""
		"In a 3 block tall space, put a Bottler (with bottles of course) on the bottom, and a Piston facing down on top with button/lever next to it."
		""
		"Put the bee in the middle, and quickly press the lever/button, that will squish the bee into a bottler and give you Squashed Bee Material"
		""
		"Put that into a Centrifuge, and it will give you the 6 genes of the bee."
		""
		"Easy right? But remember, it will only give up to around 20% of the gene per bee, so you need to repeat the process 4-5 times."
	]
	quest.4D1A4983E9155671.quest_desc: ["One of the best resource generator "]
	quest.4D1D83C41E9F02AD.quest_desc: ["A must have for any player who doesn't want to carry around a full inventory all the time."]
	quest.4D1D83C41E9F02AD.title: "Craft a &cBackpack"
	quest.4D278F1E4C68E29D.quest_desc: ["A portable device that provides wireless access to your ME network inventory and crafting system. Requires connection to a powered Wireless Access Point and consumes energy during use."]
	quest.4D3274AE190EEA88.quest_desc: [
		"&6Pipez&r mod adds &o&bsimple&r and &o&bhighly configurable&r pipes that are designed to create"
		"&nas little lag as possible&r."
		""
		"Pipe Types:"
		"• &eItem&r Pipes"
		"• &9Fluid&r Pipes"
		"• &cEnergy&r Pipes"
		"• &3Gas&r Pipes (Mekanism)"
		"• &8Universal&r Pipes (All &o&b4&r Pipes in one!)"
		""
		"Pipes &o&bdon't transfer anything&r if they are not set to &nextract&r."
		"You can &eSneak-click&r onto the end of a connected pipe with a &2Wrench&r to set it to &o&bextract&r."
		""
		"Click the &nextracting&r part of the pipe to &o&bchange modes&r, add &3filters&r or add &aupgrades&r."
		""
		"Pipes can be &cdisconnected&r/&9reconnected&r by &eSneak-clicking&r with a &2Wrench&r."
		""
		"By default pipes are &o&brelatively slow&r. The speed can &nonly&r be increased by &o&badding an upgrade&r."
		"Higher tiers of upgrades mean a higher transfer rate."
		""
		"&3Filters&r can be used with &aitem&r pipes, &9fluid&r pipes and &7gas&r pipes. To add a specific item, just &eClick&r it on the slot in the filter &o&bGUI&r. Alternatively you can type the item &o&bID&r in the text field next to it."
	]
	quest.4D3274AE190EEA88.title: "Pipez"
	quest.4D37544E9165BEAC.quest_desc: ["After completing the &aSpelunking table&r puzzle &ethree times in a row&r, you will acquire the &cMagnetic cave codex&r, which is used in crafting a &amap&r to the &cmagnetic caves&r or &lRight-Clicking&r for &binformation&r on the &acaves.&r"]
	quest.4D37544E9165BEAC.quest_subtitle: "Craft a magnetic cave codex"
	quest.4D482A1A908ABFDA.quest_desc: [
		"Unlike Linear Chassis, the Radial Chassis connects to a radius of blocks around it rather than a straight line of blocks. This can be unwieldy if there are blocks nearby one would rather not connect to the Contraption."
		""
		"You can right click on the sides of the chassis while holding a Slimeball or Super Glue to make them sticky, and again to apply it to all sides. The items are not consumed. The radius of affected blocks can be changed per chassis with a Wrench. Hold Ctrl to scroll every connected chassis."
	]
	quest.4D5153CF0B8DD67D.quest_subtitle: "Used to get your items made by multiblocks"
	quest.4D5787F48ECCB000.quest_desc: ["An&a improved version&r of the &dbrewing stand&r capable of brewing &bfour potions&r at once using &6Blazing essence&r from smelting&6 blaze powder&r in the &csteam blast furnace.&r"]
	quest.4D999E42010FFB85.quest_desc: ["Holds 1.6r AE in its battery and drains 1 AE/t for each block you are away from the nearest ME Wireless Access Point."]
	quest.4D99A3C8F8D0B850.quest_desc: [
		"Synthesized using Pulsar matter and quantum anomalies. Powers 250T crafting storages and high-density energy cells."
		""
		"&7Fun fact: The event horizon is the theoretical boundary around a black hole known as the 'point of no return.' Once anything crosses it, the escape speed required exceeds the speed of light itself.&r"
	]
	quest.4D99A3C8F8D0B850.quest_subtitle: "Singularity Boundary Core"
	quest.4D99A3C8F8D0B850.title: "Event Horizon Component Matrix"
	quest.4D9DC4973FD340E5.quest_desc: [
		"The Combat Academy is where your Knights in Training will train to become Knight. This also allows them to level up without a risk of dying to mobs."
		"The Knights in Training require a sword and shield to practice. They will attack the practice dummies, a pumpkin on top of a bale of hay."
		""
		"Tip: Consider setting the hiring mode to automatic so new recruits or kids growing up will automatically start training if not already attending school"
	]
	quest.4D9DC4973FD340E5.quest_subtitle: "Build a Combat Academy"
	quest.4D9DF84171B7453A.quest_desc: ["Allows you to &esmelt many new items&r! Including &bDark Steel&r with &dcoal dust&r, &biron,&r and &5obsidian.&r"]
	quest.4DA04ABF4FF2625C.quest_desc: [
		"Aureal Bottles can be found in loot chests, but they can also be crafted using Arcane Crystal Dust."
		""
		"You can also generate Aureal with Arcane Crystal Obelisks."
	]
	quest.4DA04ABF4FF2625C.title: "&9Aureal"
	quest.4DA1C95BED78A662.quest_subtitle: "Better than Netherite"
	quest.4DA1C95BED78A662.title: "&1Draco Arcanus Armor&r"
	quest.4DAC24440803FE58.quest_desc: [
		"An AE2 network needs to be chunkloaded for any of its devices to be able to function, and if only some of it is loaded, it may not function correctly. The Spatial Anchor solves this problem. It forceloads the chunks that its network occupies. A single cable extending across a chunk border is enough to load that new chunk."
		""
		"It will propagate its \"loading\" across quantum bridges, but not cross-dimensionally, so if you have a quantum bridge to the nether, you need a spatial anchor on the network in your base and on the network in the nether."
		""
		"By default it will also enable random ticks in its loaded chunks, this can be turned off in the ae2 config."
	]
	quest.4DAEDB4B0C8D2CE4.quest_desc: ["A high-speed power generator that converts heat or fluid pressure into rotational energy through turbine blades. It delivers efficient, continuous power for advanced machines and automation systems."]
	quest.4DD7E2BD8508A117.quest_subtitle: "Build one of every herder hut."
	quest.4DD8EC6663F695BC.quest_subtitle: "Place down a Sequenced Pulse Generator"
	quest.4DD8EC6663F695BC.title: "Computational Supremacy"
	quest.4E058BAF38B16EE0.quest_desc: ["An electrical component that stores and releases energy when needed. It helps stabilize power flow, improve efficiency, and support machines during energy fluctuations."]
	quest.4E09A9C4D7200D2A.quest_desc: [
		"Allows you to &etransport&r &bmultiple fluids&r through the &csame line!&r"
		""
		"You can also &6filter&r in or out fluids with the &dfilter options&r and a &dfilter chip&r. To configure what fluids you want to filter use a &ebucket&r of the fluid, then change the white or black list mode on the &aright of the filter UI.&r "
		""
		"Access the &emain UI&r by &lRight-Clicking&r on the part of the &cconduit&r attached to a machine."
	]
	quest.4E09A9C4D7200D2A.quest_subtitle: "Craft Ender Fluid Conduits"
	quest.4E09A9C4D7200D2A.title: "Ender Fluid Conduit"
	quest.4E12A2A28C837241.quest_desc: [
		"Tier 3 catalysts push the &bDimensional Matter Assembler&r to its speed ceiling."
		""
		"Stacking these high-tier catalysts makes recipes finish almost instantly while keeping heavy energy spikes in check. Very handy once you start crafting bulk endgame matrices."
	]
	quest.4E12A2A28C837241.quest_subtitle: "Maximum Catalytic Throughput"
	quest.4E12A2A28C837241.title: "Peak Catalysts (Tier III)"
	quest.4E190E6E1268D208.quest_desc: ["Right click the air with a empty bottle."]
	quest.4E4052F7EAD4FDD6.quest_desc: ["Bright banners and painted walls lure travelers closer, but inside these towering strongholds, chaos reigns. Each floor brims with bandits and traps, their laughter echoing as waves of foes pour from endless spawners. Conquer the towers, and their riches—and notoriety—are yours."]
	quest.4E4052F7EAD4FDD6.quest_subtitle: "Find the Bandit Towers"
	quest.4E4080F0A6E29532.quest_desc: ["The &dbest&r of the &dbest,&r &6no one can match you&r. And it lets you &bfly&r!"]
	quest.4E4080F0A6E29532.quest_subtitle: "A heart of singularity. Protects against time, space, and logic."
	quest.4E5238F00CEED8B2.quest_subtitle: "Allows you to duplicate any raw ore into 2 dusts."
	quest.4E5238F00CEED8B2.title: "Hammah!"
	quest.4E54E2E26DEA652A.quest_desc: ["An essential crafting components made with &ehammers&r or any metal making &bmachine&r. Used in building &crocket&r parts and machinery."]
	quest.4E54E2E26DEA652A.title: "Plates"
	quest.4E5C6F23628A9982.quest_desc: [
		"The Encased Chain Drive is a block that can transfer rotation much like the Mechanical Belt."
		""
		"Encased chain drives may be placed side by side either vertically or horizontally to form a chain passing rotational power among all the blocks. The blocks must touch on their sides (not axis to side) and be in a single straight line to form a chain. The axes of the encased chain drives may be all parallel or blocks can be rotated to orient the axis perpendicularly. Encased chain drives can also pass rotational power through their rotating axis, but this is not a continuation of the same chain."
	]
	quest.4E918421A699A711.quest_desc: ["&6Charged&r by pressing &lV&r and &cempted&r by pressing &lShift-V&r these &btools&r have special &lRight-Click&r &afunctionality.&r All of the tools &dnever break&r."]
	quest.4EA93AE8FD6CAF02.quest_desc: ["&bEggs&r are &cbroken&r when &ejumped on&r, and if you place &bice&r or &6amber&r beneath them they will &anot grow up&r."]
	quest.4EBD5363B552085D.quest_desc: [
		"Organizes electrical appliances into series-parallel groups without needing diodes or other circuit-splitting components."
		""
		"Different group numbers run in parallel and behave as if they are on separate diodes."
	]
	quest.4EC20D5D0EEC1DF7.quest_desc: [
		""
		"{ \"text\": \"Click Me!\", \"underlined\": true, \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"3617DE87C4E1BCB9\" } }"
	]
	quest.4EC2703C7191C1BB.quest_desc: [
		"Dense, physically stabilized matter synthesized by processing Proto-Matter and enriched spheres in the DMA."
		""
		"Forms the material base for cultivating Neutron Star and Pulsar matter."
	]
	quest.4EC2703C7191C1BB.quest_subtitle: "Solidified Physical Essence"
	quest.4EC2703C7191C1BB.title: "Corporeal Matter"
	quest.4EC2EBFA7B7757BB.quest_desc: ["cool pants."]
	quest.4EC499B88FBFA01C.quest_desc: ["Stores kinetic stress for later use. Retains charge in item form to enable long-distance energy transport. Battery capacity, RPM at discharge and stress impact values are all configurable."]
	quest.4ED870EA84A78E94.quest_desc: ["Drop &5Quantum Foam&r in &dEnd&r at y coordinate below &c0&r."]
	quest.4ED870EA84A78E94.quest_subtitle: "Void"
	quest.4EDD96EB60EF5814.quest_desc: [
		"&dAdvanced Solar Generastor&r produces &b105.6FE/t&r."
		""
		"It also can be used to add extra heat to &2Thermal Evaporation Plants&r."
		""
		"Most of the panels need a clear view of the sky."
	]
	quest.4EE55D173F98BC99.quest_desc: ["Use in an &aSmithing table&r with an item infused with a &dgem&r to &cremove&r the &dGem.&r"]
	quest.4EF01E6BA6182A27.quest_desc: [
		"Specialized tools for rotating and disassembling &5ME Machines&r without breaking them. Preserves block configurations during base redesigns."
		""
		"(Drops rotated blocks intact - no more accidental machine loss!)"
		""
		"&e\"Silent ME network architect tools\"&r"
	]
	quest.4EF01E6BA6182A27.title: "&9Wrenches&r"
	quest.4EF5DE3FBA2A7AE3.quest_desc: ["&dMystical Agriculture&r adds a few &anew tools&r, &bvanilla&r &btypes&r as well as &9new types&r such as &cscythes&r which harvest crops in an &earea,&r and &6sickles&r which destroy blocks such as &agrass&r in an &earea.&r"]
	quest.4EF621B740900EA8.quest_desc: [
		"Despite looking complex, it is actually pretty easy to draw pentacles. Just look for the desired ritual in the &9Dictionary of Spirits&r and click on the \"eye\" icon to display it in the world."
		""
		"&3Sacrificial Bowls&r work in range of up to 8 blocks."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&oTip&r: Do not draw your rituals on solid color blocks. Sometimes it is hard to notice glyphs(e.g. Green Glyph on the Grass Block)."
		""
		"{image:ftb:textures/quests/first_ritual.png width:113 height:55 align:center fit:true}"
	]
	quest.4EF621B740900EA8.quest_subtitle: "Aviars Circle"
	quest.4EF621B740900EA8.title: "First Ritual"
	quest.4F00BE972EFE7FBE.quest_subtitle: "Allows you to exchange blocks from your inv to the selected area"
	quest.4F09E98E5E615AC9.title: "Redstone Transmitter \\& Receiver"
	quest.4F1307BB5B01F90F.quest_desc: [
		"The ME Chest acts like a miniature network with a ME Terminal, ME Drive, and Energy Acceptor. While it can be used as a tiny storage network, its capacity for just one single storage cell means it has limited utility as such."
		""
		"Instead, it is useful for interacting with specifically the storage cell mounted inside it. Its integrated terminal can only see and access the items in the mounted drive, while devices on the general network can access items in any network storage, including ME chests."
		""
		"It has 2 different GUIs and is sided for item transport. Interacting with the top terminal opens the integrated terminal. Items can be inserted into the mounted storage cell through this face, but not extracted. Interacting with any other face opens the GUI with the slot for the storage cell and the priority settings. The cell can be inserted and removed by item logistics only through the face with the cell slot."
		""
		"It can be rotated with a Certus Quartz Wrench."
		""
		"It has a small AE energy storage buffer, so if not on a network with an energy cell, inserting or extracting too many items at once may cause it to brown out."
	]
	quest.4F1C04C0F6769825.quest_desc: [
		"The Chemical Injection Chamber uses Hydrogen Chloride gas to convert Ores into 4 Shards and Raw Ores into 8 Shards."
		""
		"This marks the beginning of 4x ore processing and requires a steady supply of Hydrogen Chloride, which can only be produced with a Thermal Evaporation Plant."
		""
		"This machine is the next step in expanding your Ore Processing Factory. Place it to the left of your Purification Chamber to integrate it into your existing setup and continue your progression."
	]
	quest.4F1C04C0F6769825.title: "The Start of a Tier 3 Ore Factory"
	quest.4F1FA866A2F510A1.quest_desc: ["Obtained by putting an Electrum Ingot in a Rolling Mill."]
	quest.4F1FA866A2F510A1.quest_subtitle: "Crafting component."
	quest.4F216AB740548F80.quest_desc: ["A powerful industrial engine designed to generate massive amounts of rotational energy. Ideal for driving heavy machinery, large-scale factories, and advanced automation setups."]
	quest.4F2C91B87AE30001.quest_desc: [
		"Welcome to &#FF8A66Oritech&r, an expansive modern technology mod."
		""
		"Mine &eNickel&r (Y 40 to Y -65 in stone and deepslate) and &fPlatinum&r (rare in deepslate Y -20 to Y -60, but &dabundant on the surface of the End dimension&r!)"
		""
		"Collect both to craft your first alloys and motors."
	]
	quest.4F2C91B87AE30001.title: "Welcome to Oritech"
	quest.4F2C91B87AE30002.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Wrench&r is your most important tool:"
		"- &eRight-click face&r: Toggle input/output modes."
		"- &bShift-Right-click&r: Rotate or disassemble machines."
	]
	quest.4F2C91B87AE30002.title: "The Industrial Wrench"
	quest.4F2C91B87AE30003.quest_desc: [
		"&6Machine Cores&r power every Oritech multiblock:"
		""
		"1. Place the machine block (e.g. Pulverizer)."
		"2. Place a &bMachine Core&r adjacent to it."
		"3. The Core holds &eAddons&r (Speed, Efficiency, Yield) that boost the machine."
		""
		"7 Tiers exist higher tier = more addon slots = more overclocking!"
	]
	quest.4F2C91B87AE30003.title: "Core Mechanics: Machine Cores"
	quest.4F2C91B87AE30004.quest_desc: [
		"Machine Cores go from &6Tier 1 (Primitive) to Tier 7 (Ultimate)&r."
		"Higher tiers unlock vastly more addon slots for extreme overclocking."
	]
	quest.4F2C91B87AE30004.title: "Machine Core Tiers (1 to 7)"
	quest.4F2C91B87AE30005.quest_desc: ["The &6Basic Generator&r burns solid fuels (Coal, Charcoal, Wood) to supply FE power."]
	quest.4F2C91B87AE30005.title: "Basic Generator"
	quest.4F2C91B87AE30006.quest_desc: [
		"- &aBio Generator&r: Burns organics, seeds, crops."
		"- &cLava Generator&r: Consumes lava buckets or piped lava."
		"- &3Big Solar Panel&r: Generates passive FE from sunlight."
	]
	quest.4F2C91B87AE30006.title: "Bio, Lava, and Solar Generators"
	quest.4F2C91B87AE30007.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Fuel Generator&r burns refined liquid fuels for large-scale output."
		""
		"The &3Steam Engine&r connects with &bSteam Boilers&r for massive continuous power."
	]
	quest.4F2C91B87AE30007.title: "Fuel Generator and Steam Power"
	quest.4F2C91B87AE30008.quest_desc: [
		"&9Energy Storage Blocks&r buffer surplus FE."
		""
		"The Oritech pipe system:"
		"- &eEnergy Pipes&r: Power distribution."
		"- &bFluid Pipes&r: Fluid conduits."
		"- &7Item Pipes and Item Filters&r: Item routing."
		"- &cPipe Booster&r: Attach to pipe extraction. When powered extracts &620 stacks/sec&r or &3800 buckets/sec&r!"
	]
	quest.4F2C91B87AE30008.title: "Energy Storage and Pipe Logistics"
	quest.4F2C91B87AE30009.quest_desc: ["The &3Steam Engine&r connects with &bSteam Boilers&r to create an industrial steam-driven turbine system for massive continuous power generation."]
	quest.4F2C91B87AE30009.title: "Steam Power and Boilers"
	quest.4F2C91B87AE30010.quest_desc: ["&9Energy Storage Blocks&r buffer your grid, storing excess energy and discharging it when large machines activate."]
	quest.4F2C91B87AE30010.title: "Energy Storage Buffer"
	quest.4F2C91B87AE30011.quest_desc: [
		"Oritech features an integrated logistics system:"
		""
		"- &eEnergy Pipes&r: Power distribution."
		"- &bFluid Pipes&r: Fluid conduits."
		"- &7Item Pipes and Item Filters&r: Item routing with blacklists and priority."
		"- &cPipe Booster&r: Attaches to pipe extraction points, extracting up to &620 stacks/sec&r or &3800 buckets/sec&r when powered!"
	]
	quest.4F2C91B87AE30011.title: "Pipes and Filter Logistics"
	quest.4F2C91B87AE30012.quest_desc: ["The &cPowered Furnace&r smelts items at electric speeds using FE instead of solid fuel."]
	quest.4F2C91B87AE30012.title: "Powered Furnace"
	quest.4F2C91B87AE30013.quest_desc: [
		"The &bPulverizer&r crushes raw ores into dusts and fragments, providing ore doubling and secondary byproducts."
		""
		"The &dFragment Forge&r fuses crushed ore fragments back into ingots with a bonus yield multiplier."
	]
	quest.4F2C91B87AE30013.title: "Pulverizer and Fragment Forge"
	quest.4F2C91B87AE30014.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Foundry&r performs high-temperature induction alloy smelting."
		""
		"The &eAssembler&r automatically fabricates complex microchips, casings, and processors."
	]
	quest.4F2C91B87AE30014.title: "Foundry and Assembler"
	quest.4F2C91B87AE30015.quest_desc: ["The &dFragment Forge&r fuses raw crushed ore fragments into complete ingots with an extra bonus yield multiplier."]
	quest.4F2C91B87AE30015.title: "Fragment Forge"
	quest.4F2C91B87AE30016.quest_desc: ["The &eAssembler&r automatically fabricates complex microchips, machine casings, and processors from raw components."]
	quest.4F2C91B87AE30016.title: "The Assembler"
	quest.4F2C91B87AE30017.quest_desc: [
		"The &dCentrifuge&r separates complex fluid mixtures and isolates pure elements."
		""
		"The &6Refinery&r and &eRefinery Modules&r process crude oil into industrial fuels and lubricants."
	]
	quest.4F2C91B87AE30017.title: "Centrifuge and Refinery"
	quest.4F2C91B87AE30018.quest_desc: ["The &6Refinery&r and &eRefinery Modules&r process crude oil into high-grade industrial fuels and lubricants."]
	quest.4F2C91B87AE30018.title: "The Refinery"
	quest.4F2C91B87AE30019.quest_desc: [
		"The &cLaser Arm&r is one of the most versatile machines in Oritech. Use the &eTarget Designator&r to assign its target:"
		""
		"- Mine blocks at range."
		"- Damage mobs."
		"- Transfer energy wirelessly to other machines!"
		""
		"&4Warning:&r A misaimed Laser Arm will mine blocks in a straight line until it hits something solid. Always verify target position before powering it!"
	]
	quest.4F2C91B87AE30019.title: "Laser Arm"
	quest.4F2C91B87AE30020.quest_desc: [
		"&6Renewable Fluxite tip:&r Point a Laser Arm at a &bBudding Amethyst&r block to accelerate amethyst growth and automatically harvest crystals, producing &dFluxite&r without needing to fragment Platinum ore!"
		""
		"Fluxite is needed for Flux Gates, Basic Batteries, and many mid-tier components. Set up an amethyst laser farm early!"
	]
	quest.4F2C91B87AE30020.title: "Laser Transmutation: Fluxite"
	quest.4F2C91B87AE30021.quest_desc: [
		"Synthesize the 4 primary advanced alloys in the Foundry:"
		""
		"- &aBiosteel&r: Lightweight structural metal."
		"- &2Energite&r: High-frequency crystalline superconductor."
		"- &3Duratium&r: Ultra-dense thermal armor alloy."
		"- &cAdamant&r: Extreme unyielding heavy metal."
	]
	quest.4F2C91B87AE30021.title: "Super-Alloy Metallurgy"
	quest.4F2C91B87AE30022.quest_desc: [
		"Attach Addons to Machine Cores to boost stats:"
		"- &bSpeed Addon&r: Faster operations."
		"- &aEfficiency Addon&r: Less energy per operation."
		"- &6Yield Addon&r: Bonus output chances."
		"- &9Machine Extender&r: Expands addon connection range."
		"- &3Industrial Chiller (Cooler)&r: Dissipates overclocking heat."
		"- &eInventory Proxy&r: Routes items through addon faces."
	]
	quest.4F2C91B87AE30022.title: "Machine Addons and Upgrades"
	quest.4F2C91B87AE30023.quest_desc: [
		"Expand your addon configurations:"
		""
		"- &9Machine Extender&r: Extends addon connection range beyond the core."
		"- &3Industrial Chiller&r: Actively dissipates heat from heavy overclocking."
		"- &eInventory Proxy&r: Routes item input/output through addon faces."
	]
	quest.4F2C91B87AE30023.title: "Cooling and Extender Addons"
	quest.4F2C91B87AE30024.quest_desc: ["The &5Ultimate Addon&r gives a 75% speed bonus!"]
	quest.4F2C91B87AE30024.title: "The Ultimate Addon"
	quest.4F2C91B87AE30025.quest_desc: [
		"Cybernetic augmentation and Exo-Suit:"
		""
		"- &dAugment Application Block&r: Install cybernetic body augments."
		"- &7Exo-Armor Suite&r: Modular powered armor."
		"- &eExo-Jetpack&r: Powered flight."
		""
		"&aPro Tip:&r The &6Exo Chestplate&r wirelessly charges every energy item in your inventory at &b10,000 RF/t&r from its buffer. Hand Drill, Chainsaw, and Jetpack all charge while worn!"
	]
	quest.4F2C91B87AE30025.title: "Cybernetics and Exo-Suit"
	quest.4F2C91B87AE30026.quest_desc: [
		"High-torque tools powered by FE:"
		""
		"- &6Hand Drill&r: Fast 3x3 block mining."
		"- &aChainsaw&r: Instant tree felling."
		"- &cElectric Mace&r: High damage energy weapon."
	]
	quest.4F2C91B87AE30026.title: "Powered Tools and Electric Mace"
	quest.4F2C91B87AE30027.quest_desc: ["The &6Bedrock Extractor (Deep Drill)&r penetrates bedrock to extract endless raw ores and deep minerals without destroying world blocks."]
	quest.4F2C91B87AE30027.title: "Deep Bedrock Mining"
	quest.4F2C91B87AE30028.quest_desc: [
		"The &dAtomic Forge&r synthesizes the most advanced materials: Super AI Chips, Advanced Computing Engines, and &ePromethium Ingots&r."
		""
		"&cCrucial:&r The Atomic Forge &cdoes NOT accept standard energy pipes&r! Aim at least &e2 Laser Arms&r directly at it. Add Speed Addons to the Lasers for faster charging."
	]
	quest.4F2C91B87AE30028.title: "The Atomic Forge"
	quest.4F2C91B87AE30029.quest_desc: [
		"The ultimate feat of relativistic physics: &5The Particle Accelerator&r."
		""
		"Construct a massive collider ring using &bLinear Motors&r and &dGuide Rings&r, commanded by the &eAccelerator Controller&r to make the overcharged crystal! (or just craft it?)"
	]
	quest.4F2C91B87AE30029.title: "Master of Particle Physics"
	quest.4F2F6E31C38DA17F.quest_desc: ["Automatically refills gadgets and armor that use water."]
	quest.4F30FA10742473D3.quest_desc: [
		"After using a &aheavyweight&r to create this, you will need a build a &dmagnetic quarry&r to use it."
		""
		"&lFirst:&r craft &bfour magnetic lights&r and place them in a &esquare perimater&r."
		""
		"&lSecond:&r Place down a &cMagnetic quarry&r crafted from the &bheart of iron&r next to the perimeter of &bmagnetic lights&r."
		""
		"&lFinally:&r Place the &cQuarry smasher&r in the &emiddle&r of the square and &dwatch it mine!&r"
	]
	quest.4F336B6358EC46BB.quest_subtitle: "Good for building and stealing stuff."
	quest.4F35D04721DFC9FF.title: "&bOur First&r &dRitual&r"
	quest.4F436770D30D8520.quest_desc: [
		"We will need to add 3 more machines to our current setup."
		""
		"The Chemical Dissolution Chamber is the first machine in the 5x ore processing setup. It turns Raw Ores into Slurry using Sulfuric Acid."
		""
		"The machine uses 100mB of Sulfuric Acid for every ore dissolved and outputs 1000mb of Slurry. This Slurry needs washing in the Chemical Washer."
	]
	quest.4F436770D30D8520.title: "The Start of a Tier 4 Ore Factory"
	quest.4F4B2A6997F25A5A.quest_desc: ["The chance to roll &brarer&r or &bmore&r &denchantments.&r Boosting &dArcana&r lets you pull from the deep end of the &denchantment&r pool think &amulti enchant&r combos or harder to get effects."]
	quest.4F4B2A6997F25A5A.title: "Arcana"
	quest.4F51E1672ECE7D3B.quest_desc: ["A specialized machine that works with Spatial Storage Cells to capture or deploy entire spatial regions. It must be connected to an ME network and placed within a frame of Spatial Pylons marking the area to be stored."]
	quest.4F5AA576DC7B9B24.quest_desc: ["Put these items in the top of the blast furnace to produce molten steel and molten slag."]
	quest.4F5AA576DC7B9B24.title: "Making steel"
	quest.4F78122BABAB041C.quest_desc: [
		"The Mechanical Plough is a Movement Actor used to break non-collidable blocks and fling entities."
		""
		"Placement"
		"The Plough can only be placed on the horizontal face of a solid block, however, this block is not necessary to support the Plough after it is placed."
		""
		"Breaking Blocks"
		"While attached to a Contraption, the Mechanical Plough will break non-collidable blocks it comes in contact with (ex. snow layers). The Mechanical Plough will also move or launch entities and till soil blocks."
		""
		"Tilling"
		"While attached to a Contraption, the Mechanical Plough will till any grass blocks below it (change grass blocks to farmland), which can be used to quickly till huge farms."
		""
		"Flinging Entities"
		"While attached to a Contraption that moves the Mechanical Plough in a swinging motion, any colliding entities will be flung in the direction of the swing."
	]
	quest.4F78375EDADAFEC2.quest_subtitle: "Don't forget your PPE"
	quest.4F7EC227A0B7F2D6.quest_desc: ["If eating a &4Darkened Apple&r while under the effects of &0Darkness Incarnate&r, it will extend the &deffect's duration&r for &l30&r extra seconds. This bonus &6can stack&r with &nno reasonable limit&r when eating &4multiple Darkened Apples&r."]
	quest.4F86E16DE747E9FE.quest_desc: [
		"The &bRedstone Module&r in &5RFTools&r is used to control &9redstone signals&r based on network conditions, enabling advanced automation setups."
		""
		"To use the &bRedstone Module&r:"
		"1. &n&bRight-click&r the device (e.g., &bScreen&r, &dEnvironmental Controller&r) where you want to use the redstone module to open its &6GUI&r."
		"2. Insert the &bRedstone Module&r into the module slot."
		"3. Configure the module to define the conditions under which it should emit a &9redstone signal&r (e.g., &denergy level thresholds&r, &aitem counts&r)."
		"4. Connect the device to redstone components to automate actions based on the configured conditions."
	]
	quest.4F89670D49DD2DE1.quest_desc: [
		"They provide diagnostic function by visualizing the Channel usage on the Cables, the Channels appear as lit colored lines that run along the black stripe on the Cables giving you an understanding of how your Channels are being used on your network."
		""
		"The first four Channels show as lines matching the color of the Cable, the next four show as white lines."
		""
		"These can also be colored in the same manner as Fluix ME Glass Cable."
	]
	quest.4F8BAA7B943299D9.quest_subtitle: "Mix nickel and copper in a heated basin."
	quest.4F9746A8EBB09C7B.quest_desc: ["Has 9 more filter slots and is 2x faster than the regular Exporter."]
	quest.4FA6BEA4E646B742.quest_desc: ["Acquired through smelting coal or &7charcoal&r in a &cfurnace,&r You will be using these to craft your &6reactor parts&r."]
	quest.4FA6BEA4E646B742.title: "Graphite Bars"
	quest.4FCC20D9F8F87B2F.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.4FCCEB8B6A6AA643.quest_subtitle: "Crafting component."
	quest.4FF64E14573BC439.quest_desc: [
		"A portable version of the Transmutation Table"
		""
		"Don't forget to make a transmutation interface btw."
	]
	quest.4FF64E14573BC439.quest_subtitle: "Your best friend for grinding."
	quest.4FF8483C1DD019BE.quest_desc: [
		"The &dFluid Transporter&r moves &afluids&r between machines and storage tanks."
		""
		"Connect it to a &afluid source&r and a &adestination&r."
		""
		"It ensures efficient fluid movement, supporting various automation setups."
	]
	quest.4FFD6C191AD6FCC5.quest_desc: ["A much improved, portable version of the Electric Gauge. Extremely useful for checking if a device is receiving enough current and power."]
	quest.4FFEBE0D475B9C61.quest_subtitle: "The upgraded versions of the compressor requires less material for a single singularity."
	quest.5007013C1A395087.quest_desc: [
		"&4Advanced AE&r focuses on improving user experience when handling your &1ME System&r and expanding the possibilities of"
		"end-game systems. This mod allows you to &aupgrade pattern providers&r with the capability to push items to specific sides"
		"of the target machines and create multiblock computers that can run an unlimited amount of crafts, sharing"
		"co-processors, while it has crafting storage left, plus a ton of other quality of life additions!"
	]
	quest.5014E85366FA6D22.quest_desc: [
		"Exotic spatial liquid produced using the high-energy radiation of a Nuclear Star in the DMA."
		""
		"Used as the primary reaction fluid when folding &bTesseract&r and &bEvent Horizon Component Matrices&r."
	]
	quest.5014E85366FA6D22.quest_subtitle: "Higher-Dimensional Liquid"
	quest.5014E85366FA6D22.title: "Spatial Fluid"
	quest.501C6B7580453410.quest_desc: ["Just like the other &cmultiblocks,&r the frame will need to be made out of &7Casings&r, while the faces can be made out of &9Glass&r."]
	quest.501C6B7580453410.title: "Fluidizer Construction Parts"
	quest.502D5E3F6E497D60.quest_desc: ["Helps manage energy distribution to the player wireless requires a dimension card to provide FE trough dimensions."]
	quest.502D5E3F6E497D60.title: "&2The Player Transmitters"
	quest.5047792C6EF6D2AD.quest_desc: ["Created in Pressurized Reaction Chamber from 2 x Bio Fuel, Water and Hydrogen (also Ethylene created as side-product)."]
	quest.5047792C6EF6D2AD.title: "Substrates"
	quest.504C80D0179154D5.quest_desc: [
		"Practically a &esolar panel&r, just put one on &ctop of a machine&r and it will have &6power!&r"
		""
		"Of course, these need a &eclear view of the sun,&r and only work &6during daylight hours&r."
	]
	quest.505F8B8819FE572C.quest_desc: [
		"An important concept in AE2 is \"&esubnetting&r\", where a separate &dME network&r (&ea subnetwork&r) works alongside the main network to perform specialized functions."
		""
		"What separates a subnetwork from a detached network is the use of &bQuartz Fiber&r as a cable part. Placed between two otherwise unconnected lengths of cable, the &bQuartz Fiber&r transfers no &adata&r or &achannels&r, only &apower&r."
		""
		"Thus, a subnetwork on the other side of the &bQuartz Fiber&r can be powered by the main network's power source without requiring additional &apower generation&r."
	]
	quest.506DB0F229170F7E.quest_desc: ["Stores all the &bglyphs&r youve discovered, just &lRight-Click&r after useing a new &bglyph.&r"]
	quest.506E8A76D87A55B9.quest_desc: ["Used for funny stuff >^-^<"]
	quest.506E8A76D87A55B9.quest_subtitle: "Another state of matter"
	quest.508F41D6286655ED.quest_desc: ["Another &dinfinite&r &dpower&r &eblock&r."]
	quest.509E9CA83FBC780E.quest_subtitle: "Find a Fishing Hut"
	quest.50BFFEAF92B72965.quest_desc: ["Place these items in a &l3x3 cube&r, hold a &6wrench&r to view where to place each &cbrick&r after placing the &ecoke oven&r in the &lmiddle&r of one side and hold the &6hatches&r to view their &bacceptable location.&r"]
	quest.50BFFEAF92B72965.title: "Coke Oven"
	quest.50CE0BD7B0BC4017.quest_desc: ["Fluid Valves can be switched between open and closed by providing Rotational Force to the side. This is often done with a Valve Handle or Gearshift. A set of directional arrows on the side of the valve will also rotate to indicate whether the valve is open or closed."]
	quest.50E9C56331BE762A.quest_desc: [
		"A miniaturized stellar core running sustained nuclear fusion inside a magnetic bottle."
		""
		"Provides the extreme heat and radiation needed to generate Spatial Fluid and advanced celestial isotopes."
	]
	quest.50E9C56331BE762A.quest_subtitle: "Micro-Fusion Core"
	quest.50E9C56331BE762A.title: "Nuclear Star"
	quest.50EEDDDE129D2742.quest_desc: ["Boosts &aEterna&r by &l1.5&r &6per shelf&r to a &l&dMax&r&r of &l22.5&r. And boosts &cQuanta&r by&l 3&r per shelf."]
	quest.5100CFAD43E7D67A.quest_desc: ["Rising like a monument to conquest, this sprawling fortress serves as a bastion of Illager power. Its many levels are patrolled by raiders and spellcasters, their banners declaring dominion over the land. Within its halls lie chambers of wealth, guarded by Evokers whose magic is as deadly as their stares."]
	quest.5100CFAD43E7D67A.quest_subtitle: "Find an Illager Fort"
	quest.5113AD9751B850A7.quest_desc: [
		"The &dEther Gas Bucket&r contains &aEther Gas&r, a rare and valuable fluid."
		""
		"It is used in advanced crafting recipes and certain &dmachines&r."
		""
		"To collect &aEther Gas&r, use a &dFluid Extractor&r on a &aWither&r while it is being spawned."
	]
	quest.51658A680A4C2713.quest_subtitle: "Sturdy base block for multiblocks"
	quest.517A4A2D4EDD6359.quest_desc: [
		"The &aChaos Shard&r is an extremely rare and valuable item."
		""
		"To obtain a &aChaos Shard&r:"
		"&6- &rDefeat the &cChaos Guardian&r, which can be found on Chaos Islands in The End, located every &b10k blocks&r."
		""
		"&6- &rMine the &6Chaos Crystal&r at the center of the Chaos Island after defeating the &cChaos Guardian&r."
	]
	quest.518405876B7FEB5A.quest_subtitle: "If you are lost you can use the mod's guide book if it has one"
	quest.518405876B7FEB5A.title: "Guide Books"
	quest.51844489E649C85A.quest_desc: ["A &9Time-Dilating QIO Drive&r can contain &o&b1,048,000&r &nitems&r and &o&b1,024&r &nitem types&r."]
	quest.518CA7324056BD2E.quest_desc: ["&lShift-Right-Click&r on a &cconduit&r with this &bwrench&r to&e instantly break it&r."]
	quest.518D71CFF03E0A96.quest_desc: [
		"The Oxygen Distributor allou you to fill a room with oxygen."
		"For this, place a full an oxygen tank with oxygen with the Water Separator."
	]
	quest.51A4309769963F4F.quest_desc: [
		"With &#85817EDyson Cube Project&r you can build your very own Dyson Sphere like megastructure in Minecraft and unlock limitless energy for your world."
		""
		"How it works:"
		"Send Solar Sails and Beams to the sun using EM Railguns, EM Railguns can only work during non rainy days, and they will stop working when the sun is at its peak (By default you need 1 beam to support 4 solar sails)"
		""
		"After sending a bunch of solar sails you can harvest the power (FE) using Ray Recievers"
		"(All multiblocks can be connected from the bottom middle block)"
		""
		"In multiplayer other players can join your sphere by interacting with any multiblock"
	]
	quest.51A4309769963F4F.title: "Welcome to DCP"
	quest.51A618DFE2B4746A.quest_desc: ["You will be using this &abase&r to craft &cspecial redstone filters&r."]
	quest.51ABAF89A54612DB.quest_desc: ["&dGem armor&r is the best this mod has to offer, each piece gives you &cspecial abilities&r, including, &9Night-vision&r, &eflight,&r &bspeed,&r and &6fire-resistance&r"]
	quest.51C5499FC0E932CF.quest_desc: [
		"The \"&6core&r\" of this mod, you will be using this to &acraft&r many items and &btransform&r blocks into other blocks with the same &eEMC value&r with &lRight-Click.&r This &cstone&r also gives you an &6portable crafting table&r, with the &lC key&r!"
		""
		"By pressing &lV&r it will &e\"Charge\"&r to increase the area of blocks affected, &lShift-V&r &b\"Depletes\"&r it and pressing &lG&r will switch the &c\"mode\"&r of the stone so it will only affect blocks in a &6line&r, &6square,&r or all in a &6cube.&r"
		""
		"If you have an &eenergy source&r, &credstone,&r &6glowstone,&r or &acoal,&r you can change mobs into other mobs of the same type (&chostile&r to &chostile&r and &apassive&r to &apassive)&r"
	]
	quest.51C5499FC0E932CF.quest_subtitle: "We may have buffed the recipe... a little"
	quest.51CCB7ACFD7B45F1.quest_subtitle: "Crafting ingredient"
	quest.51E9D03CD755A607.quest_desc: ["Plan on storing Liquids? You'll need a &9Fluid Grid&r to be able to see what fluids you have in your Fluid Disks.  \\\\n \\\\n Pro Tip: If you want to store gases from Mekanism, see if you can turn it into a liquid first using a Rotary Condensentrator."]
	quest.51E9D03CD755A607.title: "Fluid Grid"
	quest.520FCDA696573BAA.quest_desc: ["In contrast to Memory Shard that allows to farm usual mobs, Chaos Shard focuses on bosses."]
	quest.520FCDA696573BAA.quest_subtitle: "Bosses"
	quest.521E73E59FE17D9B.quest_desc: ["Gathered from the &6Infinity Ingot&r, you will use this to craft the &bExtreme Smithing Table&r and &bTe&bmplate.&r&r"]
	quest.5243675B5E7C5618.quest_desc: ["A grappling \"whisk\" allows you to grapple to most surfaces and sling you across terrain! AKA spiderman style."]
	quest.525F25F4ADE45B50.quest_desc: [
		"The ME Formation Plane acts similarly to the Storage Bus, but treats the world itself as its storage medium. In other words, it will place down any block in its filter directly in front of itself."
		""
		"This can be useful for situations where a block can be processed simply by placing it and breaking it with a certain tool."
	]
	quest.526559F94031FE43.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Stella Eternal&r has 3 charges, and when right-clicked, it can fully repair all of your items in your inventory."
		""
		"The main purpose of this is to give the enchant Unbreakable to an item, which is done by combining it with the tool in a Smithing Table."
		""
		"And it is used to make the &4Blade of the arcane eclipse&f."
	]
	quest.526559F94031FE43.title: "&dStella Eternal"
	quest.5269E601F5EED47A.quest_desc: ["Faster movement."]
	quest.5269E601F5EED47A.quest_subtitle: "Craft Pressurized Fluid Conduits"
	quest.5269E601F5EED47A.title: "Pressurized Fluid Conduit"
	quest.528111F34C96380C.quest_desc: [
		"Applying the &7Initial Health Spawner Rune&r reduces the starting health of spawned mobs by &c-5%&r per application (down to a minimum of 20% health)."
		""
		"Allows mobs in mob farms to be eliminated significantly faster."
	]
	quest.528111F34C96380C.title: "Initial Health Rune"
	quest.5290B54829343B91.quest_desc: ["The &aHill Step Module&r gives you the ability to have step assist."]
	quest.52D3697F1F5625C7.quest_desc: ["The chemical used in the Etching Tank to dissolve unwanted copper on the PCB."]
	quest.52D8B15C3B75AB7F.quest_desc: [
		"The generator consumes SU to produce electricity. The faster it spins, the more voltage and power it generates, up to a maximum of 255V and 12.1kW. More technical details follow."
		""
		"This is a multi-step deploying recipe, with one step involving the Winding Machine. Start with a shaft and follow these steps:"
		""
		"Add a Capacitor"
		""
		"Attach a Heavy Plate"
		""
		"Use a Winding Machine to wrap 75 turns of copper wire around it"
		""
		"Add a Magnet"
		""
		"Attach a Steel Mechanism"
		""
		"Use a Screwdriver"
		""
		"Repeat this process three times for an 83% chance of obtaining a generator."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"0 RPM - 40 RPM: No electricity generation"
		""
		"41 RPM - 223 RPM: Voltage rises linearly from 1V to 255V. Current is limited to 40A, giving power output from 40W to 10.2kW"
		""
		"224 RPM - 255 RPM: Voltage remains at 255V while power output increases up to 12.1kW. Current limit rises to 47.5A"
	]
	quest.52DA19C0A068BAD8.quest_desc: ["Can destroy a 3x3 area works with fuel(coal) and water."]
	quest.5303509A1C2B1CCD.quest_desc: ["A high-powered tool powered by pressure. Breaks blocks faster than traditional tools and supports drill bit upgrades."]
	quest.530C610F55422E4C.quest_desc: ["&aPrevents&r the &cspawning&r of the mobs within the&d filled soul vials&r placed within."]
	quest.53154550397E9704.quest_desc: [
		"The Netherite Monstrosity is located in the Nether."
		""
		"It uses devastating close-range attacks, occasionally shooting lava when its target is too far away."
		""
		"Although, this ranged attack has its limitations, as it can only be used a total of three times before the Monstrosity has to recharge it by sucking in more lava."
		""
		"Sucking in lava also heals the Monstrosity, so make sure to never give it the chance to recharge!"
		""
		"Once it reaches 33% health, it becomes enraged, attacking more often and catching fire."
	]
	quest.5316DF321B45D2CA.title: "&dDreaming of&r &cDemons&r"
	quest.531B192D31815456.quest_desc: ["The &4Netherstar Generator&r utilizes the extremely rare &aNether Stars&r to produce enormous amounts of &cEnergy&r. It’s the ultimate power source for end-game setups, offering unparalleled energy output from the rarest materials."]
	quest.531E3FF1F2865C67.quest_desc: ["Similar to the Universal Cable, the Thermodynamic Conductor is Mekanism's way of transferring power in the form of heat (essentially a heat pipe)."]
	quest.531E3FF1F2865C67.title: "&aBasic Thermodynamic Conductor"
	quest.532229D285CA4858.quest_desc: ["The &9Importer&r is used to pull items from a connected block. \\\\n \\\\n For example, you can use these on Furnaces to pull the finished product out into your system. \\\\n \\\\n Make sure to grab some &6Speed&r or &6Stack&r upgrades for them! \\\\n \\\\n You can also filter what items are pulled. Need more filter slots? Upgrade it!"]
	quest.532229D285CA4858.quest_subtitle: "Importing Items!"
	quest.532229D285CA4858.title: "Importer"
	quest.53518D4ED99A242F.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.537E39530360AD73.quest_desc: [
		"To perform a ritual, place the ingredients on the Arcane Pedestals."
		""
		"You'll need a Blacksmith's Gavel to activate the ritual. To do this, right click on the Forge with the Gavel."
	]
	quest.537E39530360AD73.title: "Performing Rituals"
	quest.537FEA93C4D1E084.quest_subtitle: "Find some desh in the moon"
	quest.538E40453CED445E.quest_desc: ["The &aDraconic Tools/Weapons&r have a grid of &b6x5&r for modules."]
	quest.538E40453CED445E.title: "Draconic Tools \\& Weapons"
	quest.53C0234C053BF0CF.quest_desc: [
		"Place a Stock Link to start a new Logistics Network. Right-click a placed Stock Link before placement to share that link’s network. Place the link on a Packager to connect the packager’s connected inventory to the network."
		""
		"Stock Links have no range limitations, but the chunk they’re in must be loaded in order to be seen by the network."
		""
		"Stock Links can receive and transmit requests through the Logistics Network."
	]
	quest.53DCD54202753184.quest_desc: ["A durable drill component made of brass, designed to enhance mining efficiency and precision. Ideal for upgrading drills to achieve smoother and faster block breaking."]
	quest.53E28A4E4223206B.quest_subtitle: "“Power beyond comprehension.”"
	quest.53E4BBE093B08389.quest_desc: [
		"An upgrade for &bCrafting CPUs&r that enables &eparallel recipe processing&r, allowing multiple crafting steps to execute &esimultaneously&r. Each unit adds +1 &9concurrent operation&r."
		""
		"Key Traits:"
		""
		"&dEssential&r for complex autocrafting"
		""
		"Stackable up to &615 units&r per CPU"
		""
		"Requires &cadditional channels&r"
		""
		"(The &a\"multicore processor\"&r for your ME Network!)"
		""
		"&e\"Parallel crafting at quantum speeds\"&r"
	]
	quest.53E4BBE093B08389.title: "&5Crafting Co-Processing Unit&r"
	quest.53EA40114B347A83.quest_desc: [
		"Fireproof Vats are required in a 3x3x2 configuration."
		""
		"Graphite electrodes must be used, and make sure to pump out the CO2."
		""
		"The electrode holders require a minimum of 25A to operate, but they have three times the resistance compared to the electrolyzer. Each must be supplied with at least 31.5 kV. This can be achieved using two max-speed Generators, a Transformer with a turn ratio of 6, and Diodes on each electrode holder."
	]
	quest.53EA40114B347A83.title: "Arc Furnace"
	quest.54169B69725C49DF.quest_desc: ["Main ingredient used for various recipes from now on."]
	quest.541BBC35DA4F0B73.quest_desc: ["Sprouting from a cluster of towering fungi, this outpost of miners has carved their livelihood into the surface world. Ruthless and territorial, they will defend their claim with tooth and nail. Whether the giant mushrooms shield them from the sun or serve some darker purpose, none can say. One truth remains certain: the mine runs rich with ore, for those bold enough to claim it."]
	quest.541BBC35DA4F0B73.quest_subtitle: "Find a Mushroom Mine"
	quest.5435BF11EB742A73.quest_subtitle: "Blow a Shear Pin"
	quest.5435BF11EB742A73.title: "Snap!"
	quest.54589F10802DFE16.quest_desc: ["A clutch that is uncoupled unless powered."]
	quest.546232163137A42E.quest_desc: ["Around this&a cave&r you will find &6amber,&r which when broken &bmight drop&r &eamber curiosity&r which is used to create a &9monolith&r to spawn &6dinosaurs&r and used to create the &cominous catalyst&r."]
	quest.54653619B53EA07F.quest_desc: ["The &aEnergy Module&r increases the energy of your items."]
	quest.546F7FF099D2696E.quest_desc: ["A better tier of tube with more storage."]
	quest.546F7FF099D2696E.title: "&dUltimate Pressurized Tubes"
	quest.54778BD66812A1CF.quest_desc: ["A transport component used to move fluids between tanks, machines, and engines. Designed for efficiency and integration with Create’s mechanical systems, it ensures smooth fluid transfer in your automation setups."]
	quest.5478173C78715113.quest_desc: ["Another rocket that allows you to reach more planets"]
	quest.54832AACF9BC8B54.quest_desc: [
		"&ePackagedAuto&r simplifies complex crafting by using &6packages&r instead of handling large numbers of individual items."
		""
		"To begin using PackagedAuto, you will need:"
		""
		"• A &ePackage Recipe Encoder&r"
		"• One or more &6Recipe Pattern Holders&r"
		"• A &ePackager&r"
		"• An &eUnpackager&r"
		""
		"Encoded Recipe Pattern Holders tell Packagers which &6packages&r they are allowed to create."
		""
		"PackagedAuto is designed with &3Applied Energistics 2&r integration in mind."
		"r"
	]
	quest.54832AACF9BC8B54.title: "&ePackagedAuto – Introduction&r"
	quest.5485B6F41527B500.quest_desc: ["Fires an &earrow&r &lwith&r the&d inscribed spell's&r effect, &lif&r &cout of mana&r will fire normal arrows, &lif&r &cout of arrows&r will shoot spell arrows with no damage. can fire &dagumented arrows&r."]
	quest.54877D056BBDB4EF.quest_desc: [
		"Woven from Dark Matter and transcending fluids. The highest matrix tier, required for 1Qd storage and the endgame autocrafting structures."
		""
		"&7Fun fact: In theoretical physics, cosmic strings are hypothetical one dimensional cracks in the fabric of spacetime left over from the Big Bang, thinner than a proton but weighing trillions of tons per meter.&r"
	]
	quest.54877D056BBDB4EF.quest_subtitle: "Spacetime Thread Core"
	quest.54877D056BBDB4EF.title: "Cosmic String Component Matrix"
	quest.54BF53CB70636C3F.quest_desc: ["Pretty much just a &l3x3x4&r &ltall&r &lrectangle&r used in &ecreating&r a few &bitems.&r"]
	quest.54C6961ACAFC8D8B.quest_desc: ["&dA true Pearl&r. Capable of creating a &0black hole&r when thrown. And used to craft the amazing &6Infinity Catalyst&r"]
	quest.54D0A4F6DCE5872C.quest_desc: ["The &aProjectile Velocity Module&r increases the velocity of your arrows when you shoot."]
	quest.54D6F7F8FE859729.quest_desc: ["You can find &bprosperity ore&r almost anywhere, when mined it will drop &bprosperity shards&r which are a &cbase&r for most &6crafts&r in this mod. And when crafted with a &aseed,&r you will get a &bposperity seed base&r which is used to craft many different &amaterial&r and &eanimal seeds&r."]
	quest.54D8B9CB3F98040F.quest_desc: [
		"Hohlraum filled with D-T Fuel? &oCheck!&r"
		""
		"Deuterium and Tritium ready to be pumped into the Reactor? &oCheck!&r"
		""
		"A Laser Amplifier with at least 400MRF ready to shoot into the Laser Focus Matrix? &oCheck!&r"
		""
		"Once you are ready, place the &5Hohlraum&r into the &aFusion Reactor Controller&r, pump in the Fuel, then activate your Laser Amplifier."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"If done right, &nyou'll see the Reactor activate!&r"
		""
	]
	quest.54D8B9CB3F98040F.title: "&6Completed Fusion Reactor"
	quest.54DA6CDF124E17B0.quest_desc: [
		"Thanks to a custom API, this mod completely bypasses 32-bit limitations and expands it up to 64-bits"
		""
		"Each player has their own network ensuring zero interference or cross-contamination."
		"Simple configuration without any linking tools, frequency channels or confusing GUIs. It just works"
	]
	quest.54DA6CDF124E17B0.quest_subtitle: "Flux Network but better!"
	quest.54DA9183B37E2BC5.quest_desc: ["&aPassivaly generates&r &eEMC&r and adds it to your \"&eEMC Acount&r\" in the &atop left&r of your screen. The &eEMC account&r can be spent at the &dtransmutation table&r."]
	quest.54DA9183B37E2BC5.title: "Power Flower"
	quest.54EAD95EDB6985A5.quest_desc: [
		"Place it above the the &#FF14E1Ritual Bowl&r to automatically collect produced items."
		""
		"{image:ftb:textures/quests/auto_collection.png width:170 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.54EAD95EDB6985A5.title: "Auto Collection"
	quest.54FD2EA4EAB18FA9.quest_desc: ["The &aItem Dislocator&r is a magnet with a range of &d8 blocks&r."]
	quest.54FF196F91374747.quest_desc: [
		"The &bSmart Wrench&r is a versatile tool in &5RFTools&r used for configuring and interacting with various &6machines&r and &ddevices&r."
		""
		"The &bSmart Wrench&r allows players to &arotate&r, &cconfigure&r, and &n&lconnect&r &5RFTools&r machines. To use the &bSmart Wrench&r, simply &n&rright-click&r on a machine to open its configuration &6GUI&r or to &arotate&r it to the desired orientation."
		""
		"You can also &n&bshift-right-click&r to &4disconnect&r cables or remove connections between devices. This tool is essential for setting up and managing your &dRFTools&r setups with &aease&r."
	]
	quest.5503FB3007C0CC91.quest_subtitle: "\"Finally a decent bomb in this game\""
	quest.550533917BF9B6FB.quest_desc: ["&6A lot more storage.&r"]
	quest.550D14F2C1CB91DF.quest_desc: ["&rThe Baubley Heart Canisters mod adds heart canisters that increase your max health. They’re equipped via Curios slots and come in different tiers, with stronger hearts dropped from tougher mobs."]
	quest.550D14F2C1CB91DF.title: "Heart Canister"
	quest.551B6182DC7E577B.quest_desc: ["Found in the &cnether&r around &lY 64-127&r and &lY 0-40&r in &9The Other&r dimension, this is used to craft new &abetter gear&r then &6ATM ore&r and is mined with an &6ATM pickaxe&r."]
	quest.551C060D404540D1.quest_desc: ["First we need to gather long lost knowledge of the Obsidian Kingdom. Some of the villages may hold them."]
	quest.5523A71F1688EA88.quest_desc: [
		"Forbidden \\&\\ Arcanus adds new ways to get better armor, enchants, and more!"
		""
		"This magic-themed mod has amazing animations, as well as some overpowered items like the &6Eternal Stella&r. "
	]
	quest.5523A71F1688EA88.title: "Welcome to &5Forbidden \\& Arcanus!"
	quest.5530C0D8BF092FCA.quest_subtitle: "Extended Crafting adds more ways to craft items, more items to craft with, and more utilities for crafting."
	quest.5530C0D8BF092FCA.title: "Welcome to &5Extended Crafting"
	quest.554102109E795CD3.quest_desc: ["An electrical component that limits or controls the flow of current in a circuit. It’s crucial for protecting devices and ensuring stable power distribution."]
	quest.556488ADD6C1576A.quest_desc: ["No more passive lines for MA essence autocraft. This update converts essence into resources &4AUTOMATICALLY.&r"]
	quest.556488ADD6C1576A.quest_subtitle: "Automation"
	quest.556D9C78EFAB5091.quest_desc: [
		"The ME Terminal is a HUD which gives you access to items stored in your ME Network. This will also include items accessible through ME Storage Bus."
		""
		"It has the ability to sort and search, as well as filter by using View Cell. It requires a Channe to function."
	]
	quest.556F880BBB1729C1.quest_desc: ["The &bXNet Router&r in &5XNet&r is used to manage and direct traffic between different network segments, while the &bWireless Router&r enables wireless communication between XNet devices over a distance."]
	quest.556F880BBB1729C1.title: "Routers"
	quest.55749230931993F2.quest_desc: [
		"Mostly clear glass made with Certus Quartz Dust."
		""
		"Can be used to make Vibrant Quartz Glass and other items."
	]
	quest.558C9059F23890E8.quest_desc: ["Boosts &7Anima spell damage&r, your &cmax health&r, and randomaly &6damages&r or &aheals &renemies"]
	quest.55AD5F4C1CDDCE35.quest_subtitle: "Can store 16000FE"
	quest.55D40CC92FA0FC2B.quest_desc: ["It doesn't do anything. Yet. But it looks like it will do something terrifying."]
	quest.55DCA040C84DCEF3.quest_desc: ["The &2Fluidizer&r needs &o&epower&r to operate, so a &6Power Port&r is required and to take the product the &2Fluidizer&r makes you'll be needed a &cOutput Port&r as well."]
	quest.55DCA040C84DCEF3.title: "Fluidizer Ports"
	quest.55E2F8C6A71E7328.quest_desc: ["A better tier of Conducter with more storage."]
	quest.55E2F8C6A71E7328.title: "&9Elite Thermodynamic Conductor"
	quest.55ED711EFD438FC3.quest_desc: ["What you have made so far &acomes together&r, &bThe extreme crafting table&f. You will use this for most of the &6powerful crafts&r."]
	quest.55EDCD2CB3329A4D.quest_desc: [
		"The &cStock Export Bus&r can be configured to export an exact amount of the filtered stacks. It keeps track of the amount"
		"currently present in the target inventory and doesn't insert above that number. To configure it, you open the GUI, drag"
		"the desired item into the filter slot and, using a middle click, you can configure the amount. Note that it will not"
		"regulate the output, meaning it won't extract extra items/fluids from the inventory if they go over the configured"
		"amount."
		""
		""
		"The &2Import &9Export&r &4bus&r&r is a mixture of an &2Import Bus&r and an &9Export Bus&r. The"
		"filter can be set to configure the exported stacks. Anything that is not on the filter is a valid stack to be imported."
	]
	quest.560AF08F81A2D904.quest_subtitle: "A simple energy generator"
	quest.563A3503CD040E41.quest_desc: ["A coiled conductor that generates a magnetic field when energized. It’s essential for crafting motors, generators, and other advanced electromechanical systems."]
	quest.563A3503CD040E41.quest_subtitle: "Made in a winding machine."
	quest.564E82070F5FFFB4.quest_desc: [
		"The &bSyringe&r in &5RFTools&r is a tool used to collect and store &9mob essence&r, which can be used for various purposes such as creating &dspawn eggs&r or mob-based modules."
		""
		"&n&bLeft-click&r a mob with the syringe to collect its essence. You"
	]
	quest.564F3BA8FC29C800.quest_desc: ["Structural framework blocks that form the outer containment shell of the Stellar Nexus."]
	quest.564F3BA8FC29C800.quest_subtitle: "Containment Framework"
	quest.564F3BA8FC29C800.title: "Assembler Core Casing"
	quest.566C0FA15F2021F1.title: "Steel Ingots"
	quest.566D6390193DD77D.quest_desc: [
		"Brass Tunnels may be used on mechanical belts for four functions: 1) purely decorative, 2) splitting streams of items to multiple destinations, 3) sorting streams of items, and 4) combining multiple streams of items. Each tunnel can have an input or output portal. The status of being an input or output depends purely on the direction of the belt touching a given side."
		""
		"Tunnels which are placed immediately next to each other are automatically treated as a group, in most cases collecting from all inputs and distributing to all outputs. The way that items are distributed is controlled by the tunnels' value setting. Item stacks from different inputs will not be combined prior to distributing."
	]
	quest.5676B5FD97FB10C3.quest_desc: ["A &bquicker version&r of the &cfurnace&r requiring &bsteam.&r"]
	quest.5680D3DCB53D9EAD.quest_desc: [
		"The &4Quantum core&r is the heart of the &1Quantum Computer&r. It has 256M of crafting storage and 8 co-processor threads by"
		"itself."
		""
		"It's the only block that can create a formed quantum computer by itself and provide all the benefits of a quantum computer."
		""
		"However, if used to create a multiblock, a much more powerful computer can be created."
		""
		"When used as a standalone computer, power must be provided through the Up or Down sides, where the connectors are."
	]
	quest.5685710C9FE8C918.quest_desc: [
		"Assemble your rocket in the &9Rocket Station&r."
		"place 9 rocket launch pads in a 3x3 area and place your rocket on it."
		"Shift right click your rocket and insert 3 fuel buckets and press SPACE to start the countdown!"
	]
	quest.56DAB8BF6BF52E6D.quest_desc: ["&cPowerful gear&r made of &6ATM ore&r, these tools &edo not break&r and have &damazing stats&r!"]
	quest.56EB12EFCAA0AB92.quest_desc: ["The best &esurvival capacitor&r you can get, makes &cmachines&r run past &d100% efficiency!&r"]
	quest.56FD576C200FC323.quest_desc: ["1 Quadrillion bytes of crafting storage. Installing 25 of these inside the Quantum Computation Nexus unlocks Infinite Computation Mode."]
	quest.56FD576C200FC323.quest_subtitle: "1,000,000,000,000,000 Byte Storage Cell"
	quest.56FD576C200FC323.title: "1Qd Mega Crafting Storage"
	quest.5706B73C528F473B.quest_desc: [
		"The &bBioreactor&r converts &aorganic materials&r into &dpower&r."
		""
		"Insert a variety of &aorganic items&r into its input slots."
		""
		"The more diverse the items, the more &dpower&r it generates."
	]
	quest.57175CF690ADCCBE.quest_desc: [
		"The Bottling Machine has no GUI. RF is supplied through the top back central block of the multiblock (where the Light Engineering Block was)."
		""
		"Fluids are added through the bottom middle block of the backside. Items are added by dropping them on the Bottling Machine's Conveyor Belts. When a liquid storing item (such as a Bucket or Jerrycan) is introduced to the Bottling Machine, the Bottling Machine will fill and output it, consuming some RF."
		""
		"The Bottling Machine with fill each container with up to 32 buckets (32,000 mB) of fluid with each pass. If the container can hold more then 32,000 mB, or if the machine runs out of the liquid, it will be sent down partially full and may need to be sent back around by conveyor belts to be filled more."
	]
	quest.57175CF690ADCCBE.title: "Bottling Machine"
	quest.57282D7E31EE61EE.quest_desc: [
		"Once you've gathered a few &aRaw Iesnium Ores&r, you'll probably want to use the first few ingots to make an &dIesnium Pickaxe&r. This not only mines Iesnium like the Infused Pickaxe, but lasts a lot longer too."
		""
		"Do yourself a favor and make one of these!"
	]
	quest.57282D7E31EE61EE.title: "&aThe Otherworld Pickaxe&r"
	quest.574F7DCA58038E98.quest_desc: [
		"&6Drygmy&r can be found anywhere tending to animals, though &drarley&r. If you do find one, through it an &eWilden horn&r to get its token."
		""
		"After crafting its charm, you can summon the &6Drygmy&r by using the charm on&a mossy cobbelstone&r, and can dye this creature &bcyan&r, &8brown&r, or &6orange&r. The &6Drygmy&r will produce mob loot from the animals near it &cwithout&r killing them!"
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"When you use the charm on the cobble it will turn into a &aHenge&r with which you can summon more with more &6charms&r, to get rid of any familiar or summon use &ddispell&r."
		""
		"The &6Drygmy&r produce more when they are &ehappy&r, give them &amore animals&r and add a &cvariety&r for the most happiness. The way this system works is each &6Drygmy&r attached to the same &aHenge&r will put progress toward a completion level, when it hits max it will drop to zero and give loot from animals withen &l10 blocks&r, then will need to recharge with &dSource&r."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&bFamiliar form&r: Gives the player &cextra damage&r with earth spells, and has a chance to apply &l&elooting&r&r on mob kill."
	]
	quest.575039EFF672065E.title: "Vacuum Tube"
	quest.576873A2E3A4D8ED.quest_subtitle: "Treated Wood Planks are Wood Planks coated in creosote oil and is used in the construction of many Immersive Engineering items."
	quest.576873A2E3A4D8ED.title: "The Treated Wood"
	quest.576ABF43FCF886B7.quest_desc: ["Different &ctiers&r of &aseeds&r need different &ctiers&r of &aessence&r and &6farmland,&r &dmake some&r&d!&r"]
	quest.5772AF46A3225332.quest_desc: ["The basic crafting ingredient for &dSigils.&r"]
	quest.57BA62BB010D870C.quest_desc: [
		"The standard energy storage block for &5ME Networks&r, storing AE2 power with configurable input/output sides."
		""
		"Variants:"
		""
		"&eEnergy Cell&r (basic storage)"
		""
		"&5Dense Energy Cell&r (higher capacity)"
		""
		"Key Properties:"
		""
		"Must connect to &5ME Controller&r"
		""
		"No channel consumption"
		""
		"Works with &6P2P Tunnels&r"
	]
	quest.57BA62BB010D870C.title: "&bEnergy Cell &r"
	quest.57BC89068117657A.quest_desc: ["Honsestly you are free to use anything you want. Although if you are for better sources of energy those might interest you."]
	quest.57C889EC980D33D9.quest_desc: ["I can finally top playing in the dirt (as much) and hand off my farming duties to someone else. I should probably have the farmer start with carrots since they don't need to be cooked, too..."]
	quest.57E30971FCEF6709.quest_desc: [
		"The Atomic Disassembler is Mekanism's an all-in-one tool, essentially the ultimate, electronic version of the paxel."
		""
		"Tools the Atomic Disassembler replaces:"
		""
		"Pickaxe"
		"Axe"
		"Shovel"
		""
		"Notable tools the Atomic Disassembler does not replace:"
		""
		"Shears"
		"Saw"
		"Sword - Although a very formidable weapon dealing an average of 20 health points, the Atomic Disassembler cannot swing attack."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"The Atomic Disassembler has five different settings which may be cycled through by Shift + Right clicking or using the Item mode switch keybind:"
		""
		"Normal (202)"
		"The default setting"
		"Works as if a diamond version of every tool with Efficiency II."
		"Slow (82)"
		"Works as if a diamond version of every tool."
		"Fast (1282)"
		"Works as if a diamond version of every tool with Efficiency V."
		"Off (02)"
		"Does not affect the world around it, except for mobs."
		"Good setting to leave it on if you intend to use it as your main weapon... and don't want to dig yourself into a death trap."
	]
	quest.57FCBFBA8789F893.quest_subtitle: "Works underwater."
	quest.58134A3611BA2D30.quest_desc: ["A &bdiamond&r is no longer rare. A &dstar&r is no longer bright. This is the new foundation of &aimpossibility.&r Crafted at the &bSkulk Crafting Table&r."]
	quest.581BAC59F957FC9F.quest_desc: ["&cWhen fired&r, this bow &dsummons&r many &earrows&r from the &bsky&r to &astrike the target&r."]
	quest.5831B3192C0E8C56.quest_desc: [
		"Want to access your storage remotely? This can be done with either the &eStable Wormhole&r or the &aStorage Accessor&r."
		""
		"To use the &eStable Wormhole&r, shift-click a &dStorage Actuator&r to link it. You can then place the Wormhole to act as another storage location."
		""
		"The &aStorage Accessor&r is linked in the same way, but acts as a wireless remote that can even work across dimensions!"
	]
	quest.5831B3192C0E8C56.title: "&aRemote Access&r"
	quest.5837C573A6DD9F15.quest_desc: [
		"&dWither Builder&r"
		""
		"The &dWither Builder&r is an incredible machine that takes the danger out of summoning the &aWither&r boss. By automating the entire process, it ensures you can focus on defense and resource collection without the hassle."
		""
		"&6Setting It Up:&r"
		""
		"&3Step 1: Find a Safe Spot&r"
		"First, place the &dWither Builder&r in a secure, enclosed area to contain the &aWither&r when it spawns. This prevents unnecessary destruction and keeps your base safe."
		""
		"&3Step 2: Power It Up&r"
		"Next, connect the &dWither Builder&r to a strong &dpower source&r. This machine requires a significant amount of energy, so make sure your power supply is robust."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&3Step 3: Load the Ingredients&r"
		"Then, insert &a3 Wither Skeleton Skulls&r and &a4 Soul Sand&r or &aSoul Soil&r into the builder. These materials are essential for summoning the &aWither&r."
		""
		"&3Step 4: Activate&r"
		"Once powered and loaded with the necessary materials, the &dWither Builder&r will automatically construct the &aWither&r. Be prepared, as the &aWither&r will spawn hostile and ready to fight!"
		""
		"&3Pro Tips:&r"
		"- Surround the &dWither Builder&r with &cblast-resistant blocks&r like &bObsidian&r to minimize damage from the &aWither&r’s explosions."
		"- Set up &dHoppers&r or &aItem Collectors&r nearby to automatically gather &aNether Stars&r and other valuable drops from the defeated &aWither&r."
	]
	quest.583A7AA84FEC027F.quest_desc: [
		"Before anything can be built, you need a Builder. The Builder must build their own Builder’s Hut before building any other huts, and they cannot build or upgrade a hut to a higher level than their own hut level. "
		""
		"The builder is arguably the hardest working citizen in your colony. (Second only to you). You are not limited to just one builder. As your colony grows, you may need to add more builders just to keep up. "
	]
	quest.583A7AA84FEC027F.quest_subtitle: "Say that 10 times real fast! "
	quest.583A7AA84FEC027F.title: "Build the Builder Building"
	quest.58445E5B3957ACC8.quest_desc: ["&6Glowstone Ingots&r can be used for making &eGlowstone Armor&r, &eRefined Glowstone Tools&r and &eTeleporter Frames&r."]
	quest.584BF3914F33F67B.quest_desc: [
		"Powah.. Powah.. Powah... Without a doubt my favourite (Kaladin here btw :D) power source for early game. It is cheap, conventional, especially easy to craft due to seeds from mystical agriculture."
		"You have realistically three options to go for power:"
		"- thermo generator - Wes has buffed them significantly and with soul lava they provide 9000% usual production"
		"- magmator - same as thermo gens, they have been buffed"
		"- reactor - my favourite before stepping into midgame, very easy to automate with ae2, each of the multiblock can produce up to 500k/t FE. Stack some of them and you are good for some time."
	]
	quest.584BF3914F33F67B.title: "Powah!"
	quest.58697C7A011F53FE.quest_desc: ["The &eSlimey Generator&r uses &aSlime-related Items&r such as &bSlimeballs&r and &dMagma Cream&r to produce &cEnergy&r. It’s a quirky way to convert your &aSlime&r collection into useful &cPower&r, especially if you have a slime farm."]
	quest.587A19FC348387C5.quest_desc: [
		"The Pressurized Reaction Chamber (PRC) is used primarily to create Substrate (to create HDPE Pellets), HDPE Pellets (to create HDPE Sheets), and Ethylene (an efficient source of fuel used in the Gas-Burning Generator). It has a variable speed and energy usage dependent on the materials/gasses it is creating."
		""
		"The Pressurized Reaction Chamber accepts a liquid, a gas, and a material(s); it uses these three substances to create another material(s) and some leftover gas. Like many other Mekanism machines, it has configurable sides; by default, it accepts gas from the left, accepts liquid from the back, and outputs gas on the right."
	]
	quest.58C2ABED43B2EA61.quest_desc: ["To get a Data Model, you must first craft a Data Model Framework, and use it on the target entity to build the model. Once you have your model, you will have to train it."]
	quest.58CA2853D9620919.quest_desc: ["Place &cinside machines&r to increase thier &boverclock.&r"]
	quest.58D711E1E495E3C4.quest_subtitle: "“In darkness, I bring light.”"
	quest.58DBD29376F49B22.quest_desc: [
		"Break &esulfur crystals&r throughout these &6caves&r to get this &adust&r used in &6crafting&r."
		""
		"&eSulfur&r can grow on &esulfur blocks&r if i tis touching the new &aAcid liquid&r."
	]
	quest.58EA939B704746E3.quest_desc: [
		"2x &fCompressed Iron Block 6x&r represent nearly &e10 Million ingots of pure iron&r!"
		""
		"An impenetrable fortress of industrial automation."
	]
	quest.58EA939B704746E3.title: "⚙️ &fSteel Wall: ~10 Million Iron"
	quest.58F07416B7E6A42F.quest_desc: [
		"&4Throughput Monitors&r are a subtype of monitor. They provide the same functionalities a <ItemLink id=\"ae2:storage_monitor\" />"
		"does, with the addition of a throughput meter. I will keep track of a single item/fluid type and monitor changed to its"
		"quantity, displaying the amount per second to the user."
		""
		"It does *not* require a channel."
		""
		""
		"The &1Throughput monitor configurator&r is a tool that can be used to change the presented data. Right-clicking a monitor"
		"with one in hand will cycle between three options:"
		""
		"* Items per tick"
		"* Items per second"
		"* Items per minute"
		""
		"Note: It may take some time before the readings stabilize when changing the modes, so don't trust initial values!"
	]
	quest.58F63AEBB7F5241A.quest_desc: [
		"The water separator transforms water into Oxygen and Hydrogen"
		""
		"The machine works by putting water in the second slot and it will generate "
		"Hydrogen and Oxygen that you can gather placing buckets or tanks."
		""
		"Water input needs to be on the bottom part of the machine"
	]
	quest.590DAF80B3A58FC6.quest_desc: ["Inscribed with a &lform-less&r&d spell&r, this sword applies a &btouch form spell&r with the enscribed effects &aplus amplification&r and 8 damage."]
	quest.5914D015D8543875.quest_desc: [
		"The &2Fluidizer&r can operate in one of &o&b3&r modes: &o&bSolid&r to &o&bFluid&r, combining &o&b2 Solids&r into a &o&bFluid&r, or combining &o&b2 Fluids&r into a new &o&bFluid&r. This all depends on the type of &aInjectors&r you use for the multiblock."
		""
		"For example, if you want to convert &1Blutonium&r into a fluid, you can use &o&b1&r &aSolid Injector&r,"
		"If you want to combine &o&btwo solids together&r into something &nnew&r, you'll build the multiblock with &o&b2&r &aSolid Injectors&r. If you want to combine &o&btwo fluids&r, you'll use &o&b2&r &9Fluid Injectors&r."
		""
		"This might seem confusing, but is &o&6important&r for progression. For example, you'll want to convert &cMagentite&r into a fluid in the &2Fluidizer&r first, then send it to a &eReprocessor&r with &5Ludicrite&r to create &7Ridiculite&r."
	]
	quest.5914D015D8543875.title: "Fluidizer Injectors"
	quest.5921FE935A2D7325.quest_desc: ["The Alloy Kiln is fairly simple to use; putting solid fuels in the bottom slot in the GUI will power the Alloy Kiln. The two other left slots are where each Ingot or Grit can be added to form a new ingot. After about 8 seconds, two new ingots will be formed."]
	quest.5921FE935A2D7325.title: "Alloy Kiln"
	quest.592335BFDAF5C228.quest_desc: ["Use with an &daffixed&r item in a &aSmithing table&r to simplify its name."]
	quest.5960F7B3CA809280.quest_desc: [
		"The &dDye Mixer&r combines different dyes to create new colors."
		""
		"Place &adyes&r in the input slots, and the &dDye Mixer&r will produce the desired color."
		""
		"Ensure it has &dpower&r and the necessary &adyes&r for operation."
	]
	quest.59686FB7606AD0CE.quest_desc: ["Tide armor provides good early game protection which is a bit better than diamond. It also provides buffs when it water."]
	quest.598E3ECE201D52C2.quest_desc: ["The &dbest&r of the &dbest,&r &6no one can match you&r. Not even &agravity&r can kill you."]
	quest.598E3ECE201D52C2.quest_subtitle: "Gravity is optional. So is falling."
	quest.599A7147413C3F69.quest_desc: ["Used as fuel in the &lRight-slot&r of an &eReforging table&r."]
	quest.59DD1897F151B40D.quest_desc: [
		"&6Starbuckles&r are great for automation in moving items around. These litle guys can be found in dense forests and can be approched by a player holding a &egolden nugget&r, after you then throw the &egold nugget&r on the ground it will pick it up and dissapear leaving behind a &6Starbuckle totem&r."
		""
		"Crafting with &egold ingots&r and the &6totem&r in an apparatus will give a &6Starbuckle charm&r which you can use to summon a pet &6starbuckle&r, you can build your new friend a bed of &dmagebloom&r."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Using a &edominion wand &r you can &lRight-Click&r the little guy and &lShift-Right-Click&r on his bed to give it to him, he will use it when he is idle"
		""
		"&6Starbuckles&r will passively gather nearby &dSourceberries&r, if you &lRight-Click&r&l the &6Starbuckle&r then &lShift-Right-Click&r a chest will make it put items it finds on the ground and growing berries in it, you can &nfilter&r out all items except the one by using an &7item frame&r, just put an &7item frame&r on the chest with the item you want in the chest and he will only put that item in the chest."
		""
		"&cNote&r: &6Starbuckles&r can have multiple jobs, &lShift-Right-Click&r the &6Starbuckle&r to &cremove&r all jobs, and can be given a Wixie hat to also be able to transport potions to potion jars if told to."
		""
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&bFamiliar form&r: gives player &lSpeed II&r. When you use a &6golden nugget&r will help the player find &egold ore&r."
	]
	quest.59DDDE6C32FE3C48.quest_desc: ["Throw this into a &cVolcano&r which is found within the &6primordial caves&r to summon an &0ancient undead beast&r. Kill it for &6tectonic plates&r."]
	quest.59F5ED931FD70C55.quest_desc: ["&9Patterns&r are the bread and butter of autocrafting. These store recipes to let your RS network know how to craft items."]
	quest.59F5ED931FD70C55.title: "Autocrafting!"
	quest.5A0860631323B5E3.quest_desc: ["A special food item crafted with Yeast and other ingredients. Great nourishment and an example of PneumaticCraft’s unique food mechanics."]
	quest.5A0DDE4265A2A8B4.quest_desc: [
		"Applying the &3Echoing Spawner Rune&r adds the &1Echoing&r modifier to the spawner."
		""
		"Spawned mobs will drop additional copies of their loot (stacks up to 3 times)!"
	]
	quest.5A0DDE4265A2A8B4.title: "Echoing Spawner Rune"
	quest.5A11A2FC20E5CE2A.quest_desc: [
		"The Barracks is the ultimate protection for your colony. The Barracks Towers (unlike the normal Guard tower) will employ and house one Guard for every level built, for a total of 5 Guards per Barracks Tower!"
		""
		"In the later game you will likely want two barracks chock full of &mexpendable&r brave souls."
		""
		"Tip: At level 3, you can hire spies for 5 gold per raid, these spies will go out into the world and if barbarians are spotted, the spies will tell you exactly where the barbarians are."
	]
	quest.5A11A2FC20E5CE2A.quest_subtitle: "Build a Barracks"
	quest.5A14292FE47ED873.quest_desc: ["A precision-crafted component that captures fluid or air flow to generate rotational energy. It’s a key part of turbine engines, ensuring smooth and efficient power conversion."]
	quest.5A161F190A8E1342.quest_desc: ["A &dGamma QIO Drive&r can contain &o&b65,536,000,000,000&r &nitems&r and &o&b2,097,152&r &nitem types&r."]
	quest.5A2174711D9219BF.quest_desc: ["Mine up to 64 of the same block for hunger. Change the hotkey in your keybinds. Search for \"FTB Ultimine\""]
	quest.5A2450162FD24F7E.quest_desc: [
		"Two Crushing Wheels must be placed next to each other horizontally or vertically one block apart. Both wheels must be given opposite rotational force. Any items to be crushed must be inserted where the wheels rotate inwards."
		""
		"Crushing wheels can be automated by placing a hopper at the top directly between the wheels and either a depot or conveyor belt below."
	]
	quest.5A2450162FD24F7E.quest_subtitle: "Crushing Wheels applie Crushing recipes to any items inserted from the direction they are spinning away from."
	quest.5A2450162FD24F7E.title: "Crushing Wheels"
	quest.5A26E1BB8C1B8172.quest_desc: ["Generates passive energy during the day using sunlight. Higher tiers produce more energy."]
	quest.5A2AF10773FA8B2D.quest_desc: ["The &1modular routers&r mod adds a block that can move items, place or break blocks, shoot projectiles, and more using upgradeable modules. It’s highly customizable and useful for automation in compact setups."]
	quest.5A3D5CAD827CCCB8.quest_desc: [
		"You’ve tasted the chaos, battled the sweets, and survived the cavity. You’ve earned your sugar high."
		""
		"&dThis effect can be obtained by eating any candy from the candy cavity, with the sundae being the most likely to grant this effect&f."
	]
	quest.5A58D4B25C9CB757.quest_desc: ["Tools stronger then the &cprevious tier&r of &aessence.&r"]
	quest.5A5A30CD4D0C98CB.quest_desc: ["Fluix Crystal is crafted in world by tossing Charged Certus Quartz Crystal, Nether Quartz and Redstone Dust in Water."]
	quest.5A615BB74A5CD332.quest_desc: [
		"Using the &6Reprocessor&r, we can combine &o&beverything&r we've made so far to make &o&bnew ingots&r."
		""
		"You might need a &aFluidizer&r to complete this step!"
	]
	quest.5A70A9C0D6D77639.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.5A9B2246E33065A5.quest_desc: [
		"Produces more combs per trip. "
		""
		"The best being Very High."
	]
	quest.5A9B2246E33065A5.title: "Productivity"
	quest.5A9D6672385D3D82.quest_desc: ["Used to apply various upgrades to your pneumatic tools or armor. Insert into Charging Stations to customize your gear."]
	quest.5AAFDED22803AE85.quest_subtitle: "Contains some useful info"
	quest.5ACF4B46ED9134B2.quest_desc: ["Very strong armor made with &6ATM gear&r and a &aVibranium template&r with a &esmithing table&r."]
	quest.5AD13B93F716568B.quest_desc: [
		"&eWhat Is Sculk Crafting?&r"
		""
		"&eSculk Crafting&r is a special crafting recipe type used to automate recipes from the &eSculk Crafting Table&r."
		""
		"It focuses on &dsculk-based&r and &elate-game&r crafting mechanics."
		""
		"The Sculk Package Crafter &crequires power&r to operate."
		""
		"&eWhy Use Sculk Crafting?&r"
		""
		"• Automates unique sculk crafting mechanics"
		"• Removes manual sculk crafting steps"
		"• Fits naturally into late-game automation"
		"• Clean integration with &ePackagedAuto&r"
	]
	quest.5AD13B93F716568B.title: "&eSculk Crafting&r"
	quest.5AD80D3242DD3F60.quest_desc: ["One of the &o&bhardest materials&r to get in the mod! This block can be used as a &ecoil&r in your &bturbine.&r"]
	quest.5AEE86EB39FD4087.quest_desc: ["Splits compressed air into hot and cold streams. Useful for creating heat gradients needed in various machines like Refiners and Processing Plants."]
	quest.5AF160257BEEF682.quest_desc: ["The &6ME Glass Cable&r is the most basic type of cable used to connect devices in an &dME Network&r. It can carry up to &d8 channels&r, making it suitable for &asmall to medium-sized networks&r. This cable is essential for &ainitial network setups&r and is often used as the &dbackbone&r of the network."]
	quest.5AFD4912CC8FBBB8.quest_subtitle: "Crafting ingredient"
	quest.5B0159A972A5A16C.quest_desc: ["Those gigants live in domes, where they graze their sheeps. They are hostile and do not let them come near you, they will grab you and bite of your head, killing you in an instant."]
	quest.5B0466324A5D3718.quest_desc: ["The &dWatch of flowing time&r allows you to move time &aforwards&r or &bbackwards&r when held and when placed on a &4pedestal&r will speed &eblock functions&r around it while &6slowing mobs&r."]
	quest.5B0466324A5D3718.quest_subtitle: "Best item in ProjecE"
	quest.5B1E0E3E876339E7.quest_desc: ["&dMystical agriculture&r adds new &aagumentable&r &aarmor!&r Crafted with &dgems&r from this &ctier,&r and &aarmor&r from the &cprevious tier&r you can craft &epowerful sets&r!"]
	quest.5B3CC3F66F2C3DE5.quest_desc: ["Seashelves help boost &aEterna&r and &dArcana&r, boosts &aEterna&r by &l1.5&r &lMax 22.5&r and &dArcana&r by &l2&r per shelf."]
	quest.5B3D9A1C8E4F0001.quest_desc: [
		"Welcome to &#8D46BDForbidden and Arcanus&r, an ancient magic mod centered around soul manipulation, alchemical metallurgy, multiblock rituals, and the mighty &6Hephaestus Forge&r."
		""
		"Start underground: mine &8Darkstone&r and &bArcane Crystals&r deep below. Grind the crystals into &dArcane Crystal Dust&r."
		""
		"&eTip:&r Right-click fully grown &bNipa plants&r (floating islands in Plains/Forest biomes) for renewable Arcane Crystal Dust Specks (Not a reliable farm btw)"
	]
	quest.5B3D9A1C8E4F0001.title: "Darkstone and Arcane Crystals"
	quest.5B3D9A1C8E4F0002.quest_desc: [
		"&6Edelwood Trees&r DID grow naturally in &8Dark Forest&r biomes. In new versions you need to click with a corrupt soul in a sapling!"
		""
		"To grow your own, you need a &cCorrupt Soul&r:"
		"1. Enchant your sword with &eSoul Looting&r."
		"2. Kill mobs until a &cCorrupt Soul&r drops."
		"3. Right-click any &aOak Sapling&r with the Corrupt Soul to transform it into a &6Growing Edelwood Sapling&r."
		"4. Plant it, use Bone Meal to grow it, then chop for &eEdelwood Logs&r!"
	]
	quest.5B3D9A1C8E4F0002.title: "Corrupt Souls and Growing Edelwood"
	quest.5B3D9A1C8E4F0003.quest_desc: [
		"&6Mundabitur Dust&r is the universal ritual powder of the mod."
		""
		"Craft it shapeless from: Arcane Crystal Dust + Redstone + Blaze Powder + Bone Meal + Gunpowder + Phantom Membrane."
		""
		"It is used to activate both the Hephaestus Forge and the Clibano multiblocks."
	]
	quest.5B3D9A1C8E4F0003.title: "Mundabitur Dust"
	quest.5B3D9A1C8E4F0004.quest_desc: [
		"Combine Gold with Arcane Crystal Dust and Mundabitur Dust to synthesize &eDeorum&r, an alchemically pure magical gold."
		""
		"The &6Blacksmith Gavel&r doubles ore drops when mining and is required to build the Hephaestus Forge! Craft the Iron version first, then upgrade to Golden and Reinforced Deorum tiers."
	]
	quest.5B3D9A1C8E4F0004.title: "Deorum and the Blacksmith Gavel"
	quest.5B3D9A1C8E4F0005.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Hephaestus Forge&r is the heart of Forbidden and Arcanus. Building it (1.21.1 layout):"
		""
		"1. Place 1 &eGilded Chiseled Polished Darkstone&r as the center."
		"2. Surround with 4 &bChiseled Arcane Polished Darkstone&r on cardinal sides."
		"3. Fill the outer ring with &7Polished Darkstone&r."
		"4. Place 8 more &eGilded Chiseled Polished Darkstone&r at the edges, each with a &6Darkstone Pedestal&r on top."
		"5. Place the &aSmithing Table&r in the center on the Gilded block."
		"6. &cSneak + Right-click&r the Smithing Table with &eMundabitur Dust&r to activate!"
	]
	quest.5B3D9A1C8E4F0005.title: "The Hephaestus Forge"
	quest.5B3D9A1C8E4F0006.quest_desc: [
		"Every forge ritual requires all 4 essences stocked:"
		""
		"- &bAureal&r: Craft Aureal Bottles from Arcane Crystals (35 each). Build &9Arcane Crystal Obelisks&r (2 Arcane Crystal Blocks on Polished Darkstone + Mundabitur Dust) for passive generation. Build 8 for decent income!"
		"- &8Souls&r: Use Soul Extractor on Soul Sand. Both regular Souls and Corrupt Souls give 1 Soul each. Enchanted Souls give 10!"
		"- &cBlood&r: Hold a &eBlood Test Tube in your offhand&r and kill mobs. Mobs killed near the forge also auto-fill blood."
		"- &aExperience&r: Use Xpetrified Orbs (91 XP each!) found between Y -6 and Y 35. Never discard them! &z(Or just craft it)&r"
	]
	quest.5B3D9A1C8E4F0006.title: "Feeding the Forge (4 Essences)"
	quest.5B3D9A1C8E4F0007.quest_desc: [
		"Upgrade your Hephaestus Forge through rituals from &6Tier 1 to Tier 5&r:"
		""
		"- &7Tier 2:&r Requires &eSpawner Scraps&r (drop from breaking spawners with a pickaxe)."
		"- &6Tier 4:&r Requires &dStellarite Pieces&r (from Stella Arcanum ore) and &aRunes&r (from Runic Stone in the Clibano)."
		"- &cTier 5:&r Requires &5Dark Nether Stars&r AND &6Dragon Scales&r from the Ender Dragon. Plan ahead, Dragon Scales are also needed for endgame armor!"
	]
	quest.5B3D9A1C8E4F0007.title: "Forge Tier Upgrades (Tier 1 to 5)"
	quest.5B3D9A1C8E4F0008.quest_desc: [
		"The &dEternal Stella&r is crafted with Stellarite Pieces in the Hephaestus Forge."
		"Applied to any tool, weapon or armor it makes the item permanently &6Unbreakable&r."
		""
		"&cWarning:&r Mine &5Stella Arcanum&r ore carefully, it explodes when broken! Clear the area first and step back immediately."
	]
	quest.5B3D9A1C8E4F0008.title: "The Eternal Stella"
	quest.5B3D9A1C8E4F0009.quest_desc: [
		"The &cClibano&r is a 3x3x3 multiblock blast furnace:"
		""
		"- Craft the &7Clibano Core&r by surrounding a Blast Furnace with 8 Darkstone blocks."
		"- Build the structure: 17 Polished Darkstone Bricks + 8 Polished Darkstone + 1 Clibano Core in the center of the middle layer."
		"- Right-click the Core with &eMundabitur Dust&r to activate."
		""
		"It smelts ores with bonus byproduct residues at ~33% chance per smelt!"
	]
	quest.5B3D9A1C8E4F0009.title: "The Clibano Multiblock Furnace"
	quest.5B3D9A1C8E4F0010.quest_desc: [
		"Equip the Clibano with prisms in the enhancer slot to change its behavior:"
		""
		"- &6Smelter Prism&r: Increases smelting speed."
		"- &9Sea Prism&r: Alters output and byproducts."
		""
		"Find the &eArtisan Relic&r inside armorer/toolsmith/weaponsmith village buildings and place it in the enhancer slot to reduce XP cost during smelting!"
	]
	quest.5B3D9A1C8E4F0010.title: "Clibano Prisms and Artisan Relic"
	quest.5B3D9A1C8E4F0011.quest_desc: [
		"The &bQuantum Catcher&r captures any mob in a portable sphere (no durability, never breaks!)."
		""
		"Craft it from &e4 Spawner Scraps + 1 Arcane Crystal Block&r. Spawner Scraps drop from breaking monster spawners with a pickaxe."
		""
		"&aTip:&r Use the Quantum Catcher to build a mob farm adjacent to your Hephaestus Forge to auto-fill the Blood essence!"
	]
	quest.5B3D9A1C8E4F0011.title: "Quantum Catcher and Spawner Scraps"
	quest.5B3D9A1C8E4F0012.quest_desc: [
		"&eAurum Trees&r grow naturally in &aFlower Forest&r biomes and occasionally drop gold nuggets from their leaves."
		""
		"Plant &6Yellow Orchids&r and use Arcane Crystal Obelisks for passive Aureal generation."
	]
	quest.5B3D9A1C8E4F0012.title: "Aurum Trees and Yellow Orchids"
	quest.5B3D9A1C8E4F0013.quest_desc: [
		"The &8Obsidian Skull&r absorbs fire damage for 30 seconds when held or worn. Upgrade to the &cEternal Obsidian Skull&r for complete, permanent fire immunity."
		""
		"The &bSpectral Eye Amulet&r highlights all nearby mobs through walls (Spectral Vision effect). Craft from: Nether Star + Eye of Ender + 2 Deorum Ingots + 3 String."
	]
	quest.5B3D9A1C8E4F0013.title: "Obsidian Skull and Spectral Eye Amulet"
	quest.5B3D9A1C8E4F0014.quest_desc: [
		"Defeat the &cEnder Dragon&r to obtain &6Dragon Scales&r (2-3 per kill). This unlocks the true endgame armor:"
		""
		"- &dDraco Arcanus Armor&r: 30 armor points, 3.0 toughness. Made from Dragon Scales."
		"- &5Tyr Armor&r: 37 armor points, 4.0 toughness (surpasses Netherite!). Made from Golden and Aquatic Dragon Scales."
		""
		"Also craft the &6Draco Arcanus Sword&r (12 damage!) from 5 Dragon Scales + 1 Diamond + 1 Draco Arcanus Staff."
	]
	quest.5B3D9A1C8E4F0014.title: "Dragon Scales, Tyr Armor, and Draco Arcanus"
	quest.5B3D9A1C8E4F0015.quest_desc: ["The &5Dark Nether Star&r and &8Obsidian Skull&r are dark magical relics that grant permanent fire immunity and unlock advanced dark ritual conversions."]
	quest.5B3D9A1C8E4F0015.title: "Dark Nether Star and Obsidian Skull"
	quest.5B3D9A1C8E4F0016.quest_desc: ["The &bSpectral Eye Amulet&r highlights nearby creatures through walls, while the &6Lens of Veritatis&r grants true arcane vision."]
	quest.5B3D9A1C8E4F0016.title: "Spectral Eye and Lens of Veritatis"
	quest.5B3D9A1C8E4F0017.quest_desc: ["Forge the legendary &8Mortem Armor&r (soul-infused armor) and the mighty &6Draco Arcanus Sword&r to conquer the deepest challenges."]
	quest.5B3D9A1C8E4F0017.title: "Mortem Armor and Draco Arcanus"
	quest.5B3D9A1C8E4F0018.quest_desc: ["Forge the legendary &8Mortem Armor&r (soul-infused armor) and the mighty &6Draco Arcanus Sword&r to conquer the deepest challenges."]
	quest.5B3D9A1C8E4F0018.title: "Mortem Armor and Draco Arcanus"
	quest.5B3FDF651D845DF1.quest_desc: ["A better tier of pipe with more storage."]
	quest.5B3FDF651D845DF1.title: "&9Elite Mechanical Pipe"
	quest.5B653A45093C56F0.quest_desc: [
		"In &bApotheosis&r, anvils can be &denchanted&r and &nhave no level limit&r! Anvils can receive &eUnbreaking&r, &cSplitting&r, and &9Obliteration&r."
		""
		"&l&cSplitting:&r"
		"Used on books with multiple enchantments to separate them into individual books. Has 20% chance per level."
		""
		"&l&9Obliteration:&r"
		"Used on books with a single enchantment above level 1. Splits the book into two books, each one level lower."
	]
	quest.5B653A45093C56F0.title: "Anvil Mechanics"
	quest.5B658B92D3E5641D.quest_desc: ["Attacks anything that comes in contact with it."]
	quest.5B681BC43371CC5C.quest_desc: [
		"The Logistical Transporter is the basic item transport pipe for Mekanism logistics. With the Configurator the player can choose to \"paint\" the pipe with colors that can be detected by the pipe's color sorter by ⇧ Shift + right-clicking the center of a transporter with a Configurator."
		""
		"It has 2 other cousins called the Diversion Transporter and the Restrictive Transporter."
	]
	quest.5B681BC43371CC5C.title: "&aBasic Logistical Transporter"
	quest.5B77D0FAD56A7F1F.quest_desc: [
		"The pinnacle autocrafting multiblock of UFO Future, running hyper-speed parallel matrix crafting across your entire network."
		""
		"Built with Hyper Mechanical Casings, Graviton Casings, an FE Energy Hatch, and a Quantum Grid Link. Transfer your automation patterns directly into it to complete your factory."
	]
	quest.5B77D0FAD56A7F1F.quest_subtitle: "Pinnacle Network Fabricator"
	quest.5B77D0FAD56A7F1F.title: "Infinity Fabrication Singularity"
	quest.5B84B8A165140BFA.quest_desc: [
		"The &bShape Card&r in &5RFTools&r is a versatile tool that allows players to define specific shapes for the &bBuilder&r to use in various construction and mining tasks."
		""
		"To use a &bShape Card&r:"
		"&41.&r Craft the &bShape Card&r."
		"&42.&r Right-click the card to open the configuration &6GUI&r."
		"&43.&r In the GUI, select the desired shape (e.g., cube, sphere, cylinder) and set the dimensions."
		"&44.&r Insert the configured &bShape Card&r into the &bBuilder&r."
		"&45.&r Place the &bBuilder&r in the world and power it using &9energy cables&r."
		"&46.&r Ensure the &bBuilder&r has access to the necessary materials for building, or a chest for storing mined items if used for mining."
		"&47.&r Activate the &bBuilder&r, and it will perform the task according to the shape and dimensions specified by the &bShape Card&r."
		""
		"The &bShape Card&r allows for precise and efficient automation of building and mining tasks, saving significant time and effort."
	]
	quest.5B8F0C492F564758.quest_desc: ["Your &6horse&r now weighs billions of tons and is &zinvulnerable&r you’re welcome."]
	quest.5B8F0C492F564758.quest_subtitle: "Thank you"
	quest.5B9501552E5DFB20.quest_subtitle: "Found in veins near the surface alongside crimsite and sand."
	quest.5B960A074B904E80.quest_desc: [
		"The electrical motor converts electrical power into SU with a small efficiency loss."
		""
		"This is a multistep deploying recipe, with one step involving the Winding Machine. Start with a shaft and follow these steps:"
		""
		"Use a Winding Machine to wrap 75 turns of copper wire around it"
		""
		"Add a Magnet"
		""
		"Attach a Steel Mechanism"
		""
		"Use a Screwdriver"
		""
		"Repeat this process three times for a 94% chance of obtaining a motor."
		""
		"Rotation direction can be configured."
		""
		"For 30V - 320V: SU output and motor speed depend on the input voltage, up to 11,220 SU at 255 RPM. This consumes 960W of power."
		""
		"For 320V - 1000V: The motor still produces its maximum SU but consumes more power. There is no benefit to going this high."
	]
	quest.5BC4250E4C9F803C.quest_desc: ["Different &ctiers&r of &aseeds&r need different &ctiers&r of &aessence&r and &6farmland,&r &dmake some&r&d!&r"]
	quest.5BCFF8D80F8A0B5F.quest_desc: [
		"&dEnder IO&r is a &cfull-featured tech mod&r. It has &aarmor,&r &etools,&r &cweapons,&r &bmachines,&r &dconduits,&r &6inventory&r &6management,&r &9mobs,&r etc. "
		""
		"To start light a &0Bedrock&r ablaze with&e Flint and Steel&r, you can wait for the &cfire&r to go out and have a &6chance&r for &dGrains of infinity&r to drop, which you will be using for multiple &bcrafting recipes&r."
	]
	quest.5BCFF8D80F8A0B5F.title: "Welcome to &dEnder IO"
	quest.5BD31AED5C80922D.quest_desc: [
		"Bound the &ddislocator&r to a position (shift + right click)."
		"Right click the &1Disclocator Receptacle&r after building a frame out of"
		"&6Draconium Infused Obsidian&r"
		"It can be as big as you want"
	]
	quest.5BD31AED5C80922D.quest_subtitle: "The perfect mob farm?"
	quest.5BE89BD0E51208C1.quest_desc: [
		"&bDimensional Cells&r are energy storage devices in &5RFTools&r that provide a means to store and transfer large amounts of &cRF&r (&dRedstone Flux&r) energy."
		""
		"Dimensional Cells come in three tiers: &aSimple Dimensional Cell&r, &bDimensional Cell&r, and &6Advanced Dimensional Cell&r, each offering increased &estorager capacity&r and &ctransfer rates&r. These cells can be linked together to share energy across different &6dimensions&r, making them highly versatile for complex setups."
		""
		"To use &bDimensional Cells&r, place the cell in your world and connect it to your &epower network&r using &9energy cables&r. &n&bRight-click&r to open the configuration &6GUI&r, where you can set the input and output modes, link cells together, and monitor energy levels."
	]
	quest.5C083F2DA57E133F.quest_desc: [
		"To make life &aeasier&r, AE2 offers a suite of devices for manipulating &dME data&r, enabling you to move stored items around the world."
		""
		"The &bME Interface&r is one such device. As an input device, the &bInterface&r allows any &aitem, fluid, etc.&r to be piped externally through it, which is then automatically stored in the &dME Network&r to which the interface is connected."
		""
		"As an output device, the &bInterface&r can be configured to keep a certain amount of a stored item in stock, transferring it from the &dME network&r to its own internal inventory. This allows items to be received by an &aexternal source&r like another player or a pipe."
	]
	quest.5C12F4CC1F6F6C32.quest_desc: ["Looming among the clouds, this massive airship bristles with defenses and hostile crew. Phantom-mounted fiends circle overhead, while fish-like raiders astride hoglins stalk the decks. Boarding it is no small feat. Tthose who triumph will etch their name among the few who dared challenge the skies."]
	quest.5C12F4CC1F6F6C32.quest_subtitle: "Find a Heavenly Challenger"
	quest.5C1667FA12469BEE.quest_desc: ["The &8Crimed Generator&r utilizes &aNether-based Items&r like &4Fungus&r and &6Shroomlight&r to generate &cEnergy&r. It’s a powerful generator for those who have access to the resources of the Nether."]
	quest.5C2108BD3DEEB0E6.quest_desc: [
		"The Spout is a block used for filling liquid containers such as bottles or buckets, or crafting with liquids."
		""
		"The Spout can be filled with up to 1 bucket of any one liquid via Fluid Pipes, and it will empty some of its fluid onto compatible items that pass under it via a Conveyor Belt or Depot. "
		""
		"The spout takes 1 second to process an item regardless of the amount of fluid used, though delay between fills may be caused by the time it takes the spout to fill back up."
	]
	quest.5C21D02BB2644A39.quest_desc: [
		"Despite what the tooltip says, it still requires Magnetic Alloy."
		""
		"Connect it to a generator, place one alloy on the prongs, and watch the needle rise until it creates a Magnet."
	]
	quest.5C4CA5CBBEA23FD4.quest_desc: ["Smelly, but provides good protection, especially against projectiles."]
	quest.5C56452BE7879D0A.quest_desc: ["Not all bookshelves increase a status. They can &creduce&r &aEterna,&r &cQuanta&r and &dArcana.&r Use them when you're aiming for &dprecision enchantment&r."]
	quest.5C56452BE7879D0A.title: "Negative Effects"
	quest.5C5DE3ECE4E39C5F.quest_subtitle: "Trigger an Overstress Clutch"
	quest.5C5DE3ECE4E39C5F.title: "Circuit Breaker"
	quest.5C63339483E6DE69.quest_desc: ["Has 9 more filter slots and is 2x faster than the regular Importer."]
	quest.5C6453AF1DC98785.title: "&bAuto Ender \\& Flux Crafters"
	quest.5C68C72416734550.quest_desc: ["This artifact, though disgusting provides debuff to enemies. Just make sure to wash your hands afterwards."]
	quest.5C786EAC4B7CBEB4.quest_desc: ["The &bEqual Distribution Card&r is a storage cell upgrade that &dpre-allocates&r a specific amount of items for each type, similar to a &aFunctional Storage drawer&r, where each compartment holds a set number of stacks, preventing items from one type crowding out others."]
	quest.5C8D7BD3DA61109F.quest_desc: ["Like most machines, there is an&e electric version&r of the &cquarry&r using, well, &eelectricity&r instead of &bsteam.&r"]
	quest.5C950B2842FBB2D9.quest_desc: ["High-end computational hardware built for complex industrial pattern crafting. You will also need one when building the Quantum Computation Nexus."]
	quest.5C950B2842FBB2D9.quest_subtitle: "Ultra-Thread Compute Engine"
	quest.5C950B2842FBB2D9.title: "750M Mega Co-Processor"
	quest.5CC88E9602D47EB9.quest_desc: ["The &bXNet Redstone Proxy&r in &5XNet&r allows for remote control of redstone signals within your XNet network, and the &bRedstone Proxy Update&r enhances its functionality and range."]
	quest.5CC88E9602D47EB9.title: "Redstone Proxys"
	quest.5CF320E9C4C1B1E1.quest_desc: [
		"Welcome to Infinity Legacy II ."
		""
		"This questline exists to provide structure and direction, especially for players who may not be fully accustomed to large, progression heavy modpacks. It is meant to serve as a starting point that helps you understand what to work toward and why each step matters."
		""
		"With over 400 mods integrated into this pack, there is no single “correct” way to progress. Everyone is free to explore systems, automate resources, and approach challenges in their own way."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"These quests should be seen as a gentle push forward, not a strict path. They outline a logical flow of progression but do not represent the full depth or every possibility the modpack offers."
		""
		"Use this questline as guidance, not as a rulebook. Infinity Legacy is ultimately about mastery, experimentation, and choosing your own route through the modpack."
	]
	quest.5CF320E9C4C1B1E1.title: "Welcome to Infinity Legacy 2"
	quest.5D0809A3B18C9206.quest_desc: ["[ \"\", { \"text\": \"Click me!\", \"underlined\": true, \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"1E31F400E47B0D34\" } } ]"]
	quest.5D343A8BA24FA327.quest_desc: [
		"The central &bpower hub&r and &echannel manager&r for &5ME Networks&r. This multiblock structure provides both energy distribution and network control for all connected devices."
		""
		"Core Functions:"
		""
		"Supplies &6AE2 power&r (via &dEnergy Acceptor&r)"
		""
		"Manages &c8-channel limit&r per cable branch"
		""
		"Expands via &9multiblock formation&r (up to 7×7×7)"
		""
		"(The &a\"brain and heart\"&r of any AE2 system.)"
		""
		"&e\"Where quantum logistics begin\"&r"
	]
	quest.5D343A8BA24FA327.title: "&5ME Controller&r"
	quest.5D3A267FBE80149B.quest_desc: [
		"This is how you will create a majority of your bees! Bees can be Cross Bred"
		"In-World, or with the Breeding Chamber."
		""
		"Click on a Bee In the JEI Menu to see the required parent bees. If no Parents are shown, you will likely have to obtain this bee in another way."
	]
	quest.5D3EE44FB41D289F.quest_desc: ["A item which contains a configuration similar to a Storage Cell, that allows you to customize the filtering of a particular ME Terminal."]
	quest.5D5C5B1F12462C2E.quest_desc: ["The Quantum Upgrade Base doesn't do anything special on its own, but it is used as a crafting ingredient for all upgrade cards."]
	quest.5D61FEEE2C38D2FE.quest_desc: ["Right click on a chicken to get Rotten Egg."]
	quest.5D64250B940BC8FD.quest_desc: ["Compressed Iron Armor offers a solid balance of protection and durability. Useful early on game."]
	quest.5D7086E12EF13158.quest_desc: ["A &asharpened spear&r made of &blimestone.&r &eUnbreakable&r and &ccan be thrown&r."]
	quest.5D7B34761E8FD212.quest_desc: [
		"Generates pressure from lightning. A powerful and futuristic alternative with no fuel or heat required."
		""
		""
		"{image:pneumaticcraft:textures/patchouli/electrostatic_compressor.png width:100 height:100 align:left fit:true}"
	]
	quest.5DAC6A9AFDDCAA33.quest_desc: [
		"&bRFTools&r is a comprehensive &6technology mod&r designed to provide players with a variety of &atechnical utilities&r and &dadvanced machines&r. These tools allow for efficient &3resource management&r, &9automation&r, and &einterdimensional transport&r."
		""
		"RFTools features &n&bpowerful machinery&r and &6automation tools&r that can be used to manage and manipulate energy, resources, and dimensions. The mod includes devices like the &aBuilder&r, &eStorage Scanner&r, and &6Dimension Builder&r, each offering unique capabilities to enhance your gameplay."
		""
		"&bXNet&r is an advanced &6networking mod&r that complements RFTools by providing a &9flexible&r and &cscalable&r solution for managing item, fluid, and energy transport across your base. XNet allows players to create &dcomplex networks&r using &n&bpipes&r, &n&bcables&r, and &n&bconnectors&r to efficiently route resources between machines and storage systems."
		""
		"With XNet, you can set up &n&bhighly configurable&r networks that automate &9resource distribution&r, &eenergy transfer&r, and &3machine interaction&r, all controlled through an intuitive &dcontroller interface&r. The combination of RFTools and XNet empowers players to build &dautomated systems&r that are both &6efficient&r and &bpowerful&r, making it easier to manage even the most complex setups."
	]
	quest.5DAC6A9AFDDCAA33.title: "Welcome to RFtools"
	quest.5DD4B5780494D422.quest_desc: ["Generates &9Neutrons&r faster."]
	quest.5DD99224F29419C1.quest_desc: ["Turns inputted &bsteam&r into &eelectricity&r that can be moved with &acables&r connected to its back, uses&b Low Voltage wires&r of &l256 EU/t.&r"]
	quest.5DE6CDBDD36EC3CC.quest_desc: ["&rThe Entangled mod lets you link two blocks so that interacting with one affects the other, even from a distance."]
	quest.5E116409DC7D30BB.quest_desc: ["The Configurator is used to configure many of the items in Mekanism, from changing pipes to \"Pull or Push\" or rotating machines."]
	quest.5E116409DC7D30BB.quest_subtitle: "Mekanism's Wrench"
	quest.5E2F9E27E6B4DF74.quest_desc: ["A better tier of Conducter with more storage."]
	quest.5E2F9E27E6B4DF74.title: "&dUltimate Thermodynamic Conductor"
	quest.5E45D2A2FDD67495.quest_desc: ["This goes in the right side of the forge."]
	quest.5E45D2A2FDD67495.quest_subtitle: "Experience in a bottle"
	quest.5E45D2A2FDD67495.title: "&aBottle O' Enchanting"
	quest.5E52934814637713.quest_desc: ["Pulls nearby &aXP&r into this chest."]
	quest.5E74162BFE874E02.quest_desc: ["Also has an extra tier level."]
	quest.5E8B7801E15425D7.quest_desc: [
		"&ePositioned Processing&r is a special processing and crafting method that allows items to be &asent to specific inventories&r in a &efixed order&r."
		""
		"It is designed for recipes where &aprecise item placement&r matters."
		""
		"&eHow It Works&r"
		""
		"• Uses a &ePositioned Package Distributor&r"
		"• Each input slot is linked to a specific target inventory"
		"• Outputs are &asorted and stacked&r when encoded"
		"• Items are inserted &ein exact order&r when unpackaged"
		""
		"&eDistributor Markers&r"
		""
		"• &eDistributor Markers&r are bound to inventories"
		"• Each marker represents one target location"
		"• Markers are inserted into the distributor slots"
		"  matching the encoded input order"
		""
		"This ensures items always go to the correct machine or inventory."
		""
		"&eSettings and Automation&r"
		""
		"• Target setups can be copied using the"
		"  &ePackaging Settings Cloner&r"
		"• Requires enough empty &eDistributor Markers&r"
		"  when pasting settings"
		""
		"&eWhy Use Positioned Processing?&r"
		""
		"• Perfect for multi-machine recipes"
		"• Guarantees correct item routing"
		"• Prevents mix-ups in complex automation"
		"• Ideal for advanced &ePackagedAuto&r setups"
	]
	quest.5E8B7801E15425D7.title: "&ePositioned Processing&r"
	quest.5E9AF6B8FC8929D0.quest_desc: ["A new &bnon-magnetic&r set of tools that do &eextra damage&r to &bmagnetic mobs&r and are crafted from &cscarlet neodymium&r."]
	quest.5E9AF6B8FC8929D0.title: "Scarlet neodymium tools"
	quest.5E9B440485DF6BCB.quest_desc: ["This one is... kinda complicated... it... well... increases max mana."]
	quest.5EB59B43781EB61D.quest_desc: [
		"Use a Wrench to switch between input and output."
		""
		"Input is marked with a blue connection, and output is marked with an orange connection."
		""
		"When converting FE to TFMG energy, the voltage can be set up to 250V."
	]
	quest.5EC7537BAF3642F3.quest_desc: ["A &ecrucial component&r in crafting &5Creative Essence&r."]
	quest.5ED1896F1986BD2B.quest_desc: [
		"These can be planted to grow Arcane Gold Nuggets."
		""
		"To create one, you'll need to find Yellow Orchids they commonly appear in flower forests."
	]
	quest.5ED1896F1986BD2B.quest_subtitle: "Growing Gold"
	quest.5ED37D7A3385EC14.quest_desc: ["Another rocket that allows you to reach more planets"]
	quest.5F0E877BE50D79D0.quest_desc: ["Used with &6Spatial IO Port&r to store spatial regions."]
	quest.5F40AC971ECE683E.quest_desc: [
		"Combine UU-matter and Corporeal Matter in the DMA to synthesize dense Neutron Star Matter."
		""
		"Used as a key ingredient to fold Tesseract Component Matrices."
		""
		"&7Fun fact: When a giant star goes supernova and collapses, gravity crushes atomic nuclei together so tightly that a sugar cube sized piece of neutron star core would weigh roughly a billion tons on Earth.&r"
	]
	quest.5F40AC971ECE683E.quest_subtitle: "Extreme Gravitational Condensate"
	quest.5F40AC971ECE683E.title: "Neutron Star Matter"
	quest.5F44B8D5CEF56038.quest_desc: ["The most &8powerful&r type of &cmatter&r in both a state of &5quantum decay&r and &1force&r at the same time."]
	quest.5F4BA6FB56DFCE1F.quest_desc: [
		"Stores hundreds of encoded patterns for Crafting, Smithing, and Stonecutting."
		""
		"Paired with the Quantum Pattern Buffer, it dispatches crafting ingredients simultaneously across multiple recipes to eliminate queue bottlenecks."
	]
	quest.5F4BA6FB56DFCE1F.quest_subtitle: "Hyper-Parallel Recipe Core"
	quest.5F4BA6FB56DFCE1F.title: "Quantum Pattern Fabrication Matrix"
	quest.5F5675E30ED046F7.quest_desc: ["You've probably already acquired some Darkstone, but we'll need it to craft the forge."]
	quest.5F5675E30ED046F7.title: "Prepping For the Forge"
	quest.5F68F1D8533B534F.quest_subtitle: "Right click the industrial mixer to install."
	quest.5F6ACDE014A61F46.quest_desc: ["A type of &aapple&r with &dmore effects&r then the&c previous tier&r"]
	quest.5F6F319B4216744C.quest_desc: ["Has 45 more filter slots and is 6.5x faster than the regular Exporter. Also has the Stack Upgrade integrated."]
	quest.5F86D3C647B91BD4.quest_desc: ["Has &einfinite storage&r for a &bitem&r."]
	quest.5F893D12A98FB378.quest_desc: ["The &aChaotic Core&r is the final core. It's used to craft &bChaotic items&r and also the &bReactor Stabilizer&r."]
	quest.5F94483E05D2F528.quest_desc: ["An upgrade to the &cAdvanced Fluid Tank&r."]
	quest.5F9B9868E3051209.quest_desc: ["Dropped from a &aboundroid&r after killing &eboth parts&r, you will use this as a part in your &dquarry&r."]
	quest.5F9B9868E3051209.quest_subtitle: "Find a heavywieght"
	quest.5FC01763770A062E.quest_desc: [
		"The Town Hall is the central building in your colony. It provides lots of helpful information about your colony such as citizen stats, open work orders, citizen happiness, allies and more. "
		""
		"The settings tab should be a first stop for any new colonist as it contains options for hiring mode, housing assignment mode, and options to allow kids to be born. Also, this is where you can customize your colony flag. Your flag will appear on guard towers and guard shields. "
	]
	quest.5FC01763770A062E.title: "Town Hall"
	quest.5FD4F40CEC37D9FD.quest_desc: [
		"The &dultimate enchantment database&r."
		""
		"An upgraded version of the &dEnchantment&r Library, with better &eefficiency&r and &astorage.&r It’s a bit &cexpensive&r to build but if you're swimming in &aXP&r and &drare&r &denchants,&r it's absolutely worth it. Think of it as the creative mode of enchantment management (but balanced for survival)."
	]
	quest.5FD95ABA63C56BD5.quest_desc: ["&eRectification&r reduces the negative value of &cQuanta.&r With enough &eRectification,&r &cQuanta&r will only be able to &bincrease your final enchanting power&r, &anot decrease it&r."]
	quest.5FD95ABA63C56BD5.title: "Retification Misc"
	quest.5FDB48511EC1C580.quest_desc: [
		"Afraid of blowing up your &6Fission Reactor&r and causing a massive &4Radiation&r leak?"
		""
		"So how can we prevent such a catastrophic disaster? By creating a redstone &aCircuit Breaker&r using &dFission Reactor Logic Adapters&r. Now these aren't &b&o100%&r guaranteed to stop an explosion, but they are absolutely nice to have."
		""
		"Essentially, these Adapters allow us to control the &6Reactor&r using &cRedstone&r. With just one, you can use a lever to turn &9on&r and &coff&r the &6Reactor&r. However, we're going to use them for damage control."
		""
		"You can also set these to give off a &cRedstone Signal&r based on a certain condition within the &6Reactor&r, like &cDamage Critical&r or &8Insufficient Fuel&r. This is useful for setting up a circuit breaker to shut &coff&r the &6Reactor&r if those ever happen."
	]
	quest.5FDB48511EC1C580.title: "&eSafety First!"
	quest.60140A3E8BFB3CA0.quest_desc: ["&dProjectE&r is a mod foucsed around &aconverting items&r to &eEMC&r and &eEMC&r back into &brarer items&r."]
	quest.60140A3E8BFB3CA0.title: "Welcome to ProjectE!"
	quest.60244F26B9ABED49.quest_desc: ["The 1024k Fluid Storage Part is used to craft the 1024k Fluid Storage Disk."]
	quest.60244F26B9ABED49.title: "&a1024k Fluid Part&r"
	quest.602C3E88D96F8843.quest_desc: ["A processed but incomplete circuit board. You’ll need to send it through an Assembly Line to finalize it."]
	quest.603877AB96321F1A.quest_desc: [
		"The Thermal Evaporation Plant or a Solar Evaporation Plant with the addition of Advanced Solar Generators, is a multiblock structure that converts water to Brine, and Brine \\& Lithium by the use of a second TEP."
		""
		"To accelerate the rate of production beyond simply placing advanced solar generators at the top, the player must import a source of heat into a valve. This is most easily done by placing a resistive heater next to a valve. Setting the energy consumption to 1250 FE/t will provide the maximum boost, with any higher consumption having no effect."
	]
	quest.603877AB96321F1A.title: "Thermal Evaporation Plant"
	quest.604B4CECA4FD44CB.quest_desc: ["You are making progress, &agood,&r but you must &6improve.&r"]
	quest.604D0A6FB5508BCA.title: "Raw Strider"
	quest.605C0B84DFC1A4D5.quest_desc: [
		"Gantry Carriages are a Contraption that will collide with unmovable blocks in their path."
		""
		"Place Gantry Shafts along where the Gantry Carriage will move. Apply Rotational power to the shafts to move the Carriage along them, and invert the power to move it back. Inverting the placement of the shafts will invert all movement. Use a Wrench to help change the orientation."
		""
		"For every 1rpm of rotational power, the gantry carriage will move along the shaft at a linear speed of 0.03846 blocks/second."
		""
		"Apply a Redstone signal to the shaft to stop the carriage and send rotational power through the Carriage's output. This can be used to move another attached Gantry Carriage."
		""
		"Gantry Shafts attached to the Carriage's output will move along with them automatically."
		""
		"Multiple Carriages on one shaft can also move the same structure built onto it."
	]
	quest.606780E5B8CF83BE.quest_desc: ["Has an &aamazing max&r with crazy &dstat buffs&r plus an extra &eenchant&r &eclue.&r"]
	quest.607D5F077D4B0715.quest_desc: [
		"The &aDislocator&r is used to teleport you."
		""
		"&bShift+Right Click&r to set the teleportation position, then you can just &bRight Click&r it to teleport you to the location (&dworks in any dimension&r) or you can put it on a &dDislocator Pedestal&r to not use the durability."
	]
	quest.60844520BAC54952.quest_desc: [
		"Place the sample drill and add a oxygen backtank to it then activate the sample drill."
		""
		"Then right click it with the Atlas to get the info about the ore vein."
	]
	quest.6084C1D0DC705312.quest_desc: ["You will be using &epowered spawners&r to activate your &cbroken mob spawners&r, First place a &epowered spawner&r into an &banvil&r with the &cbroken spawner&r to craft it, then place it and add a &6capacitor,&r it will then start spawning whatever mob you put in the &cbroken spawner&r, you can also click the arrow on the left side to switch to a &dsoul vial&r &a\"capture\" mode&r were you can place &dempty soul vials&r to automatically have them &efilled&r without spawning anything. &dSoul vials&r can be used as &9spawn eggs&r."]
	quest.6092490EC9008A05.quest_desc: ["This interface will automatically break the block it is attached to. \\n \\n You can also set it to whitelist blocks, which is useful for automating certain processes, like making casings in Create."]
	quest.6092490EC9008A05.quest_subtitle: "Breaking Blocks!"
	quest.6092490EC9008A05.title: "Destructor"
	quest.60DBF181ED929607.quest_desc: ["Charges items below it and can be used for damaging players and mobs."]
	quest.60F3D3256277F63F.quest_desc: [
		"A dusty red planet rich in &dOstrum&r &dOre.&r Requires a &cTier 2&r Rocket."
		""
		"Mars Info:"
		"&aGravity:&r 3.72076 m/s"
		"&bOxygen:&r None"
		"&cTemperature:&r -65.0 °C"
	]
	quest.60F40F9349D3F369.quest_desc: [
		"That’s all for now! You’ve reached the end of Mekanism’s progression in this modpack."
		""
		"For the moment, there are no additional Mekanism addons or extensions, so this is as far as your factory can go. You’ve mastered every stage of ore processing and automation available an impressive achievement!"
		""
		"Keep exploring, experimenting, and integrating Mekanism with other mods to push your production even further. Who knows what upgrades might come in the future?"
	]
	quest.60F40F9349D3F369.title: "What now?"
	quest.6128CB0FA162D322.title: "Find a Burning Arena"
	quest.61348E2551E8AD6C.quest_desc: [
		"For the Rotation Speed Controller to work, it must be paired with a Large Cogwheel. The Rotation Speed Controller, when powered by the Large Cogwheel, outputs any desired speed of rotational force from its sides. It also does the opposite; when powered from its sides, it controls the speed of the Large Cogwheel."
		""
		"The rotation speed and direction can be changed in the Value Settings Screen at the front or the back of the machine. The speed can be set to a maximum of 256rpms clockwise or counter-clockwise."
	]
	quest.61696434C1A9A76C.quest_desc: ["The &aChaotic Tools/Weapons&r have a grid of &b8x6&r for modules."]
	quest.61696434C1A9A76C.title: "Chaotic Tools \\& Weapons"
	quest.6173A841D5D5E52C.quest_desc: ["A &6chestplate&r crafted from &aancient materials&r. as strong as &6leather.&r"]
	quest.6177966365A058A2.quest_desc: [
		"Steel Vats are required in a 2x2x2 configuration and must be heated."
		""
		"Either Copper or Zinc electrodes can be used. Make sure to pump out the CO2."
		""
		"The electrode holders require a minimum of 25A to function, meaning each must be supplied with at least 3500V. This can be achieved using one max-speed Generator and a Transformer with a turn ratio of 4."
	]
	quest.6177966365A058A2.title: "Electrolysis"
	quest.6184B40362A7B190.quest_desc: ["&bApotheosis&r removes vanilla vertical height limits on plant growth. &bSugar cane&r, &2cactus&r, and &abamboo&r can now grow substantially taller than normal!"]
	quest.6184B40362A7B190.title: "Growth Mechanics"
	quest.618CDE6D1DAFBA8A.quest_desc: [
		"The &aMob Grinder&r is a powerful tool for killing mobs with customizable filters, allowing you to target specific types such as &dHostile&r, &dTamed&r, &dAdults&r, and more."
		""
		"You can equip it with any sword (&cincluding enchanted ones&r), and it will use the sword's durability."
		""
		"It is capable of one-shotting a &cWither Boss&r."
	]
	quest.618E80188B07F72D.quest_desc: ["Pulls &enearby items&r into the storage of this chest, a &bfilter&r can be added, and it has &aadjustable range.&r"]
	quest.618ECDB3FB534A8A.quest_desc: ["&cA&r&cdvanced Universal Cables&r are cables with more storage then the &abasic&r version."]
	quest.618ECDB3FB534A8A.title: "&cAdvanced Universal Cables"
	quest.61A51731E2EC1A96.quest_subtitle: "5.000 ingots"
	quest.61B5E14CC5647919.quest_desc: ["Useful in more powerful crafts."]
	quest.61C3E32E629F6E1E.quest_desc: ["The &bME Export Bus&r periodically sends items from its &awhitelist filter&r to an external storage it faces. Unlike the Import Bus, the Export Bus requires &afiltering&r to function."]
	quest.61F79F256C7F9623.quest_desc: [
		"1x &8Compressed Netherite Block 4x&r represents thousands of ingots of the underworld's most precious metal."
		""
		"Only the most persistent miners and beekeepers can achieve this summit."
	]
	quest.61F79F256C7F9623.title: "👑 &8Abyssal Treasure: Hypercompressed Netherite"
	quest.61FFBF4622E15859.quest_desc: [
		"The &aDraconic Energy Relay Crystal&r is used to make a relay between I/O Crystal and Energy Crystal. It can store &b64M RF&r and has &c32 links&r, with a range of &d128 blocks&r."
		""
		"The &aDraconic Energy I/O Crystal&r can store &b64M RF&r and has &c4 links&r, with a range of &d128 blocks&r."
		""
		"The &aDraconic Wireless Energy Crystal&r is used to power machines wirelessly. It can store &b64M RF&r and has &c16 links&r, providing wireless RF to &d64 machines&r within a range of &e128 blocks&r."
	]
	quest.6200BF000C6AF1D7.quest_desc: [
		"The &bDimensional Shard&r is a rare and valuable resource used in &5RFTools&r for crafting and upgrading various machines and items."
		""
		"Dimensional Shards are essential for creating high-tier machines, enhancing existing equipment, and performing powerful upgrades. You can find Dimensional Shards in the &6world&r by mining, or they can be obtained from certain &aDimlet&r structures."
		""
		"Dimensional Shards can be used to create items like the &n&dMachine Infuser&r, which improves the efficiency and capabilities of RFTools machines. Additionally, they are a key component in crafting &n&6Dimensional Cells&r and &n&bTeleporter&r devices."
		""
		"To fully utilize Dimensional Shards, you will need to gather a substantial amount, as many advanced recipes and upgrades require multiple shards. Keep an eye out for them during your mining expeditions or when exploring &nDimlet&r structures."
	]
	quest.620B503AE9D898D4.quest_subtitle: "Gaia?"
	quest.620DFA9CD7B3F7B1.quest_desc: ["Decor! Of a magnet."]
	quest.621F052BCE747E68.quest_desc: [
		"Higher Capacity cable, can carry 32 Channels unlike standard cable which can only carry 8."
		""
		"However it doesn't support buses so you must first step down from dense to a smaller cable (such as Fluix ME Glass Cable or Fluix ME Smart Cable) before using buses or panels."
		""
		"Shows load similarly to Fluix ME Smart Cable, with each line lit representing four Channels in use."
	]
	quest.6222356D4DC8011D.quest_desc: ["The &2Explosive Generator&r uses &aTNT&r and other explosive items to create &cEnergy&r. It converts the destructive power of explosives into a useful energy source. Perfect for thrill-seekers looking for a high-risk, high-reward power solution."]
	quest.623B6948CC6BEE3B.quest_desc: ["The flavor of the &dmultiverse&r. A soup brewed from &eeverything&r the &aworld&r offers. &lOne time use&r, but provides &damazing effects&r and &afully restores hunger&r and &esaturation.&r"]
	quest.6244032FE2E5F1E1.quest_desc: ["The absolute peak of &denchanting&r &cpower&r offers massive &aEterna.&r If you’re looking to break the limits of &denchantment,&r this shelf is the limit."]
	quest.6244032FE2E5F1E1.quest_subtitle: "Is that it?"
	quest.62458187F95EE35A.quest_desc: [
		"A high-tier device that prevents chunks containing critical ME infrastructure from unloading when players are absent. Maintains active chunks to preserve Spatial Storage dimensions, quantum bridges, and other AE2 mechanics that normally depend on chunk loading."
		""
		"(Functions like a more advanced version of other chunk loaders, specifically optimized for AE2's interdimensional storage systems.)"
		""
		"Note: Requires constant power and careful placement to avoid server performance impacts. Works across dimensions when properly configured with Quantum Network Bridges."
	]
	quest.62625CAF6649AB53.quest_desc: ["Don't like storing things in drives? \\\\n \\\\n You can create storage &9Blocks&r instead and just slap the block down somewhere in your system. \\\\n \\\\n Whatever items end up in the block will be stored inside whenever you break it as well. \\\\n \\\\n If you want to un-craft it, you can sneak right click while holding it."]
	quest.62625CAF6649AB53.title: "1k Storage Block"
	quest.626580DB654F128D.quest_desc: ["The Millstone is capable of applying milling recipes to any valid items inserted from above."]
	quest.62671BDA7C583957.quest_desc: ["A natural fuel source produced from organic materials. It can be processed into Bioethanol, making it an eco-friendly alternative for generating energy and powering your Create machines sustainably."]
	quest.626811BDE3A415EA.quest_desc: ["More storage."]
	quest.626B196AC0108F30.quest_desc: ["You are making progress, &agood,&r but you must &6improve.&r"]
	quest.62748F0F87FA0CC9.quest_desc: [
		"Push smelting to the absolute limit with extraordinary &asmelting speed&r, reconfigurable sides, &daugments&r for &csmoking&r and &2blasting&r and much more."
		"Mystical Agriculture is much faster then better furnaces, but alot harder to craft"
	]
	quest.62748F0F87FA0CC9.title: "Welcome to &dBetter Furnaces"
	quest.62919950155A022A.quest_desc: [
		"&bPower Cells&r in &5RFTools&r are used to store and transfer &9RF energy&r between machines and devices. They come in three tiers: &aLow Power Cell&r, &6Medium Power Cell&r, and &cHigh Power Cell&r, each offering increasing energy storage capacity and transfer rates."
		""
		"These cells are essential for managing energy in your &5RFTools&r setups, ensuring a steady supply of power for all your machines and devices."
	]
	quest.629BCF8065DFD8B1.quest_subtitle: "Use it to find a Chunk with a ore vein"
	quest.62B245A23CA62678.quest_desc: ["&lShift-Right-Click&r on machines to attach, and &aconnect&r them with &lRight-Click&r to transport fluids when attached to a &epump.&r"]
	quest.62B2C1A24AE245EA.quest_desc: ["Getting close to the best of the best, &9Deepshelf&r variants are what you want for a while, these &6shelves&r boost, well, just &lhover&r over them with your mouse."]
	quest.62BAE54B507B7A21.quest_subtitle: "Crafting ingredient"
	quest.62C126C97A94CBE5.quest_desc: ["When there is not enough space for items to be extracted, they are automatically converted in &5&lOverload Points&r."]
	quest.62C126C97A94CBE5.quest_subtitle: "Matter Overload"
	quest.62D04566426DD979.quest_desc: ["Different &ctiers&r of &bwatering cans&r hold more water. &lRight-Click&r water to fill the can up, &lShift-Right-CLick&r to water &acrops&r around you."]
	quest.62F1177325B16068.quest_desc: ["High current"]
	quest.62FD4E6D43FCC228.quest_desc: ["The &bOverflow Destruction Card&r is an upgrade for storage cells that automatically &ddelete&r any items of a type already contained within the cell if the cell is full, preventing overflow."]
	quest.630E022DE677D0AD.quest_desc: [
		"Uranus Info:"
		"&aGravity:&r 8.63 m/s"
		"&bOxygen:&r none"
		"&cTemperature:&r -224 °C"
	]
	quest.63116691C92FD576.quest_desc: ["A quiet spring hidden among the hills, its waters swirl mysteriously in the bottomless well. Travelers speak of subtle blessings for those brave enough to approach. Some even report a modest burst of speed for journeys ahead. Whether magic or rumor, the well offers a curious advantage to explorers."]
	quest.63116691C92FD576.quest_subtitle: "Find a Wishing Well"
	quest.6313B18820445882.quest_desc: [
		"The &9Industrial Turbine&r is a massive multiblock structure used to convert &cHeated Coolant&r into power. The minimum size is 5x5x5, with the maximum size being 17x17x18."
		""
		"Just like most &dMekanism&r multiblocks, the frame must be made out of &aTurbine Casings&r. However, instead of &eReactor Glass&r, you can use &bStructural Glass&r or Casings for each face."
		""
		"We're going to build this &9Industrial Turbine&r, and the quest requires the exact materials needed."
	]
	quest.6313B18820445882.quest_subtitle: "Building the Frame"
	quest.6313B18820445882.title: "&9The Industrial Turbine"
	quest.633055C65734B8B0.quest_desc: ["More storage."]
	quest.63339D05CD5EA9E9.quest_desc: ["This &dspell book&r has more slots then &ddragon scale&r and a &9codex,&r but loses the &9codex&r &bmana buff&r in trade for &abetter cooldowns&r, also made at the &esmithing table&r."]
	quest.633751761E035DFB.quest_desc: [
		"The &aModule Core&r is the base of every module for your Draconic Evolution items."
		""
		"You can press the Keybind &6Tool Modules&r to open the &2GUI&r, there you can add the &aModules&r."
	]
	quest.6350ADB7540C368D.quest_desc: [
		"If the Smart Observer is placed with the front facing a container such as a Mechanical Belt, Funnel or Fluid Pipe, it will emit a Redstone signal when an item is detected inside. A Smart Observer will also emit a signal if the block placed in front of it matches the filter."
		""
		"If a Filter is applied to the Smart Observer, it will only emit a redstone signal when the item in the filter is detected."
	]
	quest.6350B45273FD299F.quest_desc: ["A candy-fueled weapon that chews through your problems—literally. Warning: may bounce from to mob to mob."]
	quest.63797CC6D4459760.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.63797CC6D4459760.title: "Find a fortress"
	quest.637C95233A2AF9E2.quest_subtitle: "Smelt some iron"
	quest.637EBAB0500A2295.quest_desc: ["An incendiary grenade that triggers a high-temperature chemical reaction on impact, melting through metal and igniting nearby flammable materials. It deals persistent area damage and can disable machinery or break through reinforced structures, but use with caution—its intense heat affects friend and foe alike."]
	quest.63A46DD9090FABCD.quest_desc: ["Used to craft the &9Skulk Crafting Table.&r These are made with &6compressed crafting tables&r."]
	quest.63B4B2B0868360FF.quest_desc: [
		"There are &cthree versions&r of the &eEnergy collector&r, each faster then the previous, these &ecollecters &rwork simailrly to &asolor panels&r and can be made to work &9round the clock&r by placing &6glowstone&r atop it. &eEnergy collectors&r will &dpassivaly collect EMC&r."
		""
		"&eEnergy collectors&r are used to &bcharge items&r, turn items from the &aleft slots&r into items of more &6EMC,&r and can be used to power &6Energy condensers&r if placed next to one."
	]
	quest.63B4B83F528E6AD6.quest_desc: ["{ \"text\": \"Click Me!\", \"underlined\": true, \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"4CFE8B1C53B429E9\" } }"]
	quest.63D158AEF40E3293.quest_desc: ["Create &bGelid Cryotheum&r, one of the &5most used&r and important &3liquids&r in the mod!"]
	quest.63E8F78EEA3063F7.quest_desc: ["{ \"text\": \"Click Me!\", \"underlined\": true, \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"24DDED464AE48E05\" } }"]
	quest.63F6F4EBCEB914B0.quest_desc: ["Used to craft pressurized items, like Empty PCBs. Feed it pressure and watch it process recipes that normal crafting can't handle."]
	quest.63F6F4EBCEB914B0.title: "Pressure Chamber"
	quest.63FD630E1F808365.quest_desc: [
		"The &aWyvern Capacitor&r has a grid of &b4x4&r for modules."
		""
		"It can charge your &dheld item&r, &darmor&r, &dhotbar&r, &dmain inventory&r, and your &dcurios slots&r."
	]
	quest.640DB4139DF8AFA4.quest_desc: ["An &dexpensive core&r used in powerful &cmachines.&r"]
	quest.6424D99CBA76895B.quest_desc: ["A better tier of tube with more storage."]
	quest.6424D99CBA76895B.title: "&9Elite Pressurized Tubes"
	quest.64282797066B3215.quest_desc: [
		"Survival modules to keep you alive in extreme conditions."
		""
		"Aegis Singularity absorbs massive damage spikes, Chrono Regenerator steadily restores health over time, and Adaptive Biosphere protects against extreme heat and radiation."
	]
	quest.64282797066B3215.quest_subtitle: "Damage Dampening \\& Life Support"
	quest.64282797066B3215.title: "Defense and Survival Modules"
	quest.64287B360B07BEBB.quest_desc: ["Connects &cmachines&r in a line allowing the &etransfer&r of &bitems&r and &9liquids&r between them."]
	quest.642AD88F482BEC33.quest_desc: ["Used to make various alloys"]
	quest.6434D9D52129BE1A.quest_desc: ["Some of the&9 best gear&r, untill &dAvaritia&r where you gain &ccontrol of the&r &0universe.&r"]
	quest.6447492FAA873F93.quest_desc: ["Suspended in the sky, this floating steampunk city glows in hues of orange and green. Strange, gear-driven inhabitants roam its platforms, each dominated by a singular central eye or monocle. Enter with caution, this mechanical hive is as clever as it is imposing, and its secrets are tightly guarded."]
	quest.6447492FAA873F93.quest_subtitle: "Find a Mechanical Nest"
	quest.6448E508EA3CF34E.quest_subtitle: "To infinity and beyond!"
	quest.644D7DA00757C2ED.quest_desc: [
		"The &aFlux Gate&r is a device for managing the transfer of energy."
		""
		"Features of the &aFlux Gate&r:"
		"&6-&r Controls the &bflow of energy&r between different components."
		"&6-&r Allows precise regulation of energy input and output."
		"&6-&r Prevents energy loss and ensures optimal power distribution."
	]
	quest.647F95EED59927B7.quest_desc: [
		"Starving colonists will eat just about anything, including raw food and rotten flesh. Yuck! "
		""
		"When citizens are hungry, they will come to the Restaurant and the Cook will give them food. (assuming you have food to give them) Consider building a Fisher’s Hut, or a Cowhand’s Hut. "
		""
		"Note: Make sure to choose a fuel for your cook to use. Some popular options are charcoal, sticks, and planks, although anything with a burn time will work. "
	]
	quest.64878DDC1B86E823.quest_desc: ["More storage."]
	quest.649167FC31EB916E.quest_desc: ["An ingredient used in recipes or as a fuel alternative. Can be produced from seeds in the Processing Plant."]
	quest.64953DD2811A1713.quest_desc: ["You are making progress, &agood,&r but you must &6improve.&r"]
	quest.64A1337A3C4F7734.quest_desc: [
		"You will use this &cmachine&r to create a few items including changing the type of&a mob&r a &aspawner spawns&r, &lRight-Click&r a creature with a &dsoul vial&r to fill the&d soul vial&r, then place the &dsoul vial&r and a &cbroken mob spawner&r into this machine, after clicking the &aUse Player XP button&r it will began to create your item based on the &bsoul&r you gave it."
		""
		"You can &aacquire&r broken spawners from... &cbreaking spawners&r."
	]
	quest.64AB5CCDD9860DD8.quest_desc: ["Obtained by putting an Iron Sheet in a Rolling Mill."]
	quest.64AB5CCDD9860DD8.quest_subtitle: "Crafting component."
	quest.64C1CFE04441C6A0.quest_desc: [
		"Automatically uses required chalk/item."
		""
		"Artisanal version allows to complete pentagram in one click."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Read tooltips for more information"
	]
	quest.64C1CFE04441C6A0.quest_subtitle: "Handy backpacks"
	quest.64C1CFE04441C6A0.title: "Easy Life"
	quest.64D34A6C3487C5DF.quest_desc: ["A special block that connects your inventory directly to pressure systems. Great for wireless automation and tool usage."]
	quest.64E2E05B228EA53E.quest_desc: ["Even more robust than Reinforced Tubes. These can handle extreme pressure and flow rates needed for high throughput setups."]
	quest.64E85274D24FE394.quest_desc: ["When connected to your system, this block will display the current number of an item within your network."]
	quest.64E85274D24FE394.title: "Storage Monitor"
	quest.65049E66AD084DCC.title: "Visit The End"
	quest.6504C8B99E8C47A5.quest_desc: ["Energy cards add more energy storage to certain tools like portable terminals, and make Vibration Chambers more efficient."]
	quest.6518A54F5163C106.quest_desc: ["Another &dinfinite&r &dpower&r &eblock&r."]
	quest.6541EA93702C2D37.quest_desc: [
		"Ah, yes, your first multiblocks (&chopefully&r):"
		"The &5Mega Compressor&r, used to &6bulk craft&r various singularities from &zAvaritia&r and &zExtended Crafting&r."
		""
		"&aNo more waiting an eternity for the compressor to load ten thousand blocks.&r"
	]
	quest.654690D43983EF97.quest_desc: [
		"An unstable transitional state of matter synthesized from Primordial Matter Fluid and enriched spheres."
		""
		"Refine it further in the DMA to stabilize it into Corporeal Matter."
	]
	quest.654690D43983EF97.quest_subtitle: "Pre-Physical Substrate"
	quest.654690D43983EF97.title: "Proto-Matter"
	quest.6560DADDBE9FA983.quest_desc: [
		"The &bObsidian Matrix&r is the starting component for almost everything in UFO Future."
		""
		"You will use it to build your first casings and machines, so keep a solid stock of obsidian and ender pearls handy."
	]
	quest.6560DADDBE9FA983.quest_subtitle: "Foundational Crafting Substrate"
	quest.6560DADDBE9FA983.title: "Obsidian Matrix"
	quest.6581D4AF1A6DE230.quest_desc: [
		"Demons like Candles. I think."
		""
		"For almost every Ritual to summon our friends, you'll need some Candles. You can create the &aButcher Knife&r and kill some pigs, cows, sheep, horses, or even the Trader Llamas to get some &aTallow&r to make them. Matter of fact, you should definitely find the Trader Llamas. I hear they make good candles. &mI totally didn't just make that up&r."
		""
		"Otherwise, Vanilla Candles can also work!"
		""
		"&9Spirit Attuned Crystals&r are also used in several Rituals, so might as well make some now!"
	]
	quest.6581D4AF1A6DE230.title: "Preparing for a Ritual: &aCandles&r"
	quest.65A7307F9858ECB5.quest_desc: [
		"Affects bee’s hostility."
		""
		"The best being Passive."
	]
	quest.65A7307F9858ECB5.title: "Temper"
	quest.65C8A43FEDBA3835.quest_desc: ["This grid allows you to imprint recipes onto patterns for your network. \\n \\nThe easiest way to create a recipe for a pattern is to look up the item in JEI, then click the '+' button in the bottom right of the recipe. This will then place the recipe into the grid. \\n \\nOn the right side, the top slot is used for storing blank Patterns. With a blank Pattern inside, you should be able to click the Arrow underneath to imprint the recipe onto the pattern. \\n \\nYou'll then want to put the Pattern into a crafter!"]
	quest.65C8A43FEDBA3835.title: "Pattern Grid"
	quest.65D23E7683812E26.quest_desc: [
		"What kind of a leader are you?! Your citizens are so hungry, they are eating rotten flesh! &eAre you eating rotten flesh?&r Can you spare some bread or apples for the colony? "
		""
		"It is strongly suggested that you build a restaurant and any of the 5 herding huts or a fisher’s hut. If you have those buildings already, check that buildings have the resources they need to work."
	]
	quest.65E2AF881709C896.quest_desc: ["A strong building material resistant to pressure explosions. Reinforced Stone is ideal for creating safe environments for your pneumatic setups."]
	quest.65FCFDB9AABCE966.quest_subtitle: "The Ultimate Ingot"
	quest.65FCFDB9AABCE966.title: "&5&l&oThe one and only"
	quest.65FE4CA8B667A425.quest_desc: ["Outputs huge batches of finished items straight into your ME network without clogging standard item pipes or hoppers."]
	quest.65FE4CA8B667A425.quest_subtitle: "High-Bandwidth Network Item Ejector"
	quest.65FE4CA8B667A425.title: "ME Massive Output Hatch"
	quest.66049E7484E47283.quest_desc: ["&dA lot more storage&r&d.&r"]
	quest.660EFAF144F70749.quest_desc: ["A &bbetter machine turbine&r capable ofproducing more &epower.&r"]
	quest.66108B4F2DBF2E3F.quest_desc: ["Obtained by putting a Copper Ingot in a Rolling Mill."]
	quest.66108B4F2DBF2E3F.quest_subtitle: "Crafting component."
	quest.66164A4140C21BF1.quest_desc: ["Can attract &bmagnetic items&r if turned on with &lRight-Click,&r you will know its on when it gets a &every slight glow&r."]
	quest.6657B2892F72C3EE.quest_subtitle: "Flint And Steel! oh wai-"
	quest.6657B2892F72C3EE.title: "Steel"
	quest.66685C583D5075E5.quest_desc: [
		"Synthesized in the DMA or QMF by fusing White Dwarf, Neutron Star, and Pulsar matter together with Transcending Matter fluid and an Event Horizon matrix."
		""
		"Dark Matter is the crowning component needed to weave &bCosmic String Component Matrices&r, unlocking the highest tier of ME storage and endgame autocrafting."
		""
		"&7Fun fact: In cosmology, dark matter makes up roughly 85% of all matter in the universe. It doesn't emit or reflect any light, and we only know it exists through its immense gravitational pull holding galaxies together.&r"
	]
	quest.66685C583D5075E5.quest_subtitle: "Celestial Matter Fusion"
	quest.66685C583D5075E5.title: "Dark Matter"
	quest.666C2D2BFFACE98B.quest_desc: [
		"Essence inherits functionality of &aDemon's Dream Fruit&r, but provides &cThird Eye&r for much longer. "
		""
		"Throwing &2Demon's Dream Essence&r into &dSpiritfire&r will also help not to get any negative effects after consumption."
	]
	quest.666C2D2BFFACE98B.quest_subtitle: "Longer Duration"
	quest.666C2D2BFFACE98B.title: "Better Third Eye"
	quest.666EA8B8F13EB292.title: "&dEmpty Soul Gem&r"
	quest.667C5DAC623D8924.quest_desc: ["Combine some &7ice&r, snowball, &1water&r and &5liquid hydrogen&r!"]
	quest.668453E081A6C57B.quest_desc: ["The &dendgame&r is &enigh,&r acquire this&b new ingot&r to progress."]
	quest.66A35D1A11CBB671.quest_subtitle: "Assemble a Control Chip"
	quest.66A35D1A11CBB671.title: "Precision Fabrication"
	quest.66C3C169307A8025.quest_desc: ["Allows the player to fly, move and swim faster. Works with water"]
	quest.66C52B137A4FF869.quest_desc: ["A new &cti&r&cer&r of &aessence!&r Used to craft many &eitems&r."]
	quest.66D85424EC74EDCC.quest_desc: ["The Portable Grid is a portable storage that isn’t connected to a network. It allows you to interact with a Storage Disk while not being connected to a network."]
	quest.66D85424EC74EDCC.quest_subtitle: "On-The-Go Grid"
	quest.66D85424EC74EDCC.title: "Portable Grid"
	quest.66D9F91519D52482.quest_desc: ["Blaze Cake is an item that can be fed to a Blaze Burner in order to make it Super-Heated."]
	quest.67030CEFEC1CEF37.quest_desc: ["Driven from their villages, these hardy merchants now wander the wilds, taking shelter beneath simple cyan and brown tents. Though weary from exile, they still offer trade and refuge to travelers brave enough to seek them out. In a world rising with danger, such camps are rare havens of trust."]
	quest.67030CEFEC1CEF37.quest_subtitle: "Find a Merchant Campsite"
	quest.673E76FE852A39DE.quest_desc: ["Moves heat"]
	quest.673E76FE852A39DE.title: "Heat Conduit"
	quest.673FCBF8685D0EEE.quest_desc: [
		"The &bInduction Matrix&r is a highly configurable multi-block energy storage structure."
		""
		"You'll need to make a rectangular prism structure. The edges must be made out of &8Induction Casings&r. The faces can be made of either Casings, &aStructural Glass&r, or &eInduction Ports&r. It's best to have &b&o2 Ports&r: one for &9input&r, and one for &coutput&r. These can be changed using the &dConfigurator&r."
		""
		"For this build, we'll be making a 5x5x5. This quest requires the exact amount of materials needed to build this."
		""
		"{image:kubejs:textures/item/induction.png width:100 height:100 align:1}"
	]
	quest.673FCBF8685D0EEE.title: "&bThe Induction Matrix"
	quest.676BC41C19BEF1FC.quest_desc: [" "]
	quest.676BC41C19BEF1FC.quest_subtitle: "The Fastest Crushing On This Side of the Mississippi"
	quest.676BC41C19BEF1FC.title: "The &5Marid Crusher&r"
	quest.676EA360D60595A3.quest_desc: [
		"Fused in the DMA from compressed sky stone, netherite, and ice."
		""
		"This dense celestial metal is a key ingredient for dimensional processors and early suit plating."
		""
		"&7Fun fact: In real astrophysics, white dwarfs pack the mass of an entire sun into the volume of the Earth. A single teaspoon of real white dwarf matter would weigh about 5 tons!&r"
	]
	quest.676EA360D60595A3.quest_subtitle: "Condensed Stellar Metal"
	quest.676EA360D60595A3.title: "White Dwarf Ingot"
	quest.676F34D1852C7FE5.quest_desc: [
		"The &bImbuement Chamber&r is one of the basic crafting mechanisms for this mod, by &lRight-Clicking&r this block with a specific item, you can turn it into something else, at the cost of &dsource&r, however this machine &acan&r run without source, yet &cslower&r then with source."
		""
		"There are some more &9complicated&r crafts you can make in this which require more then one item to create, you can make these by ussing &aPedestals&r which allow you to place more items &cAround&r the chamber for the bigger crafts."
		""
		"Place the &apedestals&r four in each &ediagional&r spot next to the chamber touching it, and four one block away &ehorrizontaly&r and &evertically&r for a &bdiamond&r like shape."
	]
	quest.67741BCDA62F9915.quest_desc: [
		"Infinity storage cells give you an endless supply of a single item directly inside your AE2 network."
		""
		"Put one into an ME Drive and that material will never run out of stock."
	]
	quest.67741BCDA62F9915.quest_subtitle: "Bottomless Digital Reservoirs"
	quest.67741BCDA62F9915.title: "Infinity Cells"
	quest.67AFCBCE7AAC3089.quest_desc: ["These are used to make the &bturbine&r inside of the &cmulti-block build&r, place the &bturbine bearing&r inside the &emiddle block&r on the floor on the inside of the &amachine,&r then place your &6rotator&r &6shafts&r so they touch the &eroof,&r finally attach &6rotator&r &6blades&r to the &6shaft,&r the &bmore and longer&r they are, the more &7vapor&r your &bturbine&r can process."]
	quest.67AFCBCE7AAC3089.title: "Turbine Shaft"
	quest.67D1573520242FD2.quest_desc: ["The &9very best rocket&r with full range of the &dgalaxies.&r"]
	quest.67DBE6C59C0D9D1B.quest_desc: ["A new &cti&r&cer&r of &aessence!&r Used to craft many &eitems&r."]
	quest.67DDFA6FB1F9EECA.quest_desc: ["Tools stronger then the &cprevious tier&r of &aessence.&r"]
	quest.67E6378D1A88F21E.title: "Kill a Enderman"
	quest.67E8B8DCFC93F832.quest_desc: ["The warehouse is completed. It might not seem like much, but you can't have much of a trade empire without a place to store things. "]
	quest.67F0B0E23C84E40C.quest_desc: ["A &ecrucial component&r in crafting &5Creative Essence&r."]
	quest.67F7FBDD9CC782F7.quest_desc: [
		"There are three tiers of vats to work with:"
		""
		"Cast Iron"
		"Steel"
		"Fireproof"
		""
		"Each tier has its own limits some recipes will only run if you’re using a vat of a certain level or higher."
		""
		"Mixers and Centrifuges are simple they only need a single vat block to do their job. But for the heavy-duty setups like the Electrolyzer or Arc Furnace, you’ll need larger vats. The required minimum dimensions (LxWxH) will be specified when needed."
		""
		"Some processes demand heat and a single Blaze Burner won’t cut it. You’ll either need multiple burners or a superheated setup. Fireboxes act like permanently superheated Blaze Burners, perfect for the job."
		""
		"And here’s a neat trick: grab your wrench and take a peek inside the vat!"
	]
	quest.67F7FBDD9CC782F7.title: "Chemical Vat"
	quest.6819665DA7028C9E.quest_subtitle: "Crafting ingredient"
	quest.6832CFEAFA7922E8.quest_desc: ["A device that produces immense stress when powered, halting the network by overstressing it."]
	quest.68331DDD9F01BDC5.quest_desc: [
		"Works with fuel."
		"If you have fuel you can burn anything!!!"
	]
	quest.683B0581845C3A43.quest_desc: ["Hippogryphs can be found commonly in mountainous regions. They might be a good form of transportation in the early game."]
	quest.6847F5D14FCB5BF8.quest_desc: [
		"Use the Meteorite Compass to find Skystone Meteorites, which have a chance to contain Quartz blocks and Budding Quartz."
		""
		"It has a max range of roughly 2,700 blocks."
	]
	quest.684F432B43D104A1.quest_desc: [
		"This mod adds &6Trash Cans&r which can be used to &o&bvoid&r &eitems&r, &9fluids&r and &cenergy&r!"
		""
		"&eItems&r and &9Fluids&r can be &bwhitelisted&r or &8blacklisted&r and an &cenergy&r &ntransfer limit&r can be set!"
	]
	quest.684F432B43D104A1.title: "The Trash Cans"
	quest.685159786B4BCA0A.quest_desc: ["&8Steel Casting&r is a durable block used for decor and some crafting recipes."]
	quest.6858E25E510AE0FA.quest_desc: ["Drifting through the skies like a colossal squid, this otherworldly airship bristles with defenses. Phantom-riding monstrosities circle its hull, while fish-like warriors astride hoglins guard its decks. To face the Conqueror is to battle a skyborne legion. And only the strongest will claim victory."]
	quest.6858E25E510AE0FA.quest_subtitle: "Find a Heavenly Conqueror"
	quest.685C4A646E092A82.quest_desc: ["&dMystical agriculture&r adds new &aagumentable&r &aarmor!&r Crafted with &dgems&r from this &ctier,&r and &aarmor&r from the &cprevious tier&r you can craft &epowerful sets&r!"]
	quest.685DBFDE3E796260.quest_desc: [
		"Same effect as the temporal pouch but you can refill this wand with time fluid to have basically infinite time acceleration!"
		""
		"(I reccomend using the time bee to farm it)"
	]
	quest.685DBFDE3E796260.quest_subtitle: "(There is a upgraded version)"
	quest.6886DFF567919753.quest_desc: ["Energy Capacity: 128,000,000 FE"]
	quest.6886DFF567919753.quest_subtitle: "Tier 3"
	quest.689F32883C4E9502.quest_desc: [
		"&#1D4FFFCata&rc&6lysm&r is a mod that adds difficult dungeons, challenging boss-fights and powerful items."
		""
		"This mod's bosses are inspired by Minecraft Dungeons,"
		""
		"being much more unique, complex and powerful compared to Vanilla's."
		""
		"Defeat them in battle to prove yourself and earn powerful gear!"
	]
	quest.689F32883C4E9502.title: "Welcome to Cataclysm"
	quest.689F61EF65826A33.quest_desc: [
		"The &bStellar Nexus&r is a massive cosmic multiblock reactor measuring &635x34x35&r blocks that simulates a captured star."
		""
		"Shift right-click the controller with a &bStructure Scanner&r to view a full 3D hologram in the world, or click &aAuto-build Structure&r inside the controller GUI to place blocks from your inventory. Keep the area chunkloaded so the multiblock stays active."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&eRules for Assembly:&r"
		"- All 138 field generators must be the exact same tier (do not mix Mk.I, Mk.II, and Mk.III)."
		"- Include the required hatches: an ME Massive Input and Output hatch, a Massive Fluid Hatch for coolant, and an FE Energy Hatch for power."
		"- Star reactions generate huge amounts of heat. Keep plenty of Gelid Cryotheum or Temporal Fluid in the fluid buffer, and leave Safe Mode enabled to avoid emergency shutdowns."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"{image:ftb:textures/quests/stella_nexus.png width:200 height:200 align:center}"
	]
	quest.689F61EF65826A33.quest_subtitle: "Star in a Cage"
	quest.689F61EF65826A33.title: "Stellar Nexus Multiblock"
	quest.68D4965E97E25EA6.quest_desc: ["Dropped from the &9Teletor&r upon &cdeath,&r you will use this to &ecraft&r some of the &bgear&r from this mod."]
	quest.68DBCC34C70AEF1A.quest_subtitle: "Right click in the ground to find oil"
	quest.68E50F7501B945BB.quest_desc: ["A lightweight, high-energy metal ingot prized for its excellent conductivity and use in advanced batteries and electronic components. Valued in high-tech crafting and power-storage applications where energy density and low weight matter."]
	quest.68E798B9D437E949.quest_desc: [
		"Found in &6wooded forests&r the&a Whirlisprig&r can be befriend to turn into its token if a &atree&r is grown near it."
		""
		"They will naturaly produce &ecrops&r, &6trees&r, and &dflowers&r from ones around them."
		""
		"&aWhirlisprigs&r will follow mods and player occasionally grow grass nearby them."
		""
		"To summon this mob use its &echarm&r (crafted from its token) on a &dflower&r, that will become its home."
		""
		"The &aWhirlisprig&r needs &dsource&r nearby to work, but will generate &6plants&r in a chest placed by its &dhome flower&r."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&aWirlsprigs&r will only work if they are &ehappy&r, which is determined by the &bdiversity&r of plants in its home range ( withen&l 10 blocks&r of its flower)"
		"&lRight-Clicking&r on the &aWhirl&r will give you some info on it and clicking it with a &6plant&r will telll you if it would like that in its home."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&bFamiliar form&r: &eHalves&r the cost of &aElemantal earth glyphs&r, and  gives extra &esaturation&r to the player when you eat."
	]
	quest.68F157428E673455.quest_desc: ["&bEggs&r are &cbroken&r when &ejumped on&r, and if you place &bice&r or &6amber&r beneath them they will &anot grow up&r."]
	quest.68FC81E133443E76.quest_desc: [
		"The Library is a way for you to raise your adult citizens’ Intelligence skill, which influences skill increases once employed. A citizen will randomly level up their Intelligence as long as they’re assigned to the Library. Paper and books help Library Students increase their skills faster."
		""
		"Being a Library Student is a full-time job, and a student cannot be employed simultaneously at any other hut."
		""
		"Tip: Consider setting the hiring mode to automatic so new recruits or kids growing up will start school automatically."
	]
	quest.68FC81E133443E76.quest_subtitle: "Build a Library"
	quest.6904EC449FBEE387.quest_desc: ["&9Cables&r are used to connect blocks and items to your system. \\\\n \\\\n In the beginning, you can get by with placing blocks next to each other to connect them to your system, but Cables allow you to extend out! This is a staple for any Refined Storage Network."]
	quest.6904EC449FBEE387.quest_subtitle: "Connecting The System"
	quest.6904EC449FBEE387.title: "Cables"
	quest.69128ABBB31AE737.quest_desc: ["Basically a tech crafting table used to assemble &crockets&r and is essential for building all tiers of &dspacecraft.&r To craft a &crocket,&r place each part in the correct position based on the recipe, which can be found by searching &d@ad astra rocket&r in the &n&lJEI&r menu to the &r&nright of your invertory&r. &cRocket&r assembly follows a general layout: &enose on top&r, &abody in the middle&r, &ban engine at the bottom&r, &cwings on the sides&r, and &dfuel tanks beneath the body&r."]
	quest.691A99122DCD9BC6.quest_desc: ["The 1048m Fluid Storage Part is used to craft the 1048m Fluid Storage Disk."]
	quest.692AAD0BCCBCB657.quest_desc: ["All mod machines inherit feature of auto-exporting produced items in adjacent storage."]
	quest.692AAD0BCCBCB657.quest_subtitle: "Auto-export"
	quest.69385BB35797D67A.quest_desc: ["The 1024k Storage Disk can store 1024000 items."]
	quest.693A9414F2EE95D8.quest_desc: ["Hostile Neural Networks is a mob based on Deep Mob Learning. It allows you to train data models and run simulations, producing mob predictions, which can be used to generate mob loot."]
	quest.693A9414F2EE95D8.title: "Hostile Neural Networks"
	quest.694996527316F758.quest_desc: ["A&a better version&r of the previous bank which allows it to transport &emore energy faster&r by increasing its &cmax&r &bInput&r and &9Output&r speed."]
	quest.69501D98C31724E0.quest_desc: ["The &bFrosty Generator&r uses &aSnowballs&r and &9Ice&r to produce &cEnergy&r. It’s perfect for players in snowy biomes or those with access to ice farms. This generator turns cold resources into a steady stream of &cPower&r."]
	quest.695888509D42926B.title: "Find a Soul Blacksmith"
	quest.69642A3618E86DED.quest_desc: ["This is the &amain block&r you will be using to build the &breprocessor frame&r."]
	quest.69642A3618E86DED.title: "The Frame"
	quest.6965552A5CE5D023.quest_desc: ["This gun uses &boxygen&r to pull the player through low &agravity&r areas, &lRight-Click&r to propel yourself &nforward.&r"]
	quest.696B1817DDBA4509.quest_desc: [
		"A &bdetailed map&r that reveals the &aToxic cave codex&r, and the borders of &anearby biomes&r. is crafted from &ecodex's.&r"
		""
		"Do &6be carful&r here as the &eirradiated&r effect &dprevents natural healing&r."
	]
	quest.697C47E6F19215F5.quest_desc: [
		"The &bME Formation Plane&r acts similarly to the &6Storage Bus&r but treats the &dworld itself&r as storage. It places any block in its &afilter&r directly in front of itself."
		""
		"This is useful for scenarios where a block can be processed by placing and breaking it with a tool."
	]
	quest.69816C16E81355E8.quest_desc: ["A clutch that uncouples after a set delay when the network is overstressed."]
	quest.698A959C9E449592.quest_subtitle: "Now we are getting somewhere."
	quest.69A8F2AAA7F0DCDD.quest_subtitle: "Used in creative recipes"
	quest.69BF19A57DF25EAE.quest_desc: ["Find and kill the &cMagnetron&r within the &bMagnetic caves&r, after killing the &cMagnetron&r you will be rewarded with the &bheart of iron&r which you need to&e mine&r from its &agrave&r."]
	quest.69C181CEEAA2F387.quest_desc: ["An upgraded space suit made with &cNetherite&r armour and &dOstrum&r plates. Offers better protection and &edurability&r in hostile environments."]
	quest.69D8F6483DACD930.quest_desc: ["Different &ctiers&r of &bwatering cans&r hold more water. &lRight-Click&r water to fill the can up, &lShift-Right-CLick&r to water &acrops&r around you."]
	quest.69EAF1072D492F1A.quest_desc: [
		"The Ancient Tome is a glowing book that’s dropped by raiders during raids. If you have the Ancient Tome in your inventory, it will glow when there is going to be a raid that night. "
		""
		"In the later game, the Enchanter can convert Ancient Tomes into enchanted books. "
	]
	quest.69EAF1072D492F1A.quest_subtitle: "Keep one in your hotbar"
	quest.6A0237FADC519965.quest_desc: ["From a distance, it looks peaceful. Fields of golden wheat swaying beside a proud windmill. But don’t be deceived: the Illagers tend no crops for trade. Behind the rustic facade lies a nest of evil, their blades as sharp as the sickles they carry."]
	quest.6A0237FADC519965.quest_subtitle: "Find an Illager Windmill"
	quest.6A1A8BF1DA2D269C.quest_desc: [
		"The &4Auto Feeding Card&r enables the selection of specific items to be used to feed the player."
		""
		"Simply drag the desired items into the filter slots and if the equipment is linked to the AE2 grid, it will try to find them in the system to feed the player when hungry."
	]
	quest.6A1B3509AB70FA8C.quest_desc: [
		"&eWhat Is the Packager Extension?&r"
		""
		"The &ePackager Extension&r is an auxiliary machine that &acopies the functionality&r of a nearby &ePackager&r."
		""
		"It allows you to &aparallelize packaging&r without needing additional &ePackage Recipe Holders&r."
		""
		"The Packager Extension &crequires power&r to operate."
		""
		"&eHow It Works&r"
		""
		"• Place the Packager Extension within a &a3×3×3&r area around a &ePackager&r"
		"• The extension automatically copies the Packager’s recipe data and behavior"
		""
		"If multiple Packagers are detected, the extension copies the &enorth-west-bottommost&r one."
		""
		"Inputs can be extracted from the &etop side&r."
		""
		"&ePackaging Modes&r"
		""
		"The Packager Extension supports the same modes as the Packager:"
		""
		"• &eRequire Exact&r"
		"• &eRequire Disjoint&r"
		"• &eFirst Match&r"
		""
		"These modes control how inventory contents are matched to available recipes."
		""
		"&eWhy Use the Packager Extension?&r"
		""
		"• Scale packaging throughput efficiently"
		"• Reduce Recipe Holder usage"
		"• Simplify large PackagedAuto setups"
		"• Ideal for high-volume automation"
	]
	quest.6A1B3509AB70FA8C.title: "&ePackager Extension&r"
	quest.6A1C8E4F00000001.quest_desc: [
		"Welcome to &#D9914DReliquary Reincarnations&r, a hunting and artifact mod built around harvesting rare mob drops."
		""
		"Reliquary adds &e14 rare mob drops&r with a base 2% drop rate on player kills (raised to ~11% with Looting III)."
		""
		"Begin by hunting your first basic drops: &cZombie Heart&r from Zombies, &8Rib Bone&r from Skeletons, and &fBat Wing&r from Bats!"
	]
	quest.6A1C8E4F00000001.title: "The Hunter's Calling"
	quest.6A1C8E4F00000002.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Magicbane&r is the single most important early investment in Reliquary."
		""
		"1. &eDrop Rate Booster:&r Increases rare mob drop rates across ALL 14 Reliquary materials."
		"2. &bDamage Scaling:&r Its attack damage scales exponentially with the number and level of enchantments applied to it!"
		""
		"Craft and enchant it immediately to accelerate all your future farming."
	]
	quest.6A1C8E4F00000002.title: "The Magicbane"
	quest.6A1C8E4F00000003.quest_desc: [
		"&bGlowing Water&r is pure condensed liquid light created by infusing water with luminous alchemical ingredients."
		""
		"It serves as a primary crafting fluid for holy relics, glowing bread, and protective charms."
	]
	quest.6A1C8E4F00000003.title: "Glowing Water"
	quest.6A1C8E4F00000004.quest_desc: [
		"The &eAlkahestry Tome&r is an ancient grimoire of matter transmutation."
		""
		"Using alchemical redstone/glowstone charges, it can duplicate and transmute raw materials, metals, and mob drops without crafting tables!"
	]
	quest.6A1C8E4F00000004.quest_subtitle: "Poor's man Transmutation table"
	quest.6A1C8E4F00000004.title: "Alkahestry Tome"
	quest.6A1C8E4F00000005.quest_desc: [
		"The &4Witherless Rose&r blooms from the essence of undead decay."
		""
		"While held in your hand, offhand, or active inventory, it grants &6complete immunity to the Wither effect&r! Essential for Nether Fortress runs and Wither boss fights."
	]
	quest.6A1C8E4F00000005.title: "Witherless Rose"
	quest.6A1C8E4F00000006.quest_desc: [
		"The &9Pedestal&r displays artifacts and radiates their powers continuously into the surrounding area."
		""
		"Place utilitarian relics like the &eLantern of Paranoia&r, &cPyromancer's Staff&r, or &aHarvest Rod&r onto a Pedestal to create automated protective and farming zones!"
	]
	quest.6A1C8E4F00000006.title: "Alchemical Pedestals"
	quest.6A1C8E4F00000007.quest_desc: [
		"The &eInterdiction Torch&r emits an invisible psychic shockwave."
		""
		"Any hostile mob that attempts to approach the torch will be physically pushed backward, keeping bases and entryways completely mob-free."
	]
	quest.6A1C8E4F00000007.title: "Interdiction Torch"
	quest.6A1C8E4F00000008.quest_desc: [
		"The &eAngelheart Vial&r is the premier survival safeguard."
		""
		"When you suffer fatal damage, the vial shatters instantly from your inventory, preventing death, restoring a huge chunk of health, and clearing all negative debuffs."
		""
		"Carry several in dangerous dimensions!"
	]
	quest.6A1C8E4F00000008.quest_subtitle: "It Stacks!"
	quest.6A1C8E4F00000008.title: "Angelheart Vial"
	quest.6A1C8E4F00000009.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Phoenix Down&r is the ultimate artifact of true rebirth."
		""
		"Forged from Molten Cores and Angelic Feathers, it revives the fallen player with full health, saturation, and temporary invulnerability."
	]
	quest.6A1C8E4F00000009.title: "Phoenix Down"
	quest.6A1C8E4F00000010.quest_desc: [
		"The &bStaff of Rending Gale&r harnesses tempestuous atmospheric pressure."
		""
		"- &eRight-click in air:&r Grants full creative flight powered by feathers or Alkahestry."
		"- &cRight-click mob:&r Blasts targets with concentrated lightning bolts."
	]
	quest.6A1C8E4F00000010.title: "Staff of Rending Gale"
	quest.6A1C8E4F00000011.quest_desc: [
		"The &cPyromancer's Staff&r commands primeval volcanic fire."
		""
		"Hurl explosive fireballs at targets and extinguish all fire/lava damage taken by the wielder."
	]
	quest.6A1C8E4F00000011.title: "Pyromancer's Staff"
	quest.6A1C8E4F00000012.quest_desc: [
		"The &7Lantern of Paranoia&r never lets you be caught in the dark."
		""
		"As you walk through caves or unlit terrain, it automatically consumes torches from your inventory and places them whenever the local light level drops below mob-spawning thresholds."
	]
	quest.6A1C8E4F00000012.title: "Lantern of Paranoia"
	quest.6A1C8E4F00000013.quest_desc: [
		"Combine mob drop fragments into &6Mob Charms&r to permanently pacify specific creatures."
		""
		"The &eMob Charm Belt&r holds up to 8 charms simultaneously, granting passive all-around immunity to Creepers, Skeletons, Blazes, Ghasts, and Wither Skeletons!"
	]
	quest.6A1C8E4F00000013.title: "Mob Charms and the Charm Belt"
	quest.6A1C8E4F00000014.quest_desc: [
		"The &eApothecary Mortar&r grinds herbs and mob parts into refined alchemical essences."
		""
		"Use it alongside the &5Apothecary Cauldron&r to brew customized, high-duration condensed potions with multiple combined effects!"
	]
	quest.6A1C8E4F00000014.title: "Apothecary Mortar and Cauldron"
	quest.6A1C8E4F00000015.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Hunter's Handgun&r is a rapid-fire alchemical sidearm."
		""
		"Load it with specialized &eMagazines&r (Buster for armor penetration, Holy for undead annihilation, Seeker for homing rounds, and Blaze for fiery blasts)."
	]
	quest.6A1C8E4F00000015.title: "The Hunter's Handgun"
	quest.6A1C8E4F00000016.quest_desc: [
		"The &2Harvest Rod&r automatically harvests and replants a 3x3 field of mature crops in a single right-click."
		""
		"Place it on a Pedestal to automate surrounding farm plots indefinitely!"
	]
	quest.6A1C8E4F00000016.title: "The Harvest Rod"
	quest.6A1C8E4F00000017.quest_desc: [
		"The &aFertile Lily Pad&r radiates accelerated growth vitality to all crops, trees, and plants within a 9x9 radius."
		""
		"Stack several around water channels for rapid automatic farm output! (AKA Mystical Agriculture early farming)"
	]
	quest.6A1C8E4F00000017.quest_subtitle: "Arguably the best item in the mod"
	quest.6A1C8E4F00000017.title: "Fertile Lily Pad"
	quest.6A1C8E4F00000018.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Hero's Medallion&r acts as a bottomless spiritual reservoir for player Experience."
		""
		"- &eSneak Right-click:&r Stores all current player levels into the medallion."
		"- &bRight-click:&r Withdraws stored XP instantly on demand."
		""
		"Never risk losing high levels on dangerous dungeon expeditions!"
	]
	quest.6A1C8E4F00000018.title: "Hero's Medallion"
	quest.6A1C8E4F00000019.quest_desc: [
		"The &5Twilight Cloak&r represents mastery of all relic arts."
		""
		"When equipped or held, it renders the player &6completely invisible to all hostile mobs&r as long as you are standing in darkness or shadows."
		""
		"You have mastered every hunting trial and alchemical secret in Reliquary!"
	]
	quest.6A1C8E4F00000019.title: "Grandmaster Relic Hunter"
	quest.6A497B063CF32A5C.quest_desc: [
		"Applying the &9Ascent Spawner Upgrade Rune&r upgrades the spawner's core stats to Tier 2:"
		""
		"• &eMin Spawn Delay:&r 100 ticks (5s)"
		"• &eMax Spawn Delay:&r 400 ticks (20s)"
		"• &bSpawn Count:&r 10 mobs"
		"• &cMax Nearby Entities:&r 18"
		"• &dPlayer Activation Range:&r 32 blocks"
	]
	quest.6A497B063CF32A5C.title: "Tier II: Ascent Upgrade Rune"
	quest.6A4C49AE72E98727.quest_desc: ["&aArmor&r in this mod has &baugment slots&r which can be filled in an &6tinkering table&r. All you need to do is craft an &9augment&r at your &6Infusion alter&r, then place the &aarmor&r you want to &9augment&r and the &9augment&r into the &6Tinkering table&r, then take the &aarmor&r out and it will keep that &9augment.&r"]
	quest.6A4CF3A1CF4D4928.quest_desc: [
		"The Charger provides a way to charge supported tools, and Certus Quartz Crystal."
		""
		"Power can be provided via the top or bottom, via either AE2's cables, or other mod power cables. It can accept either AE2's power (AE) or Forge Energy (FE). Items can be inserted or removed from any side. Only the results can be removed, so no need for filters to prevent removing certus crystals instead of charged certus. Can be rotated with a Certus Quartz Wrench in order to facilitate automation."
		""
		"Can be used to create Charged Certus Quartz Crystal from Certus Quartz Crystal, and Meteorite Compass from Compass."
		""
		"To power it manually, place a Wooden Crank on the top or bottom and right-click it until the item is charged."
	]
	quest.6A539510EEB5F29E.quest_subtitle: "Right click Hardened Planks with a Steel Ingot."
	quest.6A60B76053393288.quest_desc: ["The Smeltery is where the Smelter will smelt ores into ingots. The higher the level of the Smeltery, the more furnaces the Smelter will be able to use. A higher level will also have a higher chance to double and even triple the ingot output per block of ore."]
	quest.6A60B76053393288.quest_subtitle: "Builder a Smelter"
	quest.6A752619712F23A1.quest_desc: ["Glass that doesn't let light through."]
	quest.6A7884E1FF0A9A8E.quest_desc: ["A new &bnon-magnetic&r set of tools that do &eextra damage&r to &bmagnetic mobs&r and are crafted from &9azure neodymium&r."]
	quest.6A7884E1FF0A9A8E.title: "Azure neodymium tools"
	quest.6A7F7835B4FFED38.quest_desc: ["&rThe Flux Networks mod enables wireless energy networks, allowing customizable, cross-dimensional power transfer without the need for extensive cabling."]
	quest.6A84FC7CC5304E10.quest_subtitle: "Crafting ingredient"
	quest.6A9A6150365C1452.quest_desc: ["Applied to &nhelmets,&r this &denchant&r will let you breath in &dspace&r if you have full &boxygen cans&r in your inventory."]
	quest.6AB126672C3BCF2C.quest_desc: ["Found within &6suspicions soul sand&r in &bbastions,&r this can be used in a &eSmithing table&r to craft &anew gear&r."]
	quest.6AB8E0C6EBB47F90.quest_desc: ["The &bDense Smart Cable&r works like &6Dense Covered Cable&r but includes a &avisual display&r of the channels being used. It can carry up to &d32 channels&r, providing a &dclear view&r of network usage. These cables are excellent for &amonitoring large networks&r and ensuring &aefficient channel distribution&r."]
	quest.6AD877ACB8F468B5.quest_desc: [
		"&ePulls&r &dmagnetic blocks&r toward the magnet while powered with &credstone.&r"
		""
		"The &arange&r can be &aincreased&r and &cdecreased&r by clicking on it with &bingots&r of the &asame type (Increase)&r or the &cdifferent type (Decrease)&r."
	]
	quest.6AD877ACB8F468B5.quest_subtitle: "Craft a scarlet magnet"
	quest.6ADDFD55AD0DF7D4.quest_desc: ["Combining &bRidiculite Ingots&r with &4Rossinite&r will create &cInanite Ingots&r."]
	quest.6AF837D98FEB79E2.quest_desc: [
		"&#A50307Powah!&r adds the classic Energy Cables and Energy Cells, but also cool and unique mechanics such as the upgradable Ender Network, Player Transmitters, the Energizing crafting system, and a bunch of cool gadgets and items such as the Charged Snowball!"
		""
		"For a good explanation of the mod's content, please have a look at the Manual."
	]
	quest.6AF837D98FEB79E2.title: "Welcome to &1Powah"
	quest.6B04FC81351CD1AB.quest_desc: ["If you want to access your Refined Storage network wirelessly, you'll need to start by creating a &9Wireless Transmitter&r. \\\\n \\\\n You can attach this anywhere on your system. This is needed to use wireless grids."]
	quest.6B04FC81351CD1AB.quest_subtitle: "Storage, at a distance"
	quest.6B04FC81351CD1AB.title: "&5Wireless Access"
	quest.6B0CE8AD86991E28.quest_desc: [
		"The Composter’s Hut is where the Composter will turn organic materials into compost, which can be used by the Farmer or Florist to fertilize crops or flowers. "
		""
		"Note: You must configure the composter’s hut with the items you want composted before the composter will compost. &7&oThis sounds similar to a woodchuck tongue twister.&r"
	]
	quest.6B0CE8AD86991E28.quest_subtitle: "Build a Composter Hut"
	quest.6B13EAC5DFFF9E0F.quest_desc: ["This &cmachine&r changes the &6texure&r of inputed blocks, including &astairs&r and &afences.&r First &binput&r a block on the &eleft&r which will apply the &cnew texture&r to the block on the &eright&r."]
	quest.6B20F8F08E5F3848.quest_desc: ["A kinetic generator that converts heat and water into rotational energy. It’s a reliable way to power your machinery and automation systems with steady output."]
	quest.6B2C91B800000001.quest_desc: [
		"Welcome to &bMahou Tsukai&r, a deeply thematic anime-inspired magic mod built around blood circles, powder catalysts, leylines, and Noble Phantasms."
		""
		"Begin your magical journey by crafting the &6Mahou Tsukai Knowledge Compendium&r using Paper, Red Dye, and Leather."
		""
		"This compendium explains every blood circle, spell catalyst recipe, and legendary weapon ritual!"
	]
	quest.6B2C91B800000001.title: "Knowledge Compendium"
	quest.6B2C91B800000002.quest_desc: [
		"The &7Hammer&r is your first tool for crushing minerals into &6Powdered Catalysts&r."
		""
		"Strike Diamonds, Emeralds, Ender Pearls, Gold, Iron, Quartz, or Eyes of Ender to create 1 powder per material."
	]
	quest.6B2C91B800000002.title: "The Alchemical Hammer"
	quest.6B2C91B800000003.quest_desc: [
		"The &bMortar and Pestle&r is a superior grinding tool crafted from diamonds, sticks, and bricks."
		""
		"It yields &62 powders per material&r instead of 1, effectively doubling your catalyst output!"
	]
	quest.6B2C91B800000003.title: "Mortar and Pestle (2x Yield)"
	quest.6B2C91B800000004.quest_desc: [
		"Mahou Tsukai classifies magic into 7 distinct catalyst powder categories:"
		""
		"- &fIron and Gold:&r Boundary wards and mystic offensive magic."
		"- &bDiamond and Emerald:&r Exchange, mana transfer, and life force."
		"- &dEnder and Eye:&r Spatial displacement and clairvoyance."
		"- &cQuartz:&r Projectile attacks and familiars."
	]
	quest.6B2C91B800000004.title: "The Seven Catalyst Powders"
	quest.6B2C91B800000005.quest_desc: [
		"To cast spells in Mahou Tsukai, you must draw circles with your own blood:"
		""
		"1. Craft a &cDagger&r."
		"2. Right-click solid ground (or a &eSpell Cloth&r) to take small damage and draw a &cBlood Circle (Mahoujin)&r."
		"3. Right-click the circle with 3 specific powders to complete the incantation into a spell or portable scroll!"
	]
	quest.6B2C91B800000005.title: "Blood Circles and Spell Cloth"
	quest.6B2C91B800000006.quest_desc: [
		"Your maximum mana pool &bgrows permanently as you spend mana&r!"
		""
		"Store excess mana into &bAttuned Diamonds&r and &aAttuned Emeralds&r to carry emergency reserves into combat."
	]
	quest.6B2C91B800000006.title: "Attuned Gems (Mana Storage)"
	quest.6B2C91B800000007.quest_desc: [
		"&bMana Circuits&r store mana in the world for use by nearby players."
		""
		"The first player to right-click a newly placed circuit binds to it. It can hold immense reserves of passive mana!"
	]
	quest.6B2C91B800000007.title: "Mana Circuit"
	quest.6B2C91B800000008.quest_desc: [
		"&eGeas Scrolls&r allow you to bind voluntary magical oaths."
		""
		"Imposing self-restrictions permanently multiplies your base mana regeneration rate!"
	]
	quest.6B2C91B800000008.title: "Geas (Mana Regeneration Boost)"
	quest.6B2C91B800000009.quest_desc: [
		"Craft the &bMystic Eyes of Fay Sight&r scroll (3 Powdered Eyes):"
		""
		"While active, you gain the ability to see &9Leylines flowing across the sky&r and track &aFae creatures&r."
		""
		"Building your magical base directly on an intersecting Leyline grants massive continuous mana regeneration bonuses!"
	]
	quest.6B2C91B800000009.title: "Fay Sight and Leylines"
	quest.6B2C91B800000010.quest_desc: [
		"&aFae Essence&r is obtained from friendly Fae spirits visible with Fay Sight."
		""
		"Feed Fae using Powdered Catalysts or Faecakes to sustainably produce Fae Essence for advanced rituals and familiars!"
	]
	quest.6B2C91B800000010.title: "Fae Essence and Breeding"
	quest.6B2C91B800000011.quest_desc: ["The &eScroll of Strengthening&r reinforces held items, granting extreme mining speed to tools and massive attack power bonuses to weapons."]
	quest.6B2C91B800000011.title: "Scroll of Strengthening"
	quest.6B2C91B800000012.quest_desc: ["The &bScroll of Protective Displacement&r creates a spatial barrier that deflects all incoming arrows, fireballs, and hostile projectile attacks."]
	quest.6B2C91B800000012.title: "Protective Displacement"
	quest.6B2C91B800000013.quest_desc: ["The &cScroll of Damage Exchange&r links your life force to nearby entities, transferring a portion of damage taken directly to hostile targets."]
	quest.6B2C91B800000013.title: "Damage Exchange"
	quest.6B2C91B800000014.quest_desc: ["Summon magical spirits to scout terrain, retrieve dropped items, and fight alongside you in battle!"]
	quest.6B2C91B800000014.title: "Familiars and Familiar's Garden"
	quest.6B2C91B800000015.quest_desc: ["&8Kodoku&r worms enable sympathetic magic, allowing you to manipulate and siphon energy from mobs remotely."]
	quest.6B2C91B800000015.title: "Kodoku (Sympathetic Magic)"
	quest.6B2C91B800000016.quest_desc: [
		"&6Caliburn&r is the holy sword of King Arthur:"
		""
		"1. Build a pool of water at least 3 blocks deep."
		"2. Draw a &cPower Consolidation Mahoujin&r at the bottom."
		"3. Throw an enchanted Diamond or Netherite Sword into the lake."
		""
		"Caliburn deals massive true damage and heals the wielder on hit. The higher the smite enchantment on the thrown sword, the higher its base attack damage!"
	]
	quest.6B2C91B800000016.title: "The Holy Sword: Caliburn"
	quest.6B2C91B800000017.quest_desc: [
		"&4Morgan&r is the corrupted, demonic sister-blade of Caliburn:"
		""
		"1. Slay your own tamed Wolf with Caliburn while standing in a corrupted blood circle."
		"2. The holy sword corrupts into &5Morgan&r!"
		""
		"Morgan steals enemy max health on hit and increases its damage cap indefinitely by slaying villagers (up to thousands of damage per swing!)."
	]
	quest.6B2C91B800000017.quest_subtitle: "Use Mithril Weaves instead of Nether Stars to increase the cap now."
	quest.6B2C91B800000017.title: "The Corrupted Blade: Morgan"
	quest.6B2C91B800000018.quest_desc: [
		"&cClarent&r is the treasonous sword of Mordred."
		""
		"Channels raw crimson mana to fire devastating continuous plasma beams and copies the attack damage of weapons it blocks!"
	]
	quest.6B2C91B800000018.title: "The Radiant Sword: Clarent"
	quest.6B2C91B800000019.quest_desc: ["&6Treasury Projection (Gate of Babylon)&r summons golden portals across the sky that unleash a barrage of projected legendary blades onto your enemies."]
	quest.6B2C91B800000019.title: "Treasury Projection (Gate of Babylon)"
	quest.6B2C91B800000020.quest_desc: ["&dRho Aias&r deploys the 7-petaled divine flower shield of the Trojan War, completely nullifying catastrophic explosions and boss strikes."]
	quest.6B2C91B800000020.title: "Rho Aias (Seven Rings)"
	quest.6B34C2736C008BE4.quest_desc: ["&dReroll basic item stats&r like &edurability&r and &6toughness&r using &dRarity materials&r you can get from salveging items. It’s your first step into reforging great for improving gear &9without gambling&r too hard."]
	quest.6B4BB5551D4DAD49.quest_desc: ["An arcane conduit made of crystallized sugar and madness. His spells are sweet... and hurtful."]
	quest.6B5BC33667C782EC.quest_desc: [
		"The Ender Golem is very similar to Minecraft Dungeons' Redstone Golem."
		""
		"Its body is made of obsidian and it moves with the force of the Void."
	]
	quest.6B5C3E68A6A3F3B5.quest_desc: [
		"The Spatial Pylon is used in spatial IO to generate the spatial field and define the volume to be affected."
		""
		"Each continuous line of pylons uses 1 channel"
		""
		"Lines of pylons must be at least 2 blocks long to function."
	]
	quest.6B660CB5ACA15B9B.quest_desc: [
		"The infinite void, an &dempty abyass&r, for those &6who have come far&r."
		""
		"Use the &6ATM portal&r in the &0end.&r"
	]
	quest.6B7188472F6ED6AF.quest_desc: ["Allow redstone links to match any frequency for the slot it is placed in."]
	quest.6B7DE9EA8E828DEE.quest_desc: [
		"The Inscriber creates different types of Processors."
		" "
		"The Inscriber can also \"create\" presses by duplicating an existing press with an Iron Block."
	]
	quest.6B8966D7EA9BB5FB.quest_desc: ["Hand cranks with a cogwheel installed."]
	quest.6B8E3833F41BD726.quest_desc: [
		"An upgrade that enables &bautocrafting functionality&r for &5ME Interfaces&r and &6Pattern Providers&r. Required to:"
		""
		"&eRequest remote crafting&r via terminals"
		""
		"&dProcess recursive recipes&r (multi-step crafts)"
		""
		"&cLink to Crafting CPUs&r"
		""
		"Key Limitation:"
		""
		"Consumes &9additional channels&r when installed"
		""
		"(The &a\"brain implant\"&r that makes ME Networks truly autonomous!)"
		""
		"&e\"From storage to factory with one card\"&r"
	]
	quest.6B8E3833F41BD726.title: "&5Crafting Card&r"
	quest.6B8E544E188FBA4D.quest_subtitle: "The heart of your system"
	quest.6B9B0E7EFA9A9B0B.quest_subtitle: "Smash, next."
	quest.6BADE45ED40D5313.title: "Crystal/ Emerald Furnace"
	quest.6BB0C51EE8CA5966.quest_desc: [
		"At the Mine, the Miner will mine for ores and materials. Once they are hired, the Miner will first create a shaft downward to a specific depth depending on the level of the Mine. Once the main shaft is completed, the Miner will then branch out. While mining, sometimes the Miner will get lucky and get an ore block instead of a basic stone block. &7&o(magic!)&r&r"
		""
		"Tip: The miner fills holes and gaps with a Fill Block, cobblestone by default. However, the fill block can be changed in the Miner’s Hut settings. If you have a forester and lots of wood, consider using wood planks. Or perhaps now you will have a use for all that deepslate."
	]
	quest.6BB0C51EE8CA5966.quest_subtitle: "Build a Mine"
	quest.6BCEC4DFC4050076.quest_desc: ["Forged in &chellish flame&r, the &cNether table&r handles recipes too volatile for the &aOverworld.&r"]
	quest.6BD625E5CA469914.quest_desc: ["Increases&c machine overclock &rwhile &binside it.&r"]
	quest.6BDC8BE7ADE7767D.quest_desc: ["&aA lot more storage.&r"]
	quest.6BE97BF6EA54D48B.quest_desc: ["Dropped from &cVesper&r use these, you guessed it, for &6crafting&r."]
	quest.6BEC1C688BC24782.quest_desc: [
		"With exchangeable Drill Heads and upgrades, itsproperties are almost entirely modifiable."
		""
		"To modify it, place it in an Engineer's Workbench."
		""
		"The Drilr runs off of Biodiesel and can be filled directly in the Refinery."
	]
	quest.6BFE5D35265080E6.quest_desc: ["A sprawling underground stronghold, the Scorched Mines radiate in four cardinal directions from a central dome. Heat and shadows fill the tunnels, and danger lurks at every turn. Brave adventurers who navigate its branching paths may uncover riches, but only if they survive the hazards within."]
	quest.6BFE5D35265080E6.quest_subtitle: "Find the Scorched Mines"
	quest.6C1BBA559963B3DF.title: "Little Book o' &cDemons&r"
	quest.6C226F99E675B063.quest_desc: ["Used to fuel &6Agumenting tables&r. Put this sigil in the &lLeft-side lower slot&r below the item your upgrading."]
	quest.6C25D42C36175BF4.quest_desc: [
		"The Purification Chamber uses oxygen to refine Ores and shards into clumps. Each ore makes 3 clumps, whereas each shard only gives one clump."
		""
		"The oxygen can be provided externally as gas, internally with an oxygen filled Gas Tank or flint. (See the gas page for how to make oxygen)"
		""
		"For example: you could transform Copper Ore into 3 Copper Clump."
		"Clumps can then be placed in a Crusher, producing dirty ores, which can be enriched in an Enrichment Chamber to create regular dusts."
		""
		"Additionally you can turn gravel into flint."
	]
	quest.6C25D42C36175BF4.quest_subtitle: "It makes Clumps"
	quest.6C29C97FD42F9CF2.quest_desc: ["Litteraly just the hat but... chestplate, also naturally has a higher tier cap."]
	quest.6C3B025A4B223E82.quest_desc: [
		"A digital recipe blueprint used for &bautomated crafting&r and &eprocessing&r in &5ME Systems&r. Encodes either crafting steps (for &dMolecular Assemblers&r) or machine workflows (for &6Pattern Providers&r)."
		""
		"Key Types:"
		""
		"&bCrafting Pattern&r (bench recipes)"
		""
		"&eProcessing Pattern&r (machine/furnace recipes)"
		""
		"(Stored in &5ME Interfaces&r to enable &9autocrafting&r systems.)"
		""
		"&a\"The ME Network's recipe memory\"&r"
	]
	quest.6C3B025A4B223E82.title: "&5Pattern&r"
	quest.6C3D9A1C00000001.quest_desc: [
		"Welcome to &#6D19C9Iron's Spells and Spellbooks&r, a massive magic RPG mod featuring 9 spell schools, 100+ spells, custom workstations, and epic dungeon boss battles."
		""
		"Begin by gathering &dArcane Essence&r from dungeon chests, wizard towers, and magical mob drops."
		""
		"Arcane Essence is the foundational material for all spells, runes, and magic equipment."
	]
	quest.6C3D9A1C00000001.title: "Arcane Essence"
	quest.6C3D9A1C00000002.quest_desc: [
		"Combine Arcane Essence with Wool to weave &5Arcane Cloth&r."
		""
		"Arcane Cloth is the essential fabric used to craft all elemental wizard robes and battle armors."
	]
	quest.6C3D9A1C00000002.title: "Arcane Cloth"
	quest.6C3D9A1C00000003.quest_desc: [
		"Fuse Iron with Arcane Essence in a crafting table to produce &bArcane Ingots&r."
		""
		"Used to construct early workstations, casting staffs, and metal-bound spellbooks."
	]
	quest.6C3D9A1C00000003.title: "Arcane Ingot"
	quest.6C3D9A1C00000004.quest_desc: [
		"Smelt underground Mithril Ore / Mithril Scraps to produce pure &aMithril Ingots&r."
		""
		"Mithril is a lightweight superconductor metal that enhances lightning and holy magic!"
	]
	quest.6C3D9A1C00000004.title: "Mithril Ingot"
	quest.6C3D9A1C00000005.quest_desc: [
		"&8Hogskin&r drops from Nether Hoglins and is used to craft magical parchment and beast-bound grimoires."
		""
		"Combine it with blood essence to manufacture &4Bloody Vellum&r for blood magic crafting!"
	]
	quest.6C3D9A1C00000005.title: "Hogskin and Bloody Vellum"
	quest.6C3D9A1C00000006.quest_desc: [
		"The &fShriving Stone&r is a purifying mineral crafted from Raw Iron and Amethyst."
		""
		"Use it in an Anvil to safely remove spell imbuements or upgrade orbs from weapons and armor without destroying the gear!"
	]
	quest.6C3D9A1C00000006.title: "Shriving Stone (Gear Cleansing)"
	quest.6C3D9A1C00000007.quest_desc: [
		"The &bInscription Table&r is where you bind and organize spells into your Spellbook."
		""
		"Place your Spellbook on the left, any single-use Scroll in the middle, and click to imprint the spell permanently into your book!"
	]
	quest.6C3D9A1C00000007.title: "The Inscription Table"
	quest.6C3D9A1C00000008.quest_desc: ["The &6Scroll Forge&r manufactures custom spell scrolls on demand using Ink, Paper, and a School Focus item."]
	quest.6C3D9A1C00000008.title: "The Scroll Forge"
	quest.6C3D9A1C00000009.quest_desc: [
		"&eInks&r determine the power tier and minimum spell level you can forge:"
		""
		"- &7Common Ink:&r Tier 1 basic spells."
		"- &aUncommon Ink:&r Tier 2 spells."
		"- &9Rare Ink:&r Tier 3 spells."
		"- &5Epic Ink:&r Tier 4 high-potency spells."
		"- &6Legendary Ink:&r Tier 5 master incantations."
	]
	quest.6C3D9A1C00000009.title: "The Five Ink Tiers"
	quest.6C3D9A1C00000010.quest_desc: [
		"The &dArcane Anvil&r performs advanced spellcrafting:"
		""
		"- &eUpgrade Scrolls:&r Combine two identical scrolls to raise the spell level (up to Level 10!)."
		"- &bUpgrade Gear:&r Apply Upgrade Orbs to permanently enhance armor and weapons."
		"- &cImbue Weapons:&r Slot a spell scroll directly into a sword to cast on right-click!"
	]
	quest.6C3D9A1C00000010.title: "The Arcane Anvil (Spell Level 10 and Imbuing)"
	quest.6C3D9A1C00000011.quest_desc: [
		"The &5Alchemist Cauldron&r brews potent mana potions and elixirs."
		""
		"&aPro Tip:&r Throw any unwanted scroll into a water-filled Alchemist Cauldron for a &b50% chance to recycle it back into equivalent ink&r! Never throw away dungeon loot scrolls."
	]
	quest.6C3D9A1C00000011.title: "Alchemist Cauldron and Ink Recycling"
	quest.6C3D9A1C00000012.quest_desc: [
		"&7Blank Runestones&r are found in wizard towers and dungeons."
		""
		"Surround a Blank Runestone with 8 school focus items to inscribe it into a specialized elemental rune!"
	]
	quest.6C3D9A1C00000012.title: "Blank Runestones"
	quest.6C3D9A1C00000013.quest_desc: [
		"&cFire School:&r High explosive AoE and burning DoT damage."
		""
		"- &eFocus:&r Blaze Rod."
		"- &cRune:&r Fire Rune."
	]
	quest.6C3D9A1C00000013.title: "Fire School (Blaze Rod Focus)"
	quest.6C3D9A1C00000014.quest_desc: [
		"&bIce School:&r Freezes enemies solid, creates ice spikes, and slows hostile mobs."
		""
		"- &eFocus:&r Frozen Bone (dropped by Strays)."
		"- &bRune:&r Ice Rune."
	]
	quest.6C3D9A1C00000014.title: "Ice School (Frozen Bone Focus)"
	quest.6C3D9A1C00000015.quest_desc: [
		"&eLightning School:&r Rapid chain lightning and high single-target shock damage."
		""
		"- &eFocus:&r Bottle o' Lightning (use an empty glass bottle on a charged creeper!)."
		"- &eRune:&r Lightning Rune."
	]
	quest.6C3D9A1C00000015.title: "Lightning School (Bottle o' Lightning Focus)"
	quest.6C3D9A1C00000016.quest_desc: [
		"&fHoly School:&r Healing, radiant barriers, and massive bonus damage against undead."
		""
		"- &eFocus:&r Divine Pearl (crafted with Gold and Amethyst Shards)."
		"- &fRune:&r Holy Rune."
	]
	quest.6C3D9A1C00000016.title: "Holy School (Divine Pearl Focus)"
	quest.6C3D9A1C00000017.quest_desc: [
		"&4Blood School:&r Life stealing, raising undead minions, and devastating sacrifice magic."
		""
		"- &eFocus:&r Blood Vial (obtained by cooking mobs or yourself in a campfire cauldron!)."
		"- &4Rune:&r Blood Rune."
	]
	quest.6C3D9A1C00000017.title: "Blood School (Blood Vial Focus)"
	quest.6C3D9A1C00000018.quest_desc: [
		"&6Upgrade Orbs&r permanently augment armor and weapons in the Arcane Anvil with +5% school spell power or +50 Max Mana per orb!"
		""
		"Craft Empty Upgrade Orbs with Cinder Essence and infuse them with your desired school rune."
	]
	quest.6C3D9A1C00000018.title: "Elemental Upgrade Orbs"
	quest.6C3D9A1C00000019.quest_desc: [
		"Hunt Ancient Knights in the Nether &4Ancient Battlegrounds&r to harvest &6Cinder Essence&r."
		""
		"Cinder Essence burns with primeval volcanic fire and is required to craft the Citadel summoning horn!"
	]
	quest.6C3D9A1C00000019.title: "Cinder Essence (Ancient Battlegrounds)"
	quest.6C3D9A1C00000020.quest_desc: [
		"Craft the &6Cinderous Soulcaller&r using Cinder Essence, a Blaze Rod, and Netherite Scrap."
		""
		"Climb to the summit of the &4Nether Citadel&r and blow the horn at the summoning brazier to awaken the &cCitadel Keeper&r boss!"
	]
	quest.6C3D9A1C00000020.title: "Cinderous Soulcaller"
	quest.6C3D9A1C00000021.quest_desc: [
		"Slay the &cCitadel Keeper&r boss on the Citadel ramparts."
		""
		"The Keeper drops the &eDecrepit Key / Bone Key&r and the mighty &6Keeper Flamberge&r sword!"
		""
		"Use the key to unlock the &8Citadel Vaults&r inside the citadel."
	]
	quest.6C3D9A1C00000021.title: "Defeat the Citadel Keeper"
	quest.6C3D9A1C00000022.quest_desc: [
		"Unlock the &4Citadel Vaults&r with your key to extract the legendary &cPyrium Ingot&r!"
		""
		"Pyrium is required to forge the top-tier Pyrium Staff, high-end fire battle robes, the Rocket Emblem, and can be blasted in a furnace for &e5 Ancient Debris&r!"
	]
	quest.6C3D9A1C00000022.title: "Pyrium Ingot (Citadel Vault Treasure)"
	quest.6C3D9A1C00000023.quest_desc: ["The &cPyrium Staff&r channels volcanic Nether thermal energy, providing massive fire spell power bonuses."]
	quest.6C3D9A1C00000023.title: "Pyrium Staff"
	quest.6C3D9A1C00000024.quest_desc: [
		"The &fIronbound Tome&r holds up to 6 permanent spells and increases your max Mana and Mana Regen."
		""
		"&aControls Tip:&r Press &eR&r to open your Spell Wheel, &eScroll&r to select, and &eV&r to cast!"
	]
	quest.6C3D9A1C00000024.title: "Ironbound Tome"
	quest.6C3D9A1C00000025.quest_desc: ["The &bDiamond-Encrusted Spell Book&r holds 10 spell slots with high mana capacity and cooldown acceleration."]
	quest.6C3D9A1C00000025.title: "Diamond-Encrusted Spell Book"
	quest.6C3D9A1C00000026.quest_desc: [
		"The &8Ruined Book&r is an ancient relic retrieved from Sculk-infested Ancient Cities."
		""
		"It is required to bind Netherite and forge the legendary &6Ancient Codex&r!"
	]
	quest.6C3D9A1C00000026.title: "Ruined Book (Ancient City Relic)"
	quest.6C3D9A1C00000027.quest_desc: [
		"The &8Ancient Codex&r is crafted by binding Netherite and the Ruined Book."
		""
		"Features &612 spell slots&r, &e20% spell cooldown reduction&r, complete fire immunity, and serves as the foundation for the ultimate AllTheModium spellbook upgrades!"
	]
	quest.6C3D9A1C00000027.title: "Ancient Codex (Foundation for ATM Upgrades)"
	quest.6C3D9A1C00000028.quest_desc: [
		"In a Smithing Table, combine the &8Ancient Codex&r with an &eAllthemodium Ingot&r."
		""
		"Creates the &eAllthemodium Spell Book&r with 13 spell slots, enhanced mana regen, and extreme spell power scaling!"
	]
	quest.6C3D9A1C00000028.title: "Allthemodium Spell Book"
	quest.6C3D9A1C00000029.quest_desc: [
		"In a Smithing Table, upgrade your &eAllthemodium Spell Book&r with a &dVibranium Ingot&r."
		""
		"Yields the &dVibranium Spell Book&r with 14 spell slots and massive dimensional magic resonance!"
	]
	quest.6C3D9A1C00000029.title: "Vibranium Spell Book"
	quest.6C3D9A1C00000030.quest_desc: [
		"The pinnacle of all sorcery across the multiverse."
		""
		"In a Smithing Table, upgrade the Vibranium Spell Book with an &5Unobtainium Ingot&r."
		""
		"Grants the &5Unobtainium Spell Book&r featuring &615 spell slots&r, colossal mana pools, near-instant spell cooldowns, and unmatched elemental mastery!"
	]
	quest.6C3D9A1C00000030.title: "Unobtainium Spell Book (Apex Sorcery)"
	quest.6C3D9A1C00000031.quest_desc: [
		"Harvest &dDragonskin&r by slaying the Ender Dragon in The End."
		""
		"Used to bind the elemental Dragonskin Spell Book!"
	]
	quest.6C3D9A1C00000031.title: "Dragonskin Harvest"
	quest.6C3D9A1C00000032.quest_desc: [
		"The &dDragonskin Spell Book&r is forged from genuine dragon scales."
		""
		"Holds &612 spell slots&r and provides 10% Ender spell power!"
	]
	quest.6C3D9A1C00000032.title: "Dragonskin Spell Book"
	quest.6C3D9A1C00000033.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Wayward Compass&r holds a trapped soul that points directly toward the nearest underground &8Catacombs&r dungeon."
		""
		"Follow the needle into the deep depths to locate the lair of the Dead King!"
	]
	quest.6C3D9A1C00000033.title: "Wayward Compass (Locating Catacombs)"
	quest.6C3D9A1C00000034.quest_desc: [
		"Raid the crypts and defeat dungeon keepers in the Catacombs to obtain &eBone Keys&r."
		""
		"Use Bone Keys to unlock &7Bone Vaults&r containing ancient scrolls, Elixirs of Evasion, and rare grimoires!"
	]
	quest.6C3D9A1C00000034.title: "Bone Key and Catacombs Vaults"
	quest.6C3D9A1C00000035.quest_desc: [
		"Enter the central throne room of the underground &8Ancient Catacombs&r, summon and defeat the two-phase boss: &4The Dead King&r."
		""
		"Claim the &6Dead King's Phylactery&r, &5Blood Staff&r, and &eTarnished Crown&r to prove yourself the undisputed Grand Archmage!"
	]
	quest.6C3D9A1C00000035.title: "The Dead King: Grand Archmage"
	quest.6C4B5F02B8A6AFD0.quest_desc: [
		"The Fuel Refinery is very important. It allou you to create fuel"
		""
		"To create Fuel, you need to input oil in the first slot and it will generate fuel that you can get by putting a bucket in the last slot"
	]
	quest.6C52C108FA9020E4.quest_desc: ["Concentrated universal matter. Essential for synthesizing Neutron Star Matter and other high-tier cosmic materials in the DMA."]
	quest.6C52C108FA9020E4.quest_subtitle: "Universal Synthesis Liquid"
	quest.6C52C108FA9020E4.title: "UU-Matter Supply"
	quest.6C6417BE692EE73D.quest_desc: ["Refined and deadly. This isn’t your grandma’s peppermint stick it’s a weaponized dessert."]
	quest.6C74E5CD21611F2E.title: "Speed Upgrades"
	quest.6C76AB8A6110C0C7.quest_desc: ["Provides more &aEterna&r and &cQuanta&r then other &cHellshelves,&r but reduces the number of &dEnchant&r clues."]
	quest.6C7940D152032730.quest_desc: [
		"Turns nearby food (like &bsource berries&r) placed on &bpedestals&r or onthe ground into &dsource&r for nearby &dsource jars&r. "
		""
		"This also turns nearby dirt to &5mycelium&r and &2mushrooms&r."
	]
	quest.6C8431C216A66C1F.quest_desc: ["A better tier of transporter with more storage."]
	quest.6C8431C216A66C1F.title: "&dUltimate Logistical Transporter"
	quest.6C9157A690AA5F3C.quest_subtitle: "Don't drink it."
	quest.6C93B82EEA152199.quest_desc: [
		"The &dFluid Collector&r collects fluids from the world."
		""
		"Place it near a &afluid source&r, and it will automatically collect the &afluid&r into its internal tank or connected tanks."
		""
		"Ensure it has &dpower&r and proper &afluid storage&r."
	]
	quest.6C96992416059AC4.quest_desc: ["An &damazing tool &rthat runs on &lMEU.&r"]
	quest.6CA01DCE1F4A0EC3.quest_desc: ["The base fluid for all pneumatic fuels. Extracted with a Gas Lift or Pumpjack and processed in a Refinery for Diesel, Gasoline, and more."]
	quest.6CA941AE132445D9.quest_desc: ["A useful &6crafting component&r automated in the &cassembler.&r"]
	quest.6CAA311E22F52EF1.quest_desc: [
		"This one’s the trickiest and most important; this trait can only be gotten from Kamikaze Bees."
		""
		"Kamikaze Bees spawn in a particular way by being attacked. Their only objective is to protect you by… well… going kamikaze on the attacker."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"While wearing a Bee Nest Helmet (a Diamond helmet with a Nest on top), if you get hit by a hostile mob, there is a 30% chance of a Kamikaze Bee spawning. The difficult part? They’re TINY and FAST so you need to have a setup inside an enclosed box, have a Catcher ready, or have good aim and cage them once they spawn."
		""
		"Get 4-5 of them then squeeze them. This should get you a 100% Very High Productivity gene."
		""
		"Now, you need to put the gene in an easy-to-breed bee (via Honey Treat + Gene) and breed them, and once an offspring is born with the Very High gene use it to breed more bees of that type. With that, you basically have infinite, Very High Productivity genes."
	]
	quest.6CAA311E22F52EF1.quest_subtitle: "(Very High Productivity)"
	quest.6CB5ACBAAED66871.quest_desc: ["Shaped from the stem and cap of a giant fungus, this whimsical dwelling offers a rare touch of charm in a perilous world. Lightly guarded and easy to claim, the mushroom house makes for a delightful refuge, perfect for any adventurer who’s ever dreamed of calling a mushroom home."]
	quest.6CB5ACBAAED66871.quest_subtitle: "Find a Mushroom House"
	quest.6CB8610599D88B8F.quest_desc: ["The better the &acapacitor,&r the &bquicker&r and &ebetter&r the &dmachine will function&r."]
	quest.6CC5FE34778F0DFA.quest_desc: [
		"You're bound to have too many items playing this modpack. It's just it works, and if you haven't figured out your storage situation yet, &dDimensional Storage&r might just be right for you!"
		""
		"To get started with this magical storage solution, you'll need to craft the &dDimensional Storage Actuator&r and place it down into the world. This acts just like a Shulker Box, meaning if you break it, it won't lose any of the items stored inside."
		""
		"By default, this has 128 storage slots with each slot holding up to 16 stacks of an item, except for items with &5NBT&r data. These will not stack and will take up an entire slot, so make sure to leave those items out!"
	]
	quest.6CC5FE34778F0DFA.title: "&c&mDemonic&r &dMagical Storage&r!"
	quest.6CD0A72A42EE5F15.quest_desc: ["Infused with the echoes of the &dDeep Dark&r, this table unlocks a new &ccrafting table tier&r and a few vanilla items. It's the first step to &eultimate power&r."]
	quest.6CD2CF2142976D18.quest_desc: ["If you wish for your dragon to remain at its current size, feed it this disgusting thing, Uncle Roger will be disappointed.."]
	quest.6CD96328B7567F46.quest_desc: ["The Mechanical Harvester will harvest all mature crops it comes in contact with while moving forward."]
	quest.6D03D3B4D83C1840.quest_desc: [
		"Right click the front of a Mechanical Crafter with a Wrench to change the direction it sends items during crafting. "
		""
		"Mechanical Crafters can be automatically filled by Funnels or Hoppers."
		""
		"On the back and sides of Mechanical Crafters, a Wrench can be used to connect or disconnect the inventory of two adjacent crafters. Crafters can share inventories while not participating in the same crafting recipe."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"Items can also be inserted or removed by hand."
		""
		"Each Mechanical Crafter has an internal gear that can only be powered by adjacent Mechanical Crafters or any size Cogwheel. This means only 1 Mechanical Crafter in a setup needs to be powered by a Cogwheel."
		""
		"When powered by rotational force and either powered with Redstone or all crafter slots are filled, Mechanical Crafters will send their items to adjacent crafters. For a successful recipe, the items must eventually meet in one crafter. Once all of the items reach the final Crafter, they will turn into the product."
	]
	quest.6D100E60EE8BE745.quest_desc: ["They are more annoying than lethal. Make sure to kill them quick as they provide you debuffs."]
	quest.6D124ACF4AE80490.quest_desc: ["Tiny but powerful missiles used in combat or Sentry systems. Another example of PneumaticCraft’s tech-meets-combat features."]
	quest.6D21D41A34D92174.quest_desc: ["More storage."]
	quest.6D4361D7A8890651.quest_desc: ["The &aChaotic Staff of Power&r has a grid of &b10x8&r for modules."]
	quest.6D56AD1BEC644A10.quest_desc: [
		"The Archery is where your Archers in Training will train to become Archer. This also allows them to level up without a risk of dying to mobs. "
		""
		"The Archers in Training require a bow to practice. They will shoot at the practice targets, a target block"
		""
		"Tip: Consider setting the hiring mode to automatic so new recruits or kids growing up will automatically start training if not already attending school. "
	]
	quest.6D56AD1BEC644A10.quest_subtitle: "Build an Archery"
	quest.6D592A925D4F2981.quest_desc: ["A &bmassive bone&r from &aprehistoric beasts&r."]
	quest.6D607DAE675DF749.quest_desc: [
		"&bApotheosis&r introduces the &dGeode-Encased Bookshelf of Stability&r, crafted with amethyst and calcite."
		""
		"Provides a steady boost to &cQuanta&r and &eArcana&r while granting &aRectification&r, preventing negative enchantment rolls!"
	]
	quest.6D607DAE675DF749.title: "Geode-Encased Bookshelf"
	quest.6D750A38944E9B68.quest_desc: [
		"These will be used to craft &especial items&r and &aseeds&r from &dMystical agriculture&r, this recipe has been &cmodified&r so you need &6ignitium ingots&r to craft it."
		""
		"Place the &9pedestals&r in a &ecircle&r around the &dalter,&r and &lRight-Click&r with an item to input it into the &9pedestal&r or &dalter.&r"
		""
		"After placing all required items into the &dAlter&r and &9Pedestals,&r click the &dAlter&r with a &dMystical Agriculture wand&r."
	]
	quest.6D7CABCFB50D8B0D.quest_desc: ["Made from a &aBasic Control Circuit&r this item is used in a few crafting recipes."]
	quest.6D7CC9EA47063963.quest_desc: ["A lightweight and durable metal ingot used in crafting advanced machinery and components. Its strength and conductivity make it ideal for high-tech and industrial applications."]
	quest.6D7CC9EA47063963.quest_subtitle: "Aluminium innit bruv"
	quest.6D87B5B0E13878B8.quest_desc: [
		"Pluto Info:"
		"&aGravity:&r 0.588 m/s"
		"&bOxygen:&r none"
		"&cTemperature:&r -229 °C"
	]
	quest.6D913EFFF25ACE03.quest_subtitle: "Used to input Items into multiblocks"
	quest.6DA0DA7EBBAAB1DF.quest_desc: [
		"&lRight-Clicking&r a &cBeholder&r with an &4Occult Gem&r&6 links the Gem&r to the &cBeholder&r, causing it to display the &eBeholder's coordinates&r in its tooltip. &lRight-Clicking&r while holding the &6linked Gem&r allows you to&o see through the &cBeholder&r&r. The camera can be panned &ain all directions.&r Pressing &lLeft-Shift&r exits the &6Beholder's view&r."
		""
		"A Beholder &dcannot be seen &rthrough if the player is in &canother dimension&r, but it can be seen through if the chunk containing it is &eunloaded&r. "
		"&oThe latter situation may cause mobs to not appear.&r"
	]
	quest.6DAA1F51CA09BA72.quest_desc: ["Dropped from the &agammaroach&r, which attacks you if you are &eirradiated&r, use this in &6crafting&r."]
	quest.6DB1AAAD926486BC.quest_desc: [
		"&aFluid Tanks&r are storage blocks to store fluids."
		""
		"The amount of fluid (mb) a fluid tank can store is based on its tier."
		""
		"It will retain its inventory when broken. You may use a &dMechanical Pipe&r that is set to &cPull&r in order to extract the fluid out of the tank."
		""
		"It has a &o&bbucket&r mode which can be toggled to scoop up liquids with it. Very useful for &6lava&r in the beginning!"
	]
	quest.6DE7A57143B0C88E.quest_desc: [
		"The &eUnpackager&r is the machine responsible for turning &6Recipe Packages&r back into real items."
		""
		"It distributes packaged inputs into &eadjacent inventories&r or &epackage crafting machines&r, depending on the recipe type."
		""
		"The Unpackager &crequires power&r to operate."
		""
		"&eHow the Unpackager Works&r"
		""
		"• Insert &6Recipe Packages&r into the Unpackager"
		"• Packages are placed into internal &etrackers&r"
		"• Once a tracker is filled, the package is unpackaged"
		"• Items are sent to adjacent inventories or machines"
		"• Requires an &3AE2&r channel"
		""
		"The number of trackers can be adjusted to control parallel processing."
		""
		"&eProcessing and Blocking Mode&r"
		""
		"For processing recipes, you can enable &eBlocking Mode&r."
		""
		"• Prevents unpackaging into occupied inventories"
		"• Ensures correct machine synchronization"
		""
		"Inputs can be extracted from the &etop side&r."
		""
		"&eWhy Use the Unpackager?&r"
		""
		"• Converts packages back into usable items"
		"• Essential for all &ePackagedAuto&r workflows"
		"• Supports complex multi-machine recipes"
		"• Scales cleanly with &3AE2&r automation"
	]
	quest.6DE7A57143B0C88E.title: "&eUnpackager&r"
	quest.6DE8ACA4F08C420E.quest_desc: ["Transfer stress capacity from one network to another while keeping the networks separate. Guarantees that the source network will not be affected when the destination network is overstressed."]
	quest.6DF595F9E2523C41.quest_desc: ["A new sword crafted from &0dark steel&r with the same stats as &bdiamond.&r"]
	quest.6E14D2CF2A950157.quest_desc: ["5 max"]
	quest.6E537B08FCD57418.quest_desc: ["After completing the &aSpelunking table&r puzzle &ethree times in a row&r, you will acquire the &aToxic cave codex&r, which is used in crafting a &amap&r to the &aToxic cave codex&r or &lRight-Clicking&r for &binformation&r on the &acaves.&r"]
	quest.6E79797DBD8A54EA.quest_desc: ["Same as &aEnder Crafter&r the &6Flux Crafter&r will launch the &9Flux Alternators&r in a 7x7x7 area around it, but it requires power."]
	quest.6E79797DBD8A54EA.title: "&6The Flux Crafter"
	quest.6E8C6A4A07957E5A.quest_desc: [
		"When Rotational Force is given to the Hose Pully, it can extend the hose infinitely. Reversing the Rotational Force will retract the hose back to the block. The hose of the Hose Pully must be extended by at least one block before it can function."
		""
		"A Fluid Pump is required for the hose to drain or flood liquids."
		""
		"-If a fluid is pumped out, it will drain a body of liquid down to the level of the hose. If multiple hose pulleys draw from the same source, it will effectively expedite the drainage process, provided that the pipe's capacity is maintained."
		""
		"-If a fluid is pumped in, it will flood a room of any size, with the hose marking the highest point of flooding."
	]
	quest.6E95E958201D50BE.quest_desc: [
		"The personal chest used to be called, \"Electric Chest\" that could lock with the use of electricity. Now it is called the Personal Chest and doesn't need electricity. You can still lock it, and set it to \"trusted\"."
		""
		"The chest can be placed down and used as a regular, normal chest. This chest has the storage of a double-chest but the space of one chest. If you right click the air, your chest's storage will open up. If used with a Logistical Transporter, items can be piped in and out of the chest."
	]
	quest.6E9B60CCAE55E387.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.6E9B60CCAE55E387.title: "&fFlux Point"
	quest.6EBB60D3CF01C03D.quest_desc: ["The &aProjectile Gravity Compensation Module&r makes your archery straighter, allowing you to shoot farther."]
	quest.6EBFFFB567687A1E.quest_desc: ["A new &bvaluable item&r used in &6crafting,&r and gathered thorough &dmixing&r multiple dusts in a mixer, putting it through the&c blast furnace,&r and the &9freezer.&r"]
	quest.6ED242739E16BFBF.quest_desc: ["The 4096k Storage Disk can store 4096000 items."]
	quest.6EE0CF1C19D181CF.quest_desc: [
		"&eWhat Is the Package Recipe Encoder?&r"
		""
		"The &ePackage Recipe Encoder&r is the tool used to &aencode recipes&r into &ePackage Recipe Holders&r."
		""
		"These encoded holders provide recipe data to all &ePackagedAuto&r machines."
		""
		"&eEncoding Recipes&r"
		""
		"To encode a recipe:"
		""
		"• Select a &erecipe type&r"
		"• Configure &einputs&r and &eoutputs&r"
		"• Set the required &eitem counts&r"
		""
		"Once configured, insert one or more &ePackage Recipe Holders&r and press the &aSave&r button."
		""
		"You can preview which &6Recipe Packages&r will be created on the right side of the interface."
		""
		"&eLoading Existing Recipes&r"
		""
		"• Insert an encoded &ePackage Recipe Holder&r"
		"• Press the &eLoad&r button"
		"• Existing recipes will be loaded"
		"  into the encoder interface"
	]
	quest.6EE0CF1C19D181CF.title: "&ePackage Recipe Encoder&r"
	quest.6EEA012FA11C7C08.quest_desc: ["Once you have found the location for your colony, you will likely want to build either a supply camp or supply ship. You can choose one but not both. Either will provide you with some basic supplies to help you get started in the early game. &o&7(bed, food, basic tools and armor, starting resources, etc.)&r&r It’s beneficial to place your supply camp or ship near your colony as you will be traveling back and forth to it frequently in the early game. &eClose, but not in the way close.&r"]
	quest.6EF133E0EC49BC33.quest_desc: ["The next &bitem&r you will be using to craft other&e useful items.&r (Mostly wires)"]
	quest.6F327F16809D96A6.quest_desc: [
		"Impossibly tough and oddly spicy. Smells like protection. And cookies. Mostly cookies."
		""
		"&6Gingerbread Men will run up to any &4Candy Canes&f, &dGumball Piles&f, &7Sweet Teeth&f, Sundaes, &cCaramel Apples&f, Hot Chocolate Bottles, &dRadiant Essences&f, &bFrostmint&f, &eSundrops&f, &4Cakes&f, &6Pumpkin Pies&f, or &8Cookies&f &6on the ground and grab them. They will also chase down any players holding any of these candies in their inventory within a 20-block radius - upon reaching a player, they will take the candy from their inventory before running away for a minimum of 6 seconds. After stealing a rare candy, a Gingerbread Man will seek out any Gingerbarrels within a 32-block radius - upon reaching one, it will deposit the candy inside the Gingerbarrel. If 9 different rare candies are deposited into a Gingerbarrel by Gingerbread Men, they will convert into a random piece of Gingerbread armor&f."
	]
	quest.6F327F16809D96A6.title: "Gingerbread set"
	quest.6F3C4259ECFFAC99.quest_desc: ["A dual-purpose block that transfers items between physical inventories (chests, machines) and your ME network. It can import/export items and swap Storage Cells in drives without breaking the network connection. Connects via ME cables and requires power."]
	quest.6F57A2A5AA6E3F49.quest_desc: ["This shape is &cvery complicated,&r you can view it by holding &lG&r over the &cOil drilling Rig,&r but you can use this &bmultiblock&r to gain &bdifferent fluids&r based on the &edrill&r you input into this &cmachine.&r"]
	quest.6F57A2A5AA6E3F49.title: "Oil Drilling Rig"
	quest.6F62B5510FA881CD.quest_desc: [
		"This mod introduces many different mid-to-high tier forms of machinery, power generation, and tools to the game that create a whole new element of technology to a game originally aimed at survival."
		""
		"The mod focuses on breaking down materials to their chemical makeup, and getting the best out of every material you come across. "
		""
		"This mod features Hydrogen Powered Jetpacks, a Mini Robotic friend, Reactors, a Digital Miner to automate mining, Reactors, and much more."
	]
	quest.6F62B5510FA881CD.title: "Welcome To Mekanism"
	quest.6F63B60042A7F6AE.quest_desc: ["Used to &6craft&r multiple &bitems.&r"]
	quest.6F6898DC529D1120.quest_desc: [
		"&lFirst:&r Place a &aquarry&r on the ground."
		"&lSecond:&r Make a &l3x3x2&r&e hollow rectangle &rwith the &aquarry&r in one side."
		"&lThird:&r Make two,&l three block tall&r pillars of &ePipe machine casing&r &nopposite&r each other on the &etwo sides&r with no &aquarry&r block."
		"&lFourth:&r Put you &esteel casing&r in between the &epillars&r at the top, and build up to it with &bchains.&r"
	]
	quest.6F6898DC529D1120.title: "Steam Quarry"
	quest.6F71FD826C29C31A.quest_desc: ["Applying the &eYouthful Spawner Rune&r causes spawned mobs to always spawn as baby variants whenever possible."]
	quest.6F71FD826C29C31A.title: "Youthful Spawner Rune"
	quest.6F8577EACCE26F1F.quest_subtitle: "Iced out"
	quest.6F864188C6FD3638.quest_desc: [
		"The &dMob Slaughter Factory&r kills &amobs&r and collects &aLiquid Meat&r and &aPink Slime&r."
		""
		"Provide it with &dpower&r and place it in an area with &amobs&r."
		""
		"It will automatically kill the &amobs&r and collect their &aresources&r."
	]
	quest.6F90D56060E854A9.quest_desc: ["Essentially a &6battery,&r if you need &eEMC&r to use an item, just have a &9charged star&r in your inventory."]
	quest.6F90D56060E854A9.title: "Klein Stars"
	quest.6F978C4D561F35EC.quest_subtitle: "Can be used to bottle a few liquids"
	quest.6FD65139CD50A8C0.quest_desc: ["Start automating Compressed Iron production with this Mystical Agriculture seed. It requires initial crafting effort but pays off with a passive and renewable source of Compressed Iron."]
	quest.6FD65139CD50A8C0.title: "Iron seeds"
	quest.6FE2D0B83A342E64.quest_desc: ["'I need more RANGE!!!' \\n \\nWell, slap one of these bad boys in your Wireless Transmitter and you'll be able to access your network storage with infinite range. \\n \\nThis, however, does not extend to other dimensions....."]
	quest.6FE2D0B83A342E64.title: "Infinite Range Booster"
	quest.6FE2FE40C2F60183.quest_desc: ["Relays rotation in two directions independently."]
	quest.6FE386C83D27FF6F.quest_subtitle: "Don't throw it after mining 3 stones"
	quest.6FF217AD12C1523C.quest_desc: ["Better then &9Netherite,&r these are crafted in a &esmithing table&r by buffing &9Netherite&r with the &6ATM template&r and &6ATM ore&r."]
	quest.6FFC4582D3620F32.quest_desc: ["A simple control device that opens or closes an electrical circuit. It allows you to start, stop, or redirect power flow to machines, lights, and automated systems with precision."]
	quest.70112194DFFD15D3.title: "&5Tyr Armor"
	quest.702AEA76BB811DD9.quest_desc: [
		"These are &aamazing blocks&r for &etransportation,&r while you stand on one, &6others&r up to fifty blocks away, &dwill be highlighted,&r then you can look at one and &ajump&r to &dteleport&r to it, &bplus&r you can &cname them&r for organization."
		""
		"While holding the &estaff of traveling&r, they will be &6highlighted&r and when looking at one, you can &lRight-Click&r to &9teleport&r to it."
	]
	quest.702AEA76BB811DD9.quest_subtitle: "This block may be broken"
	quest.70327C3AC547B354.quest_desc: ["Marked by its dark prismarine and yellow terracotta roof, this temple has long since fallen to corruption. Inside, swarms of spider-like creatures creep through its halls, striking with venom and ferocity. To enter is to step into a nest where every shadow crawls."]
	quest.70327C3AC547B354.quest_subtitle: "Find an Infested Temple"
	quest.703FD6207A3C5475.quest_desc: [
		"The &bMemory Card&r is a versatile tool with two functions. Firstly, it saves device &aconfigurations&r (like whitelist filters) for copying to another device of the same kind."
		""
		"Secondly, the &bMemory Card&r links &eP2P tunnels&r together. The &bP2P tunnel&r being linked is assigned a unique &aID&r, stored on the memory card for future linking."
	]
	quest.7040CA41C0A3C2F2.quest_desc: ["Used to guide the creation of PCBs. Place in the UV Light Box with an Empty PCB to expose it for etching."]
	quest.7044EAB5EDF32BBC.quest_desc: ["When attached to your system, the &9Crafting Monitor&r allows you to see what items are currently in your crafting queue. \\\\n \\\\n You'll need one of these if you want to be able to cancel crafts that aren't working or are bugged."]
	quest.7044EAB5EDF32BBC.title: "Monitoring the Crafting Queue"
	quest.704E19B3EFC43E17.quest_desc: ["Another rocket that allows you to reach more planets"]
	quest.7052C9A5A804E866.quest_desc: ["A riot of color rises from the wilderness, marking the territory of a cunning band of raiders. Their homes are bright and inviting, but enter at your own risk. These defenders strike fast and often. Those who prevail will find spoils and secrets hidden among the lively façades."]
	quest.7052C9A5A804E866.quest_subtitle: "Find a Bandit Village"
	quest.70563C0F10205A32.quest_desc: [
		"&4Don't build it next to other blocks, the structure checks in a square around so it will count blocks right next to it too&r"
		""
		"[ \"Tip build it in \", { \"text\": \"The Other\", \"underlined\": true, \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"2978E3692E772978\" } }, \" dim\" ]"
		""
		"Due to how (&6MMR&r) works, for the &#9510A7Darkness Forge&r multiblock on top of the &dantimatter x7 block&r you must place 2 stacked 3x3 &#FF6209Energy Core Stabilizers&r to form a ring just like so:"
		""
		"{image:ftb:textures/quests/corestab2.png width:300 height:150 align:center}"
	]
	quest.70563C0F10205A32.quest_subtitle: "The ultimate multiblock!!!"
	quest.7064A09B6BDBC88D.title: "Golden Furnace"
	quest.7078DD00551BF863.quest_subtitle: "Does not use Neutronium from Avaritia tho"
	quest.707EBB99AA8F4C57.quest_desc: ["Converts &bplates&r into &ewires&r used for &6crafting.&r"]
	quest.708421C2339616F3.quest_desc: ["The &aDraconic Staff of Power&r has a grid of &b8x6&r for modules."]
	quest.70CC7F36C90AFAD6.quest_desc: ["&rThe LaserIO mod allows players to manage items, fluids, energy, and redstone signals using a single block face, offering flexible and efficient resource transportation."]
	quest.70DD78CE9A860AC0.quest_desc: ["Faster transport."]
	quest.70DD78CE9A860AC0.title: "Pressurized Chemical Conduit"
	quest.70E66957E98D944D.quest_desc: ["Gateways to Eternity adds wave-based combat events where you summon portals and fight through enemy waves for rewards."]
	quest.70E66957E98D944D.quest_subtitle: "A nice way to obtain good gems"
	quest.70E66957E98D944D.title: "Gateway"
	quest.71055E7BBB337C4D.quest_desc: [
		"Maledictus is the final boss of the Frosted Prison dungeon in the Cataclysm mod for Minecraft. Maledictus possesses high mobility, powerful melee attacks, and complex multi-phase combat mechanics."
		""
		"He is summoned through a Cursed Tombstone located in the lowest chamber of the Frosted Prison, serving as the ultimate challenge within the dungeon."
		""
		"Maledictus shows colored rings around his wrists prior to each attack:"
		""
		"Green: The upcoming attack can be blocked."
		""
		"Orange: The attack will disable shields."
		""
		"Red: The attack cannot be blocked and must be dodged."
		""
		"The colored indicators are essential for predicting and responding to his attacks. A red ring signals that players should prepare to evade, while a green cue indicates a safe opportunity to block or counter. Players should always position themselves with enough space to retreat or strafe, particularly when Maledictus is about to unleash his lunging halberd strikes or multi-directional bow volleys."
	]
	quest.7111C78368C786CD.quest_desc: ["A partially crafted coil awaiting insulation or assembly. It’s an intermediate component used in producing fully functional electromagnetic devices and generators."]
	quest.71222E3AF49A8143.quest_desc: [
		"&eWhat Is End Crafting?&r"
		""
		"&eEnd Crafting&r is a specialized crafting recipe type used to automate recipes from the &eEnd Crafting Table&r."
		""
		"It focuses on &5End-themed&r and &elate-game&r crafting recipes."
		""
		"&eWhy Use End Crafting?&r"
		""
		"• Automates End-specific crafting mechanics"
		"• Removes manual End Crafting"
		"• Fits naturally into late-game automation"
		"• Clean integration with &ePackagedAuto&r"
	]
	quest.71222E3AF49A8143.title: "&eEnd Crafting&r"
	quest.712CB147B5873121.quest_desc: ["An upgrade to the &bElite Fluid Tank&r."]
	quest.713006AB89E43C6D.quest_desc: [
		"Scylla, the Storm Empress, is the boss found at the center of the Acropolis, a submerged dungeon introduced in the Cataclysm mod. Players must use the Eye of Storm, which functions similarly to the Eye of Ender, to locate the Acropolis within deep ocean biomes."
		""
		"After navigating through the Acropolis and defeating multiple waves of enemies, players will eventually arrive at Scylla’s chamber, where the boss encounter occurs."
	]
	quest.713EA1BC9BAAA0AB.quest_desc: [
		"The molecular assembler takes items input into it and carries out the operation defined by an adjacent ME Pattern Provider, or the inserted Crafting Pattern, Smithing Table Pattern, or Stonecutting Pattern, then pushes the result to adjacent inventories."
		""
		"This assembler has a crafting pattern that specifies the 1 oak log = 4 oak planks recipe. When oak logs are fed into the upper hopper, the assembler crafts and spits oak planks into the lower hopper."
	]
	quest.714380DBF581725A.quest_desc: [
		"If the&9 blue side&r of this shield is facing down it will &epush mobs away&r and &cdamage them&r, while the &4red side&r &epulls them&r towards you and&c damages them&r."
		""
		"&lShift-Right-Click&r to &bswitch the mode.&r"
	]
	quest.715344C9F5C7F174.quest_desc: ["Some of the&9 best gear&r, untill &dAvaritia&r where you gain &ccontrol of the&r &0universe.&r"]
	quest.715B86DC82EA636B.quest_desc: [
		"An alternative to the Air Compressor, this uses flammable fluids like Diesel or LPG. Often more efficient and cleaner for long-term setups."
		""
		""
		""
		"{image:pneumaticcraft:textures/gui/gui_liquid_compressor.png width:200 height:200 align:left fit:true}"
	]
	quest.7162AD63AB61136A.quest_desc: [
		"The &dLaser Drill&r extracts &aores&r and &amaterials&r from the ground using laser technology."
		""
		"Place it above the desired mining area and provide it with &dpower&r."
		""
		"The &dLaser Drill&r works in conjunction with &dLaser Lens&r to determine the type of &amaterial&r to mine."
		""
		"It will produce &aores&r and &amaterials&r based on the configured &dLaser Lens&r and the biome it's placed in."
	]
	quest.7167023C7FD28CF0.quest_desc: [
		"&eNether Crafting&r"
		""
		"&eNether Crafting&r is a specialized crafting recipe type used to automate recipes from the &eNether Crafting Table&r."
		""
		"It focuses on &cNether-themed&r and &elate-game&r crafting recipes."
		""
		"The Nether Package Crafter &crequires power&r to operate."
		""
		"&eWhy Use Nether Crafting?&r"
		""
		"• Automates Nether-specific crafting mechanics"
		"• Removes manual Nether Crafting"
		"• Fits naturally into late-game automation"
		"• Clean integration with &ePackagedAuto&r"
	]
	quest.7167023C7FD28CF0.title: "&eNether Crafting&r"
	quest.7174A0CEC5CCC53B.quest_desc: [
		"See, they aren't all bad!"
		""
		"If you've completed the Ritual properly, you'll now have your very own &cFoliot Crusher Demon&r. These Demons are great at crushing down items for you!"
		""
		"To give it an item to crush, just throw it nearby and it will pick up the item and crush it. You can also sneak-right click the Demon to open up the inventory."
		""
		"This is a starter Demon, so it won't last very long. This one can also double your ore output for you!"
	]
	quest.7174A0CEC5CCC53B.title: "&aTalking with our New Friend!&r"
	quest.71776A6A96EB037C.quest_desc: ["Used a &cfurnace multiblock &rin order to craft &asteel.&r"]
	quest.7177E49BF9ECA5CF.quest_desc: [
		"Generates pressure using heat instead of fuel."
		""
		"{image:pneumaticcraft:textures/patchouli/thermal_compressor.png width:100 height:100 align:left fit:true}"
	]
	quest.717CA8EB4DF4EDB8.quest_desc: ["Acts like a blaze burner but with fuel and CO2 additionaly you can use the blaze burners with the straw."]
	quest.717D20AEF6E02B06.quest_subtitle: "All in 1 tool."
	quest.719218CEA358D540.quest_desc: ["Right-click the ground to place a Train Track facing away from you. Train tracks can be placed in eight different directions corresponding to the closest of the four cardinal direction and 45° increments in between. Tracks may also be placed on the side of blocks that have no blocks immediately above them. These tracks will have a 45° vertical incline. Break tracks using any pickaxe or by right clicking with a wrench while sneaking. Breaking with any other item will cause a track to disappear."]
	quest.71A772DE60643C45.title: "The Inscriber Presses"
	quest.71A950338C3C57DA.quest_desc: [
		"Neptune Info:"
		"&aGravity:&r 11.082 m/s"
		"&bOxygen:&r none"
		"&cTemperature:&r -218 °C"
	]
	quest.71A9A81DAD843B88.quest_desc: [
		"The &dFluid Placer&r places fluids in the world."
		""
		"Provide it with &afluids&r and &dpower&r, and it will place the &afluids&r in front of it."
		""
		"Useful for creating &dautomated fluid setups&r."
	]
	quest.71CD58F48960B657.quest_desc: ["&fYou&r have reached the &5pinnacle&r of &ecreation&r. These items is not just &4powerful&r they are &blimitless&r. With them, you bend &0the rules&r of &athe world&r itself. Few have ever &9come this far&r, and even fewer have held &dtrue infinity&r in their hands."]
	quest.71DF296B3C1D32B4.quest_desc: ["More storage."]
	quest.71EDE15818D4C2A1.quest_desc: ["The blast furnace can be any height you like. Taller furnaces melt steel faster."]
	quest.71EDE15818D4C2A1.title: "Blast Furnace"
	quest.71FB3EA8CB37A038.quest_desc: ["Applie on to a Blaze Burner to enable them to burn liquid fuels, some can superheat a blaze burner for way more time."]
	quest.71FCF06A98CC66D7.quest_desc: [
		"With so many colonists working for the greater good it can be difficult to know who needs what. The clipboard is an easy way to see all the requests your workers have."
		""
		"&eSneak + right-click&r on your town hall block to register the clipboard."
	]
	quest.720E5426BFA55DF4.quest_desc: [
		"The &dLatex Processing Unit&r converts &dLatex&r into &aTiny Dry Rubber&r when provided with &3Water&r."
		""
		"Ensure it's connected to both a &dLatex source&r and a &3Water source&r to produce &aDry Rubber&r."
	]
	quest.721C40D15B15DDC1.quest_desc: ["The &3Furnace Generator&r burns &aCombustible Items&r like &bCoal&r and &9Charcoal&r to generate &cEnergy&r. It’s a straightforward, reliable source of power, perfect for early to mid-game setups. Simply feed it fuel, and it will keep your machines running smoothly."]
	quest.7223640410925F4B.quest_desc: ["The base template for all suit modules. Craft these with graviton plating, then combine them with celestial matter to create custom suit upgrades."]
	quest.7223640410925F4B.quest_subtitle: "Modular Socket Substrate"
	quest.7223640410925F4B.title: "Blank Upgrade Card"
	quest.7234CB42AEF6C941.quest_desc: ["Introducing chaos to your enchants. Higher &cQuanta&r means more &avariation&r in the result possibly better, possibly worse. It's a &bgamble&r... but sometimes the &ejackpot&r is worth it."]
	quest.7234CB42AEF6C941.title: "Quanta"
	quest.726DF1B2F0DFE008.quest_desc: [
		"&1ME Quantum Ring:&r"
		"The primary multiblock structure for interdimensional ME networks. Forms one endpoint of a Quantum Network Bridge when linked to a matching ring in another dimension. Requires a Quantum Entangled Singularity for activation."
		""
		"&5ME Quantum Link Chamber:&r"
		"A support block for the Quantum Ring that stabilizes interdimensional connections. Must be placed inside the ring and supplied with power."
		""
		"&cQuantum Entangled Singularity:&r"
		"A crafted singularity that synchronizes two Quantum Rings across dimensions, enabling cross-dimensional ME networks. Created by combining 4 Singularities in an ME Condenser."
	]
	quest.7295B4B792EB5103.quest_desc: ["A &anew alloy&r with many uses, smelted with the &6alloy smelter&r."]
	quest.729A16C0DF2A473B.quest_desc: ["This book is the Dragon Master handbook. Inside you will find crucial information about dragons and other creatures roaming the Overworld."]
	quest.72A25C237B9B8411.quest_desc: [
		"A specialized multiblock supercomputer designed to handle massive autocrafting calculations."
		""
		"Build the frame with Quantum Hyper Mechanical Casings, link it to your network with a Quantum Grid Link, and house your storage and co-processor blocks inside."
		""
		"Filling the multiblock with 25 1Qd Storages and 25 2B Co-Processors unlocks Infinite Computation Mode."
	]
	quest.72A25C237B9B8411.quest_subtitle: "The Ultimate Crafting Computer"
	quest.72A25C237B9B8411.title: "Quantum Computation Nexus"
	quest.72AE2A8DC19D3A5B.quest_desc: [
		"The &eWorld Transporter&r moves entire &ablocks&r and &amachines&r."
		""
		"Use it to transport complex setups from one location to another without dismantling them."
		""
		"It simplifies large-scale relocations and reorganizations."
	]
	quest.72BC8C4941732A6E.quest_desc: ["The &bME Smart Cable&r functions similarly to &6Covered Cable&r but with an added feature. It can carry up to &d8 channels&r and &dvisually displays&r the number of channels being used with &acolored lines&r along the cable. This visualization helps in &amanaging and optimizing&r the network."]
	quest.72C09FD89C28B1EC.quest_desc: ["Processes Crude Oil into usable fuels: Diesel, Gasoline, LPG, and more. This is your main fluid processing station for pneumatic fuel chains."]
	quest.72C749AD9F1C634E.quest_desc: [
		"Citizens will go to the Residence they are assigned to at night to sleep. The Residence is also a way to get more citizens for your colony. Every residence level adds another bed. More beds means more citizen capacity."
		""
		"It’s worth considering residence locations and the citizens they house. Workers get grumpy when they have to travel long distances to work. Try to move citizens into homes close to where they work. "
	]
	quest.72C749AD9F1C634E.quest_subtitle: "Build a Residence"
	quest.72E4DF206C33D50D.quest_subtitle: "The main block used to craft the rockets!"
	quest.731BAB843C26EA77.quest_desc: ["Oh oh, so you actually did it, not like I doubted you or anything. Well congratulations! I bet the fight have been epic, surely you didn't use some futuristic gear or spells to one shot it, right?"]
	quest.7322A19FDA5B78E1.quest_desc: ["The Valve Handle functions much like the Hand Crank, though the amount and direction it rotates with one use can be adjusted in its Value Settings Screen."]
	quest.732D1A96512F2BFD.quest_desc: [
		"The Steam Engine is a block that provides Rotational Force. "
		""
		"It outputs the highest Stress Unit (SU) capacity of all the survival mode power generating blocks. "
		""
		"It converts the pressure caused by heating Water in a Fluid Tank into Rotational Force, allowing for large scale item production and multiple contraptions to be powered."
		""
		"Brace for a huge amount of text."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"Steam Engines use heated Water for power and are placed on Fluid Tanks, which are then used as a boiler. A Shaft can be used on the engine to create a kinetic output. The direction of said output can be adjusted through the Value Settings on the side of the engine."
		""
		"Increasing the total power generated requires that one or more of the three characteristics (heat, size, water) of the Fluid Tank boiler be increased. This will increase the boiler's level to the lowest level reached by any of the three characteristics, increasing the maximum amount of SU Steam Engines are capable of generating from the boiler. A single Steam Engine can only extract up to 16,384 SU (The equivalent of 1 boiler level). To combat this, multiple Steam Engines can be attached to a single boiler to extract more power; however, this will not increase the total power generated by the boiler."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"The tank size is the basic characteristic of a steam boiler. The required dimensions are affected by the heat supplied. For a passive steam engine (level 0) the boiler must be a 2x2 fluid tank of preferably one block height (making it any higher will be a waste of resources). For an active steam engine (level 1 or higher) the boiler must have 4 blocks per heat level. For example, a level 1 boiler must have a tank made of at least 4 fluid tank blocks, a level 9 boiler must be made of at least 36 blocks and a level 18 boiler (maximum achievable) must be at least made of 72 blocks."
	]
	quest.73349B993DE69954.quest_desc: [
		"We'll be using all of that Darkstone to create the Hephaestus Forge."
		""
		"Once you have all of the blocks needed, you'll need to build the platform for the forge."
		""
		"Once built, place a Smithing Table in the center, then sneak+right-click with a piece of Mundabitur Dust."
	]
	quest.73349B993DE69954.title: "&1The Hephaestus Forge"
	quest.73350AD668200E99.quest_desc: ["A new &cti&r&cer&r of &aessence!&r Used to craft many &eitems&r."]
	quest.73362EDC984B8A0F.quest_desc: [
		"Reactor &2Moderators&r are materials placed inside of a reactor where there aren't fuel rods &o&bto change how it performs&r, based on the &nproperties&r of the moderator. These are placed inside of the reactor &o&bduring construction&r."
		""
		"The &o&9rarer&r the material is, the &nbetter&r of a &2Moderator&r it is. Leaving the reactor &o&bempty&r means you are using the &7air&r inside as a moderator, which isn't that great."
		""
		"If you are looking for something &o&acheap&r in the early game, try using &3Graphite Blocks&r!"
	]
	quest.73362EDC984B8A0F.title: "Reactor Moderators"
	quest.735412C77BE7A82A.quest_desc: [
		"Fluids are input into the mixer through the port at the bottom of its powersupply. Items can be input via the two hatches at the back. The fluid port at the front serves as the fluid output."
		""
		"Applying a redstone signal to the control panel at the front will halt the machine's process, this behavior can be inverted by use of the Engineer's Screwdriver."
	]
	quest.735412C77BE7A82A.title: "Mixer"
	quest.735B103013BCCEB5.quest_desc: [
		"Defeat 3 &5Chaos Guardians&r in the outermost reaches of the End."
		""
		"Even the most lethal and unpredictable apex beast of the modpack cannot breach your armor."
	]
	quest.735B103013BCCEB5.title: "🐉 &5Chaos Slayer (3x Chaos Guardian)"
	quest.73688A75A466C834.quest_desc: ["Using a few types of &amob heads&r, and requirering an &baxe&r and &eshears,&r you will use this &cmachine&r to create a few &amechanical&r mob related &bitems.&r"]
	quest.73708157A391E412.quest_desc: ["Hatched from &cdetonating&r the&6 nuclear furnace&r next to this &bcreatures egg&r, this mob is &dvery powerful&r, and &acan grow&r."]
	quest.73708157A391E412.quest_subtitle: "Hatch a tremorzilla"
	quest.737570259C5A4052.quest_desc: [
		"&cThe Nuclear Furnace&r is a &bfast&r, &emultiblock structure&r created by placing &aeight Nuclear Furnace Components&r in a &lcube&r. It uses &aUranium Rods&r as fuel, with each rod capable of smelting &l60&r items. However, using the furnace produces &atoxic waste&r, which accumulates &ninside the structure&r. To manage this, players must regularly &einsert a Metal Barrel&r to purge the waste."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&lIf the waste is not purged&r, the &cNuclear Furnace &rbegins to &eoverheat&r. As it &eoverheats&r, it goes through three &nvisual and physical stages&r: it starts to turn &eyellow&r, then &6shakes violently&r, and eventually &cignites fires nearby&r. While &coverheating&r does make &9smelting faster&r, it doesn't increase the number of items &aprocessed per Uranium Rod&r."
		""
		"If the &awaste&r continues to build up and is still not removed, the furnace will eventually &4explode&r in a blast similar to a &aNucleeper's&r. This explosion scatters &bUnrefined Waste&r and can also hatch any nearby &cTremorzilla Eggs&r."
	]
	quest.738F637AE5C1ECB6.title: "Obtain an &bElytra&r"
	quest.738FF04BEE2342A0.quest_desc: [
		"The &eMeka-Tool&r is a &o&bmulti-use&r tool item in &dMekanism&r."
		""
		"It has almost no use default but can have &9Modules&r installed to give it a wide range of functions. While the &aConfigurator&r is required to craft the &eMeka-Tool&r, It does not have that functionality."
	]
	quest.7395B41685F4BC1A.quest_desc: ["Generates pressure using Redstone Flux (RF). Useful if you have access to a strong power grid instead of fuel or heat."]
	quest.73A95AF90890098C.quest_desc: [
		"The &aWireless Energy Link&r is a versatile tool for wireless energy transmission."
		""
		"Features of the &aWireless Energy Link&r:"
		"&6-&r Allows for &benergy transfer&r without the need for physical connections."
		"&6-&r Supports &dmultiple connections&r, enabling a flexible and dynamic energy network."
		"&6-&r Can be configured via its &dGUI&r for targeted energy distribution."
		""
		"Usage:"
		"&6-&r Place a &aWireless Energy Link&r at each &edevice&r or &elocation&r you want to power."
		"&6-&r Connect the links to your &bmain energy source&r for efficient, wireless energy delivery."
	]
	quest.73B6E398931525BA.quest_desc: ["You are making progress, &agood,&r but you must &6improve.&r"]
	quest.73CE7FA690FC5760.quest_desc: ["You will use these to craft many of the &dEnder IO&r &cMachines,&r Each machine needs a &ecapacitor&r to run and you can configure its &ainputs&r and &coutputs&r by pressing the &asquares&r in the &bcorner of the machine's UI&r then &lRight-Clicking&r a side to &aswitch its function.&r"]
	quest.73D5EE5238C37982.quest_desc: ["In the wilds rests the skeletal form of a great creature. its skeleton stretching skyward like branches of pale bone. Whether a relic of forgotten myth or a beast once hunted to extinction, none can say. Its silent frame endures as a monument to creatures long lost."]
	quest.73D5EE5238C37982.quest_subtitle: "Find a Ceryneian Hind"
	quest.73E38D6DE2295C61.quest_desc: [
		"A &cblazing planet&r full of &echallenges&r and &6high heat&r. &nRequires&r a &cJet Suit&r and &cTier 3+&r&c Rocket&r to explore safely."
		""
		""
		"Venus Info:"
		"&aGravity:&r 8.87 m/s"
		"&bOxygen:&r none"
		"&cTemperature:&r 464.0 °C"
	]
	quest.74068F67A2FC5670.quest_desc: [
		"The reaction chamber is capable of accelerating chemical reactions by using a catalyst fluid and a great amount of"
		"power. In doing so, reactions that naturally occur can be forced to happen inside the chamber, most of the time with"
		"more efficient results, due to the controlled environment."
	]
	quest.74092BDC7DA9BAD9.quest_desc: ["You are making progress, &agood,&r but you must &6improve.&r"]
	quest.7409CCAA7B1E12A6.quest_desc: ["Welcome to &4MMR&r, a mod that lets you &5build multiblock&r structures to aid your mid game progression and craft insanely difficult &zend game items&r. You can check each &5multiblock&r by pressing '&6U&r' on its &2controller&r to view its &erecipes&r and see a &d3D preview&r of its structure."]
	quest.740AD1C00684D5CD.quest_desc: [
		"&eWhat Is Extreme Crafting?&r"
		""
		"&eExtreme Crafting&r is an &cextreme endgame&r crafting recipe type used to automate recipes from the &eExtreme Crafting Table&r."
		""
		"It is intended for the &cmost expensive&r and &cmost complex&r recipes available."
		""
		"&eWhy Use Extreme Crafting?&r"
		""
		"• Automates the most demanding recipes"
		"• Removes manual Extreme Crafting"
		"• Handles massive ingredient counts cleanly"
		"• Essential for true endgame automation"
	]
	quest.740AD1C00684D5CD.title: "&eExtreme Crafting&r"
	quest.74200A48498DD7F8.quest_desc: [
		"Generates power from the &6sun&r!"
		""
		"Produces about &b17.6FE/t&r."
		""
		"Needs a &aunblocked&r view of the &bsky&r to funtion, similar to beacons."
	]
	quest.742A5BB44F257D8E.quest_desc: ["&bTransports items&r between blocks these are connected to, &lRight-Click&r to open a menu where you can configure between &bwhitelist,&r &8blacklist,&r &ainput/output etc.&r"]
	quest.7436F6599E2D79C1.quest_desc: ["A chestplate that allows the use of flight when you press a keybind, and provides a &agood amount&r of &barmor points!&r"]
	quest.7439CFAD20E3E2BF.quest_desc: [
		"Using this bone meal on Farmland will convert it to Magical Farmland."
		""
		"Crops will produce double the output when grown on Magical Farmland."
	]
	quest.7439CFAD20E3E2BF.quest_subtitle: "Use on Farmland to make it Magical!"
	quest.743C84D1D94C5670.quest_desc: ["The Brass Funnel is a block that can extract or insert items into inventories"]
	quest.744842B2AED28344.quest_desc: ["Allows you to access your grid wirelessly but with a crafting table built-in."]
	quest.744842B2AED28344.title: "Wireless Crafting Grid"
	quest.744A01000E086CC9.quest_desc: ["The Dragon Scale can be made into a Golden and Aquatic Dragon Scales."]
	quest.7463BA727C6D8148.quest_desc: ["Surely you already made some right?"]
	quest.7463BA727C6D8148.quest_subtitle: "Use that Corporeal Matter we made earlier."
	quest.746DE7FD1C2B8DBF.quest_desc: [
		"The &aReactor Stabilizer&r is a critical device for maintaining reactor stability."
		""
		"Features of the &aReactor Stabilizer&r:"
		"&6-&r Helps to stabilize the reactor during operation."
		"&6-&r Prevents dangerous fluctuations and potential reactor meltdowns."
		"&6-&r Must be placed at specific points around the reactor core."
	]
	quest.746DE905D45A396C.quest_desc: ["The Leviathan is the ultimate aquatic boss, serving as the primary antagonist of the Sunken City structure and one of the most challenging encounters in the entire modification. This massive sea serpent has a peculiar appearance, featuring a dragon-like head attached to a fish-like fin, along with four menacing tentacles that obscure its true nature."]
	quest.7486637361FEC7A9.quest_desc: ["Can be uncovered within &bsuspicious clay&r inside of &9Ancient cites&r, this is used to craft new &aarmor&r and a &dspell book&r."]
	quest.74A57FB367B60E87.quest_subtitle: "All of this for one item??"
	quest.74ADA21AEDFB9E9F.quest_subtitle: "10.000 ingots"
	quest.74BA767367F2722B.quest_subtitle: "A way to teleport between dimensions"
	quest.74C114D0C0D4D374.quest_desc: ["Remember in the beginning how it seemed that everyone was sick with Influenza and you had to keep feeding everyone carrots and potatoes? With the hospital built, they can go see the doctor and get cured by the Healer. You or the colony still needs to supply the ingredients."]
	quest.74C114D0C0D4D374.quest_subtitle: "Build a Hospital"
	quest.74DA690631920E06.quest_subtitle: "Made just like normal bricks."
	quest.74E606B6472C77F9.quest_desc: [
		"An environmental hazard suit crafted from Thermal Resistor Plating."
		""
		"Protects the wearer against extreme temperatures, atmospheric pressure, and radiation before upgrading to full UFO Armor."
	]
	quest.74E606B6472C77F9.quest_subtitle: "Hazard Protection Gear"
	quest.74E606B6472C77F9.title: "Thermal Resistor Suit"
	quest.74E8D7CBD9E3157D.quest_desc: [
		"The fundamental unit of this mod is the Data Model an item which holds information about an entity that you can utilize to generate their drops. "
		""
		"To get a Data Model, you must first craft a Data Model Framework, and use it on the target entity to build the model. Once you have your model, you will have to train it."
	]
	quest.74FB93DBD3DCFC41.quest_desc: [
		"&9Source Relays&r provide a controlled channel for &dSource&r to flow through without dissipating back into the world. &dSource Relays&r &nmay be linked to other&r &drelays&r &nas well as jars&r to provide safe transit from one place to another."
		""
		"First &lRight-Click&r the jar you want to take from, then &lRight-Click&r the &9relay&r, then the&9 relay&r again, then the jar you want to give the &dsource&r to."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"There is also a &eSource Relay Collecter&r which &aautomatically&r takes source from &djars&r it is not linked to withen &l5 blocks&r."
		""
		"And a &aSource Relay Warper&r which can transport source from &dfarther distances&r but some &cmay be lost&r in the process."
	]
	quest.74FE4BDF6CEFAA42.quest_desc: ["A mechanical system that transfers and regulates rotational power between engines and machinery. It ensures optimal speed, torque, and efficiency across connected components."]
	quest.750B10A7ADE8DE08.quest_desc: [
		"A crafted component essential for advanced &bME Network&r devices. Comes in three tiers, each requiring an &eInscriber&r with its corresponding press:"
		""
		"&bLogic Processor&r"
		""
		"Base tier for most machines (&5Interfaces&r, &9Drives&r)"
		""
		"&6Engineering Processor&r"
		""
		"Used for automation blocks (&cExport/Import Buses&r)"
		""
		"&dCalculation Processor&r"
		""
		"Required for high-tier devices (&aQuantum Bridge&r, &eControllers&r)"
		""
		"(The &9\"microchips\"&r powering AE2's advanced technology.)"
		""
		"&e\"From simple storage to quantum computing\"&r"
	]
	quest.75109760BD283B33.quest_desc: ["More storage."]
	quest.751189465F91B353.quest_desc: ["&bCrystaline Seashelves&r are generally good bookshelves,&r however these shelves have a &aaverage Max&r &aEterna,&r so get ready for stronger shelves in your setup with this one."]
	quest.7522F2DC9038ED92.quest_desc: ["A better tier of Conducter with more storage."]
	quest.7522F2DC9038ED92.title: "&cAdvanced Thermodynamic Conductor"
	quest.753775F80FFD5B2C.quest_desc: [
		"Addons enhance machine performance."
		""
		"&bSpeed Addons&r increase processing speed."
		""
		"&cEfficiency Addons&r reduce power consumption."
		""
		"&9Range Addons&r expand the working area of machines."
		""
		"Install addons by right-clicking the machine with the addon in hand."
	]
	quest.754B6642565FD2FC.quest_subtitle: "Used to input fluids into multiblocks"
	quest.7553689BC9202E14.quest_desc: ["&bElite Universal Cables&r are a version of &cadvanced cables&r with more storage."]
	quest.7553689BC9202E14.title: "&9Elite Universal Cables"
	quest.75560045ED084900.quest_desc: [
		"You will place &bmob drops&r into the &cextracter&r with a &esoul jar&r to fill it with the &aessence&r of the &bmob&r the items belong to. Then use the &aessence&r with a &6soulium seed base&r to create that &amob's seeds&r."
		""
		"You can craft &6soulium dagger&r variants (either &chostile&r or &apassive&r) to fill &6soul jar&r in your &einventory&r with the &aessence&r of creatures you kill."
	]
	quest.75599A9909C7A8C8.quest_desc: ["Citizens need to eat in order to work. Until you have a restaurant and a steady supply of food, you will need to put a few pieces of food in their inventory. They’ll eat when they are hungry."]
	quest.75599A9909C7A8C8.title: "Another Mouth to Feed"
	quest.7559B2C7BB3440A8.quest_desc: ["You can get a &aDragon Heart&r by killing the &cEnder Dragon&r."]
	quest.757D4EEC01CBB056.quest_desc: ["More storage."]
	quest.757E1521D84AC5C8.quest_desc: ["Blood is collected by crafting Test Tubes, then killing mobs with the Mystical Dagger."]
	quest.757E1521D84AC5C8.title: "&4Blood"
	quest.7593E582FA928061.quest_desc: ["A worse &edrill&r for your &aquarry,&r &dunable&r to mine many ores."]
	quest.75A28517E08FE190.quest_subtitle: "Place down a Brass Gearbox"
	quest.75A28517E08FE190.title: "Serious Organization"
	quest.75AD0CEBC1335915.quest_desc: [
		"After placing this in a &creactor&r you will be able to view its stats, including &epower controls&r fuel levels&6, and &ctemperature levels&r."
		""
		"&oA few tips:&r"
		""
		"&cHigher core heat&r means &emore fuel used.&r"
		""
		"&cHigher casing heat&r &eincreases energy production&r, and &bcoolent conversion&r."
		""
		"You can choose either &amanual&r or &bautomatic&r &ewaste ejection&r mode, &aManual&r means the pipe attached to the &dSolid port&r must call for the waste i.e &cMekanism&r p&aipes on pull mode&r, while &9automatic&r outputs the &ewaste&r to the pipe anyways."
	]
	quest.75B3AB84C74ED23F.quest_desc: [
		"&bP2P&r (peer-to-peer) is a powerful system in AE2, allowing for the transfer of &aitems&r, &afluids&r, and more without intermediary &dME storage&r."
		""
		"Right-clicking a &bP2P tunnel&r with certain items will &eattune&r the tunnel for transferring items through pipes, energy through cables, redstone signals, and even &dME connections&r."
		""
		"&bP2P tunnels&r must be linked using a &eMemory Card&r, detailed in the next quest."
	]
	quest.75C0ED308F5D7417.quest_desc: [
		"The &3MekaSuit&r is a highly configurable set of late-game modular armor added in &dMekanism&r."
		""
		"The &3MekaSuit &ris divided into &o&b4&r parts, the headpiece, the chest plate, the leggings, and the boots. "
		""
		"Each part of the &3MekaSuit&r can be upgraded with &eModules&r that are installed with the &6Modification Station&r and can be configured by pressing \"&b\\&r\"(backslash)."
		""
		"It is considered the best armor in &dMekanism&r and is very expensive to make and &o&bfully upgrade&r, even for late game players, requiring a large amount of &9Polonium&r to be processed into pellets."
		""
		"With a fully upgraded suit however, the wearer becomes &nnearly&r &6Invincible&r."
	]
	quest.75C0ED308F5D7417.title: "&bMekaSuit Armor"
	quest.75C60265AE39D9F1.quest_desc: ["Unlock the &6Tome of Knowledge&r, holding the blueprint for every transmutable material in existence!"]
	quest.75C60265AE39D9F1.title: "📖 &6Material Omniscience: Tome of Knowledge"
	quest.75D242FBEA58818C.quest_desc: [
		"The &1Quantum Crafter&r is a powerful and configurable auto-crafter. With the entire inventory of the AE systems at its"
		"grasp, crafting non-stop becomes a trivial task. It is capable of running crafting jobs at a very fast pace while making"
		"sure you never run out of crucial resources. It is also capable of running fluid substitution crafts as well as"
		"recursive crafts, which have an input as an output."
	]
	quest.75D3F3C1D4A3EAA2.quest_desc: ["Transfers heat between machines or areas. Vital for creating efficient and balanced thermal systems."]
	quest.75DE856385F6FB3F.quest_desc: [
		"ME Soul Card"
		"An AE2 upgrade that allows you to accelerate your machines using Souls directly from your AE2 network, without the mess of Soul Surges."
		""
		"Usage"
		""
		"Craft the Soul Card and install it in a compatible AE2 machine (Pattern Providers, Interfaces, Export Buses, and Import Buses). The upgrade is only compatible with the part variants of the corresponding machines."
	]
	quest.75E3FA5CAD3C1F66.quest_desc: ["Your &dsummons&r atack what &nyou&r hit with &cextra damage&r."]
	quest.75E7216AB5411DF6.quest_desc: [
		"Chopping"
		"Mechanical Saws are powered through rotational force, and when placed down facing to the side they will automatically chop down wood blocks in front of them. When chopping down a tree or giant mushroom, it will automatically destroy the entire tree by only destroying the bottom-most block."
		""
		"Mechanical saws are only supposed to mine 2x2 trees as long as at least the last block (horizontally) is mined using the saw. The easiest way to bypass this is by removing the block immediately above the block being cut, in which case the entire 2x2 tree will be cut down by the mechanical saw."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"Mechanical saws can mine any structure of logs that doesn't have a vertical 2x2 square with the block being destroyed as one of the bottom blocks"
		""
		"Mechanical saws are automatically powered when on a create Contraption. The saw will damage entities and break blocks at a certain speed depending on the contraption's speed."
	]
	quest.75F9C3635B91F39F.quest_desc: ["A better &esolar panel &rthen the one before it."]
	quest.7604D8B3C9FCCFD9.quest_desc: ["It's time to create the 'Hard Drives' of Refined Storage. To do this, we'll need a &9Storage Housing&r that we'll combine with a &aStorage Part&r to create a &dStorage Disk&r. Just simply make the desired size of the part, then combine with the housing to create a disk. \\\\n \\\\n The Storage Disk is used to store your items virtually once placed inside of the Disk Drive. It has to be put in a Disk Drive. The Storage Disk won’t despawn when dropped in the world."]
	quest.7604D8B3C9FCCFD9.title: "Storage Housing"
	quest.76071C22A73A2026.quest_desc: ["Different &ctiers&r of &aseeds&r need different &ctiers&r of &aessence&r and &6farmland,&r &dmake some&r&d!&r"]
	quest.761B1545D84A87F8.quest_desc: ["Slay 50 &8Withers&r to fuel your Nether Star generators and reactors."]
	quest.761B1545D84A87F8.title: "💀 &8Wither Genocide (50x Wither)"
	quest.7630386B70BCB814.quest_desc: ["[ { \"text\": \"Click me!\", \"underlined\": true, \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"551B6182DC7E577B\" } } ]"]
	quest.763614F0E739C5C3.quest_desc: ["Dropped from the &ewatcher&r, which is &csummoned&r when you have a &dunderzealot&r holding a &egloomoth&r with &efive other&r &dunderzealots&r are around it, you will use this for &6crafting&r."]
	quest.76406EFFF8CBA6B4.quest_subtitle: "DIAMONDS!!"
	quest.764C79BE8CA8F5D1.quest_desc: ["Same as hat, max tier at&l I II III&r, instead of chestplate and leggings having &lII II III&r"]
	quest.7653935BDE025D18.quest_desc: [
		"The &dScuba Tank&r is a piece of equipment worn on the backpack (the chest armor slot) that provides underwater respiration when a Scuba Mask is worn (on the helmet armor slot)."
		""
		"Like the &cJetpack&r, the &dScuba Tank&r must be filled with &3Oxygen&r gas in order to function."
		""
		"The &eScuba Mask&r is an utility head armor piece, used in conjunction with the &dScuba Tank&r to breathe underwater."
	]
	quest.7653935BDE025D18.title: "Scuba Gear"
	quest.7655E1C6C5E5469F.quest_desc: [
		"&bGrowth accelerators&r are placed &ebelow plants&r to &aspeed up growth&r of &ethat plant&r, &ceach tier&r has a different &9\"Range\"&r of how far down you can place it, the &6more accelerators you place&r below the &cfaster&r that &aplant grows&r. "
		"(the &9range&r is basically how many can place below the plant.)"
	]
	quest.768789FEB6EBB8F8.quest_desc: [
		"A Blaze Burner is a heating component that is required for certain Mixing recipes. It can be used for heating Steam Engines, Bulk Smoking, Bulk Smelting, and as a decorative light source."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"Heating"
		"Blaze Burners are used for Heating and Super-Heating Basins when doing Mixing recipes. In particular, they are required to make Brass. They can also be used as a heat source for boilers used to power Steam Engines. When a heat-able block is placed above a fueled Blaze Burner, the Burner will appear to channel heat into the block."
		""
		"Right-clicking a Blaze Burner with any item that can be used as Furnace fuel will temporarily put it in a Heated state. Right-clicking a Blaze Burner with a Blaze Cake will temporarily put it in a Super-Heated state."
	]
	quest.768F9EBD3E115CA6.quest_desc: ["A better tier of Tube with more storage."]
	quest.768F9EBD3E115CA6.title: "&cAdvanced Pressurized Tubes"
	quest.76919513DA354DBC.quest_desc: [
		"The Gearbox is a block used to transfer Rotational power in 4 directions, either horizontally or vertically."
		""
		"The Gearbox can relay rotational power in four horizontal directions. The vertical counterpart, like the normal version, can relay power in four vertical directions."
		""
		"When receiving input from any input side (sides with a shaft shape), the Gearbox will output/relay rotational power in opposite spin for all of the remaining sides. In another word, when the input is clockwise, the output on the other 3 sides will be anti-clockwise, and vice-versa."
	]
	quest.76A38CCA5816CDAD.quest_desc: ["Combining Oxygen, thylene, and a Substrate in a Pressurized Reaction Chamber will create an HDPE Pellet."]
	quest.76A38CCA5816CDAD.title: "HDPE Pellets"
	quest.76B34EEE64731991.quest_desc: ["A &l3x3&r pad where you place and launch your &crockets.&r Without it, your &crocket’s&r not going anywhere."]
	quest.76BC484FC50EAEC3.quest_desc: [
		"To enchant items, you'll need Darkstone Pedestals placed around the Forge."
		""
		"Make sure to place these on the Arcane Chiseled Polished Darkstone."
	]
	quest.76BC484FC50EAEC3.title: "Darkstone Pedestals"
	quest.76C86143497AA77E.quest_subtitle: "Allows for easy trade with villagers"
	quest.76C86143497AA77E.title: "Easy Villagers"
	quest.76E0FA2416CF0B39.quest_desc: [
		"&eWhat Is Basic Crafting?&r"
		""
		"&eBasic Crafting&r is a simple crafting recipe type used to automate recipes craftable in a &eBasic Crafting Table&r."
		""
		"It is designed as a lightweight alternative to standard crafting systems."
		""
		"&eHow It Works&r"
		""
		"• Uses the &eBasic Package Crafter&r"
		"• Supports recipes from the &eBasic Crafting Table&r"
		"• Crafted items are &eejected&r into adjacent inventories"
		""
		"The Basic Package Crafter &crequires power&r to operate."
		""
		"&eUse Cases&r"
		""
		"• Automating simple crafting recipes"
		"• Early- to mid-game automation"
		"• Lightweight PackagedAuto setups"
		"• Compact crafting systems"
		""
		"&eWhy Use Basic Crafting?&r"
		""
		"• Simple and easy to set up"
		"• Lower complexity than full crafting systems"
		"• Works seamlessly with &ePackagedAuto&r"
		"• Integrates cleanly with &3AE2&r"
	]
	quest.76E0FA2416CF0B39.title: "&eBasic Crafting&r"
	quest.76E6C8B3F124B3B2.quest_desc: [
		"Welcome to &6Draconic Evolution&r this is a &bmod&r that adds a lot of &ahigh-tier&r items such as &2tools&r and &earmor&r as well as some &ahigh-tier&r energy storage and a lot of other random &cfeatures&r such as:"
		""
		"&5Teleportation&r"
		""
		"&4Mob farming&r (spawning+killing)"
		""
		"&3Player detection&r"
		""
		"&eTime and weather control&r"
		""
		"&bPowerful tools and armor&r"
		""
		"&1High tier energy storage&r (RF)"
	]
	quest.76F22616A4D03494.quest_desc: [
		"Building multiblocks block-by-block from memory is a nightmare. Shift right-click any controller with the &bStructure Scanner&r to display a complete 3D holographic outline in the world."
		""
		"It marks missing or misplaced blocks in red so you can spot errors instantly."
	]
	quest.76F22616A4D03494.quest_subtitle: "Holographic Multiblock Projection"
	quest.76F22616A4D03494.title: "Structure Scanner"
	quest.76F51AD1E8A28949.quest_desc: ["If you wish to tame a hippogryph feed it some rabbit feet."]
	quest.7700E08416618198.quest_desc: [
		"Interfaces act like a small chest and fluid tank that fills itself from and empties to network storage depending on what you set it to keep a stock of in its slots. It tries to complete this in a single gametick, so it can fill itself with or empty itself from up to 9 stacks per gametick, making it a fast method of import or export if you have fast item pipes."
		""
		"Another useful trait is that while most fluid tanks can only store 1 type of fluid, interfaces can store up to 9, as well as items. They're essentially just chests/multi-fluid tanks with some extra functionality, and you can prevent that extra functionality by keeping them disconnected from any networks. Thus, they are useful in some niche cases where you want to store a small amount of a bunch of different stuff."
	]
	quest.7703240374D92007.quest_desc: ["If you give this &cmachine&r a &egrinding ball&r and an item in the &atop slot&r, it will &egrind down the item&r into &bother items&r, &nnot all items can be ground down.&r"]
	quest.773C9DA610091CFC.quest_desc: ["Push smelting to the absolute limit with extraordinary &asmelting speed&r, reconfigurable sides, &daugments&r for &csmoking&r and &2blasting&r and much more."]
	quest.773C9DA610091CFC.title: "Iron Furnace"
	quest.774AA4A99AED8B97.quest_desc: [
		"Sedna Info:"
		"&aGravity:&r 0.098 m/s"
		"&bOxygen:&r none"
		"&cTemperature:&r -240 °C"
	]
	quest.774B1D4152A0B4ED.quest_desc: ["Mainly used to assemble multiblocks when right clicking the middle block."]
	quest.77572C546A50BE0C.quest_desc: [
		"The &bShape Card (Placing Liquids)&r is a specialized version of the &bShape Card&r in &5RFTools&r designed for placing liquids in defined shapes."
		""
		"This card is ideal for creating custom lakes, moats, or other liquid-based structures."
	]
	quest.776451A1A5F3B2FB.quest_desc: ["Place the Electric Gauge on a section of a circuit to measure various stats. Exact values can be viewed using Goggles, and the quantity being measured can be changed with the Wrench."]
	quest.776C4F2AE494ADB1.quest_desc: ["The absolute pinnacle of co-processing power. Capable of handling billions of parallel operations simultaneously without breaking a sweat."]
	quest.776C4F2AE494ADB1.quest_subtitle: "The Ultimate Compute Array"
	quest.776C4F2AE494ADB1.title: "2B Mega Co-Processor"
	quest.7778937DF377C1B4.quest_desc: [
		"This is a great option for generating power."
		""
		"This generates around &b40FE/t&r, and increases based on &nhow high you are&r."
		""
		"The higher the &o&bY level&r, the more &cpower&r it produces!"
	]
	quest.7778937DF377C1B4.quest_subtitle: "Generates Power from the Wind"
	quest.7798733A0ED2A8C3.quest_desc: ["Those cute looking feelas roam in deep seas, they are easy to kill, well as long as sea serpents aren't nearby."]
	quest.779C3C6B89AD2526.quest_desc: ["Used in many &6crafting recipes &rfor the &e\"Electric Age\".&r Mainly used in &cLV machines.&r"]
	quest.77B2C22D776D1B60.quest_desc: ["Connects forge energy compatible blocks with wires to transfer energy."]
	quest.77C016A83AD73399.quest_desc: ["Allows the player to controll a Brass Drone"]
	quest.77C3D285E52CCA0E.quest_desc: ["Table Cloths can be used to sell items to other players."]
	quest.77DEFD511513D7CE.quest_desc: [
		"Using &9relays,&r you can create a &eEMC \"Flower\"&r to generate almost any item easily, you will make this similarly to a &bpyramid&r with a stem."
		""
		"&cFlowers&r will provide much &eEMC&r to the &6Condenser&r in the &amiddle.&r"
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&d&lFirst:&r&r Place your &6energy condenser&r, this will be the &amiddle&r of the flower."
		""
		"&d&lSecond:&r&r surround it with &9relays&r on every side &aexcept the&r &abottom.&r"
		""
		"&d&lThird:&r&r Place &benergy collectors&r on every side of the &9relays&r except the &abottom.&r"
		""
		"&d&lFourth:&r&r Place &cglowstone&r on the &atop&r of every &benergy collector&r."
		""
		"&5&lFinally:&r&r place the item you want to produce into the &6energy condenser&r and attach &cMekanism&r pipes to the &6condenser&r to transport the generated items."
	]
	quest.77E56DA3EA680F09.quest_desc: [
		"Throwing resources like &7Andesite&r and &7Diorite&r in &dSpiritfire&r, will convert them into &5Otherworld&r version."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"In order to get the &5Otherworld&r wood, you would need to throw &2Oak Sapling&r in the &dSpiritfire&r, to get &e\"Otherworld Sapling\"&r. You would not notice any visual differences except you have effect of &cThird Eye&r. It is important to have it when you chop the tree,"
	]
	quest.77E56DA3EA680F09.quest_subtitle: "Otherworld"
	quest.77E56DA3EA680F09.title: "Basic resources"
	quest.77F07C8F789C0FA4.quest_desc: [
		"Made at an &denchanting apparatus&r with &eiron armour&r and &dmagebloom fiber&r, can be imbued with &bthread&r, the higher tier armour the higher tier and more quantity of &bthreads&r you can add, you can increase the tier of your armour in the &denchanting apparatus&r."
		""
		"To apply the &bthread&r, place the armour piece you want to upgrade in an &eAlteration table&r then &lRight-Click&r with the &bthread&r you want to add, &lRight_Click&r the &bthread&r while your armour is in the table to remove that thread."
	]
	quest.77F958F43649A746.quest_subtitle: "Make sure you have ender eyes"
	quest.77F958F43649A746.title: "Find the Stronghold"
	quest.78019E2925B93446.quest_desc: ["A key mechanical component that compresses and channels energy within an engine. It’s essential for converting fuel or pressure into smooth, consistent rotational motion."]
	quest.7832EC603EE98190.quest_subtitle: "7.500 ingots"
	quest.783CE8C9E866F86C.quest_desc: ["Dropped form the &aNucleeper&r, you will use this to craft a &cnuke&r!"]
	quest.785322C002100649.quest_subtitle: "Keep a network running at speed with a powered brake attached"
	quest.785322C002100649.title: "Overpowered"
	quest.78545503CE761C3F.quest_desc: ["A &6rare ore&r found in the &bend highlands&r, this is used to create the&d best&r this mod has to offer. Gathered with a &dVibranium pickaxe&r"]
	quest.785460A567666B2D.quest_subtitle: "Used to generate any temperature you want"
	quest.785527C9E5AC4B5B.quest_desc: [
		"Good way of generating resources. "
		"Does not require anything, it loses durability instead."
		""
		"Miner could be enchanted to increase yield."
		"Apply &2Eternal Stella&r to make it &zUnbreakable&r."
	]
	quest.785527C9E5AC4B5B.quest_subtitle: "Resources from air"
	quest.7870800C28A7E199.quest_desc: [
		"The Chicken Farmer’s Hut is where the Chicken Farmer will raise chickens, collect eggs, and butcher chickens for food. You will have to capture and bring in two chickens to the Chicken Farmer’s Hut, as the Chicken Farmer will not catch and bring in any chickens."
		""
		"The Chicken Farmer will only keep two chickens alive per hut level, so at level 5 they will have ten chickens."
	]
	quest.787415570026FFAA.quest_desc: ["These upgrades add enchantments to your Destructor. \\n \\n Wondering why you would use this? Imagine having a Builder or Quarry pump Silk-Touched Ores into your system. You can have a Constructor place these ores, then a Destructor with Fortune on it to break it for even more raw ores."]
	quest.787415570026FFAA.title: "Destructor Upgrade"
	quest.788A3685A7D07E75.quest_desc: ["Souls are gathered by creating a Soul Extractor and then using it on Soul Sand."]
	quest.788A3685A7D07E75.title: "&dSouls"
	quest.788CBA6B7ED78D1F.quest_desc: [
		"As you progress deeper into &zUFO Future&r, you will encounter various ingots, dusts, and fluids."
		""
		"Metals like &bWhite Dwarf&r, &bNeutron Star&r, and &bPulsar&r alloys are made into high tier casings and components. Meanwhile, liquids like &dPrimordial Matter&r, &bGelid Cryotheum&r, and &5Temporal Fluid&r serve as reactor coolants and reaction mediums in the DMA and Cryoforge."
		""
		"The more \"&cVeteran&r\" players might notice that fluids, ingots and dusts are &4missing&r from the questline now, but that is intended to give &9more space&r for new features and machines."
		""
		"Always check &2JEI&r for their exact processing steps, liquids, coolants and setups."
	]
	quest.788CBA6B7ED78D1F.quest_subtitle: "INFO:"
	quest.788CBA6B7ED78D1F.title: "Materials and Fluids"
	quest.7892AB6D8C1495FA.quest_desc: ["Gives &bmore filtering options&r like &6NBT changes&r and&c Item damage&r."]
	quest.78A6906529F21DD4.quest_desc: [
		"Place your &dEnchanting Table&r in the &lcenter&r, surrounded by bookshelves 1 block away (standard 5x5 ring)."
		""
		"&cNote for recent versions:&r &eQuantic Rectification&r was replaced by &bQuantic Stability&r (provided by the &dGeode-Encased Bookshelf&r). "
		""
		"Without stability, high Quanta can roll negative penalties!"
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"The optimal 1.21 setup (&b12 bookshelves total&r) that maxes every stat:"
		""
		"• &l1x&r &dGeode-Encased Bookshelf of Stability&r (&bQuantic Stability&r prevents negative Quanta rolls)"
		"• &l1x&r &6Deepshelf of Arcane Treasures&r (enables &eTreasure Enchantments&r like Mending)"
		"• &l1x&r &eBeeshelf&r (&c100% Quanta&r)"
		"• &l3x&r &dDraconic Endshelves&r (&a100 Eterna cap&r, offsets Beeshelf loss)"
		"• &l3x&r &9Echoing Sculkshelves&r (&e3 Clues&r to reveal all 3 choices)"
		"• &l3x&r &bHeart-Forged Seashelves&r (&d100% Arcana&r for max rare enchantments)"
		""
		"&oThe remaining 20 spots around the table can be left empty or filled with whatever decorative shelves you like!&r"
	]
	quest.78A6906529F21DD4.subtitle: "Max stats & stability in 1.21"
	quest.78B6A586B9B0458C.quest_desc: [
		"The Core Sample Drill is a 3 block tall block added by Immersive Engineering. The Core Sample Drill is used to determine if a mineral vein, an Immersive Engineering mechanic, is in a Chunk. Once the Core Sample Drill has completed right clicking it will print the result of the operation, as either finding a vein or not. If a vein is found it must be extracted using the Excavator Multiblock."
		""
		"The Core Sample Drill requires RF through the bottom of the machine. The Core Sample Drill requires 40 RF/t for 600 ticks. This equates to taking 30 seconds and requiring 24,000 RF per a use."
	]
	quest.78B6A586B9B0458C.title: "Core Sample Drill"
	quest.78C3192B690B7691.quest_desc: ["A high-performance component that compresses incoming air to boost engine power and efficiency. It enhances speed, output, and overall performance in advanced mechanical setups."]
	quest.78CF88FF66C784FF.quest_desc: ["You can give this &6wand&r a single spell at the &dScribe's table&r, the spell must be &aprojectile&r and the wand gives it &bacclerate&r."]
	quest.78D47E13F77F3239.title: "Enter &eThe End&r"
	quest.78DBA875765BF3E5.quest_desc: ["Naquadah can be found in two ways in the &2overworld&f, in bedrock very rarely, or in &0the end&f, much more commonly, it is found under the islands near the void."]
	quest.78ECC28DD4BA9696.title: "Hunting For &dOtherworld&r Materials"
	quest.790A1A3A99CCF2F1.quest_desc: ["To speed up growth of your beloved dragon feed him this delicious meal."]
	quest.7917E75BBA3F0614.quest_desc: [
		"First, use the display link on a Display Block to link it. Then place it on the Source Block that will be read from. Though it will link to any block, not every block can act as a display or source. "
		""
		"Right click the link to access its interface. Additional labels can be added to the output text through this interface. Some sources provide multiple options for formatting the text. Once the interface settings are accepted, the green light on the display link will start blinking, indicating transmission of information to the display blocks."
	]
	quest.791CAEBAE57EF0E1.quest_desc: ["A useful &6crafting component&r automated in the &cassembler.&r"]
	quest.79219F395AF8573B.quest_desc: [
		"The &bMob Crusher&r is used to automatically kill &amobs&r and collect their drops."
		""
		"Place it facing the area where &amobs&r will spawn and provide it with &dpower&r."
		""
		"The &bMob Crusher&r will kill any &amob&r in front of it and collect the &adropped items&r and &aLiquid Meat&r."
		""
		"It is useful for &dmob farms&r to collect resources without manual intervention."
	]
	quest.79348BBCD8CD88CC.quest_desc: ["Now, use these&e new found plates&r to &acreate powerful gear&r."]
	quest.7940E814260C556F.quest_desc: ["Made from a &8Metallurgic Infuser&r this item is used in a few crafting recipes. Can also be found in &9loot crates&r."]
	quest.79421304E140F426.quest_desc: [
		"The &bEnchantment Extractor&r removes &aenchantments&r from items and places them onto &abooks&r."
		""
		"Provide it with the &aenchanted item&r and &dbooks&r, and provide it with &dpower&r."
		""
		"The &bEnchantment Extractor&r will extract the enchantments from the item and transfer them to the books, preserving the enchantments for future use."
	]
	quest.7947F1F725619F60.title: "Fortune Upgrades"
	quest.794ED2661B8E4621.quest_desc: ["Allows the player to fly, move and swim faster. Works with water and fuel."]
	quest.79587F25A161BD93.quest_desc: [
		"The communication bridge between your ME network and UFO multiblocks."
		""
		"Point the outward port directly against an ME cable or storage bus. Power cables alone will not connect UFO multiblocks to AE2; they require this link for digital communication."
	]
	quest.79587F25A161BD93.quest_subtitle: "Digital Multiblock Bridge"
	quest.79587F25A161BD93.title: "Quantum Grid Link"
	quest.796BBB1319182FFE.quest_desc: ["This tool is crucial for fighting dragons on land. The sound of this flute brings dragon down from their flight which evens the odds."]
	quest.79757F66DF263FA0.quest_desc: [
		"To create a reaction for the &6Reactor&r to turn on, we're going to need to inject it with a ton of power. &o&bAnd I mean a ton of power&r."
		""
		"This requires you to set up several &9Lasers&r that all need to be powered, then shooting &o&b400MFE&r directly into the &aLaser Focus Matrix&r."
		""
		"The &aLaser Focus Matrix&r is placed in the center of one face of the &6Fusion Reactor&r. We'll build the &9Lasers&r next."
	]
	quest.7975C7145572C438.quest_subtitle: "Don't throw me out :("
	quest.79794CD70AEF100B.quest_desc: ["More storage."]
	quest.79A4739041FA0BDB.quest_desc: [
		"UFO multiblocks require direct power from external cables rather than running off ME network power."
		""
		"Hook up your highest-output cables or energy wireless points directly to this block to keep the reactor fed."
	]
	quest.79A4739041FA0BDB.quest_subtitle: "High-Voltage Power Terminal"
	quest.79A4739041FA0BDB.title: "FE Energy Input Hatch"
	quest.79CBF8A2400A345E.quest_desc: [
		"To use the &dEnchanting Apparatus&r:"
		""
		"Setup:"
		""
		"Place the &bArcane Core&r, then place the &dEnchanting Apparatus&r on &ntop&r."
		""
		"Position &aPedestals&r anywhere within an &l11x11 area&r centered on the Core."
		""
		"Ensure a &dMana Jar&r with mana is nearby."
		""
		"Usage:"
		""
		"Put crafting ingredients on the &aPedestals&r."
		""
		"Place the main ingredient in the &dApparatus&r."
		""
		"&lSneak + Right Click&r the &dApparatus&r with an&n empty hand&r to collect the finished product."
		""
		"&cNote&r: put in the main ingredient last."
	]
	quest.79CBF8A2400A345E.quest_subtitle: "A better chamber"
	quest.79CBF8A2400A345E.title: "&6Enchanting Apparatus"
	quest.79D85DBE0F5D717B.quest_desc: ["Crafted from a &acave codex&r, this map will lead you to the &bcave&r the &acodex&r was &elinked to&r."]
	quest.79E01F6906DA951A.quest_desc: ["Automatically refills gadgets and armor that use water."]
	quest.7A103577EAE7B3F1.quest_desc: ["A new &cti&r&cer&r of &aessence!&r Used to craft many &eitems&r."]
	quest.7A313979F034AA19.quest_subtitle: "Terraria mentioned!!!!"
	quest.7A3928429B3F5230.quest_desc: ["A new destination has been marked, deep below the overworld. A land of syrupy colors and sinister confections awaits."]
	quest.7A39B7C7B0EEBF4F.quest_desc: ["A crystallized energy core infused with Fluix essence. It serves as a key crafting material for advanced network components, storage devices, and wireless systems."]
	quest.7A4D01AF34BB7E0E.quest_subtitle: "Right click on the industrial mixer to install it."
	quest.7A831B4889E6A7F8.quest_desc: ["The 65536k Fluid Storage Part is used to craft the 65536k Fluid Storage Disk."]
	quest.7A9AE63998BB41FF.quest_desc: [
		"Applying the &5No AI Spawner Rune&r causes spawned mobs to have no artificial intelligence."
		""
		"Mobs will stand completely motionless and cannot attack or move on their own."
	]
	quest.7A9AE63998BB41FF.title: "No AI Spawner Rune"
	quest.7A9DF67899445C99.title: "Extra Drop Upgrades"
	quest.7AA18B409FB698D2.title: "&fFlux Block"
	quest.7AA7094E591A373B.quest_desc: ["A gearbox with all 4 sides spinning in the same direction."]
	quest.7ABB925C1277D695.quest_desc: [
		"Generate and store &e10 Billion FE&r."
		""
		"You can use a &bTask Screen&r connected directly to an Induction Matrix, Draconic Reactor, or Dyson Cube to submit the energy!"
	]
	quest.7ABB925C1277D695.title: "⚡ &eEnergy Storage: 10 Billion FE"
	quest.7AE502EDB73BD57A.quest_desc: [
		"The Crusher crushes, among other things, clumps into Dirty Dusts, Ingots into dusts and Biomatter into Bio Fuel."
		""
		"By defualt, it consumes 50 J/t and processes one item every 10 seconds."
	]
	quest.7AE502EDB73BD57A.quest_subtitle: "It's Crushing Time"
	quest.7AEAF2E101B5D652.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.7AEAF2E101B5D652.title: "&fFlux Plug"
	quest.7AEE26C5734D4C0D.quest_desc: ["The Engineer's Wire Cutters is used to remove wires from a block by right clicking on the block. The wire will drop when using the Engineer's Wire Cutters and can be picked up and reused."]
	quest.7AF270EF635B11CF.quest_desc: ["Crafted in a &ecompressor&r and &cimplosion compressor&r or a &apacker.&r use these to create &bnew items.&r"]
	quest.7B0764DDE94E73D0.quest_desc: [
		"Using some vanilla mechanics and &o&b2&r &aFission Reactor Logic Adapters&r, we can create a simple circuit breaker to trip and turn &coff&r the reactor &o&ein case things get a little crazy&r."
		""
		"To do this, we'll need a single piece of Redstone, a Piston, a block of either sand or gravel, and an Observer."
		""
		"On one of the faces, we'll want to put a &aLogic Adapter&r down, then skip a block above it and then place another Adapter. Set the top Adapter to &9\"Activation\"&r, and the bottom Adapter to &c\"Damage Critical\"&r."
		""
		"Next, in front and underneath the bottom Adapter, place any building block and stick a piece of Redstone on it leading from the Adapter. We'll then place a Piston facing up in front of that Redstone, then place our piece of sand or gravel on that Piston."
		""
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"For the final part of our breaker, place the Observer with the face pointing outwards towards the &7Piston&r setup. This is &nimportant&r!"
		""
		""
		"Whenever the Reactor has critical damage, it will then activate the bottom Adapter, causing the redstone to get a signal, which then activates the Piston and pushes up the Gravel/Sand. This will activate the Observer, which then turns off the Reactor."
	]
	quest.7B0764DDE94E73D0.title: "The Circuit Breaker"
	quest.7B0774E5D09D01A2.quest_desc: ["The &bInfused Diamond&r in &5RFTools&r is a powerful crafting component created by infusing a diamond with &aDimensional Shards&r, used in high-tier recipes and machine upgrades."]
	quest.7B1E1AF7188B1A2E.quest_desc: [
		"&bPortable Cells&r are a versatile &dstorage solution&r. Just like regular storage cells, they can be inserted into an &bME Chest&r or &bME Drive&r to store items."
		""
		"The key difference is that &bPortable Cells&r offer &ddirect access&r to their contents without needing to be placed in a network. They function like a &adigital backpack&r, allowing you to &aaccess your stored items&r &aanytime, anywhere&r by simply using the cell item itself. This makes them an excellent choice for &amobile storage&r and &aquick item retrieval&r on the go."
	]
	quest.7B2008977702D0C8.quest_desc: ["Pressure is the core mechanic of PneumaticCraft. Machines require air pressure to function. Learn how to generate, manage, and safely use compressed air without bursting your systems."]
	quest.7B2008977702D0C8.title: "Pressure"
	quest.7B3E0DD6A0E2285F.quest_desc: ["Crafted with &6Allthemodium nuggets&r and an &9enderpearl,&r you can &lRight-Click&r this to teleport to the &emining dimension&r."]
	quest.7B4AAC741F0A6073.quest_desc: [
		"&9Fuel rods&r and will be placed inside of a &creactor&r in a &ediagonal&r patteren, towering up to the &6roof&r where on the very top will be the &bControl rods&r."
		""
		"If you interact with a &bcontrol rod&r, you will get a &6small slider&r on the bottom of a &lUI&r which allows you to \"push the &9fuel rods&r\" which makes them use &aless fuel&r, but make &eless energy&r."
		""
		"The fuel for your first &cbasic reactor&r should be &auranium.&r"
	]
	quest.7B4AAC741F0A6073.title: "Reactor Control Rods"
	quest.7B4EB796D5230871.quest_desc: ["A &efragment&r of the&c undead beast&r. important for &6crafting.&r"]
	quest.7B5A0BFD47D96BDE.quest_desc: [
		"This Block Uses Bee Cages to capture"
		"any bees flying in a 3x3x3 Cube above it."
		""
		"You can use \"Upgrade: BaBee\" to only"
		"catch Baby Bees, and \"Upgrade: not"
		"BaBee\" to only catch Adult Bees."
		"This Block is entirely optional."
	]
	quest.7B5DF264A026BBD0.quest_desc: ["The Adjustable Chain Gearshift functions similarly to Encased Chain Drive, but can change the speed of the output when powered with redstone."]
	quest.7B5E2CD676A1A1C4.quest_desc: ["The Baker will craft bread dough, cookie dough, cake dough, and raw pumpkin pie, then bake these in a furnace to create bread, cookies, cakes, and pumpkin pies. They will only do this upon request, whether from the Cook, the postbox, or as a minimum stock in the Warehouse."]
	quest.7B5E2CD676A1A1C4.quest_subtitle: "Build a Bakery"
	quest.7B6E46D719CFB570.quest_desc: ["An item used to hold and craft Spools of Wire. It serves as a key component in producing electrical materials, helping you advance toward automation and power generation within the Create ecosystem."]
	quest.7B7585BC5EAECAC7.quest_desc: [
		"To use it, energy be input through one of three black power points. Like many other Immersive Engineering multiblock machines, it can be turned on or off using the redstone input panel (the red dot) on its front side."
		""
		"It has a GUI, with 12 input slots, 4 additional (alloying) slots and 7 output slots. To run, three Graphite Electrodes need to be inserted into the machine manually. An Arc Furnace can smelt approximately 500 items before the electrodes wear out and need replacing."
	]
	quest.7B7585BC5EAECAC7.title: "Arc Furnace"
	quest.7BA5575CE84466DF.quest_desc: ["The &aShield Control Module&r decreases the Shield Cooldown."]
	quest.7BC56CDCB7F4CCF6.quest_desc: ["While exploring the Overworld you might find that except dragons, other creatures roam the lands. Some of them you may find useful, while the other will try to bite your head off."]
	quest.7BDBE300D4B0B1F7.quest_desc: [
		"Pretty much just&6 automated composting&r using &bsteam.&r&o "
		"(i.e. it turns things to bone meal)&r"
	]
	quest.7C074B5E2A0EAA63.quest_desc: [
		"To assemble a Train, the train must have at least one set of controls that face forward relative to the Train Station the train is created at. If a non-player conductor is desired, a Blaze Burner or Seat must be placed directly behind the controls."
		""
		"On a Train, Train Controls can be right clicked to take control of the Train. The player's ordinary movement options will affect the Train instead. Use the controls again or sneak to stop. Hold left or right at a fork to choose a path. Use the scroll wheel to adjust maximum speed. Hold jump to approach and align at a Station. If a Steam Whistle is attached, press the sprint key to blow it."
	]
	quest.7C0FA555C5FE00D1.quest_desc: ["A useful &6crafting component&r automated in the &cassembler.&r"]
	quest.7C11AA7CB05BFBEA.quest_desc: [
		"This will give you the Budding fully entroized fluix."
		""
		"It works exactly like the budding certus crystal block then you can obtain fluix dust/crystals."
	]
	quest.7C11AA7CB05BFBEA.quest_subtitle: "Right click a fluix block with a entro seed"
	quest.7C169A4A39F37FAC.quest_desc: [
		"You need to get these from vanilla bee nests, which can be found randomly on trees. If you’re having trouble finding one, there is a chance for newly grown birch and oak trees to come with a beehive; plant a bunch of saplings, plant flowers next to them, and wait for the trees to grow, and each one will have a 5% chance to come with a beehive."
		""
		"Once a nest is dripping with honey, you can harvest honey by using a glass bottle on it, or honeycomb by using shears. Both of these will anger the hive unless you pacify them with smoke first, so be prepared to run you can probably defeat the bees easily but then they won’t be around to collect more honey, and you’ll need more than one harvest."
	]
	quest.7C169A4A39F37FAC.title: "Getting honey and honeycomb"
	quest.7C31E7904E8DD77C.quest_subtitle: "Produces any amount of RPM with no need of RF"
	quest.7C3968AF39557751.quest_desc: [
		"In &bApotheosis&r, Mob Spawners can be collected using &d&lSilk Touch&r&r, at the cost of &c100 durability damage&r to the pickaxe used."
		""
		"Spawners maintain all their properties and applied modifications when broken and moved."
	]
	quest.7C3968AF39557751.title: "Spawner Mechanics"
	quest.7C4D8AA107780795.quest_desc: [
		"By using the &3Fluidizer&r, we can combine &1Blutonium&r with &eYellorium&r to make &2Verderium&r."
		""
		"When used &o&bas fuel&r in a reactor, &2Verderium&r produces &4Rossinite&r as a reactant. &nWe need this&r!"
		""
		"To use &2Verderium&r as a fuel, you'll need to make &9Fuel Injection Ports&r for your reactor. Don't forget &o&bto empty&r out the fuel currently in your reactor, or make &o&ba new reactor&r for this purpose."
	]
	quest.7C4D8AA107780795.title: "Making Rossinite"
	quest.7C4E4793DA887DE4.quest_desc: ["&aExtreme Reactors&r is a mod focused on &epower generation&r though &bturbines&r and &creactors.&r This quest-line will act as your &aguide&r through this world of &eelectricity,&r once you have &agenerated power&r you can use it for other mods like &cMekanism&r"]
	quest.7C4E4793DA887DE4.title: "Welcome to &2Extreme Reactors"
	quest.7C56E7051D52722C.quest_desc: ["A easy way to deactivated teleporting mobs in a small radius"]
	quest.7C5BBC3A73049AF0.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.7C5BBC3A73049AF0.title: "Craft a Chest"
	quest.7C61906C6C87C97D.quest_desc: [
		"The &9Electromagnetic Coil&r is placed directly on top of the &aRotational Complex&r to convert the kinetic energy into power."
		""
		"You can use multiple, with &o&b5&r &nbeing the max&r. These must either touch another &9Coil&r, or the &aRotational Complex&r."
	]
	quest.7C8E1BCF863959DF.quest_desc: [
